window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":501,"title":"Chapter 501 - Whoever Chickens out Is the Loser","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Sitting in the easternmost part of the continent, Dajin bordered on the vast ocean in the east. The celestial islands stood in the ocean, which were home to many cultivators and some factions.","Birds flew in the misty sky above the Eastern Ocean. Sword energies could be vaguely seen as they traveled close from the distant horizon and landed on the shore of the Northern Ocean. Then, they flew to the south. About 15 minutes later, the people flying on the swords saw a huge prosperous human city that was cut through by a canal.","Looking from the distant sky, they could see this city was much larger than Half City. On the outer range of the city were rows of residential houses built with black bricks and white tiles, and the streets and alleys ran across each other with big and small rivers winding through the residential areas. One-third of the streets in the city were waterways, and they could see boats traveling in the rivers.","In the center of the city stood exquisite small buildings with glass tiles and beautiful engravings, adding a sense of sentiments and a picturesque atmosphere to the whole city.","Compared with the magnificent cultivation cities such as Half City and Black Dragon City, this city looked like a piece of warm jade submerged in water.","“Is this Jiuhua City?!” Many cultivators exclaimed while flying.","“It might be!” Liu Ningyun rolled her beautiful eyes. “When we asked for directions, they told us this is the way and it was past the three small cities. This should be the place.”","“Guys, look! Look over there!” With a shiver, Mo Xian suddenly pointed to the east of the sky.","Among the flowing white clouds, three figures wearing simple white robes were traveling on swords, looking like immortals.","Of course, they would’ve looked like immortals if the two girls trailing behind were not chatting with each other.","“Fenghua, the people in yesterday’s Final Fantasy were so dashing, weren’t they?”","“The girls in the movie are so gentle,” Fenghua said cheerfully. “That girl named Tifa... I wish I could take her home!”","“The antagonist is super dashing too! Ahh!” They shrieked in excitement.","“Ahem!” Su Tianji coughed lightly, showing her dignified look as their master. “Don’t you think that your master is dashing as well?”","She was about to show them her move that she copied from the movie.","“Oh! We have company!” Immediately, she resumed flying with the sword control technique and acted serious.","“Sword control technique?” The people of the Morning Star Sea Realm yelled in surprise and stared at them.","Then, the three white-clothed girls flying with the sword control technique stared back at them.","“Master, there so many people over there. I’ve never seen such dressing styles before.”","“The girl wearing the green gauze dress looks familiar?!” Su Tianji gazed at Ning Bi.","To her surprise, the green-clothed girl stared back at her.","They stared at each other for a long while.","Suddenly, Su Tianji opened her mouth and yelled, “Isn’t she that Biyao who played the guitar and sang ‘The Boundless Sea and Sky’ by Beyond?!”","“Ms. Sprite?!” Fenghua and Yuexin yelled out her QQ ID.","“Ahh!”","“You are...”","“F*ck!” Black Demon blurted out an internet cussing word. “How come I feel like she looks like the Yuji Immortal who beat me in the Legend of Mir 2!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master also recognized Su Tianji, and she shouted in astonishment, “Aren’t you the Daoist friend who played ‘A Music from Guangling’ at the New Year’s Party?!”","“I saw her on Mr. Fang’s livestream! The one who went to the three saint factions!”","“You are...” Su Tianji’s mind instant blanked out.","“Morning Star Sea Realm...” The people in the front only said four words.","“Ahh-!”","“Ahh-!”","Screams and shrieks rose in the sky. They knew that there was going to be a netizen meetup, but they were still astonished that people whom they only knew through the internet and lived in a place hundreds of thousands of kilometers away across the ocean would appear before them.","After exchanging their Internet IDs, many of them realized that they were friends on the internet, and a few of them, Su Tianji and Ning Bi for example, had talked about music with each other in personal chats.","Also, Su Tianji had encountered Xi Yue many times when they played the Legend of Mir 2 since Xi Yue was the only wizard on Mr. Fang’s team.","Liu Ningyun and Mo Xian were regular visitors of Mr. Fang’s arcade shop in QQ, and Su Tianji met them frequently when playing the King of Fighters there.","Su Tianji had just finished her work in the Liuyun Daoist Palace and was on her way to the internet café while flying on her sword. To her surprise, she had encountered so many friends from the internet in real life.","It was amazing!","She was excited, thrilled, curious, and a bit nervous.","Although she had known many of them through the internet, she didn’t know their personalities and backgrounds in the real world.","Finally, she said to the group of people who came from afar, “Would you like to visit the internet café? You can meet the others while you’re there.”","“Let’s go! Let’s go! Let’s go!”","“Hahahaha! I feel like three seasons pass when I don’t get online for a day!”","“I wonder how it feels to get online in Jiuhua City!”","The cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm were thrilled at this topic.","“Come on! Let’s take a group photo and show them! Let them be envious first, hahahaha!” It seemed like these people acted almost the same way as they did online. Su Tianji laughed heartily and almost exposed her reckless personality, and she pulled some girls she was familiar with to her side. “Smile!”","She pressed on the image-saving button on her communication jade.","Then, she copied the picture and posted it in all the group chats on QQ.","Ji Wu said, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\"> How come you’re together?!]","Nalan Hongwu chimed in, [You met them already?! Where are they?! I’ve never seen people from across the ocean before. Let me meet them!]","Song Qingfeng inputted, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f924.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F924;\">]","Lin Shao stared at the screen with wide-open eyes. “The girls of the Morning Star Sea Realm are all gorgeous.”","Liang Shi, who was a player as experienced as Song Qingfeng but rarely spoke in the group chat, voiced his thoughts, [Oh my goodness. I never thought that I could meet people from across the ocean in my life...<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\">]","Tang Yu asked, [You’ve seen each other already?]","Mr. Fang chimed in, [Awesome. Congratulations on your safe arrival.]","While messages flooded the group chats, the people acting as hosts such as Ji Wu, Nalan Hongwu, and Lan Mo came out of the city to welcome the guests. Some players followed them out to have fun, including Song Qingfeng, Dong Qingli of Jiuhua City, Ye Xiaoye of the Cloud Ocean Faction, Ling Wanyin of Yuxu Mountain, and Li Longyuan of Xuanzhong Manor, etc. Dozens of flying swords flew up into the sky above Jiuhua City, presenting an eye-catching sight.","“Do you recognize them?!” Mo Tianxing said with a laugh.","“I recognize one!” Yue Yan raised her hand and said, “I saw that white-haired old man once before! He can use Sword 23! Super powerful!”","Black Demon shrunk his neck and said, “Quite a few members of the Royal Clan Guild...”","For a moment, he had a feeling that he would get beaten up.","He had indeed come over ‘through the internet cable’, but seeing so many members of the Royal Clan Guild, he was afraid that we would be knocked down to the ground instantly.","“Hehehe...” Tang Yuan was smarter and more adaptable to changes. “You must be Daoist friends of the Royal Clan Guild.”","He was all smiles.","“Yuanheng Old Dog?!” It just slipped out...","“F*ck you! Scumbags of the Royal Clan!”","“F*ck! You dare to call me a scumbag? I’ll kill you in the game later!”","“Come on! Let’s battle outside the Earth City! Whoever chickens out is the loser!”","The others looked embarrassed and were at a loss for words."]},{"number":502,"title":"Chapter 502 - Arriving at Spiritual State","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“They have repaired the teleportation array.”","The ocean waves crashed against the reefs on the shore, and gales whistled stubbornly through the sharp rocks as if they were letting out unyielding cries between two stone cliffs.","The two voices collided with each other in the winds.","“Why didn’t you stop them? It’s a piece of cake for you to destroy the ruined array with a landslide or thunderbolts, right? These people know nothing but watching anime and playing games in that shop...”","“...”","Their voices suddenly vanished as if they were swallowed by the winds from the ocean. Not even a shadow could be seen.","...","“What’s happening?!”","“What’s with the commotion outside the shop?”","Waves of cheers came from outside the Jiuhua City Shop.","Subconsciously, some disciples of Lingyun Academy put down their virtual reality headsets and looked toward the door.","“It’s said that the people of the Morning Star Sea Realm...”","“What?!”","“They are really here?!”","Suddenly, almost all the customers on the first floor of Jiuhua City Shop stood up and craned their necks toward the entrance.","Accompanied by a few members of the Royal Clan Guild and some regular customers of the shop, a group of people wearing clothes from unknown factions walked into the shop; most of their faces were new.","If one had to say that they were acquaintances, the people in the Jiuhua City Shop had met some of these new people online.","“Look! Look at her! She is the person who cosplayed as Chizuru Kagura last time...”","“Oh my goodness... The guy wearing black clothes looks like the boss of the Black Demon Guild...”","“Look over there! Aren’t they the people of the Green Cloud Faction? That’s the Water Moon Master.”","“They are not people of the Green Cloud Faction; they cosplayed as people of the Green Cloud Faction... I even see that the dumb guy who cosplayed as the White Brow Spiritual Master.”","The Reincarnation King quickly looked over with a dark expression.","“...”","“Damn! He can even hear us...?” Two figures shrunk and moved to stand behind the others.","The two shop fronts stood on the opposite sides of the street. In the drizzle, people thronged on the street lined with houses of white walls and black tiles. The willow trees in front of the shops began to sprout tender green branches which danced with the pedestrians. Some passersby holding paper umbrellas walked past the shops with swift steps. Overall, it looked like a beautiful ink landscape painting.","Some girls took the rear while whispering among themselves.","“So, this is Jiuhua City...”","“Senior Sister, I haven’t seen so many ordinary people before!”","“They all carry weapons with them; there are many warriors in this place.”","“It’s said that this nation was founded by a warrior. The Guild President of the Royal Clan Guild is the emperor...”","“It’s said that the headquarters of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance is somewhere to the west.”","Yue Yan exclaimed, “So many people are looking at us!”","She immediately stood straighter, enjoying being in the center of the attention; she liked this feeling.","“Welcome to Jiuhua City of Dajin!” Ji Wu welcomed them with hearty words. Then, he whispered something to a person beside him, and a thin and sharp voice sounded, “Today, we will treat you all to instant noodles and iced red tea! Please don’t be overly polite with us!”","“Do you guys want to race?”","“The new movie! Do you guys want to watch Final Fantasy with us?”","Mo Xian and the others looked around. “There seems to be nothing special about this place...”","“Oh, is the mysterious Gongzi Xiao in this shop?” This Gongzi Xiao had provided lots of guides for each game, and the players regarded him as a godlike existence.","However, his technical posts were always made by others that gave him the credit, and no one had ever seen him.","“Where’s Gongzi Xiao?!”","Hearing the question, the crowd in Jiuhua City Shop split up and revealed a handsome young master standing before the counter. He wore a yellow robe and had a folding fan in his hand.","“Is he Gongzi Xiao?!”","Xiao Yulv looked proud and said, “That’s me. I know everything up in the sky and down in the earth. I’m familiar with every detail about the shop’s products from Resident Evil to Final Fantasy! You can ask me any questions you have!”","“Hahahaha! So young and so brilliant!”","“An awesome young man!”","“Gongzi Xiao, do you want to come and play a game with us?”","Xiao Yulv was at a loss for words. “Ugh...”","...","Fang Qi glanced at the System Interface and saw that the sales of Final Fantasy were steadily growing.","However, most people were still stalling. On the one hand, the Heavenly Academy mostly consisted of cultivators, and they didn’t think that it was necessary for them to watch it.","On the other hand, although people knew that this movie could increase their combat experience, few of them knew how much they would get out of. After all, it costs 100 crystals.","Since only a small number of players had watched the movie, the visible effects of the movie were not obvious.","...","Meanwhile, the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm went online and toured the nearby places in the company of the cultivators and warriors of Dajin. They enjoyed themselves very much.","One day later, the teleportation array was activated.","The warriors mainly from Lingyun Academy, Xiyi Academy, and Shengjing Academy and a few cultivators from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and other forces gathered before the teleportation array in Jiuhua City.","“Is this the teleportation array...?” Although they had used teleportation arrays many times in the games, Song Qingfeng and even grand cultivators such as Su Tianji were still amazed by the sight.","It was the product of the ancient array disk and the array technology of the Spiritual State; it had only existed in the legends.","...","– Meanwhile, in the Heavenly Academy –","“Pooh!” Gabriel was impatient. “That’s the best that the warriors of Heavenly Academy can do?”","Boom!","He struck down his huge sword, which was taller than himself, with vicious force.","Boom! With a huge booming noise, the stone on the ground shattered, and the ground around the tiles cracked.","About a dozen warriors lay before him. They were warriors of the Heavenly Academy, and one of them was even the white-clothed manager of the Martial Dao Field.","“That’s outrageous! Try to step over the line!” The manager looked angry.","“We already gave you enough time, and what is the result? You guys are so weak; do you think that warriors from a bleak place can turn the tables?”","“What a joke! They are just a bunch of bumpkins who don’t know how to write the word ‘martial’. They are bugs that I can crush with one finger! If you can’t bring out opponents who are powerful enough for me, I’ll show no mercy to you!”","“Gabriel!” Lou Piaoling slightly frowned.","“What are they up to? What’s the meaning of this exchange? They just want us to teach them our combat techniques and Martial Dao. And they make it sound good and call it an ‘exchange’...”","“Enough!”","“We just got the news that a martial competition of three realms will be held inthe Heavenly Academy tomorrow. I think the Heavenly Academy will give us a satisfactory answer by then.”","Standing beside Luo Piaoling, the blonde-haired girl looked eager at the prospect.","“Sister Sia, you don’t need to show your hand.” Gabriel bowed elegantly and said, “I’ll give those bumpkins a good lesson and show them what real warriors look like.”","He spread out his hands and said, “I even don’t have to use my saber.”","“I hope that they won’t return with tears on their faces.”","Laughter burst out around him."]},{"number":503,"title":"Chapter 503 - Every Place Is A Scenery","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The people were teleported in three groups. At this moment, the first group including the cultivators of Yuxu Mountain, Xuanzhong Manor, and other forces had arrived at the teleportation platform on Zixiao Mountain.","The next group consisted of the cultivators of Dajin and warriors of the three major academies.","“Did you mention it to Young Master An?” Some soldiers of the Jiuhua Army were whispering among themselves. Since they were serving in the army, they could come and watch the teleportation array but couldn’t take this long trip due to their drills and duties in the military each day.","“Of course, I did!”","“What are you guys whispering about? You look mysterious,” an officer of Jiuhua Army asked.","After a long pause, one of them answered, “Captain, you might not know this, but this kid got to know a super cute little girl and got her QQ ID from her. Since we are on duty, we asked Young Master An to...um... have a look of her for us...”","“A little girl in the Legend of Mir 2?” The captain froze.","“Yeah! Her voice is super cute!” That man touched his head. “She is a bit dull but very adorable. Hehehe...”","“Right! We used to take her to level up, and her ID is Lu Xiaoxian...”","At this topic, these soldiers got excited since they had never met netizens before in their lives.","Although they couldn’t go in person this time, even the thoughts of getting a closer connection was thrilling.","Looking toward the teleportation array, they saw that it had been activated. With flowing spiritual light, the cultivators and warriors of Jiuhua City soon vanished.","The third group consisted of the cultivators and warriors of the Morning Star Sea Realm.","...","On the teleportation platform on Zixiao Mountain, groups of people appeared from thin air.","Looking around from the huge platform, they saw rolling green mountains engulfed in white clouds. The immense spiritual essence in this place was much more intense compared to the Deserted Sea Realm.","Even though they had no landmarks to guide them, they could tell that they were no longer in the Deserted Sea Realm.","Gathering on the teleportation platform in Zixiao Mountain, the large group of people couldn’t stop expressing their amazement at the magical array which was left from the ancient times.","The grand cultivators who came in the first group were exchanging greetings with cultivators of the Spiritual State, looking thrilled.","The young people behind them talked among themselves animatedly.","“Young Master Song, how do you feel after your first trip through the teleportation array?” Lin Shao and the other young warriors’ faces were red with excitement.","“I feel dizzy!” Song Qingfeng was obviously still feeling fuzzy.","Liu Ningyun, Mo Xian, and the other girls walked down the teleportation array, feeling dizzy too.","“Senior Sister, give me a hand. Oh, I feel so dizzy!” Yue Yan almost dropped to the ground.","“Don’t yell... I’m dizzy too...” Mo Xian complained.","“No, I’ve got to sit down.”","“How was it? Are you okay?” The girls of Dajin walked up to help.","Dong Qingli said curiously, “We felt fine when we arrived. How come you’re so nauseated?”","Nana Hongwu glanced at them and said, “How come these girls have weak constitutions, eh?”","“I feel a bit dizzy too...” The Xichi Spiritual Master patted her forehead lightly.","Ning Bi’s face turned a bit dark.","The teleportation process was so fast that most of the cultivators didn’t have time to observe the process, but Ning Bi was different.","Laws of nature were the most mysterious and complicated knowledge in the world. The more complicated the laws were, the closer to the fundamentals they were.","The dumb ones could only get a tiny glimpse of laws of nature even if they pursued them all their lives. The wise ones tried to understand the true meaning of the world by understanding these laws.","However, the lucky ones were born with this knowledge.","With a demon bloodline in her, she had talents that no ordinary people possessed.","In one instant, she seemed to have seen many weird spatial tunnels hiding in the depths of the dark void. From one of the tunnels, something seemed to have looked toward them.","She shivered uncontrollably.","“Are you okay?”","“I’m fine.” She thought perhaps it was an illusion that she got in the unknown darkness.","Or maybe, someone else was also passing this place in the spatial tunnel?","...","Meanwhile, the teleportation platform was bustling with people.","A few old men met each other.","“Old Ignorant Nalan!”","“You are... Old Undead Zong?!”","“Hahahaha! You are the damn old undead!”","On the other side, some young men gathered and whispered to each other.","“Song Qingfeng?!” Tang Yu pointed at the young man wearing the purple warrior suit and yelled, “I’m Tang Yu!”","“Yeah, I’m your big brother!” Song Qingfeng looked at the guy who used to beg for guides from him and said in surprise, “It seems like you are quite a figure here! You look more handsome than I imagined.”","“Of course!” Tang Yu said while patting his chest, “Tell me if anyone dares to mess with you in Spiritual State; I’ll nail them!”","Lin Shao replied, “Damn! Good to know.”","Xu Luo said, “You sound like a big figure, Bro!”","“Let me introduce... That girl wearing white clothes is New Snow.”","“And that is Ms. Sprite.”","“What...?” Tang Yu asked in a low voice, “New Snow is so young? She looks younger than my little sister.”","“Let’s go!” Xun Yuan said, “Guys, today, I, Xun Yuan, am your host. I invite you to tour Yuanyang City, and you can pick up whatever you like; it’s on me.”","“F*ck!”","“You guys are all this powerful here?”","Xun Yuan said, “We have some power and face in the small Spiritual State here.”","“Superb!”","“Awesome!”","Tang Yu asked, “By the way, where’s Haoran?”","As a fan of guns and machines, Tang Yu was most familiar with the artifact master of the younger generation.","“The grand artifact master is of course in the group of artifact masters; we are just ordinary people who can only play games.”","The young men yelled in excitement, but the girls looked more reserved. They talked in gentle voices, afraid to ruin their images in front of so many people.","“Xiaoyue, come and give Big Sister a hug!”","“Oh! I haven’t seen Xiaoyue for a long time!”","“Well, no hugs! It’s embarrassing in front of so many people!” Jiang Xiaoyue said in ‘contempt’. “Now, I’ll introduce to you to my friends in the Heavenly Academy. They are Little Bai, Little Qing... and this is Little Bell...”","...","“Guys! Follow me to Yuanyang City!” By now, all the people had gathered together. A large group of sword energies rose from Zixiao Mountain. Standing on the flying swords, they looked down and found that this place was more beautiful than the Deserted Sea Realm. The winding mountains and green rivers were everywhere, and it was beautiful no matter where they looked. They felt like they had walked into a painting.","“Wow... Is this the Spiritual State?”","“It’s our Tang Family over there!” Tang Yu pointed in one direction.","“Do you see the mountain over there? The Heavenly Academy is behind it!”","“Over there is the relic of the Ancient Moon Faction; I’ll take you there some day.”","“There is no hurry. Let’s go to the internet café first.”","“We’re close to Yuanyang City now. Do you see that spiritual ship? We’ll get there soon following its direction...”","Hearing the introductions from the cultivators of the Spiritual State, the guests found that there were too many scenes for their eyes to see. Every place was a beautiful piece of scenery for them."]},{"number":504,"title":"Chapter 504 - Mr. Fang Got Mocked","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm were still in the early stages of development, their combat force was one large realm lower than cultivators. However, this system and calculation method didn’t apply to the Spiritual State.","According to the legends, the warriors in the Ultimate West Realm had inherited an ancient system. In the distant past, the sky knights rode huge dragons and flew from the western snow mountains, creating a long period of prosperity. No one knew why they had later fallen into a decline, but they still had a system as powerful as that of the cultivators.","In this perspective, the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm who were in the early stages of development were no match.","The King of the Ultimate West Realm was a top-level existence called the Blood Dragon Grand Warrior Empire. He was the most powerful warrior in the Ultimate West Realm, and he and his mount ‘Blood Dragon’ were among the most powerful existences in the world.","In the past hundreds of thousands of years, they had developed steadily in the bitter cold northwest and built cities in the ice-covered world. The brave warriors guarded the natural strongholds on the cliffs among the glaciers which were fraught with natural barriers, storms, and fierce beasts. The extremely cold ice and snow could even freeze the spiritual essence in cultivators.","It was true that cultivators were usually more powerful than warriors, and a western warrior was no match for a same-level cultivator of the Spiritual State. However, the western barbarians lived with their neighbors, the horned dragons in the ice-covered mountains, for generations, and they had signed the covenant in the distant past to co-habitat, which was why they were named after dragons. The two species had deep bonds and fought shoulder to shoulder in battles.","This was the background of the four dragon families of the western barbarians.","As for the warriors of ordinary families, they had a system to tame fierce flying beasts and fought enemies together with their mounts.","When fighting two-vs-one battles, there wasn’t only the numbers advantage. The pure-blooded horned dragons not only had powerful combat abilities but also excelled in casting spiritual spells as well, eliminating all the disadvantages that warriors had against cultivators. In fact, the cultivators would be at the absolute disadvantage.","It was why only western barbarians had invaded other territories and not the opposite where other people invaded the ice mountains in the northwest. Even when the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace was in its prime, its cultivators didn’t dare to go into the Ultimate West Realm by crossing that foreboding ice mountain range. That was why they didn’t chase wanted criminals when those people escaped to the Ultimate West Realm.","If the big families of the western barbarians were counted as separated family, their general strength would be no less than any of the seven ancient families with great inheritances in the Spiritual State.","Now, the Ultimate West Realm was like a lion wide awake while the Spiritual State was like a huge dragon falling into a deep sleep.","“It’s said that... while we were on the way to Spiritual State, the number of ancient families in the Spiritual State was reduced from seven to six?” In the hotel housing the guests from the Ultimate West Realm, some elders of the Frost Dragon Family were talking about the situation in the Spiritual State.","“I heard of it too.” Another elder looked grim. “I wonder if it’s true. If it is, it’s truly unbelievable...”","“It’s most likely true. I’ve sent the information back home. I’m surprised that an ancient family in the Spiritual State could vanish so easily; it is a big incident that had never happened in the past.”","“It’s said the Nangong Family had the ambition to conquer the world; it seems that the other ancient families are not weak, and their combined force is naturally stronger than the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace.”","“No, no, no. I heard another version of the story. It is said that their destruction was triggered by an outlander.”","“Outlander?” the elder sneered, “An outlander?”","In their eyes, the cultivators of the Spiritual State were the most powerful ones in the whole world.","“If it’s true, the cultivators of the Spiritual State have weakened greatly and are living backwards!”","“From the looks of it, the Spiritual State has indeed declined. I think they are postponing the Martial Dao Exchange to wait for the arrival of the people of the Deserted Sea Realm to help them not lose much face.”","The brass bell sounded outside.","“The time is up; it’s time to go.”","“The people of the Spiritual State are boring,” an elder said, “They want to hide their weakness and not lose face, but we’ll humiliate them in public even more!”","“Hehe...”","...","In the Martial Dao Field of the Heavenly Academy, the atmosphere had become livelier than ever.","Sword energies danced on the field with loud noises resonating all over the Martial Dao Field.","On the field, a valiant-looking girl attacked and blocked with a double-handed heavy sword almost instinctively, timing each move perfectly.","With his usual cold arrogance and a somewhat wicked expression, Gabriel sat on the high stand and looked down at the Martial Dao Field with disdain.","Mr. Fang had just arrived at this moment. By the time he took a seat groggily, the Martial Dao Exchange had already been going for a while.","“Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue called to him in a low voice while patting the seat next to her. “Here.”","“Hey!” With a frown, Gabriel watched as the young man wearing a blue and white robe walked up with hands in his pockets and took a seat behind him.","He was angry that this newcomer missed seeing his excellent performance before now.","More infuriating was that this man looked as if he hadn’t woken up completely.","Before he lost his temper, the girl wearing a red dress and black armor walked off of the field and took off her helmet adorned with beast horns. Then, her blonde curly hair fell and fluttered like a waterfall, revealing the gorgeous face of a wild beauty.","“Finished?” Gabriel said teasingly, “I’m surprised that it took you so long, Ms. Sia.”","“It’s a shame. I thought I would taste defeat for a moment.” Sia sat down next to Gabriel and asked, “My opponent was good with double-handed sword techniques. He said that he learned them from a person named Cloud. Do we have such a swordmaster in the Ultimate West Realm?”","“In my opinion, he is someone from an unorthodox force. However, if he could force you to use your full force...” Gabriel smiled and said, “Then, the Martial Dao Exchange is a bit interesting.”","Mr. Fang was yawning, but he suddenly froze as he gaped and looked at them, wondering how she won this match!","Although real geniuses are much stronger than ordinary people, this exotic girl must be a genius among geniuses...","Seeing the astonishment in Mr. Fang’s eyes, Gabriel snickered. “What? Is that warrior very famous here?”","He looked disdainful as he continued, “But different warriors have different strength. I hope you people of the Spiritual State understand it.”","“Um...” Mr. Fang scratched his head and said embarrassedly, “I’m not from the Spiritual State.”","Gabriel’s narrow eyes looked more disdainful. “Are you from the Deserted Sea Realm?”","“May I ask if you guys from the Deserted Sea Realm know martial arts? Maybe you just know dances?”","[TL Note: Martial arts is pronounced in Chinese as ‘wu shu’, and dance is also pronounced as ‘wu’.]","“Hahaha!” Sitting behind him, a few young people of the Frost Dragon Family burst into laughter with him."]},{"number":505,"title":"Chapter 505 - Completely Unrivalled","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“May I ask if you guys from Deserted Sea Realm know martial arts? Maybe you just know dances?”","“Ugh...” Exasperated, Mr. Fang said, “About this question... I don’t know about the others, but I... know a bit of it.”","“Hahahaha!” The people around him laughed harder, and Gabriel’s voice had almost gone hoarse from laughing. “Then, you must carefully watch what the real warriors look like. They don’t win with dance moves.”","At this moment, a lean warrior of the Heavenly Academy had defeated his opponent on the Martial Dao Field, which was rare for the side of the Heavenly Academy.","Immediately, cheers rose from the camp of the Heavenly Academy.","Obviously, the warriors of the Heavenly Academy were no match for their peers of the Ultimate West Realm since they had lost several matches in a row. Now that they had won one match, even Gu Tingyu looked better.","Gabriel’s face darkened. He beckoned, and a burly young man walked up. This man wore heavy armor and had brown hair.","“His name is Alva, a master of the younger generation in our family.” This time, Gabriel didn’t speak using his awkward Spiritual State language; he used the language of the Ultimate West Realm. “Alva, you can take the next match.”","While he spoke, Alva had put on his face armor.","With a furious roar, a brawny figure leaped down from the stands. In heavy armor, he landed in the center of the Martial Dao Field with a resonating loud noise, holding a heavy longsword in his hand.","Clad in the heavy armor, this man looked like an advanced and delicate war machine. Since he was also wearing a cold piece of face armor, the others could only see a face made of iron. Faint cold glints shot from his black eyes, and others who looked at them would feel suffocated by the coldness.","That warrior of Heavenly Academy pulled back his longsword and bent his body like a hard bow that was pulled to its limit.","His presence changed and was different from before. More importantly, the audience felt a surge of tremendous spiritual essence gathering in his sword.","His opponent, the western barbarian named Alva, slightly bent his legs like a puma hiding in the long grass, waiting to lunge at its prey.","This move of his instantly induced exclamations from the audience.","The cultivators and warriors of the Heavenly Academy looked angry, but Gabriel looked arrogant and proud.","“What are they exclaiming about?” Mr. Fang asked.","Hearing his question, Gabriel’s face darkened. “You don’t know that?”","However, this isn’t surprising since this kid doesn’t look like a master in martial arts.","Gabriel patiently explained, “Don’t you see that Alva shows no intention of using any combat techniques?”","The moment he said it, they heard a long roar. Violent gales swept across the entire Martial Dao Field, and the grey-clothed warrior struck out as his longsword turned into a blinding white beam of light.","“White Rainbow!”","The grey-clothed warrior’s strength was about at the sixth level of the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, but this sword technique contained astonishing force.","Like a long rainbow, the sword whistled across the sky like rumbling thunders. The wind created by the sword cut open the ground, leaving a deep groove in the floor. In the blink of an eye, the sword was before his opponent.","However, at this critical moment, everyone saw the warrior named Alva make an astonishing move.","Alva reached out his right hand and clenched forward before his chest!","The sword light and the storm it carried suddenly stopped!","A sharp sword was firmly caught by a hand covered in a gauntlet, and it vibrated in the hand!","Almost all the warriors were shocked by this scene.","Then, the warrior named Alva kicked his opponent in the chest and instantly sent him flying with force.","Alva’s move was simple, but it was the result of many life-and-death battles, showing his perfect timing. Everyone could see who was stronger in this match.","Then, Alva cast a provocative glance at the stand, and he said in a loud voice, “I seem to hear that... warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm are very good.”","The people of the Ultimate West Realm all laughed at his words.","“Anyone who dares to have a match with me?”","The stands fell silent.","Beside Fang Qi, Gabriel looked smug. “Alva is an elite fighter of our Frost Dragon Family. He once caught a Frost Dragon’s spiritual spell, the ‘Ice Spear’, with explosive force using one hand.”","Gabriel said with a smile, “The warrior who fought with Sia must be their best trump card. Unfortunately, he encountered Ms. Sia.”","He continued smugly, “Ms. Sia, what do you think of this fighter of our Frost Dragon Family?”","“I heard about Alva.” Sia wasn’t fluent in the Spiritual State language either, so she spoke in their own western barbarian tongue. “He’s a good fighter.”","At this moment, someone finally entered the field.","He was a man wearing a suit of black warrior armor and carrying a big saber on his back.","The people of the Deserted Sea Realm were all very familiar with this figure since he was Liang Shi, one of the most experienced players in the shop.","After getting a good placement in the Counter Strike Competition, Liang Shi was no longer short on funds, which was why he came to tour the Spiritual State.","Liang Shi stood there casually like an ordinary person who knew no martial arts.","“Level 9 of the Ancestral Warrior Realm?” Gabriel lost interest in watching when he saw this warrior of the Deserted Sea Realm. “I’m surprised by the overconfidence of this warrior of the Deserted Sea Realm.”","After all, Alva had defeated a warrior at the sixth level of the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm!","Sia also looked disappointed this time, and she said in the language of the Ultimate West Realm, “I harbored a slight hope for the Deserted Sea Realm. Now, I know I thought too much.”","“Boss, what did she say...” Jiang Xiaoyue furrowed her brows, feeling dizzy. These people sometimes spoke using their awkward Spiritual State language and sometimes using their own language; she wasn’t able to properly understand.","Sitting nearby, a few other warriors of the Ultimate West Realm talked among themselves, and they felt good about their powerful warriors.","“What are they talking about...”","This time, Mr. Fang didn’t speak using the Spiritual State language, which was similar to the language Fang Qi had used before he traveled to this world. Instead, he yelled using English, “Too young, too simple.”","The western barbarians looked at him in bafflement.","“!!??”","Displeased, Gabriel yelled, “Alva.”","In the field, Alva coldly lifted one finger and waved it at Liang Shi.","Gabriel asked Fang Qi beside him, “Do you think this warrior of your Deserted Sea Realm can last one strike?”","“Um...” Mr. Fang looked embarrassed. “This... probably not.”","“It’s good that you know your limits.” Gabriel smirked.","Before he could finish, Mr. Fang added, “After all, he might not even be able to use one move.”","“What did you say?!” All the faces of the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm turned dark.","Meanwhile, a few cultivators of the Deserted Sea Realm were talking among themselves.","“Old Liang has been watching Wind and Cloud, right? Which part has the Wind and Cloud come to?”","“A while ago, it showed Nie Feng learning the moved called Completely Unrivaled...”"]},{"number":506,"title":"Chapter 506 - Before Finish Using One Move","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Completely Unrivaled was created by Wu Wudi, the top-tier master of a generation in Wind and Cloud. It was divided into external techniques and internal techniques. The external techniques consisted of ten combat techniques including ten techniques of the saber, spear, sword, halberd, staff, fist, palm, leg, finger, and claw. Each of the ten moves was among the most powerful of its kind in the world.","The internal techniques were even more amazing since they could turn someone who was sickly and ill into an unrivaled master.","When empowered by Mystic Martial Internal Technique, Completely Unrivaled had three ultimate techniques of offense, defense, and finishing off the opponent. After learning all these, a person could become almost completely unrivaled. With these powerful techniques, Wu Wudi even defeated the challenger Di Shitian, who was one of the biggest villains in the TV Series.","Wu Wudi had left the Ultimate Technique of Offense, which was a part of Completely Unrivaled in Lingyun Cave, and Nie Feng ventured into the cave later on and mastered this technique.","“Do you think Old Liang has mastered Completely Unrivaled?” Song Qingfeng asked the people around him.","While Fang Qi said that the master of the Frost Dragon Family might not be able to even use one strike, Alva beckoned at Liang Shi on the Martial Dao Field.","In the next moment, the audience including Gabriel, the elders of Frost Dragon Family, the people of the Black Dragon Family led by Luo Piaoling, and the people of the Red Dragon Family led by Sia, saw something unbelievable.","Liang Shi’s lips moved slightly and murmured. “Completely Unrivaled!”","In the blink of an eye, Liang Shi vanished from everyone’s vision.","In the next instant, he transformed into blurry shadows, attacking Alva from all directions.","The blurry shadows came from all directions, each using fist, palm, leg, finger, claw, or even weapons techniques.","Alva could still handle them if they were ordinary moves. However, they were not ordinary techniques. The moves were exquisite, and they complimented each other seamlessly!","There was no place to dodge or escape. After all, it was hard to block two fists using one, let alone facing ten or 20 fists.","Each attack was as powerful as fire and lightning, which could pierce metal and shatter boulders!","Being one large realm higher than Liang Shi, Alva tried to block but failed after one moment.","Meanwhile, Completely Unrivaled had just begun to unleash its power. Liang Shi pointed with two fingers, moving all the weapons on the weapon racks around the Martial Dao Field with warrior qi, including sabers, spears, swords, halberds, and staffs, etc.","Equipped with these weapons, Completely Unrivaled looked even more horrifying.","Instantly, the weapons seemed to move like godly items with intelligence and life as if they were controlled by horrifyingly powerful demonic gods. Before the weapons came close, the horrible presence cut open the air and the ground.","“What combat technique is this?!” Sure enough, before Alva could even use one technique, he was sent flying backward like a broken bag. The heavy armor on him was useless, and it was covered by deep, bloody cuts. If they were in a life-and-death battle instead of a practice match, he would have been cut into pieces.","The people of the Frost Dragon Family who were sneering looked like ducks whose necks were clenched. Their mouths opened wide but couldn’t utter a sound.","This scene totally went beyond their knowledge about the world!","When did the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm become more powerful than those in the Spiritual State?!","“Im... Impossible!” It was unbelievable.","“What’s impossible?” Jiang Xiaoyue glared at him and said, “Now, you know our strength, right? You know nothing but boasting.”","Compared with Jiang Xiaoyue who held her grudges for a long time, Mr. Fang looked relatively calm.","“Ebley, you go and fight him!” Gabriel said as he gestured at a young man sitting behind him.","Obviously, this technique had consumed a lot of Liang Shi’s energy. In contrast, Ebley was a master at the first level of the King Warrior Realm, two large realms higher than Liang Shi.","He could overwhelm Liang Shi with only his realm and cultivation strength, let alone other things.","Gabriel glanced at Mr. Fang with provocation in his eyes. “I don’t believe that he will win this match as well!”","As soon as he said it, Liang Shi said in the field, “I didn’t finish mastering the Offense Technique of Completely Unrivaled, so I’m not sure if I can control the outcome of the following moves. Are you sure that you want to try?”","Gabriel as at a loss for words. “!!??”","He stared at the Martial Dao Field with wide-open eyes.","He is still not finished?! He had beaten his rival so hard with the first part of the technique, and there is more?!","“You’re bluffing!” Ebley said in a cold voice, “I think you’re afraid!”","He beckoned at Liang Shi. “Come on!”","“...”","Under the super powerful technique, the weapons controlled by Liang Shi shattered into pieces and fell to the ground.","Then, Liang Shi used Completely Unrivaled again. Leaping into the air, he swept up the shattered pieces of the weapons with the vital essence of Mystic Martial Internal Technique.","At this moment, all the moves of Completely Unrivaled combined into one!","His body shot down like a huge godly weapon descending from Heaven with earth-shaking presence!","Standing around him, people couldn’t help but feel tiny in the face of the great power of nature. The ordinary people would lose the courage to raise their weapons and resist.","However, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm who had grown up battling fierce beasts were different.","“Are you kidding me?!” Ebley yelled and waved his huge saber, making a special pose.","“Combat Technique, Sky-Covering Strike!” Instantly, Ebley unleashed his full force. With his strength that was two large realms higher than his opponent, he used the technique and struck forward with horrifying sword energy.","The gusts howled in the field, and the surging, turbulent waves of energy from the collision knocked down the bronze cauldron in the field and sent the weapons on the weapon racks flying like arrows.","With an earth-shaking noise, Completely Unrivaled pierced Ebley’s massive amount of warrior qi like a sharp sword, shattering his armor.","Defenseless, the huge saber flew out from his hand with blood spewing from his hands.","However, the power of this technique didn’t stop!","“Stop!” An elder of the Ultimate West Realm who was at level 9 of the Emperor Warrior Realm instantly moved, and huge surges of warrior qi exploded between them.","If he didn’t show his hand, the Frost Dragon Family would probably have lost one genius.","Gabriel’s face was livid. Seeing two masters losing to an unknown warrior of the Deserted Sea Realm, he couldn’t remain seated. “I’ll take the next match!”","He leaped into the Martial Dao Field.","“Shame on you!”","“Your cultivation strength is so much higher; how can you fight with him?!”","“This warrior has fought two matches. Are warriors of the Ultimate West Realm so shameless?!”","Gabriel’s face turned darker, and he yelled using his awkward, improper Spiritual State language, “Any of you can come and fight me!”","Obviously, Liang Shi couldn’t battle any longer after the great consumption of his strength. Even if he still had sufficient warrior qi, he was no match for Gabriel who had a cultivation strength higher than the combined strengths of the previous two fighters.","In terms of other people, Gabriel didn’t think that there were people more powerful than Liang Shi."]},{"number":507,"title":"Chapter 507 - To Learn This Technique, You Must Start from Zero...","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Geniuses were called geniuses since their strength and abilities far surpassed those of the ordinary people.","This was why there were so few geniuses in the world. There was no way that they can pop up one after another.","The combat technique that this warrior used was so powerful that the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm, who regarded themselves the best in the world in terms of combat techniques, began to look at him in a new light. However, this technique consumed lots of energy.","Liang Shi barely used it, and he seemed exhausted. It meant that this technique was very difficult, and not many people could master it.","Gabriel didn’t think that there would be a second person who could use this technique.","In fact, he was right. Except for Liang Shi, a talented warrior and an old customer who seldom played new games and concentrated all his attention in one subject, few people could use Completely Unrivaled.","After all, no one was as talented as Nie Feng who could master Completely Unrivaled after watching it once.","“Any of you can come and fight with me!”","Gabriel’s challenge was issued to the younger generation since senior warriors wouldn’t be so brazen as to fight with him.","At level 6 of the King Warrior Realm, his cultivation strength was higher than anyone in his generation.","In fact, the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm were in much lower realms compared to their peers of the Ultimate West Realm.","Unless they mastered horrifying ultimate techniques such as Completely Unrivaled or Sword 23, it was impossible for the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm to defeat the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm.","After all, apart from cultivation strength, the combat techniques of the Ultimate West Realm were more powerful than those in the Spiritual State. One couldn’t battle an opponent who was at a higher realm with only the sword control technique.","He glanced around at the large group of people and said, “Do any of you want to come down and fight with me?”","He looked toward the zone where the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm were standing, and he said provocatively, “Ever since I came to the Heavenly Academy, I’ve been bombarded with tales of how powerful the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm are. I watched the previous battle. This warrior is indeed good, but he’s no match for me.”","Some audience members booed at him.","At this moment, a figure leaped down from the stand and landed before Gabriel.","Gabriel sized up this man and found that the latter wasn’t old but looked more mature than him.","This man’s age was a bit older than Gabriel, but his cultivation strength was much lower; it was only merely at the peak of the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm. At the most, this man only had one of his feet inside the King Warrior Realm.","Wearing a set of black warrior suit, his imposing figure, deportment, and spirit were impeccable.","“Liang Heihu?!”","“It’s Liang Heihu?!”","Exclamations came from the audience.","Liang Heihu was an instructor in Shengjing Academy. When Fang Qi flew with the sword control technique for the first time, he had passed and shocked an instructor of Shengjing Academy who was flying on a big eagle with a female disciple; this instructor was Liang Heihu.","With exceptional talent in martial arts, Liang Heihu’s status in Shengjing Academy was only lower than the Vice Academy Masters. Although he took the position of an instructor, he had only Xiao Lengyu as his disciple; he never taught other students.","As one of the initiators leading the disciples of Shengjing Academy to the Jiuhua City Shop, even though he had come to the shop later than Liang Shi, he was still one of the most experienced players.","At this moment, the warriors of the Frost Dragon Family sitting near Fang Qi looked impatient.","They had been confident that Liang Shi would lose, but to their astonishment, he had defeated two masters of the Ultimate West Realm each with one move. It was a disgrace to them.","Besides, the little girl, Jiang Xiaoyue, looked at them in disdain and said that they were bluffing and boasting.","It was hard to bear!","This time, Gabriel entered the field, and their confidence came back.","After all, Gabriel had defeated many masters of the Heavenly Academy.","“Wait and see,” a brown-haired young man said in a cold voice.","“This time, you guys from the Deserted Sea Realm can’t win.”","“Gabriel won’t be as careless as the others,” another person said. He made it sound like the two warriors of the Ultimate West Realm had been defeated because of their carelessness instead of their inferior abilities.","Seeing Mr. Fang’s casual expression, their faces instantly darkened.","“Sir, do you still think that the warrior of your Deserted Sea Realm will win?” the girl named Sia asked.","“What do you think, Miss?” Fang Qi chuckled.","“I have confidence in the warriors of our Ultimate West Realm.” Sia’s voice oozed innate coldness. “I don’t think everyone can launch the ultimate technique like what the last warrior did.”","Pointing at Liang Heihu, she asked, “He doesn’t know how to use that technique, right?”","“Can you use the combat technique that is as powerful as the one before?” In the Martial Dao Field, Gabriel curled his lips while he looked at the warrior who was only half a step in the King Warrior Realm!","He was one big realm lower than Gabriel who was a level 6 King Warrior!","“Do you think I’m as much of a wastrel as those before me?” Gabriel’s face turned cold. “If you can’t use a combat technique as powerful as that one, you don’t stand a chance!","“Now, I’ll give you a chance to use that combat technique, and lets’ see if it can defeat me.”","“I can’t use that technique,” Liang Heihu answered honestly.","Hearing his words, Sia smiled. “Then, why do you think that he will win?”","The analysis was logical and smooth, and it seemed like Gabriel would surely win.","In fact, Gabriel had the same thought.","He said with a smile, “Attack me with your full force. I’ll let you attack three times before I fight back, so you’ll have a chance to show us the combat antics of the Deserted Sea Realm.”","Some audience instantly laughed at his words.","Antics sounded like tricks played in a circus.","Then he heard Liang Heihu add, “What makes you think we warriors from the Deserted Sea Realm have only one ultimate technique?”","“!!??”","Gabriel suddenly froze.","Even Sia, Luo Piaoling, and the other warriors of the Ultimate West Realm froze at these words.","Then, they burst into laughter.","Meanwhile, the warriors of Xiyi Academy and Lingyun Academy were talking among themselves. “Senior Liang had reached this realm long ago, right? How come his cultivation strength had gone backwards instead of going up?”","After all, even Elder Fu, a long-standing King Warrior, had reached the Emperor Warrior Realm.","Then, they saw Liang Heihu move his fingers and the long sword carried on his back unsheathed automatically before floating up in the air slowly.","“We’re not afraid of the combat techniques from the outland!” Liang Heihu yelled, “Don’t underestimate warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm! Today, I’ll show you the Innumerable Sword Returning to Root!”","“Pu!” Su Tianji almost spewed out the iced red tea in her mouth, and she exclaimed in astonishment, “Did he destroy his original strength and start from the beginning again?! He must be crazy!”"]},{"number":508,"title":"Chapter 508 - Pray for Himself","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What Innumerable Sword Returning to Root?” Gabriel snorted as he thought, If it is really a powerful technique, how come I’ve never heard of it?","“You can’t frighten me with a bluff!” While thumping his chest, Gabriel roared furiously, “I told you that I will let you attack me three times before fighting back! That is set in stone!”","Then, this young man just stood there without the intention of making a move.","“Is this guy stupid?” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed.","Was he seeking death? How could a human body be harder than a weapon?","“Don’t be so startled and ignorant.” The brown-haired young man sitting near Fang Qi smiled and said, “Gabriel is the ultimate genius of our Frost Dragon Family. He was bathed in dragon blood since he was very young and had tempered his body into the legendary Demon Dragon Body. Even the fierce beasts in the big snow mountains can’t hurt him, let alone weapons!”","This young man looked proud while he spoke. “Do you understand, Little Girl? His body is more powerful than combat techniques!”","“Oh, is that so?” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a snort, “He said that he will let his opponent attack three times first, but he is using combat technique along the way!”","“...” Blue veins bulged on the forehead of this young man from the Frost Dragon Family.","At this moment, Liang Heihu let out a furious roar on the Martial Dao Field. Intense sword energies swept up while his body emitted radiant sword lights!","When the sword energies swept to his face, Gabriel immediately sensed their overwhelming power. With a grim face, he circulated his warrior qi, covering his body and face with tiny, vague, and dense scales, even though he was in a defensive position.","Gabriel’s human features faded away, replaced by a half-human and half-dragon face.","The armor on his body was instantly broken by sword energies, revealing a stretch of dark grey scales on his chest.","Gusts and sword energies swept up in waves. Under Liang Heihu’s control, endless bolts of sword energies swept toward Gabriel like a furious dragon.","The bolts of sword energies hit Gabriel’s chest, and a series of metal-colliding sounds rang out as if Gabriel was made of metal!","“Hahahaha! Very good!” Gabriel laughed wildly. “Among so many people, you’re the first one who could make me feel pain! Although you’re one large realm lower than me, you should be proud.”","“But if this is all you can do.” Gabriel shook his head and said, “It’s not enough to challenge me! You are too arrogant!”","The invincible sword energies were bounced off by the dark grey scales that were covered by warrior qi. Then, they landed on the ground, shattering into pieces before these pieces flew in all directions.","“Did you see that?!” The brown-haired young man said proudly, “This is the power of a genius of our Ultimate West Realm!”","It astonished not only Liang Heihu but the other warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm.","“This guy is bit strong...” Song Qingfeng gulped down a big mouthful of iced red tea.","Nalan Mingxue said with a nod, “He’s arrogant, but he’s got the abilities to back his arrogance.”","An Cheng asked, “Can Liang Heihu defeat him? This ‘animal’ is indeed fierce.”","“It’s hard to say... he can even block Innumerable Sword Returning to Root?!” Su Tianji gaped at the battle in the Martial Dao Field.","Meanwhile, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm sitting near Fang Qi began talking among themselves in their own language.","“Gabriel is awesome!”","“Show these warriors of the Spiritual State and the Deserted Sea Realm our strength!”","They had been defeated in a couple of matches, but now they could win back a round.","Sia said calmly, “It seems like I’m right. I don’t like Gabriel’s personality, but I must admit that he has great abilities.”","“Boss.” Jiang Xiaoyue pointed at the people who were talking in their own language and said in a huff, “What are they talking about now? Are they badmouthing us?!”","Mr. Fang shrugged. “They are saying...’no zuo no die’.”","[TL Note: No zuo no die is a Chinese internet slang.]","“‘No zuo no die’ What’s that?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked in bafflement, “I still don’t understand.”","“You won’t die if you don’t seek it,” Mr. Fang explained.","“What did you say?!” The warriors of the Ultimate West Realm looked over with dark expressions; they wanted to give Fang Qi a good beating.","The moment they said it, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm felt their huge swords beginning to shake.","“My sword?!”","“Why did it fly away?!”","“My Rock Hacker!”","“My Steel Breaker!”","Beside them, Sia yelled in alarm as well, “My Blood Thorn!”","Different from cultivators, most warriors carried their weapons with them all the time. Now, these weapons all flew out.","Sia’s fierce-looking, double-handed greatsword flew out.","Besides their swords, all the swords that were not inside storage spiritual artifacts clinked and clanked.","While the swords cried, a prolonged dragon-roar-like noise resonated in the sky. Then, all the swords, including the greatswords, the ordinary longswords, the precious swords carried by the warriors, the practice swords on the weapon racks around the Martial Dao Field, and even the black spiritual sword that Nalan Hongwu carried unsheathed themselves!","“This ...?!” Mu Qing, Yue Bai, and Li Lanruo were sitting with Jiang Xiaoyue instead of the other disciples of the Heavenly Academy. They yelled in astonishment, “Sir, this is still the initial move of Innumerable Sword Returning to Root, but how come it feels different from before?”","Jiang Xiaoyue had taken out a bag of potato chips and was eating, and she had handed some to her friends. Hearing this, she said, “You didn’t watch the TV Series carefully. A moment ago, he used the version that Master No Name showed with 10% of his strength.”","Although Liang Heihu had used more than 10% of his strength, he obviously hadn’t used his full force.","But now...","Suddenly, Liang Heihu pointed his index and middle fingers at the sky and bent the other hand before his chest. In the sky, many swords rotated around him like a dragon. Then, he yelled, “I’ll show you the shocking power of the true Innumerable Sword Returning to Root!”","Liang Heihu shook his arms. Under his control, the many swords in the sky split up and transformed into two fierce dragons.","The dragon-like swords roared fiercely while they shot toward Gabriel with horrifying sword spirit.","Gabriel felt desperate when he saw the huge swords.","Among them were some swords that he was very familiar with.","Rock Hacker was a sword made with the techniques of the Frost Dragon Family. The star iron in the sword was mixed with a special ancient process and could shatter hard rocks with ease.","Steal Breaker was a sword of the Black Dragon Family. It could instantly break the opponents’ weapons when they collided.","Blood Thorn, a huge double-handed sword, was a godly item of the Red Dragon Family. It contained a dragon slaughtering curse from the ancient times and could open hard scales of huge dragons with one touch. Also, each slash could weaken the opponents’ strength.","Gabriel couldn’t block these three swords, let alone the many sword energies behind them.","At this moment, Gabriel froze while he stared at the storm of swords crashing toward him! He was stupefied!","The elders of the Ultimate West Realm couldn’t tend to other things, and they were busy yelling, “Hurry! Hold the swords! Hold them down!”","They just didn’t have time to help Gabriel...","He was on his own, and he could only pray for himself."]},{"number":509,"title":"Chapter 509 - Combat Techniques Are So Powerful? Let’s Compete with Sword Techniques","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Gabriel could no longer think of his prior promise of letting his opponent attack three times. With a long roar, he gripped his huge sword tightly.","The ground shattered, and everyone here felt the violent shaking.","Gabriel was swallowed by the giant storm of swords.","“Will that guy die?” Mo Xian whispered on the audience stand.","“He was so arrogant; he can blame no one if he’s killed by one attack,” Yue Yan whispered back while sipping iced red tea.","At this moment, the Heavenly Academy Master, the masters of the ancient families, the elders of the Black Dragon Family, the Red Dragon Family, and the Frost Dragon Family of the Ultimate West Realm all stood up from their seats.","The spot where Gabriel was standing had been turned into a ruin.","Swords pierced into the cracks on the ground like messy teeth, and the shattered ground sank and formed a huge crater made by swords.","When the dust settled down, the audience cranked their necks toward the center of the sword crater.","“Hahahaha... Hahahaha!” Suddenly, a hysterical laughter came from the sword crater. A blood-covered figure was half-kneeling in the center.","Gabriel slowly lifted his face which was covered in dragon scales. Supporting his body with the huge sword in his hand, he hadn’t fallen to the ground.","A black-armored old man with a brown beard said from behind Lou Piaoling, “Why didn’t you stop it?”","“This kid is too hard to kill.” Luo Piaoling took a deep breath as if he was still digesting the unexpected situation. “In fact, I didn’t know that the warriors of Deserted Sea Realm would be as strong as this.”","Andrew touched his forehead as if he was having a headache. “This should be the limit of their abilities, right?”","“I... suppose...” Luo Piaoling answered but sounded uncertain.","If it were in the past, he would answer with certainty. But now, he didn’t feel so sure.","“Hahahaha!” The elders and young disciples of the Frost Dragon Family laughed along.","“I didn’t misjudge this kid!”","“The warriors of our Ultimate West Realm are unrivaled!”","“Come on and use all your techniques!”","But at this moment, the two opponents were too exhausted to use any techniques.","Gabriel didn’t even have the strength to stand up. He could do nothing but try to recover his strength where he was.","Liang Heihu was in the same state. After using Innumerable Sword Returning to Root twice, he used all the warrior qi in his body; he stood there and panted heavily.","After he mastered the Innumerable Sword Returning to Root, he hadn’t encountered such a powerful opponent as Gabriel.","“I admit that the warriors of Deserted Sea Realm are indeed powerful,” Gabriel said in a cold voice, “But I will not be defeated!”","He took out an exquisite crystal bottle from his storage spiritual artifact. The red liquid in the crystal bottle glittered in the sun.","“Is... this dragon blood essence?!” The young men of the Frost Dragon Family yelled.","“This is the holy item that only warriors with the Demon Dragon Body can take! It shouldn’t count as a potion. He can use it to come back to life even if his head was chopped off!”","“Gabriel will certainly win!”","Sia also heaved a sigh of relief, astonished by the great power of the warriors from the Deserted Sea Realm.","However, in the end, the warrior of the Ultimate West Realm was going to win.","“Despicable!”","“Shameless!”","“How can he drink potion while having a practice match?!”","Even Mu Qing, who was sitting behind Jiang Xiaoyue, cussed in a fury, “How can he be so brazen?!”","The brown-haired young man of Frost Dragon Family immediately retorted, “Are there rules forbidding taking potions?! Besides, it’s an item that goes with his Demon Dragon Body; why can’t he use it?”","Liang Heihu froze and then looked toward the audience. “Can he do that?”","“I neglected this,” Gu Tingyun said, “But since we don’t have this rule on the book, he can do it.”","“Hahahaha!” The warriors of the Frost Dragon Family laughed. “See? Who said that he can’t do it!”","“I’m furious!” Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot in anger. “How can he do that?!”","Li Lanruo and the other girls also looked angry.","After being wounded so severely, Gabriel would surely collapse before his opponent. They had expected to win the match, but now it seemed like the result would be different!","However, the audience were stupefied by what they saw next.","Liang Heihu took out a bottle of iced red tea from his storage spiritual artifact and opened the cap before taking two gulps","“Ahh!” It was delicious.","Then, he stood up and walked forward.","At this moment, Gabriel hadn’t recovered yet. He couldn’t do anything but watch as his opponent walked toward him.","Flame Sword Technique!","“Ahh!”","With a scream, Gabriel fell into the sword crater.","The smiles froze on the faces of the elders of the Frost Dragon Family.","“Hurry! Get down and check on him!”","“Feed him a Dragon Blood Pill!”","They scrambled to help.","The players of the Deserted Sea Realm and Heavenly Academy were reacting differently.","“Hahahaha!”","“Awesome!”","“You think your Dragon Blood Essence is good? Have you tasted our iced red tea?!”","The warriors of the Ultimate West Realm were stupefied.","How could things end up this way?!","“Cheating! It was cheating!” An elder of Frost Dragon Family jumped up. “We should forbid taking potions during matches!”","“I didn’t take a potion.” Liang Heihu showed him the iced red tea and said, “I just drank some of this beverage. It’s super tasty; do you want to try it?”","“...” The elder looked murderous. How could this be a beverage?!","Sia frowned. “Elder Lu Mingwei, you are most familiar with the Spiritual State. Have you heard of warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm before?”","“No.” Elder Lu Mingwei of the Red Dragon Family said, “I visited the Spiritual State the year before last year, and I didn’t hear anything about warriors of Deserted Sea Realm.”","How come they are so powerful yet no one had heard of them? Sia thought.","They hadn’t heard of these guys before; how come these guys were so powerful?!","At this moment, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm had obviously realized that the people of the Deserted Sea Realm weren’t as weak as they had imagined.","The two warriors had used two different combat techniques, each of which was shockingly powerful.","In terms of combat technique, only the Blood Dragon Grand Emperor Warrior, the most powerful warrior in the Ultimate West Realm, deserved to learn combat techniques on this level.","However, two warriors of the younger generation of the Deserted Sea Realm had mastered two techniques on that level.","Did the Deserted Sea Realm suddenly get two super-geniuses in this generation, or...","Despite their thoughts and dread, they still refused to admit defeat. After all, only a few young warriors were defeated, which wasn’t enough to scare them off.","After all, they had seniors with them, right?","They found it hard to accept the fact that their young warriors had been defeated in a row.","An elegant-looking elder stood up. He was wearing a wide, white silk robe in a style different from that in the Spiritual State, and he said a few sentences using the language of the Ultimate West Realm.","Sia said, “This is Elder Chekov, and he wants to have a sword technique match with you guys.”","A sword technique match meant that combat techniques weren’t allowed.","The sword techniques used by the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm were inherited from the ancient times. Their ancestors had created and improved many combat techniques while they fought life-or-death battles with fierce beasts in the bitter cold snow mountains, and these techniques had been passed down from one generation to another while being refined further.","You have powerful combat techniques? Then, we won’t compete with combat techniques or ultimate techniques!","Let’s compete with sword techniques! We don’t believe that you can defeat us in this area!","They just didn’t believe that they had a chance of losing."]},{"number":510,"title":"Chapter 510 - How Come You Warriors of Deserted Sea Realm Seem to Know Everything!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Compete with sword techniques?” The warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm exchanged a look of bafflement.","The so-called sword technique match meant that the opponents would compete with only sword techniques instead of ultimate techniques, which was categorized as combat techniques in this world, or cultivation abilities.","In such battles, the participants were forbidden to use powerful techniques such as ‘Completely Unrivaled’.","The Frost Dragon Family had easily defeated many masters of the Heavenly Academy before the warriors of Deserted Sea Realm participated.","However, when the warriors of Deserted Sea Realm entered the contest, the Frost Dragon Family received three pathetic defeats in a row. How could they take this with grace and endure it?","They had seen the great power of the combat techniques used by the two warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm in the previous matches, so they intended to avoid this area and have matches in another area.","They didn’t expect that they could defeat their opponents in a landslide, but they must win at least one match to redeem themselves.","Otherwise, the Frost Dragon Family would be disgraced if they were totally defeated by the warriors from a place that others didn’t even know about.","When Liang Heihu used Innumerable Sword Returning to Root, he summoned many swords from the audience. Some of them had been delivered back to their owners, and some people just walked down to fetch their swords to avoid all the trouble.","Nalan Hongwu was one in the latter group.","At this moment, Chekov repeated his request for a sword technique match.","“I’ll take this match,” Nalan Hongwu said nonchalantly.","Seeing Chekov having a huge double-handed sword, Nalan Hongwu pulled up a greatsword from the ground. While glancing at the young man of Ultimate West Realm who came over to fetch this sword, he said, “Let me borrow your sword for a while.”","“Ahh?”","“He’s going to use a greatsword?!”","His words astonished not only warriors of the Frost Dragon Family but all warriors of the Ultimate West Realm as well.","After all, the warriors of the Spiritual State were used to single-handed long swords. From the previous matches, they could tell that the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm were used to single-handed long swords too.","In other words, only warriors of the Ultimate West Realm liked using double-handed greatswords.","However, this warrior of the Deserted Sea Realm picked up a double-handed greatsword that was as thick as a door, wanting to use it a sword technique match!","Chekov instantly yelled in a fury, “I’ll make you regret trying to show off your techniques in front of an Emperor Warrior!”","“Hmph! I’m surprised at the arrogance of the warriors of your Deserted Sea Realm!” Sia had been calm, but now her pretty face turned livid with fury.","Since Sia was already like this, the warriors of the Frost Dragon Family were even more furious, and they yelled, “Beat him!”","“Show him our power!”","“He’s tired of living! How dare he show off his double-handed sword techniques in front of Elder Chekov!”","In fact, none of them thought that warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm could use double-handed greatswords.","The double-handed greatswords and single-handed long swords were both swords, but they had two different systems of techniques. It meant that people couldn’t use double-handed swords with single-handed sword techniques.","When Chekov saw the white-haired old man grasping the double-handed huge sword with the single-hand sword posture, he sneered and thought, This guy doesn’t know how to use double-handed swords; I’ll surely defeat him.","With an explosive roar, Chekov leaped high into the air, hacking his huge sword toward Nalan Hongwu with overwhelming wind pressure. It felt like he was holding a huge mountain in his hands and attacking Nalan Hongwu.","In the next instant, a sword light flashed.","Nalan Hongwu lifted the huge sword that was about 100 pounds, but it seemed like he was holding nothing.","Faced with his opponent’s lightning-speed strikes, Chekov retreated a dozen steps with alarm.","His robe was hacked open in the chest. If he didn’t dodge in time, he would have been hacked into two halves!","What is this sword technique?!","Before he could come up with an answer, Nalan Hongwu moved forward and leaped up into the sky with both hands gripping the sword.","It was the same type of drop strike. Compared with Chekov’s move, this strike was as heavy as a mountain and was also as fast as a bolt of lightning!","“Cloud?” Song Qingfeng instantly recognized it. “Senior watched Final Fantasy as well?!”","Boom!","The ground shattered under Nalan Hongwu’s sword; the ground before him exploded and turned into a huge crater.","“You’re not using your greatsword properly.” While looking at Chekov who kept dodging, Nalan Hongwu said calmly.","“Watch my greatsword technique!” While he spoke, Nalan Hongwu shot out like a cannonball. Chekov was alarmed and knew that stuff was about to go down. He dodged one slash, but Nalan Hongwu’s greatsword seemed to turn weightless and continued to hack toward him.","The repeated strikes were as heavy as a mountain when needed and were as fast as lightning when required. Nalan Hongwu used this technique to the teeth, and it felt like he wasn’t a human but a complicated war machine!","Each technique and every move were the best way of killing. They looked extremely simple, which shocked Chekov even more.","Only geniuses with great combat talent could reach this realm after many battles.","This white-haired old man has reached this realm!?","While Chekov tried his best to block his opponent’s storm of attacks from all directions, Nalan Hongwu drew out his single-handed sword from his waist.","With the greatsword in one hand and the single-hand sword in the other, he used both swords at the same time!","The warriors of the Ultimate West Realm felt blinded by this scene!","“The person who battled me said that he learned his sword technique from a guy called Cloud, and this old man is using the same sword technique,” Sia said in a daze, “Is this old man Cloud?!”","“You know nothing! Don’t say such nonsense!” Jiang Xiaoyue explained while crunching on potato chips, “Senior also learned the greatsword technique from Cloud.”","Although the players watched the same movie, Nalan Hongwu could use much more powerful sword techniques compared to the ordinary players who had watched Final Fantasy once. After all, he had swept across battlefields since he was young and excelled in all kinds of weapons with abundant combat experience. Besides, he had played the Paladin character and Devil May Cry, and thus he had a deep understanding of various systems of sword techniques.","At this moment, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm watched in a daze as Chekov was getting beaten by a warrior of Deserted Sea Realm with a double-handed greatsword; they were at a loss for words.","With two swords in hand, every single one of Nalan Hongwu’s attacks was the same as if two swordmasters were moving; his greatsword and longsword worked together seamlessly. Chekov’s defeat was inevitable.","“Impossible! I don’t believe it!” After Chekov was defeated, another incredulous elder leaped into the field.","Three minutes later, he was knocked down onto the ground.","“Let’s compete with only double-handed swords! Don’t use single-handed swords!” Another elder leaped down onto the field.","“This time, let the young people under 20 years old compete!”","“This time, let’s compete with saber techniques!” They even discarded swords.","“This time, let’s compete with fists!” They discarded weapons this time.","...","They had many matches.","“How come you warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm seem to know everything?!” Sia suddenly realized something and gasped."]},{"number":511,"title":"Chapter 511 - Sincerely Become a Disciple to a Master","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","They had meant to find some weaknesses in their opponents to win at least one match. However, they lost pathetically from the younger generation to the youth generation, from saber techniques to sword techniques, to fist techniques. They didn’t win a single match and lost all their dignity during the process. It could be said that they almost lost their pants.","Even the cultivators and warriors of the Heavenly Academy looked at them as if they were morons.","Now, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm had replaced the disdain in their eyes with a weird look as if they were observing a group of monsters.","What kind of people are they?!","How come each of them is so f*cking powerful?","However, a few of them still thought that they had met all the masters of the Deserted Sea Realm.","There must be a few weak ones, right?!","For example, Sia thought that the young man sitting nearby looked like a harmless passerby. He had refused several requests to compete with all kinds of excuses.","Maybe this guy is weaker than the others and doesn’t want to bring shame them by being a burden?","Mr. Fang was chatting with others and casually took a big handful of potato chips from Jiang Xiaoyue’s bag, making Jiang Xiaoyue glare at him with her eyes wide open.","Suddenly, he felt like something wasn’t right as he felt a chill on the back of his head.","Turning his head, he saw many warriors of the Ultimate West Realm staring at him.","He even took that little girl’s snack! There is no way that he is a master!","Fang Qi heard them talk in their native tongue while glints seemed to flash in their eyes.","Meanwhile, Luo Piaoling who was sitting a little further from them stood up. “I’m surprised to witness the great power of the combat techniques in the Deserted Sea Realm. Since it’s quite late now, shall we call it a day?”","...","“Ugh? How come you are leaving?!”","“We can certainly win against this guy!” The brown-haired young man of the Frost Dragon Family yelled.","“Don’t drag me!”","“...”","...","The warriors of the Ultimate West Realm looked livid when they left.","In contrast, the warriors of Deserted Sea Realm cheered, “Awesome!”","“Hahahaha! Senior’s tutoring session of the greatsword technique was precious.”","“Didn’t you see their faces and expressions?!”","“They deserved the shame! They were acting so arrogantly!”","They were elated.","However, the cultivators and warriors of the Spiritual State looked envious.","“Brother, where did you learn that fancy technique where flames shot into the sky?”","Song Qingfeng was surrounded by many people.","That technique with a lot of flames is indeed cool and dashing! they thought to themselves.","“Brother, how come your double-handed sword technique looked different from what I saw in Final Fantasy?”","Meanwhile, Fifth Prince Ji Yang looked around at the people who had surrounded him, and he had tears on his face. He had thought that he wouldn’t have a chance to have a match, but the people of the Ultimate West Realm were stubborn and insisted on having more matches, giving him a chance to compete in the field.","He was exhilarated as he explained, “I combined the double-handed giant sword technique from Diablo 2 with the one that I leaned from Final Fantasy. It’s super effective!”","“We can do that?!”","“Boss, why didn’t you go?” Li Lanruo asked in bafflement, “You can beat them senseless by yourself!”","“Um...” Mr. Fang was embarrassed. He only had the cultivation strength of a King Warrior, and he was strong in prior important battles since he used Complete Synchronization. Now that he had run out of Owner-brand cigarettes, and he couldn’t stimulate his potential, so he might be stuck in the field if the people of the Ultimate West Realm kept coming at him one after another.","Then, he heard Li Wuya say, “Lanruo, Boss is a super master. How can he show his hand unless its necessary?”","“Ahem.” Mr. Fang coughed lightly to hide his embarrassment, grateful for Li Wuya’s powerful explanation. “This... Elder Li is right.”","Then, he lectured like a senior, “Lanruo, you’re still young and need to obtain more worldly experience by doing different things at different places.”","“I think Boss just wants to stay here and eat my potato chips!” Before Jiang Xiaoyue could finish her words, Mr. Fang took another handful of chips from her bag.","“Aya!” She immediately put away the bag of potato chips.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","...","Luo Piaoling and other warriors of the Ultimate West Realm had returned to their hotel.","On the other hand, Gabriel was carried back by them instead of walking himself.","Born in the snowy mountains in the northwest, the people of the Ultimate West Realm respected the powerful people as they followed the law of the jungle. They would work harder to obtain more cultivation strength after being defeated, trying to redeem themselves that way. They would never resort to secret acts of revenge, so the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm didn’t have to worry.","The competition between the Spiritual State, Deserted Sea Realm, and Ultimate West Realm had temporarily come to an end.","In the hotel, Andrew, the black-armored elder of Black Dragon Family said, “According to the legends, the Deserted Sea Realm is a wasteland notorious for its shortage of spiritual essence, right? How come they have so many masters?!”","Lou Piaoling said, “From what I saw of their cultivation strengths, the rumor about their shortage of spiritual essence is true. Their realms are generally lower than ours.”","In the later stages, the path of cultivation had no short cuts. It must be accumulated with the passage of time, which was why the cultivators and warriors of Deserted Sea Realm generally had lower realms compared to their counterparts in the Spiritual State.","“Then, why are they so powerful?”","Luo Piaoling patted his forehead, feeling a headache.","Then Andrew asked again, “About the Frost Dragon Family...?”","Luo Piaoling said with a snort, “Ignore them. It’s not a bad thing for them to learn a lesson.”","Andrew said, “If we followed our plan, and this was only a normal Martial Dao Exchange, we wouldn’t have ended in such a disgrace...”","Andrew’s expression turned ugly.","“Let’s talk about something else,” Luo Piaoling said, “Elder Andrew, did you notice that the old man with the family name of Nalan defeated Elder Chekov with the same sword technique as the warrior of the Heavenly Academy who was defeated by Sia?”","“Now that you mentioned it... it is indeed the case.”","Knock! Knock! Knock!","Someone knocked on their door.","“Come in.”","A blond-haired beauty pushed open the door. She was dressed neatly in long leather boots, a leather jacket, and leather pants.","“Did you notice the weirdness of today’s competition?” Sia walked in briskly and went straight to the point.","“It was more than strange...” Elder Andrew shook his head. If it were in the past, he wouldn’t have believed that there were such warriors in the world.","“I plan to do some investigation tonight,” Sia said suspiciously, “Each of them is powerful; I wonder if the Deserted Sea Realm has a secret that we don’t know about.”","Hearing her words, Luo Piaoling was deep in thought.","“Oh, also Master Cloud!” she said, “It isn’t a name used by people of the Spiritual State. I think I can become one of his disciples and learn sword techniques from him. Since he taught warriors of the Spiritual State and Deserted Sea Realm, I don’t think he will refuse to teach us!”","“We must show enough sincerity.”","“Sincerity?” Lou Piaoling and Andrew looked at her in confusion.","“Of course!” The two people behind her each carried a big chest into the room.","They opened the lid of one chest and revealed crystals that were as clear as water.","Crystals were usually translucent with a faint grey color. Only the perfect crystals were as clear as these ones without a single trace of impurities.","One of these crystals was equivalent to 100 ordinary crystals.","When the other chest was opened, they saw all kinds of precious ores and treasures.","Sia said confidently, “These are treasures of our Red Dragon Family. I think they can show my sincerity to learn! I’m sure that I can successfully take Cloud as my master! I will cultivate under Master Cloud!”"]},{"number":512,"title":"Chapter 512 - Do You Think You Can Do Whatever You Want with A Large Payment?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Some time had passed after the Martial Dao Exchange among the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm, Spiritual State, and Ultimate West Realm. It was night now.","In Yuanyang City which was full of cultivators, there were no curfews; most of the cultivators who could enter the big Yuanyang City usually spent their nights in cultivation.","Although there was no curfew in the city, few people walked around during the night.","However, at this moment, a few furtive figures sneaked some glances toward the shop.","These people all wore black cloaks, and one of them asked, “Are you sure that this is the place?”","“Yes. It’s said that they learned the sword technique in this shop. Master Cloud must live in here as a hermit!”","“Good!” A proud and cold female voice said, “As long as Master Cloud is willing to teach us sword techniques, we will soon defeat the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm!”","“Should we enter now?!”","“Now?” A voice reprimanded, “Don’t you know any manners?! Do you want to enter the shop dressed like this?","“Hurry back and change your clothes!”","...","With the elevation of his privileges, Fang Qi now had the right to postpone the release of new items and had access to the data on the System’s energy reserve and partial consumption.","He glanced at the System Interface. When the Nangong Family attacked last time, the shop activated a large-scale, high-level lightning punishment, consuming lots of system energy. After the shop expansion and the production of movies and games, the system energy had almost run out. The original tens of millions of crystals had dwindled to about 100,000 a couple of days ago.","After the shop expansions, the business had more players, which replenished some of the consumed crystals. However, it would take some time to return to the previous level.","Mr. Fang had earned a few million crystals; he enjoyed his life by wearing custom-made spiritual artifacts as clothes and eating spiritual food as his lunch and supper to increase his cultivation strength, other than his breakfast of instant noodles. But recently, he was also a little short in funds.","He stayed in the shop each day to keep an eye on the business. He was afraid that trouble makers might come in. If they activated a couple of more lightning punishments, Fang Qi’s remaining crystals would run out.","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly saw two big figures pushing open the door and coming in.","They wore luxurious light armor which seemed to be designed for special ceremonies; they weren’t as stiff as those used in battles. They looked form-fitting, light, and smooth to move in.","The gilded engravings on the armor gave people the illusion of dancing light in the dark background. When the light reflected on the glossy surface, the radiant colors made the armor look like a silky garment.","These armors were beautiful pieces of work of art.","After they pushed open the door, a blonde-haired woman walked in. She was wearing a pure-white fur jacket, a pair of long boots, and a pair of long pants; she looked elegant and aristocratic.","Mr. Fang had seen this woman earlier today. He thought for a moment and remembered that she was Ms. Sia of that so-called Red Dragon Family.","Mr. Fang was sipping iced red tea when rows of aristocratically-dressed people, both male and female, filed in after this woman.","Mr. Fang gaped at them and stood up immediately, thinking that they were here to make trouble.","“Is Master Cloud here?” At this moment, Sia gestured to the people behind her with her eyes, and they put some chests on the counter.","When the chests opened, spiritual light almost spilled out from them. While looking at them, Li Xin’er, who was the cashier, felt a bit dizzy.","“These are our small gifts for Master Cloud,” with a rare smile, Sia pointed at the chests of treasures and said in her awkward Spiritual State language.","“Boss...” Li Xin’er was totally confused by the situation.","These people brought so many treasures to Cloud?!","If I can, I want to give him gifts too! After all, Cloud is so gorgeous.","But this...","Li Xin’er turned her eyes to Mr. Fang beseechingly.","“Gifts for... whom?” Mr. Fang stared at them in a daze.","“For Master Cloud!” Sia lifted her exquisite chin and said with cold arrogance, “You learned the huge sword technique from Master Cloud. The people of our Ultimate West Realm can do the same. I think we are more sincere than you guys.”","She pointed at the crystals and treasures on the counter and said, “These are two million crystals and all kinds of unique treasures from the Ultimate West Realm. I hope we can meet Master Cloud; it would be better if we can see his ultimate sword technique.”","“...” Mr. Fang’s lips kept twitching.","“Boss... What should we do...?” Li Xin’er asked in a low voice.","“...” After a long pause, Mr. Fang said, “Put two hundred million crystals in this lady’s membership card.”","Almost all the players in the shop looked over and stared at the newcomers in a daze.","Mr. Fang waved his hand and said, “There are seats over there. You can get online yourself.”","Then, he asked Li Xin’er to lead these people over to their seats.","Everyone was at a loss for words.","Mr. Fang said, “Now, I don’t even know why I got two million crystals. What can I do?”","“...”","On the other side, Sia had sat down and gotten online. A group of warriors of the Ultimate West Realm stood behind her and watched.","“I can meet Master Cloud through this spiritual artifact?” After Li Xin’er explained the operations to her, Sia began to watch Final Fantasy.","Soon, she was enthralled by the fascinating battles.","“Master Cloud is so young?!” She was surprised.","“This double-handed sword technique is awesome!” She was thrilled.","When Sephiroth came out, Sia’s eyes almost popped out as she yelled in astonishment, “How come he’s so powerful?!”","“Superb!”","Her shrieks could be heard all over the internet café, “What combat technique is this?!’","Nearby, two old men from the Heavenly Academy were playing StarCraft. When hearing the noise, they put down their virtual reality headsets and glared at her.","Zerg units filled their screens. GG!","Sitting opposite to her, the young people playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy also put down their virtual reality headsets and glared at her with murderous gazes.","The people of the Red Dragon Family who were watching from behind her looked baffled.","The veteran players of the Deserted Sea Realm were more experienced, and they turned off their external communication option. But before that, they called over Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang had heard her screams from the counter which was far away from her computer; he immediately walked over.","“Do you think that you can do whatever you want with a large payment?!”","Snap.","Mr. Fang turned off her computer."]},{"number":513,"title":"Chapter 513 - Dungeon Fighter Online— The Game Is Free?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s wrong?! How come the screen is black?” Sia asked impatiently. She was in the middle of the thrill, and the screen darkened!","After putting down her virtual reality headset, Sia saw people around her glaring at her ‘murderously’.","After all, most of the players leave a thread of spiritual awareness outside, afraid that they would be sneak-attacked.","“Why were you screaming while watching the movie?” Mr. Fang issued the warning, “This is a public place; please don’t make loud noises here.”","“...” This woman of the Ultimate West Realm was torn between being ashamed and jumping up to hit him.","It wasn’t a good feeling.","Suddenly, she remembered that she was here to become a disciple of Master Cloud. Instead, they let her watch this stuff?!","While she was mulling over it, she suddenly felt like she had understood many combat techniques. If she were to use a double-handed greatsword now, her combat force would be much higher than before!","“How can it be?!” Astonishment and excitement filled her mind! She couldn’t contain herself!","She felt as if she had obtained the legendary battle memories left by some ancient master in her family. If she could understand these memories, she would achieve unimaginable elevation in her strength.","Thrilled, she was eager to continue watching.","“Hurry! Turn on the spiritual artifact for me!”","Mr. Fang said mildly, “It’s no use turning it on.”","He pointed at the time on the computer beside hers. “It’s 12 at midnight, time to close the shop.”","“...” Grinding her white teeth, Sia looked like an enraged female puma.","“By the way, if you beat the shop owner or make trouble in the shop, you’re no longer welcome in the shop.” This sentence ended all her violent urges.","Mr. Fang gestured to the door. “Please.”","“!!!” Sia felt like she was going to explode.","Her expressions changed several times. In the end, she cussed in her own tongue to vent her anger and finally walked out.","...","The sales of Final Fantasy had slowly increased to a little over 900. After all, if not for the recommendations of other viewers, few people would spend 100 crystals to try it.","– The morning of the next day –","Mr. Fang had just opened the door when he felt a surge of murderous spirit rush toward his face.","He rubbed his tired eyes and saw about 100 warriors of Ultimate West Realm blocking the door with murderous spirit.","According to the family badges on their clothes, they mostly came from the Red Dragon Family and the Black Dragon Family. As for the Frost Dragon Family, with several high-level warriors still recovering from their injuries, only a few of them came.","“What are you doing here?” Mr. Fang asked, “Don’t you know how we handle trouble makers?”","The leaders were Sia, Luo Piaoling, and elders of the two families.","With her hands on her waist, Sia walked to stand before Mr. Fang arrogantly while saying in a heavy accent, “We want to see Final Fantasy! Now! Block us if you can!”","Mr. Fang closed the door and put a notice on it. [The shop owner is resting; not open until the afternoon.]","Nalan Hongwu and the others who had just arrived were surprised, and their faces turned dark. “What’s happening?”","The masters of the Tang Family, Wang Family, and other ancient families had just traveled from afar and arrived here, ready to get on the computers in the shop. “The shop is not open?”","“What’s wrong?! How come it’s still closed at this hour?”","“Resting? What damn excuse is this?!”","Nalan Hongwu stroked his beard, feeling like something wasn’t right. “It happened once before when a few kids of our Deserted Sea Realm woke up the shop owner in the middle of the night. I wonder...”","The moment he said it, the family masters immediately looked around with anger on their faces. “Who did it?!”","F*ck!? The warriors of the Ultimate West Realm were stunned, and their faces twitched.","“This... We have something else to do; we need to return to the hotel now.”","Run!","They fled.","“You guys! Stop immediately!”","The others had the urge to catch them and beat them to death.","“What should we do now?”","“Should we call and ask the shop owner to open the door...?”","“Let’s come back in the afternoon.” Nalan Hongwu was too lazy to try since he still remembered what had happened in the last similar incident.","...","When the door opened in the afternoon, the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm looked more subdued.","About 100 warriors filed in and some of them whispered, “What happened today?!”","“I have no idea... I was beaten when I was just walking down the street. How come this city is so dangerous?!” With bruises on his face, a warrior of the Ultimate West Realm said to his friend.","“I want to return to the Ultimate West Realm... The Spiritual State is so dangerous...”","Walking before them, Sia looked awkward and embarrassed when she overheard the conversation.","Feeling a headache, Lou Piaoling touched the scratches on his face and said, “You guys, stop messing around...”","Subdued, about 100 of them each bought a membership card and got online.","At this moment, Fang Qi finally saw a message on the System Interface.","[New Task: New Online Game (Completed)","Task Description: The game can only be activated by unlocking more world views.","World View Unlock: Please unlock more sci-fi world views (5 sci-fi games/movies reaching average sales of 1,000); please unlock more magic world views (5 magic fantasy games/movies reaching average sales of 1,000)","Task Reward: Dungeon Fighter Online Virtual Reality Remake; one luck treasure chest (Large)]","By now, the old games and the rules in the shop had been listed in a big table and glued on the wall.","Only new games would be written on the small blackboard.","Today, the top position of Final Fantasy was taken by a new game on the small blackboard: [Dungeon Fighter Online. Activation price – free.]","The cultivators were swarming into the shop after waiting for a whole morning. Then, they saw that a new game had appeared on the small blackboard.","“Free?” Mo Xian and her female companions exclaimed, “Sir, is this game... free?!”","Afraid that she had seen it wrong, she looked again with wide-open eyes.","There was a line of words below the title. [You can enter the game by clicking on the icon on the desktop; it doesn’t need to be activated.]","Nalan Hongwu had also entered the shop and was passing the counter.","“Ugh? Kid Fang finally found his conscience?”","Instantly, chatter erupted before the counter.","Sia was displeased. Due to her yelling, her computer had been turned off yesterday, and now people were making such loud noises.","Soon, she finished the last part of Final Fantasy. After putting down her virtual reality headset, she walked over to the counter and looked at the people around the counter curiously.","“Sir, is this new game really free?!” A cultivator of Yuanyang City asked cautiously.","At this moment, the Jiuhua City Shop and Half City Shop had also put this new game on the small blackboards.","“We don’t have to pay money to activate this game?!” Many people felt as if they were in a dream. After all, even Resident Evil needed 5 crystals to activate, which were not much for high-level people but were quite a lot for ordinary players.","It was more so for soldiers of Jiuhua Army; they only played the Legend of Mir 2 since it was paid by the army, and they would hesitate for a long time before they decided to buy other games.","But now, there was a free game?!","Sia narrowed her eyes. In the last two days, she had gotten a general idea about games, knowing that other people had been high-level players in the old games. As proud as her, she would feel bad if she entered those games now as a newbie.","It was even harder in the online games. It was said that the forces in the Legend of Mir 2 had been firmly established.","However, in the new game, everyone was at the same starting line.","Maybe... I should try this game?!"]},{"number":514,"title":"Chapter 514 - Arad Continent","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It was noon, and many people were playing games. However, with only a few games on the screen, the new game icon attracted many people’s attention.","After the incident with the three saint factions and the counterattack of Dajin, and the demon catastrophe in the Morning Star Sea Realm, the players in the Half City Shop and the Jiuhua City Shop included not only big forces but independent cultivators, independent warriors, and people of small and moderate forces from nearby areas.","After seeing that this game was free...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","An independent warrior sat before his computer and yelled, “Hurry up and look! This game doesn’t need activation to play!”","Someone had tried to click on the game. “It’s indeed free! I’m in the game now!”","While they were talking about it, some young masters from other cities had just entered the shop. Upon hearing this, they looked over and asked, “It’s free? Really?”","They exchanged a look. “Should we try it?”","...","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","As a new player, Sia was very eager about this new game.","She immediately returned to her seat and clicked on the game.","While she waited patiently for the game to load, she heard crisp musical notes sounding by her ear, which were quite enjoyable.","Lou Piaoling who was sitting next to her looked over at the sounds. “What’s this?”","“The newly-released game. I want to try it.”","“A newly-released game?” Lou Piaoling started thinking once he heard that. In this morning, he asked around and got lots of information; he was still not familiar with this new stuff but wasn’t as ignorant as before.","A new game meant a new starting line and a chance to fairly compete with others.","Acutely, his sharp senses told him that something was unusual.","A new game that was just released? He had heard that in a virtual world such as the Legend of Mir 2, the players who entered the games before others would obtain lots of advantages.","Should I try it too?","At this moment, they entered the game with many other players from the three shops at the same time.","The Character-Creation Interface was decorated in the classical western style. On the bottom of the screen was a row of metal boxes, in which were complicated-looking, medieval emblems representing different classes. The sword represented Slayers, the gun represented Gunners, and the cross represented Priests...","It was only a game, but it gave people the feel of an ancient ceremony. When one class was chosen, the character for the class and the related introductions would appear on the screen.","It must be noted that, when the original game was first released, there were no Female Slayer, Female Gunner, Female Priest, Male Mage, and Male Fighter.","However, the virtual reality remake by the System was as real as it could be, and there was no chance for imposters. Therefore, in this remake version, there were both male and female characters for all five classes.","“Can this class use greatswords?” Sia clicked on the Female Slayer and started.","Lou Piaoling also chose Male Slayer.","Meanwhile, the guests from the Deserted Sea Realm had also started the game.","For example, Song Qingfeng chose the class of Fighter.","Xu Zixin chose to be a Female Gunner.","Tang Yu, Wang Xie, and others of the Spiritual State chose classes such as Male Gunner and Male Mage respectively after reading the introductions on each of the classes.","“Boss, what should I choose?” Jiang Xiaoyue stared at Mr. Fang questioningly, intending to choose the same class as Mr. Fang.","Fang Qi said after a moment of consideration, “You can choose Mage; I want to play Slayer.”","“Okay...” She chose to be a loli mage reluctantly.","This was an adventure story that happened on th eArad Continent.","When the crystal wind-chime-like music faded, players opened their eyes in the darkness and found that the world suddenly lightened.","The clouds before them scattered, and they looked down from the high sky, seeing a vast world of mountains and oceans. The sky was engulfed in an extremely huge magic array, and the distant tower reached high into the clouds. Faint shadows that looked like huge beasts moved behind the clouds, and everything showed that this continent was strange and special.","Even the warriors of the Ultimate West Realm were amazed.","“I feel like I’m in a new world! Is it really not a small world in a spiritual artifact?” Lou Piaoling asked in surprise.","He could feel wind flowing around him, and everything felt real at the touch. When he opened his eyes again, only fuzzy memories were left in him.","He remembered a vicious and bloody-red demonic hand, and the creepy atmosphere startled him out of his sleep as a cold corpse lay beside him","When he woke up, he found that he had fallen asleep leaning on a big tree in a huge forest.","Reaching out his hands, he found that his left hand was locked in a huge chain, and it looked vicious and bloody-red, giving him an ominous feeling. A huge sword that was as long as one person lay on the ground on his right. He was dressed in a simple short vest, which didn’t seem like his clothes.","“I’m...” Lou Piaoling shook his head and found some information and memories in his head. “Is this the Slayer?!”","With wonder and surprise, he looked at his left hand which seemed to contain demonic strength. “Kazan...?”","Dark-green skinned monsters walked out from the shadows in the forest and surrounded him.","Each character that the players controlled in the game came to this land with their own dreams and goals. The slayers wanted to find Kazan and seek revenge, male gunners were squeezed to a corner in the Empyreans and fell onto Arad, priests fought with the imposters of ‘Curse of Blood’ with holy missions, and the female slayers came to this land to seek revenge on the empire as the products of the empire’s Metastasis experiments...","The slayer on Luo Piaoling’s screen waved his huge sword and slaughtered all the goblins that surrounded him in the forest. The adventurers (players) who walked out of the forest would enter Elvenguard, the spawn place in the game.","It must be noted that the forest in the spawn place was an open map instead of a dungeon. A character called Seria would be rescued by the first group of adventurers, and she would be friendly to later adventurers because of that.","Elvenguard was a station built in the forest. Only when the players entered Hendon Myre riding in horse-drawn carriages would their adventures really began.","“Wow... It’s huge!”","The players saw a huge, prosperous city with white walls and red tiles. In the streets lined with many green plants thronged all kinds of pedestrians from all over the world, including adventurers, merchants, and scholars.","As a free city that advocated a magic civilization, Hendon Myre had many magic infrastructure and devices around the city.","Seeing the pedestrians walking on the streets and the prosperous scenes, the players all exclaimed in amazement.","On the street, many pedestrians were talking, and sometimes...","“Giggle... Boss, look at that guy! He’s so funny!” Jiang Xiaoyue pointed at a vendor on the street and giggled.","“Come on! Make money with money!” A cunning merchant with a weird pot on his head called out to people like Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue in a croaky voice.","“I don’t believe your non-sense!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted. While glancing around at the adventurers and pedestrians who were walking on the street, she said, “Boss, we’re here to look for Master Pungjin, right? Where is he?”","“He’s easy to find. He might yell ‘My name is Pungjin, and I’m a Wind Fist instructor!’” Fang Qi tried to mimic Pungjin’s voice.","A bald man, who was wearing yellow clothes and walking from the opposite direction, looked at them in disapproval. “I’m the Wind Fist Instructor Pungjin!”","“...” Mr. Fang felt embarrassed that it was so easy to find his target."]},{"number":515,"title":"Chapter 515 - How Can I Adventure on Arad While Wearing Those Ugly Clothes?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The word ‘dungeon’ in the game was derived from a tabletop role-playing game ‘Dungeons & Dragons’. As the game evolved, in most cases, the word ‘dungeon’ represented a private zone or a parallel space where one could explore, adventure, or complete missions.","No one but you and your teammates could enter this private zone.","There weren’t multiple servers or channels in the system version of the game, but Hendon Myre was as large as any city in the real world. The adventurers walking out from the spawn place didn’t crowd the city. In fact, if not for the many pedestrians and NPCs (non-playable characters) including adventurers and merchants who were thronging in the streets, the players would find this huge city quite empty and cold.","Also, the players had to travel in horse-drawn carriages between places. If they walked, they wouldn’t be able to finish a few simple quests that required running around even if they had eight hours.","Besides the main storyline and quests, the various side story quests weren’t limited to those few NPCs; more NPCs could issue quests. Perhaps the pedestrians walking on the streets or residents living in the houses in the alleys might give them quests.","For the adventurers, despite their different goals and ambitions, their way of surviving was to complete quests and make money.","For Luo Piaoling and other new players who had just arrived at the city, the first place that they had an encounter with was Seria’s hotel. The new adventurers entered the elegant and bright hotel in twos and threes.","Upon entering, they heard the beautiful music played by bards.","The first thing that they saw was a snow-white grand hall with a western-style floor paved in sapphire blue tiles. Also, exquisite magic chandeliers dangling from the ceiling made the place look elegant and comfortable.","On one side was a corridor leading to the second floor. The hotel wasn’t huge but bright; the bright yellow curtains were pulled to the sides, letting in radiant sunshine. People felt warm and cozy bathed in the sun.","Luo Piaoling saw several familiar faces who were cultivators of the Deserted Sea Realm that he had seen in the Martial Dao Exchange.","“Ugh? Isn’t the hotel owner the girl who we encountered in the forest?” He saw two figures walking into the hotel.","“Hello. My name’s Seria.” He seemed to hear the silver-haired elven girl friendly greet the adventurers.","Subconsciously, he recalled the old man in the Slayer Dojo in the Back Alley who kept murmuring nonsense such as ‘a sword may conquer the flesh, but only your heart may conquer the mind.’","If not for the others’ introduction, he would never have thought that this blind old man was his instructor.","He had only seen him a few times, but the old man left a deep impression on his mind.","“A sword may conquer the flesh, but only your heart may conquer the mind?” Luo Piaoling chewed on the words and was amazed. “It’s surprising that such a grandmaster lives on the inconspicuous streets.”","Since Dajin was almost a nation full of warriors, there were many slayers in the game. Some of them paid gold coins and went up to their rooms, and some were still chatting in the hall on the first floor.","At this moment, Luo Piaoling made a sudden discovery.","“These people... how come they are dressed exactly like me?!” He hadn’t noticed it before since there were all kinds of people thronging in the streets.","But now in the hotel, most of the people here were adventurers, and he made this unique discovery in one glance.","Meanwhile, Sia who chose to the class, Female Slayer, had also come to Arad as instructed in the special mission for female slayers. They had taken another route after they fled from the empire compared to other players, and they met other adventurers at this place.","Upon entering the hotel, she froze. How come so many people are dressed exactly like me?!","She wore a short, tight-fitting black dress with decorative black feathers on the shoulder, a pair of flaxen, tight-fitting long pants, and a pair of black boots.","Sia found that all the female slayers were dressed this way!","However, her clothes were quite pretty.","Beside her, Lou Piaoling felt embarrassed while he looked down at his loose pants and short vest which covered only his chest and shoulders, so he wasn’t completely naked.","Lou Piaoling thought that it looked quite ugly.","Putting that aside; more importantly, with everyone dressed this way, he wouldn’t be able to be distinguish from others.","Damn it!","At this time, he saw three young man walking over from the opposite direction. They each held a sword, but they were dressed differently.","One of them wore a long windbreaker with dark grey and silver shoulder armor, the second wore a black, sleeveless turtle-neck, and the last one wore a dark blue vest with a white inner shirt. More important, the last guy’s hair was red hair?!","“Young Master Lin, what do you think? My outfit is quite awe-inspiring, huh?!” The red-haired young man wearing the dark blue vest laughed and said, “If it is still like before, how can I adventure on Arad while wearing those ugly clothes?”","“Good, good. It looks like Iori Yagami’s outfit.”","Luo Piaoling’s face reddened, feeling as if they were talking about him.","“Ugh-?!” Sia had just met up with Luo Piaoling, and she looked in the direction of the conversation. “How come they are dressed differently from you?!”","“I have no idea.” Luo Piaoling spread out his hands. “Should I... go and ask them?”","Immediately, he walked up to them. “Brothers, are you slayers too?”","Song Qingfeng said, “Yeah. What’s up?”","“Can I ask a question? Why are we all dressed...” Luo Piaoling pointed at himself and said, “And you’re dressed differently?”","“Oh, that...” Lin Shao explained casually, “It works like the store in Qzone. You can pull out the Game Interface and find the button leading to ‘Item Shop’.”","“We can buy clothes in there?!” Sia ask in surprise.","Immediately, she entered her hotel room in which there were items such as windows and desk, etc. Then, she pulled out the Game Interface, wondering if she should change into other outfits.","...","“We can indeed buy clothes here...” Sia looked as if she had just discovered a new continent. “There are other things too!”","“Hurry and look! There are many good things!”"]},{"number":516,"title":"Chapter 516 - The Internet Connection Is Off","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What things do we have in here?” Luo Piaoling opened the item shop and saw many options, including [Hot Items], [Outfits], and [Items], etc.","At this moment, the people who had overheard Song Qingfeng’s words also opened the item shop and browsed the many items in it.","After all, it was humiliating for them to be adventurers dressed like everyone else.","Immediately, they began to pick clothes for themselves in the item shop.","They wanted to find a set of clothes that were fitting for their status! They didn’t just want unique clothes!","Nalan Hongwu was also browsing the outfits in the item shop. As an old duke in Dajin, he was a well-respected old man; how could he wear such a short vest?","He carefully looked at each outfit in the item shop with widened eyes.","He studied them for a long while.","“How come there are no good outfits here?!” He slammed his hand on the desk and yelled.","Tights?! How could an old man like him wear tights?!","Leather armor?! Too low!","Bronze armor? He had seen someone wear it! That wouldn’t work!","He couldn’t find any luxurious and elegant attire that fitted his status!","Then, he glanced at the prices.","1 crystal?","1.5 crystal?","So cheap?!","“Kid Fang, don’t you have anything better and more expensive?!”","For ordinary cultivators and warriors, they didn’t care about their outfits. They felt good as long as they could come into the shop and play games.","However, some other people felt different about this issue.","For example, a girl who had deposited two million crystals in her membership card was yelling, “Sir! There isn’t a single pretty outfit! What is going on?!”","These outfits aren’t as pretty as the outfit that I’m wearing right now!","At this moment, someone said, “It’s a free game. How can you expect good things in here?”","“Right...” Sia shook her head and thought in disappointment, It seems like this game was released for the sake of the ordinary people. After all, it doesn’t need money to activate! It is quite clear.","Forget it! Sia thought, I can’t do anything even though they aren’t that pretty. As long as I’m not dressed like everyone else on the street.","She chose one outfit and was ready to pay. When she looked at the price again, she almost spewed blood on the screen.","She had seen that this piece of high-end clothes cost 1.5 crystals. However, at check-out, she found that it was 1.5 crystals for 7 days!","There were other options including 4.5 crystals for 30 days and 15 crystals for permanent use.","If she bought all the pieces including the blouse, pants, and hat permanently...","Sia froze; she almost didn’t want to buy these clothes and hesitated.","However, the more expensive the outfit was, the fewer people would buy it. She decided to buy it for one month to try it out.","The entire outfit cost her more than 30 crystals, higher than the cost of the Legend of Mir 2 for one month.","People like Luo Piaoling and Sia had come to this wondrous land for adventures, but to their surprise, they were almost trapped in the item shop by the exorbitant prices of their outfits before the adventure began!","Luo Piaoling and Sia almost weren’t able to get out, but other adventurers didn’t dare to go out and felt like puking up blood. Right now, they were still loitering in the item shop, hesitating over the outfits.","Finally, some people chose to buy outfits for a limited time while others just gave up.","At last, they embarked on their journey again. At this time, most players encountered a new problem—subclass advancement.","There were only five primary classes at the beginning of Dungeon Fighter Online, but as the players leveled up, they were qualified to advance to subclasses. Almost every class contained four subclasses.","Take male slayers as an example.","Some of them wouldn’t yield under any situation and would advance continuously toward their goal.","These people would never give in to fate even if the hands they used for grasping weapons became distorted. Instead, they would put more efforts in the study of weapons. Some of these people achieved the ultimate level in their respective weapon areas and were called Blade Masters.","To achieve the ultimate level of skill with swords, they gave up and sealed the strength of the devil-like hand. As time went on, this hand turned gray.","This was a subclass that could unleash the ultimate power of swords.","In contrast, another type of male slayers would do anything to gain greater power. They embraced Kazan’s strength, becoming crazy and hot-tempered. They even turned into aggressive devil gods, with blood-red eyes being a characteristic of this class. They were Berserkers.","Following the path of the great Zieg who was one of the first Soul Benders, Soul Benders were the only people who could master the force of demons and ghosts. They unlocked the chains of fate and mastered the strength in their arm. Perhaps one day, they could command all ghosts.","Some male slayers gave up their eyesight in order to sense waves and fluctuations. With powerful fortitude and perseverance, they could still survive in this dangerous land after losing their eyes since they had learned to see things with their hearts.","Coming from the same spawn place and with the same original experience, different people would embark on different paths from now on. Like male slayers, the other classes also had different subclasses. The players would follow their respective path toward their goals with determination.","Now, Grand Flores was in its liveliest moment.","“We need some veteran players to come with us to the Thunderland! King Difficulty!”","“Poison Thunderland! Players who want to come join the team!”","At the dungeon entrance outside the forest, adventurers from all kinds of classes were yelling boisterously.","“So many people...” Having just purchased his outfits, Luo Piaoling hurried to Grand Flores. Right now, it was time for him to complete his subclass quest.","“Shadow Thunderland at Master Difficulty! Come into our team to level up and advance to subclasses!”","“Me!” Luo Piaoling froze for a moment and yelled without hesitation","“Okay. Come in.”","After joining the team, Luo Piaoling found that he had three teammates of different classes, and their accent showed that they came from the Deserted Sea Realm. “It’s our last round! Hurry!”","Since the Jiuhua City Shop didn’t close in the morning, many players had almost used up their computer time by now.","“Okay...” Luo Piaoling followed them into the dungeon.","In the virtual reality remake version, the monsters in the dungeons were more powerful than those in the original game, which was why the players must play in teams.","Seeing Luo Piaoling’s hesitation, his teammates realized that he was a newbie, so they urged with some displeasure, “Hurry up!”","“The three of us are godlike players; you’re in luck!”","“Oh...” Luo Piaoling had realized that this game was quite difficult; even with his great power, he couldn’t play it all by himself.","The forest was fraught with horrifying monsters; even plants could trap one in a desperate situation.","Luo Piaoling followed his teammates cautiously.","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","Three young men were busy fighting zombies in the Shadow Thunderland.","Suddenly, the screens dimmed.","“What’s wrong?!”","The screens showed, [Internet connection is off.]","The three gaped at the screen and were at a loss for words.","In the next moment, the game was off.","Meanwhile, Luo Piaoling battled his way into the depth of Shadow Thunderland with his teammates.","He suddenly looked around. “???”","“Where are they?!” They had been killing zombies before him a moment ago!!!"]},{"number":517,"title":"Chapter 517 - The Weak Adventurers","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Before Luo Piaoling was a vast and gloomy forest.","Seemingly endless hordes of zombies crawled out from the forest and swarmed toward Luo Piaoling.","There were four difficulty levels in this virtual reality remake version. Among them, the Master Difficulty was the normal mode where everything was real-world-like. In the game and plot, the adventurers all had great strength, which meant that the Master Difficulty was tough to beat.","The King Difficulty was the highest difficulty level for the adventurers, and the players couldn’t pass it alone.","The higher the difficulty level, the more benefits players would get. To challenge themselves and obtain better items, many players would choose higher difficulty levels.","The three players stared at their screens in a daze.","Then, realization struck them.","“Time is up.”","“Let’s go!”","They got off the computers and left.","The team had had four players, but now only Luo Piaoling was left in the game.","“...” His face darkened. Although he wasn’t sure why his teammates had disappeared, he wondered how he could handle so many zombies!","Without his original cultivation strength in the real world, he was now only a male slayer who was about level 10. In the dark dungeon, his awareness of the surroundings dropped to an extremely low-level. Luo Piaoling tried to kill zombies, but he was wounded many times during the process!","After several rounds of that, even though he battled his way to the boss, he was too injured to continue.","Soon, he fell in front of the boss and a large horde of zombies.","He had asked around before and knew that he could resurrect in a certain spot after dying in the game.","However, Luo Piaoling saw the option of life tokens on the game interface before him!","He could buy a life token for one crystal to resurrect on the spot.","@","He still had more than 700 crystals in his membership card. He chose the option tentatively to try it out. With one less crystal in his card, he resurrected on the spot with full HP.","“I can do this!!??” Dumbfounded, he stared at himself and laughed since he had resurrected with full HP.","“Since I can do this, no monster can block me!”","He neatly moved and dodged the boss’s attack, striking his huge sword forward with vicious force.","Combining his skills in the game and his own sword techniques, he cleared all the small monsters around the boss.","But then, he found that...","He had struck the boss once before, but now, its injury couldn’t be seen anymore.","The boss of the Shadow Thunderland was a fast zombie king who emitted a freezing presence. Luo Piaoling carefully dodged its attack and struck it again.","Calmly, he dodged the next few attacks and found another chance to strike back.","Then, he saw that all the wounds he inflicted on this boss had disappeared.","Luo Piaoling was stupefied.","If he struck someone several times with his greatsword in the real world, the head and the torso of this person would have been severed!","But this zombie king only had a few scratches on it, and these scratches were slowly recovering!","More importantly, the freezing presence around the zombie king weakened his health and reduced his HP continuously.","Half an hour later, he died with a scream.","Desperate, Luo Piaoling decided to go out and come back with a team...","Soon, he resurrected at the entrance of Grand Flores.","However, he felt like he didn’t have any strength left in him.","[You’ve entered the Weakened State.]","“Ahh!” He was experiencing a mental collapse.","What the heck is this?","After fighting for almost one hour, he had gotten no experience points. Instead, he became so weak that he couldn’t walk?!","If he entered a dungeon in this state, he wouldn’t even be able to kill small monsters.","His game experience was extremely poor!","In this state, he could do nothing but wait at least ten minutes for recovery.","While he stood there in the weakened state, he saw that many other adventurers were also reduced to a weakened state.","Many people complained about this among the loud chatter.","“How come you’re weakened too?”","“Don’t mention it. The King Difficulty is so hard. The three of us entered the dungeon and couldn’t defeat the monsters. How come you’re weakened too?”","“My teammates are scum; they disappeared in the middle of the battle.”","“...”","This complaint was mild since Luo Piaoling was not hot-tempered.","However, there were hot-tempered players, and they cussed, “That guy with the ID Young Master Chen and his buddies are scum! They disappeared in the middle of the battle! Don’t form a team with them in the future!”","“Are these places even for humans!” The cultivators and warriors who had entered the weakened state after being killed complained to each other.","“It was horrifying! I entered with two teammates and found that the monsters couldn’t be killed!”","Although the players were cultivators and warriors, the game set the difficulty levels according to their true strengths. Besides, most of them hadn’t advanced to their subclasses yet and didn’t have equipment. The players with greater strength could pass the Master Difficulty themselves, but their low damage couldn’t allow them to pass higher levels.","As for the warriors and cultivators with average strength who had just entered the game, they had to form teams of at least four players to even think about challenging the higher difficulty levels.","For example, Tang Yu, who wasn’t a great shooter, chose the class of Gunner, and he also chose a high difficulty level in the dungeon. He had been beaten senseless and wondered what was life.","Xun Yuan didn’t fare any better in his role as a mage. Although mages were similar to cultivators in many ways, there were quite a few differences between them. Without understanding his mage skills, Xun Yuan tried to challenge a high difficulty level and thus received a heavy blow.","Soon, Luo Piaoling glanced around and saw that a white-haired old man was also in the weakened state; the old man was Gu Tingyun.","“...”","A large group of adventurers in the weakened state gathered at the entrance of Grand Flores; they were reduced to this state either for challenging a higher difficulty level beyond their abilities or due to the disappearances of their teammates.","With nothing to do while in the weakened state, the players in the Yuanyang City Shop began protesting with passion.","“Can anyone pass this place?!”","“It’s too difficult!”","“Sir! What’s wrong with this game?!”","“It’s impossible to pass the King Difficulty!”","“This game is infuriating.”","“I want to quit!”","While they were whining and protesting, a voice yelled at the entrance of Grand Flores, “Taking people to pass Shadow Thunderland at King Difficulty for 15,000 gold coins! You don’t have to do anything in the process!”","All the players froze.","“What?!”","“Take us to pass Shadow Thunderland at King Difficulty?!”","“Is he crazy?!”","Tang Yu yelled, “Look! Someone is offering to help people pass the Shadow Thunderland at King Difficulty!”","“What?!” Wang Xie, Xun Yuan, and other young masters all looked over.","“Taking people to pass Shadow Thunderland?!” Sia had just come out from Shadow Thunderland at Master Difficulty Level. Her teammates were newbies, and she had to buy several life tokens to resurrect her teammates and herself, and they had barely passed it.","She could imagine how hard it would be to pass it at King Difficulty all by oneself.","“Impossible! Is he a scammer?” After all, with her great strength, Sia had just barely passed the Master Difficulty Level!","Luo Piaoling soon found this guy; his ID was ‘Only Like Playing White Hand’. This guy didn’t buy new outfits and wore the original male slayer’s outfit, and his name sounded like a weak and insignificant slayer.","[TL Note; White hand is the nickname that Chinese players had for Blade Master.]","“Maybe he’s a scammer?”","“Isn’t it the shop owner’s ID?!” Suddenly, someone recognized the ID.","The faces of many people’s faces as they wondered, Why did the shop owner get himself such a weird name?","Many players of the Ultimate West Realm had followed Luo Piaoling’s footsteps and entered the game after watching Final Fantasy.","“Humph! Even Mr. Seth (Luo Piaoling) was defeated; how can there be people who can beat that monster?!”","“If the Lord of our Ultimate West Realm is here, he might have a chance. That kid didn’t even dare to enter the Martial Dao Exchange; how can he challenge that monster?”","“Don’t worry. Look at the weakened adventurers around Mr. Seth. He will soon join them.”","“Hahaha!”","The weakened adventurers talked among themselves animatedly."]},{"number":518,"title":"Chapter 518 - Secret Sword Art","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, almost everyone was at the point of advancing to a subclass, and thus they didn’t believe that someone could pass Shadow Thunderland at King Difficulty by themselves.","The mages used a different system of techniques than cultivators, so the cultivators couldn’t be that good at the class yet, but the warriors excelled in the skills of the fighters and slayers. Also, some cultivators and warriors who researched guns played as gunners, and their skills with guns had greatly improved from before.","Among the many slayers and fighters who were warriors in real life, Fang Qi’s sword techniques were no better than those high-level warriors if he didn’t use Complete Synchronization with one character. Then, what was Mr. Fang’s advantage while he played the same role as the warriors whose sword techniques were as good as his?","He had no advantages at all.","Then, how could he pass the dungeon of this difficulty level?","“Ugh? Look! Someone entered his team!” A warrior of Ultimate West Realm said with interest as if he were watching a show.","Two newbies entered the team. One had the ID ‘Swordsman’, and the other had the ID ‘Stone’. They were slayer and fighter respectively, and they were both in the weakened state.","For ordinary warriors, they didn’t know how hard these high-level difficulties were. Since they were in the weakened state and couldn’t do anything, they decided to have a try. “Godlike Master, take us with you.”","“Are these people morons?”","“We have such morons among us?!”","Before they could finish, they saw another player entering Mr. Fang’s team.","It was a female slayer with the ID ‘Nalan Mingxue’.","“Can you do it?” Although Nalan Mingxue was doubtful, she joined the team.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue had finished advancing to her subclass. The others were either fighting in the dungeons or watching this drama.","After the payment of gold coins, the team challenging Shadow Thunderland at King-Level Difficulty embarked on their journey.","Soon, others saw these people entering Grand Flores.","In the weakened state, the two newbies who had come to follow Fang Qi took the rear of the team, thinking that they wouldn’t even have the strength to flee if the zombies lunged at them if they walked in the front.","Obviously, they didn’t know that it wasn’t safe to take the rear.","With Fang Qi taking the lead, Nalan Mingxue in the middle, and the two newbies taking the rear, they walked into the depths of the forest.","Deep, bestial growls came from the dense, gloomy, and humid forest.","Soon, the zombies smelled the scent of humans and swarmed out, quickly killing the two newbies who had lagged behind. Then, they tightened the circle.","“So many monsters for two players?” Sia watched in disdain. “I think they might be killed by the first horde of zombies.”","“Can you do it?” Nalan Mingxue rolled her eyes at Fang Qi. The zombies got closer, and she was ready to fight them.","In the next moment, Mr. Fang blocked the lunge of the nearby zombies and then leaped up as if he were stepping on wind. All the zombies lunging at him missed their target!","Before Nalan Mingxue could show her hand, she heard a yell from the sky, “Move back!”","In the game that resembled reality, the players might injure their teammates if they were not careful.","Nalan Mingxue stepped aside and dodged the attack of one zombie, and then she saw Fang Qi shooting down from the sky with a huge sword beam like a heavy arrow!","Moonlight Slash!","The damage of great swords was the strongest among all weapons. With the momentum of the big leap, this strike was much more powerful than its usual damage.","The huge sword light crashed into the horde of zombies with vicious force.","Boom!","With an earth-shaking sound, the huge force created an overwhelming sword shock wave on the ground, sending all the zombies flying!","Everyone saw that this Moonlight Slash forced all the zombies to fall to one side.","“Leap and Moonlight Slash? Good combination.” Some people smiled and thought that it was a good move which had forced all the monsters to fall in front of him instead of behind him.","However, that was all Fang Qi had achieved. Soon, the thick-skinned zombies would stand up and surround Fang Qi again.","But in the next moment, their vision blurred and they suddenly saw Fang Qi switching his sword.","The backpacks in the game were spatial spiritual artifacts, same as the ones that players used in the real world.","It wasn’t a surprise to them that Fang Qi suddenly took out another weapon from thin air.","However, after this sword was taken out, they couldn’t clearly see Fang Qi’s sword moves; they only saw dizzying, white, blurry shadows.","It looked as if Fang Qi weren’t holding a sword but a wave of light.","Not only using his right hand that was holding the previous sword, Fang Qi waved the sword with both hands, creating waves upon waves of dizzying sword light.","He slid across the grass-covered land silently in three steps. With each step, he struck out a wave of radiant sword light which moved so fast that it was a blur.","“Is this... Drive Slash?!” Luo Piaoling was astonished that Fang Qi used Drive Slash this way. “The steps are right, but the sword technique... how come it is so fast?”","He found that each of Fang Qi’s strike reduced resistance, and the blade of the sword skimmed the zombies’ skin like swimming fish and didn’t slash them. If Fang Qi had slashed the zombies, without cutting through them, the zombies would have been sent flying like baseballs, and Fang Qi’s sword would have been slowed down by the huge resistance.","Everyone saw streaks of light dancing in front of Fang Qi. When he slid back to his original spot in three steps like a ghost, most of the zombies didn’t fly outward. Instead, they gathered in the direction of Fang Qi.","“What sword technique is this?!” Sia yelled in astonishment.","“What sword is he using?! It moves so swiftly?!” Luo Piaoling stared at the screen dumbfoundedly.","Exclamations came from behind Fang Qi non-stop.","The weapons that Fang Qi used all required level 20, and he had advanced to the subclass of Blade Master. After choosing a subclass, the slayers would finally find their paths and obtain tremendous strength compared to before.","Obviously, it was a set of exquisite double-handed sword techniques specially designed for the sword which looked like a light beam","Secret Sword Art!","Secret Sword Art was the basic sword technique and the core of the high-level techniques that brought pride to Blade Masters. The double-handed lightsaber could move at an extremely fast speed.","It was not only complicated and effective, but it was magnificent to watch as well!","The sword moved so fast that the white sword light looked like a dazzling butterfly dancing in the air or a sword flower made of lights blooming in the air.","In the radiant, elegant, and extremely fast streaks of sword light, the zombies closest to Fang Qi were sent into the air by the sword before they could fall to the ground.","While the streaks of sword light danced, the zombies closest to Fang Qi were shredded. Meanwhile, the zombies in the front and at the back were gathered in one group.","Gore Cross!","Before the zombies could get up, a bloody-red cross-shaped sword light struck the zombies in the front, pushing them into their peers behind them.","Then, Fang Qi leaped up again and used Moonlight Slash!","Radiant sword light rose again and almost transformed into a storm!","Fang Qi killed his way into the depths of the forest until he came before the boss of the dungeon, and he almost wasn’t injured.","This wasn’t a battle with monsters but a magnificent display of sword skills!","The scene dazzled the audience, including the people of the Ultimate West Realm who had claimed with conviction that Mr. Fang couldn’t pass this dungeon.","“Awesome!”","“Bravo!”","“Unrivaled!”"]},{"number":519,"title":"Chapter 519 - Vanishing Step","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Is he really going to pass it?!” Sia gazed at Fang Qi’s screen in a daze.","“This sword technique is indeed powerful, and the shop owner’s control of it is very good.” Luo Piaoling shook his head and said in a grim voice, “But... It isn’t so easy to defeat a boss at King Difficulty Level!”","Now that Fang Qi achieved tremendous strength growth after advancing to a subclass and obtaining level 20 equipment, everyone knew that the boss wouldn’t be able to heal its injury faster than Fang Qi’s attacks.","But the battle wouldn’t be short.","From the looks of it, it was possible that Fang Qi would defeat the boss. However, Luo Piaoling couldn’t forget his feeling of desperation and powerlessness when he faced the boss. The zombie king boss could emit extremely chilling energy which would slow the players’ movements.","More importantly, when players were attacking, the chilling energy could suddenly erupt inside their bodies. The consequences were fatal. Many players who had been struck by this chilling energy while they were attacking were bitten by the zombie king on the neck.","The players’ life in this game was not digitized. It was the same as the real world.","Without digitalized bodies, once their necks were broken, the players would certainly die if they didn’t have teammates who could rescue them.","In other words, except for long-range classes, all the close-range classes were at a disadvantage, and the players must attack with caution.","If the zombie king could make the battle last, Fang Qi would die even if the zombie king couldn’t hit him with its attacks.","Bosses at King Difficulty Level were notorious for their high defense and HP. Even if the zombie king just stood there and let the players attack it, it probably could last long enough to freeze Fang Qi to death.","Except for berserkers, all other classes would have difficulty attacking, dodging, and defending when their HP was low. In fact, the zombie king didn’t have to freeze Fang Qi to death since he wouldn’t be able to dodge its attacks when his physical condition deteriorated.","Fang Qi seemed to know this danger since he first killed the ordinary zombies around the zombie king instead of allowing them to gather.","The zombie king moved much faster than ordinary zombies. As everyone knew, most zombies had no intelligence.","Fang Qi used the zombie king’s fast speed and lured it out of the group of zombies. Then he killed all the ordinary zombies...","“Look! He’s charging at it!”","Some players yelled in surprise as Fang Qi dashed up neatly with Drive Slash.","At the third step, he passed the zombie king. With a flash of sword light, he left a deep wound in its side.","“He is using this sword technique again!?” The sword light created by the double-handed lightsabre danced, and the zombie king, with its back to Fang Qi, didn’t have the chance to turn around. It stumbled and almost fell at the force of the sword light several times.","The boss didn’t have time to strike back!","Despite all this, Luo Piaoling still didn’t change his opinion. Once the extremely chilly energy erupted in his body, Fang Qi would have to stop his attacks. As close to the zombie king as he was now, he would receive a destructive blow!","“Ugh? How come the shop owner switched to a great sword?!” On the screen, people saw Fang Qi suddenly taking out a giant great sword and viciously striking the zombie king. The latter couldn’t remain standing anymore and was about to fall.","Then, the Drive Slash which connected three times knocked it down completely.","The greatsword left a line of blinding sparks on the ground before slashing upward with force.","Losing its balance, the zombie king was thrown high up into the sky.","Fang Qi’s huge sword technique was learned from Cloud. With this heavy sword, it was easier for him to toss up his opponent compared to thin swords such as the lightsaber.","Fang Qi put more force into his arms and tossed the zombie king into the air vertically with tremendous strength.","Then, he leaped into the air swiftly.","“Will the shop owner use Cloud’s technique?!” Seeing this move, someone exclaimed.","“I think it’s the technique that Sephiroth used to toss up Cloud!”","“Mr. Fang switched his weapon again!”","Fang Qi returned to the lightsabre and struck twice using Moonlight Slashes from the air!","However, the Moonlight Slashes struck nothing.","“He missed?!” Everyone stared at the scene in bafflement, wondering if Fang Qi had missed his target this time after striking the boss many times before.","“No!” Luo Piaoling said, “He did it on purpose!”","Nalan Hongwu said, “Since there are no techniques which has the same effects as Heavy Fall in the game, he used the Moonlight Slash to accelerate his fall!”","[TL Note: Heavy Fall is a martial art technique where people can drop from the air faster.]","Sure enough, Fang Qi landed on the ground before the zombie king and used Secret Sword Art again!","The force of the sword wasn’t huge, but it had the right force to stop the zombie king from falling.","“Dodge! Dodge! Or defense!” Sia looked more impatient than the boss itself.","“How come the boss became so stupid?!” Even if it couldn’t dodge, it could parry with its arms to disrupt Fang Qi’s attacks so that he couldn’t combo.","The boss wasn’t an ordinary zombie and had a certain level of intelligence. Besides, a boss in a dungeon at King Difficulty Level wouldn’t be so dumb as to get beaten without fighting back.","At this moment, Fang Qi struck upward, so his force was also headed upward. If the zombie king couldn’t dodge these attacks, it couldn’t fall to the ground.","Although this game simulated reality and the players didn’t have digitized bodies, making the game more difficult to play, the players had a greater degree of freedom in this game!","“How come it is acting this way...?”","“Is the zombie king stupid?!”","Some audience began to complain.","“This is...” Nalan Mingxue suddenly typed some words into the current channel, [Is this... Vanishing Steps?!]","In Dungeon Fighter Online, players would turn into the form of ghosts if they didn’t return to the city after death. In this state, they could chat.","Nalan Mingxue suddenly remembered a story about games that Mr. Fang had told them long ago.","In the story, Fang Qi mentioned that one could attack from the opponents’ blind spots, and it was impossible for the opponents to dodge or block!","That wasn’t a skill in the game but a special technique.","“You mean... the Vanishing Steps as in the King’s Avatar?!” Xu Zixin exclaimed, also remembering that Mr. Fang had once told them an advanced technique only godlike players could use.","A long time had passed since Fang Qi told the story, and Nalan Mingxue had taken it as a story, thinking that it could only happen in stories.","But now, Mr. Fang seemed to be using it?!","They looked closer and found that Fang Qi indeed moved into the zombie king’s blind spots of vision. From the viewpoint of the zombie king, Fang Qi was totally concealed in the shadows as if he were invisible!","Is he really using Vanishing Steps?!","Fang Qi had told them about the technique in a story, but now he was using it before their eyes!","This feeling was completely different!"]},{"number":520,"title":"Chapter 520 - The Shop Owner Is Cheating?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The King’s Avatar?! What’s that?” Obviously, many cultivators and warriors from Yuanyang City and Half City hadn’t heard of it before.","Even Gu Tingyun, this old man, was curious. “Do we have such a movie or game in the shop?”","“What’s Vanishing Step?!” Many people looked baffled.","In the game, the players at levels lower than 20 couldn’t use the high-level combat techniques that they had learned in the real world. On one hand, their bodies in the game were not familiar with those combat techniques and the spiritual spells yet. Even if they use them, the power of these techniques would be weak. On the other hand, the essence and magic used in the games were slightly different from the warrior qi and spiritual essence in the real world, and the players had to spend lots of time to study them before using them in the games.","“The King’s Avatar is a story about games; the shop owner told us the story before,” Xu Zixin explained.","“What’s Vanishing Step?! It must be an insignificant low-level combat technique!” Sia said contemptuously.","“A story about games?!” The girls stood together, and Yue Bai asked Xu Zixin curiously, “Do we have such a game in the shop?”","Xu Zixin pointed at Mr. Fang and whispered. “Do you want me to tell you the story?”","“Okay! Ok!”","“What story?!” With ears perked up, Sia listened carefully.","Then, she heard, “I’ll tell you the story after Mr. Fang clears the stage.”","“...” Sia’s face twitched. Why don’t you tell it now!","She had been waiting to listen.","...","In fact, Nalan Mingxue noticed that Fang Qi had used more than just Vanishing Step.","It suddenly dawned on her that Fang Qi had used all kinds of small skills in his previous battles with monsters.","They were not combat techniques and didn’t consume lots of physical strength; they could be used after getting smooth with some practice.","For example, Fang Qi had switched between the great sword and lightsabre and used ordinary sword techniques and Secret Sword Art alternatively. Secret Sword Art consumed energy, and it used a lot of energy maintaining such a horrifying fast speed.","However, Nalan Mingxue sensed that it didn’t consume lots of Fang Qi’s essence, A.K.A MP, since his essence had remained at a high level.","For another example, Fang Qi had used Secret Sword Art in the middle of the Drive Slash, so he could attack multiple targets at a faster speed.","It must be noted that the sliding steps of Drive Slash were extremely fast. At this great speed, how could Fang Qi use the Secret Sword Art, an extremely complicated and fast sword technique, together with Drive Slash?!","In the King’s Avatar, the main character used this technique to keep a small master in the air.","They were surprised that Fang Qi was able to use this technique in this game!","The cultivators of the Ultimate West Realm were at a loss for words. As wounds accumulated on the zombie king, it couldn’t heal itself under such fast sword strikes solely using its healing ability; the zombie king was going to die soon!","Many people stared at Fang Qi’s screen with widened eyes. “Is he going to pass for real?!”","“So powerful!” Tang Yu yelled, “The zombie king doesn’t have a chance to fight back!”","When they fought the zombie king it was extremely difficult. However, Fang Qi made the process look so simple and smooth. They felt as if Fang Qi were playing a different game!","“Will he pass just like this?!” someone asked weakly.","“Impossible,” Sia snorted and said, “This zombie king will unleash its power and knock everyone around it away if it’s under siege for a long time.”","The moment she said it, sure enough, a tremendous force erupted from the zombie king.","Like a storm, the force instantly spread out in all directions!","“See?” Sia said smugly.","Before she could finish, Fang Qi slashed out his great sword with vicious force.","The storm hit him, but Fang Qi was as steady as a giant boulder.","Instead, he even tossed up the zombie king again!","In the original version of Dungeon Fighter Online, if the players reacted fast enough, they could block the shock wave of the bosses with Super Armor. Even though Fang Qi didn’t have the fancy special effect where light radiated out of his body, Fang Qi remained as steady as a mountain.","“How did he manage it?!”","“Did he block it by using Super Armor?!” Some sharp-eyed players saw the trick.","“He’s going to pass!”","Under Fang Qi’s wild attacks, the HP of the boss was declining at a fast speed!","“His combo is more than 100 attacks!”","Looking at the combo number shown on the screen, they yelled, “He’s not a human!”","With a shrill scream, the zombie king was already dead when it fell from the sky.","“He passed?!”","Many people couldn’t believe their eyes. “How can it be so easy?!”","“F*ck!!”","“No...!” Luo Piaoling’s face turned grim.","“What’s wrong?” Sia asked curiously.","“Didn’t you notice that?” Luo Piaoling said, “It has been a long time, and the chilly energy in his body should have erupted; but... he showed no sign of it!”","“Why is that?!” Sia was astonished. She remembered that when she passed the Master Difficulty Level in a team, the chilly energy in her body had erupted at regular intervals, interrupting several of her combos.","However, this chilly energy hadn’t affected Fang Qi at all?!","How could it be?!","“Cheated! He must have cheated!” As an ignorant viewer, Sia thought that Mr. Fang must have cheated in the game.","As an ignorant viewer, Luo Piaoling also felt incredulous. While looking at Mr. Fang’s default slayer outfit and then at his own...","Could it be that this outfit adds armor to the players?!","It was unbelievable!","“Cheated?” Many people froze at their protest.","“Right!”","“How come the shop owner wasn’t attacked by the zombie king’s freezing energy?!”","It seemed like the boss was fond of Fang Qi. While other players battled the boss, they all swarmed up and tried to kill it as quickly as they could. Otherwise their combos would be interrupted by its freezing energy, and they would freeze to death if the battle took too long.","However, the freezing energy had no effects on Mr. Fang?!","Nalan Mingxue sat near Mr. Fang.","She put down her virtual reality headset and said, “Did you guys notice that the shop owner would slash upward and leap into the air once in a while?”","“What do you mean?!”","“He did that to continue his combo, right?”","“It’s not the time to talk about this!” the warriors of Ultimate West Realm said impatiently, “Obviously, the shop owner cheated!”","After all, he must toss the boss into the air to make it lose balance, so he can continue his combo !","“I don’t think so,” Nalan Mingxue chuckled and said, “I calculated in my mind. The shop owner leaped every five seconds, which is almost as long as the interval for the chilly energy to erupt in the body; I calculated the time of its eruption while I was passing the Shadow Thunderland at Master Difficulty Level.”"]},{"number":521,"title":"Chapter 521 - Old Driver, Bring Me with You","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You mean leaping into the air can help us dodge the eruption of the chilly energy in our bodies?!”","But the chilly energy is stored in the body; what does leap up have to do with its eruption?!","Sia and other warriors of the Ultimate West Realm found it hard to believe.","“The zombie king uses the gloomy and moist energy in the ground to spread the chilly energy; that is easy to understand. If the curse of chilly energy in the body also has to be activated by the energy in the ground...” After passing the King Difficulty Level, Nalan Mingxue had obtained many experience points and finished the mission for advancing to her subclass. While finished the mission in satisfaction, she explained, “Don’t you see the connection now?”","“Then, why does it activate the eruption at a regular interval?” a warrior of the Ultimate West Realm asked in disbelief, “If the zombie king activates it randomly, no one can predict it, right?”","“It’s because you don’t know auras,” Nalan Mingxue said, “In Diablo 2, the auras are all activated automatically if it’s not purposefully controlled. As an undead creature, the zombie king doesn’t have a high level of intelligence, which is why it can’t control this effect.”","It was an automatic activation mechanism similar to an aura. As long as the players discovered its activation rhythm, they could dodge it perfectly,","Nalan Mingxue glanced at Mr. Fang and asked, “I wonder how much of that I got right.”","Mr. Fang applauded and said, “100 percent! 100 percent!”","They complimented each other happily.","“When you have time, will you tell us more about King’s Avatar?!” Nalan Mingxue asked.","Now that Mr. Fang had used Vanishing Steps, who knew if he would talk about other even more advanced skills in the future.","Skills weren’t combat techniques which must be used with warrior qi or spiritual spells that must be cast with spiritual essence.","They were combat skills that needed little energy and required simple criteria, but they could unleash great power.","Vanishing Step was a skill of controlling one’s steps to make sure that they remained outside the opponent’s vision, which could prevent the opponent from counterattacking.","However, achieving the effect of Vanishing Step in the virtual reality game was more difficult than finding the right positions.","One must also consider the angles of the sword strikes, the steps on positioning, and the force used in each attack. Fang Qi’s opponent was a monster that was as powerful as a real zombie king, not a lame monster in the original game before he traveled through space and time. In the original version, the zombie king’s speed had been slowed down in consideration of the slower reflexes of ordinary people.","For ordinary people, the zombie king in the current version of the game was a monster that moved as swift as the wind. However, a level 20 slayer had far surpassed the abilities of an ordinary person as well.","While battling, Fang Qi must leap up to dodge the activation of the chilly energy in his body.","To achieve this, Fang Qi had to rely on things such as the skills from the sliding steps of Drive Slash, Immortal Wind Cloud Body, and Drunk Immortal Moon-Observing Step, the blade master’s profound understanding of sword techniques, and the powerful greatsword technique from Cloud. On top of all that, he was more familiar with this game compared to others, and he was barely able to use concepts such as Vanishing Step to attack the zombie king and use combos.","The result was amazing.","Many people looked at Mr. Fang in a daze, wishing that they could also use these fancy and effective skills that they didn’t know!","“As for that...” Mr. Fang scratched his head at the request of telling them the later plot of the King’s Avatar. “I’ll consider it when I have time.”","Hearing Nalan Mingxue’s analysis, Sia fell silent.","“Is it really what she said...?” Sia blinked. “Can we avoid the zombie king’s freezing energy so easily?!”","Of course, to master these skills later on, she had died countless times in the Shadow Thunderland and spent many crystals to buy life tokens. But it was another story.","“Sir!” Su Tianji walked over. “Can you take me through the dungeon, so I can advance to a subclass?!” She played a female mage.","It would be much easier if she chose to play as a female slayer or a female fighter. After all, all the players had learned sword techniques and fist techniques in the real world.","However, mages were different, even though the cultivators and mages both used lightning and fire, and the effects looked almost the same.","However, spiritual spells and magic spells had different incantations, hand gestures, and ways of circulating spiritual essence and MP.","The mages needed some time to adapt to the new system.","It was why Su Tianji had become an idol player and a newbie from the captain of the team which had won the second place in the Counter Strike Competition.","She had died several times on Expert Difficulty, let alone the Master Difficulty Level!","It wasn’t only Su Tianji. Many other cultivators who played as mages had the same problem, and they were eager for a free ride.","“Sir! Take me too!”","“Old driver, take me with you!”","“Me! Me! Me! Me too!” Tang Yu dashed over as well. As a cultivator who had played with guns only in StarCraft, his performance as a male gunner was very poor.","“Can you take me too?!” Gu Tingyu was in an embarrassing situation as well. He had chosen the class of priest which looked similar to cultivators. However, after he entered the game, he found that his weapon was a big cross. Except for some spells, he had to fight at close-range.","Caught between close-range and long-range, he felt like this class was more difficult to play than mages.","“Alright...” The moment he said it, Mr. Fang glanced at his fatigue points and shrugged. “I ran out of fatigue points.”","“Fatigue points?!” The players looked at Mr. Fang in puzzlement.","The fatigue points determined if the players could enter a dungeon.","Although the new version didn’t have the settings for rooms, it retained the setting of fatigue points which was consumed according to the exploration range in the dungeons. If the players used all the fatigue points, they couldn’t enter dungeons again on the same day.","Having leveled to over level 20, Mr. Fang had run out of his fatigue points.","By now, Fang Qi had only played a little more than three hours.","In other words, the players only needed about three to four hours to level up and hunt for treasures in the dungeons each day, and they could use the remaining time to do other missions. If they were fast, three hours was enough.","Of course, if the players tried to pass the King Difficulty Level without the necessary levels and equipment, eight hours each day wouldn’t be enough for them.","Hearing his explanation, all the players were alarmed. “What? The game has such a setting?!”","Luo Piaoling said, “I spent a long time exploring the dungeon of King Difficulty Level and didn’t pass it; it’s just a waste of time and energy then?!”","He felt frustrated. He had thought that he could continue his exploration after being ‘tricked’ by his teammates, but now he learned that there was a limit on it!","“Ahh!” He howled silently.","“What should we do now?!” Su Tianji found that she still had many fatigue points left. How come Mr. Fang is already out of it?","Mr. Fang pointed at Jiang Xiaoyue and said, “You can ask Xiaoyue if she has fatigue points left.”","“Xiaoyue can take us too?!”","Sitting next to Mr. Fang, the loli was concentrating on her female mage character.","This mage... was actually in close-range combat?!","“Xiaoyue! Take me with you!”","“Xiaoyue, I’m your good friend. Can you take me first?”","“I have gold coins!”","“The market price is 10,000 gold coins! Take me!”","They all came up to her.","Jiang Xiaoyue asked, “Ugh? What’s happening?”"]},{"number":522,"title":"Chapter 522 - How Come People of This Subclass Are Blind?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After watching Mr. Fang pass the Shadow Thunderland at King Difficulty Level, many players had picked up a few things that they could use to try to pass the dungeons at a high difficulty level, and they were eager to try.","Due to the limited fatigue points, the players acted more cautious now and wouldn’t dare to challenge the dungeons that were too difficult for their levels.","The system version of Dungeon Fighter Online had five primary classes and 40 subclasses at this moment.","Each primary class had four subclasses, and males and females had different systems. For example, the male slayers’ demon-like hands turned red because of the Kazan syndrome, but for the female slayers, their demon-like hand turned red because of the Metastasis.","They were fundamentally different.","After advancing to their subclasses, the differences between males and females were even greater. Male slayers could advance to Blade Masters, Berserkers, Asuras, and Soul Benders. Female slayers, on the other hand, could advance to Sword Masters, Demon Slayers, Vagabonds, and Dark Templars.","Both excelling in sword techniques, Blade Masters and Sword Masters wielded different basic sword techniques. Blade Masters used the Secret Sword Art while Sword Master used Imperial Swordsmanship.","Imperial Swordsmanship was a set of ultimate sword techniques inherited from an unknown source in the ancient times. It was said that they were created by a sword god who combined many kinds of sword techniques and combat techniques. This set of sword techniques was focused on fast sword strikes and contained horrid, destructive power.","From the initiation method, it was similar to Vergil’s Dimension Slash when he pulled out his saber.","...","After the advancement to their subclasses, the players of the same primary class would follow completely different paths.","“Senior sister, what subclass do you plan to choose?” On the side, Mu Qing and Yue Bai whispered to each other.","“I’ll... choose Sword Master...”","On the other side, Yuanyang Castellan Zong Wu looked at Nalan Hongwu who sat next to him and asked, “Brother Nalan, what subclass will you choose?”","“Hahaha! Of course, Blade Master!” Nalan Hongwu looked at his young game character in the computer and asked, “How about you, Brother?”","“My Martial Dao comes from the Heavenly Academy, and my style is a bit different from that of the Blade Master.” Zong Wu shook his head and said, “I’ve studied each subclass and found that my style is closer to the subclass of Asura. I’d try that.”","“Come on! Let’s team up and enter the Shadow Thunderland at Master Difficulty Level!”","“Count me in! Count me in!” Su Tianji immediately joined them.","“Me too!” An Huwei dashed over to take the ride.","As mages, they hadn’t gotten used to the new system yet, and it was painful to team up with strangers.","As for Jiang Xiaoyue...","When Mr. Fang used up his fatigue points, Jiang Xiaoyue was on her last trip in the dungeon.","Running out of fatigue points didn’t mean that the players could do nothing in the game.","As mentioned before, in the huge city of Hendon Myre, there were all kinds of people doing all kinds of things, and they provided players with many types of missions that didn’t require them to enter the dungeons.","They could obtain all kinds of rewards such as reputation, gold coins, and even items when they finished these missions.","Of course, if the players were not interested in these missions, they could go to Pungjin’s dojo to battle with adventurers from all over the world.","If someone wasn’t interested in all that, they could do what Mr. Fang was doing. Right now, Mr. Fang exited to the Character-Selection Interface, creating more characters in the Adventure Guild. He created another male slayer with the ID ‘Red Duke’, a third slayer with the ID ‘Black Noble’, and a fourth slayer with the ID ‘Sewer’.","Then, he created two accounts, one fighter and one gunner, and entered the game.","Most of the games in the shop didn’t allow players to create small accounts. However, in Dungeon Fighter Online, one could create as many characters as allowed in an adventure guild.","[TL Note: In China, all accounts aside from a player’s main account in online games were referred to as ‘small accounts’.]","Of course, having enough time to play all these classes was another story.","While Mr. Fang played on his small accounts, Nalan Hongwu and other players of Dajin of the Deserted Sea Realm had also advanced to their subclasses one after another.","For example, Nalan Hongwu had advanced to be a proud blade master.","Zong Wu realized his dream of becoming an asura.","An Huwei advanced to the glacial master subclass under the male mage class.","In terms of other subclasses, except for Swift Master, he couldn’t understand Blood Mage and Dimension Walker.","They glanced at Su Tianji’s screen and asked, “Witch?! What’s this?”","“Ugh...” Su Tianji said, “I’m not sure. It seems to be some technology in the magic world? It sounds powerful.”","The world in Dungeon Fighter Online was a place with a perfect combination of magic and technology. In this world, there was a complete magic technology system which was completely different from the regular technology system.","It was a combination of magic and technology.","The products that this system developed looked like the new communication jade that the cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had made with spiritual spells and arrays, different from a smartphone but had the various functions of a smartphone.","The background of this world was different from the worlds described in other games. Due to some reason related to the origin of Pandemonium, Pandemonium controlled powerful technology, and witches were the mages who studied this subject.","Although she didn’t quite understand this subclass, she chose this special path since she didn’t like fighting.","“Should we venture into the dungeon again? I want to try my new skills!”","“Good! I want to try my skills too!” At this moment, they saw a guy walking over to the cross where they stood, stumbling around with a long saber which looked like a bamboo stick as he poked it around to the left and right.","“Auch!” With a scream, Zong Wu fell flat on the ground in the street of Hendon Myre, attracting the attention of many players and pedestrians.","“...”","“I say, Old Ghost Zong, what’s going on with you?!” Nalan Hongwu asked as his face twitched.","Zong Wu lifted his head, and everyone saw that he had a black band on his eyes.","“How come people of this subclass are blind?!” Zong Wu howled. “That god-damn trainer asked me if I was truly determined to advance to this subclass... I didn’t know that he meant this! Before I could react, he turned me blind! He told me to see with my ears and slash with my heart! But how can I slash without seeing the enemies?!”","With a dark face, he got up and said, “Let’s go and level up!”","The others fell silent. They suddenly didn’t want to team up with him!"]},{"number":523,"title":"Chapter 523 - The Place Where the Dreams Begin","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations#","“Where are we going?” Zong Wu asked.","“Old Ghost Zong, can you enter the dungeon like this?” Nalan Hongwu’s face darkened, wondering how the latter could kill monsters without his sight.","“To tell you the truth,” Zong Wu said, “Although I lost my sight, I learned a technique named Hostility Detection from the trainer. With the experience that I’ve accumulated in the many years of studying Martial Dao, I can detect enemies by hearing. The monsters pose no issue to me!”","“Are you sure...?” Nalan Hongwu looked at him doubtfully.","“How do you think I walked here from the Back Alley all by myself?!” Zong Wu said in anger.","“It’s fine.” Su Tianji said, “We don’t have to go to the Shadow Thunderland which has a high difficulty level; we can try another dungeon which is less difficult.”","“Right!” An Huwei said, “Anyway, we’ve finished almost all the missions in Hendon Myre. We can go and check out West Coast.”","The dungeons in the Sky Tower at West Coast were generally more difficult than Grand Flores, but since it was their first time entering, they could only choose the Normal Difficulty Level, which wouldn’t be too hard for them.","“Let’s do it then.” Nalan Hongwu agreed after a moment of consideration. He had heard of the legends about the Sky Tower and wanted to see it.","Although they were much older than the players of the younger generation, they were newbies in this world; everything was new and novel to them, let alone the Sky Tower in the legends.","According to the legends, the Sky Tower was the only path leading to Empyrean.","West Coast was a port city not far from Hendon Myre, and it was in the territory of Bel Myre Principality. It had advanced on-land and sea routes, and it was a busy city of commerce and trade. Also, it was an important location since it had the Sky Tower, the entrance to Empyrean.","It was the second-largest city in Arad, only smaller than Hendon Myre.","In the original game, West Coast was next to Hendon Myre on the right. However, if the players wanted to go to West Coast from this huge city, they had three traveling options: horse carriages, zeppelin, and teleportation.","Since the travel time between the two cities wasn’t as short as that in the original game (The newbies couldn’t afford teleportation), the missions that required traveling between the two cities had been adjusted accordingly.","As mentioned before, the Arad Continent had a prosperous magic civilization.","Hendon Myre and West Coast were two prominent cities born in this civilization. According to the legends, Hendon Myre had been created in the desert by the powerful magic arrays of a great mage named Myre.","That was why high-end magic products such as magic zeppelins and teleportation arrays weren’t novel to the residents in these cities.","Not only Nalan Hongwu and his teammates, but many players who finished advancing to their subclasses boarded a zeppelin and flew toward the next city.","Flying on the magic zeppelin, they looked down and saw that the blue sea was almost the same color as the sky. The clear surface of the ocean sparkled with the reflections of white clouds in the sky. Big and small ships and boats passed or docked in the harbor.","Looking down from the high sky, they saw a huge garden-style park in the center of the city. The orderly residential houses with white walls and red tiles spread out like fans. Outside the residential area was green forests that had dense plants, surrounding the garden-like city. In the distance, clouds floated around the rolling hills, and everything looked beautiful.","While Hendon Myre was a bustling and prosperous city, West Coast was a charming port city which was both lively and tranquil.","Hendon Myre was the starting point for the adventurers on this land.","West Coast was the true starting place for their subclasses.","“Wow-!”","“This city is so pretty!”","Sitting on the zeppelin, Mu Qing and Yue Bai looked down at the city beneath them, finding that the style of the city was different from that of a cultivator-populated city; it was quite refreshing.","Some warriors of the Ultimate West Realm had also come to the sky above the city in the zeppelin.","With its balmy and fresh air, the beautiful port city surrounded by hills on three sides looked like a dazzling pearl inlaid in a green forest.","“This city will make few people want to leave...” Luo Piaoling sighed.","The cities in the Ultimate West Realm were all built on the peaks on cliffs covered by ice and snow. Although they used arrays to adjust the temperatures in the cities, they could only see white snow swept by howling gales, representing death and destruction.","It was said that many cities in the Ultimate West Realm were built by their ancestors with blood and bones while they gradually drove away powerful fierce beasts in the severe cold.","“I’ll be frank with you since we’re from the same place. I wonder why the cultivators of the Spiritual State and even the Deserted Sea Realm are so fortunate and have so many powerful figures.” Sia sounded jealous as she said, “They are living in such comfortable places and have such powerful combat techniques and sword techniques. On top of that, they are even better at playing games than us... For example, I don’t know how they thought of such a battle skill as the Vanishing Steps...”","Luo Piaoling’s face twitched. “Didn’t you say that it was an insignificant, low-level combat technique?”","“Hahahahaha...” He laughed with sudden understanding. “I didn’t know that Ms. Sia would be so stubborn!”","“I’m not stubborn!” Sia mumbled, “I just wonder why they are so powerful!”","Luo Piaoling pretended to sniff the air. “Ugh? I smell some sourness and jealousy in the air.”","“You-!”","“Okay! I won’t tease you.” Carrying his heavy sword in his arms, Luo Piaoling said with a smile and a shake of his head. “We still have some time before we can get off the zeppelin. We must use the time on the zeppelin to enjoy the beautiful scenery of this city.”","He sighed and said with some envy, “It would be wonderful if we and our descendants can one day live in such a beautiful city...”","“You seem to like this place?” Sia asked tentatively.","“Yeah... look at the houses and people. They seem to share our traditions and style, and I won’t feel like a stranger living in such a city.” He shook his head, and his smile under his blond curls looked bright and warm. “We never saw oceans living in the snow mountains in the Ultimate West Realm. But here, we can gaze at the magnificent ocean all day long.”","“It sounds wonderful.” Sia frowned when a thought struck her. Then, she asked teasingly, “Do you like this place that much? What if some people want to destroy this place one day?”","Luo Piaoling tightened his grip on his sword and said with a faint smile, “If that day comes, I’ll kill anyone who dares to do that even at the price of my life!”","Then, he shook his head and chuckled. “But it’s only a virtual world. How can anyone destroy it? You think too much.”","With that said, he continued to quietly enjoy the lovely scenery beneath the zeppelin."]},{"number":524,"title":"Chapter 524 - Leveling Up in Clumsiness","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations*","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu, Su Tianji, and the others finally entered the legendary Sky Tower, the miraculous portal leading from Arad to Empyrean.","Looking at the column-shaped tower leading to the sky, all the cultivators and warriors exclaimed and were amazed by this magical building.","It hadn’t originally existed at West Coast; it had only existed in legends, and few people had seen it.","However, some time before the adventurers arrived at West Coast, it had suddenly appeared here.","There were many strange life forms such as cold and strange statues and enormous stone giants that could fly. In the pitch-black darkness, there were even many knight stone statues that would come back to life at any time and attack anyone who entered the tower.","This grand building was fraught with many weird things.","The Sky Tower was also a dungeon. Soon, Nalan Hongwu, the leader of the team, chose to enter Dragonoid Nest.","Since the magic power in the Sky Tower had effects on all life forms, the dragons had evolved into dragonoids! The dragonoids lived for the sole purpose of guarding their territory and blocking any adventurers.","This was the first stop in the Sky Tower.","This tower was magnificent. If the players walked inside, they would find that the interior space was even bigger than what it looked like from the outside.","They walked up along the steps. Suddenly, a big flock of creatures flew toward them.","“Watch my Ice Orb!” After condensing magic energy in his palm, An Huwei launched the ice spell, shooting out a basketball-sized magic orb of ice and water.","When the Ice Orb crashed into the herd of monsters, it instantly exploded into ice pallets and water splashes, sending these monsters flying in all directions.","At a closer look, they saw that the monsters were baby dragons which looked quite similar to the horned dragons of the Ultimate West Realm. Including their wings, they were as big as basins.","“How was it? My Ice Orb wasn’t bad, eh?” An Huwei laughed at this effect.","His mage character had good skills amongst all mages since he had played as a sorcerer in Diablo 2.","Before his laughter naturally came to an end, a dark yellow shadow lunged at him from behind swiftly with whistling noises.","“Ground Quaker! Wave Sword!” With quick reflexes, Zong Wu detected the attacker’s position with his ears and swung his short sword, shooting out a dark-yellow sword light along the wall of the staircase!","The force sent the attacking figure flying.","“Ugh?!” Nalan Hongwu looked back and said in surprise, “Good aim!”","“Hahaha!” Zu Wu was feeling smug. “I’m still adapting, but my sense for hostility is more useful than eyes in some aspect. For example, I sensed many monsters lurking on the floor above us, ready to sneak-attack!”","“You’re so powerful?!” Su Tianji said in surprise.","“Of course! I’ve never felt so sensitive to the movements around me. If I can master this skill, I think no one can sneak-attack me,” Zong Wu laughed and said, “Although I’m blind, I feel like I’m stronger!”","“That is possible?!” Nalan Hongwu looked at Zong Wu in a daze.","“Of course!” Zong Wu said confidently.","“Let’s go! After we defeat this boss, we’ll go and challenge a higher difficulty level!”","“Ugh?!” Zong Wu’s face turned grim. “Be careful! The murderous intent is getting close!”","Nalan Hongwu looked back and saw the dragonoid, who was sent flying, lunging toward them again!","Nalan Hongwu held his sword before him horizontally.","Tink! He blocked the attack steadily.","It was a beautiful parry!","“Hahahaha” He was about to boast when a pitch-black sword light hacked toward him like a lightning flash.","“Ghost Orb!”","Nalan Hongwu looked at the Ghost Orb crashing toward him in a daze.","“!!??”","“Hahahaha!” Zong Wu laughed and said, “What do you think of this Ghost Orb of mine? Did I just save you guys again?”","“Old Ghost Nalan, what do you think?!”","“Old Ghost Nalan?”","“Where’s Old Ghost Nalan?”","The other two teammates looked at him dumbfoundedly.","Nalan Hongwu had only one thought in his mind right now, “Never team up with people who are blind!”","It was impossible to carry them!","...","Meanwhile, Song Qingfeng and the others were also leveling up in the dungeons.","At the Puppet Museum, Lin Shao used the dizzying Secret Sword Art. “Am I dashing? Young Master Song, look at how dashing I am!”","The lightsabre wildly danced in his hands.","Suddenly, a pale grey puppet shot toward them.","“My striker character is dashing, alright!” Song Qingfeng kicked viciously. Then, he took out a brick and aimed it toward the stone puppet. “F*ck off!”","Snap!","The figure who had been waving the lightsabre instantly dropped to the ground.","“Your aim is trash!”","In the past, the male fighters on the Arad Continent had not been strong since Martial God Shannon Myer never accepted male disciples.","As time went by, female fighters had become the mainstream on the Arad Continent.","Without opportunities to learn fighting skills, the male fighters didn’t give up. Instead, they had gradually created many new styles.","It was why the male fighters and female fighters could be treated as totally different classes in Dungeon Fighter Online.","In the world where Fang Qi lived in right now, these two classes could be viewed as two factions. They were both fighters sharing some basic knowledge, but they were different in many core areas.","For example, female fighters mainly fought with fists. In contrast, Song Qingfeng had been using kicks all this time. Except for the fist techniques that he had learned in the real world, he almost never punched out with his fists.","“Ugh... It’s not enough to only fight with my legs...” Song Qingfeng looked embarrassed.","...","Most players were now leveling up clumsily with their skills that were new and unfamiliar.","Their enthusiasm drew the attention of many other players, and these people decided to try this new game as well.","The whole internet café looked livelier than usual.","“Hu...” Having played three characters in one day, Mr. Fang was extremely tired. When midnight came, he had just used up the fatigue points of the third character.","Lounging in his computer chair, he saw that most of the customers had gone, and he stretched his body by force.","He hadn’t had this feeling in a long time.","Looking at his accounts, Fang Qi shook his head and chuckled.","On the morning of the next day, many people had gotten up early as if they were driven by some force in their minds.","Most of them had reached level 20 yesterday and had learned some complicated and fancy skills of their subclasses, such as the Secret Sword Art.","However, these were not enough for them.","It was just the beginning."]},{"number":525,"title":"Chapter 525 - Black Diamond Membership, It Is Worth Having?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The ocean waves along the shore of Heavenly Abyss Sea were usually turbulent, but they looked calmer today.","“Did you get any new information? Have you found out about the background of this shop?” On the broken cliff on the shore of Heavenly Abyss Sea, gloomy black essence condensed into a ghost-like shadow.","“Nothing new... that shop is really weird...” The large figure concealed in a wide, black cloak said in a scratchy and deep voice, “Is it possible that the powerful existence in that era is hiding somewhere in this world?”","“No.” The voice from the floating black shadow in the sky said, “You know it better than I do; it is impossible.”","The two black figures fell silent as if they were deep in thought.","After a long pause, the black figure standing on the cliff asked, “By the way, where are you in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?”","“I passed the game a couple of days ago,” the voice from the ghost-like figure said with some pride. “Even the Demon Lord lost under my sword. Hmph!”","“He lost to Jing Tian!” The big figure standing on the cliff said with a muffled voice, “Actually, I’m about to pass the game soon as well. It will be a hearty battle to fight with the Demon Lord who could sweep across six realms!”","“Right, did you play the new game called Dungeon Fighter Online in the shop?” The floating shadow in the sky said, “After I passed the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, I found that many people talked about this game. I tried it and found a vast world inside! Maybe there are many things that are beneficial to us!”","“Of course.” The figure on the broken cliff said smugly, “I used up all the fatigue points of my two accounts yesterday, and both are at level 20!”","“What subclass did you advance into? I advanced into an avenger and a blood mage yesterday. I checked out their spiritual spells; they seem powerful!”","“I advanced to a mistress.” The voice from the shadow in the sky floated over. “This subclass is fitting to my identity. I reached level 21, one level higher than you.”","“What?! How come you’re one level higher than me?!” The black figure on the cliff asked in a grave voice, “You can only have 156 fatigue points. How did you reach level 21?!”","“I know something you don’t!” The shadow in the sky looked vague, and the voice sounded smug. “I happened to find a Black Diamond Membership on QQ. I read the instruction and bought this membership which increased my fatigue points to 188 and my experience points gained in the dungeon by an additional 5%!”","[TL Note: In actual QQ, users could pay to get all kinds of memberships such as Green Diamond for music and Black Diamond for games.]","“What a loss!” The black figure lamented in regret, “I put all my attention on finding out more about the shop’s background and didn’t see this! Today, I’ll buy this... um... Black Diamond Membership!","“I’ve got to go now! I must go and buy the Black Diamond Membership now!”","“Should we go to different shops to investigate or...”","“Today, let’s go to the same shop. We’ve found out whatever we can. As for the information that we don’t know, I don’t think we can get it in a short time anyway.”","“Well, you’re right!” The figure of black mist said, “Let’s go to the shop today and try to get above level 30!”","With that said, the black mist evaporated, and the two figures vanished.","...","Today, all three shops, Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, and Yuanyang City Shop, were crammed with more people than yesterday.","“Boss! Here’s your breakfast!” Li Xin’er pointed at the food box on the counter. “I bought you the Nine-Patterned Tiger Bone Soup which can toughen your meridians and bones and steady your vital essence. It’s a special soup for warriors to toughen their physical bodies.”","“Yawn...” Mr. Fang yawned, still tired due to yesterday’s long-playing session. “Thanks. I’ll get it later.”","Then, he logged into the game. His blade master account was close to level 22, and so were his launcher account and ghost bender account.","Since this game was generally more difficult than the others, and the players must pass Expert Difficulty Level and Master Difficulty Level before playing in the King Difficulty Level, Fang Qi’s progress wasn’t much faster than the others.","“Where’s your sister, Lanruo, and Xiaoyue?” Fang Qi asked Li Xin’er, “Are they in school now?”","“Yeah,” Li Xin’er said, “It’s said that the cultivators and the warriors from the Jiuhua City Shop and the Half City Shop are returning today, but some people who have a lot of free time will stay for a bit longer.”","...","An Cheng was one of the people who had lots of free time on hand. He had stayed in the shop playing games all day and seldom came out. For the time being, he had no intention of going back to the Deserted Sea Realm. Today, he came to the shop quite early as well.","He glanced at other players and found that many of them had come early in the morning to play Dungeon Fighter Online.","When An Cheng walked along the corridor, he seemed to see something that flashed before his eyes.","“Lu Xiaoxian?” Behind the wide computer chair, he spotted this ID and saw a loli mage on the screen. She was fighting goblins clumsily with her newly-learned magic spells.","“Ugh...!? Lu...?” An Cheng froze. “Isn’t she...”","He suddenly remembered the favor that a few elite soldiers in the Jiuhua Army asked of him.","“Ugh...?” An Cheng, the Young Castellan of Jiuhua City, said in surprise. “She’s indeed a cute little girl...","“She also plays the Legend of Mir 2?”","While shaking his head, he walked up with a chuckle, intending to greet her. Then, a naively-charming deer head stuck out from the wide computer chair.","An Cheng’s face twitched. “...”","What is this?!","“Brother An? What’s wrong?” Bu Che, a young master in Jiuhua City and one of An Cheng’s buddies, had just walked into the shop.","“...Nothing.”","“I saw a cute little girl,” An Cheng said with a nod. “Yeah, that’s all.”","He paid three minutes of silent condolences to those soldiers of Jiuhua.","...","At this moment, An Cheng saw two black figures walking furtively to a remote corner in the shop.","“How come these two people look so weird.” An Cheng frowned.","“Hurry! Where can I buy Black Diamond? Today, I’ll have 188 fatigue points too.” A voice came from the corner.","“Hush! Don’t let others hear you...”","“188 fatigue points?!” An Cheng heard these words.","Wait, we can have 188 fatigue points?","If one had 32 extra fatigue points, they would have one to two levels of experience points more compared to others!","Immediately, he asked Bu Che beside him, “Do you know what Black Diamond is?”","“Black Diamond?” Bu Che looked bewildered.","“Those two people mentioned something about Black Diamond Membership that has 188 fatigue points. Let’s go and find it!”","“Black Diamond Membership?!” Sia had just walked in the shop and heard this sentence.","After all, these people had profound cultivation strengths which gave them acute hearing.","“What Black Diamond Membership?” Before Luo Piaoling could react, Sia exclaimed, “I seem to have seen such a thing before! We can get a Black Diamond Gift Bag with this membership!”","“Black Diamond Membership?!”","“Black Diamond Gift Bag?!”","All the cultivators and warriors who were walking into the shop heard her exclamation.","An Cheng turned around and looked at the internet café which had gone mad like a hornet’s net that got poked. “F*ck...”"]},{"number":526,"title":"Chapter 526 - Weapons That Emit Lights","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The Black Diamond Membership... is quite cheap!” The people of Ultimate West Realm got online, and Luo Piaoling glanced at the price and said, “15 crystals?”","He still had more than 700 crystals in his membership card. He bought it without hesitation!","As for the woman who had two million crystals! She brought it instantly!","Then, she browsed the outfits.","“You’re looking at outfits again?” Luo Piaoling was puzzled. “Don’t you have a new outfit?”","“I can’t wear the same thing every day!” Sia browsed the clothes in the shop and said, “Today, I must change into a new outfit.”","Sia got busy moving clothes from the shop to her shopping cart. There were only about 10 outfits for female slayers. When Luo Piaoling glanced at her screen again, he found that the shop had almost been emptied out.","...","At this moment, most of the players only had blue uncommon equipment, and lightsabres were in such a high demand that many blade masters and vagabonds (a subclass of female slayers) only had dimly glowing swords, which were level 18 white common weapons.","If one could get a drop of blue lightsabre in the dungeons, it would be regarded as a treasure to them.","This delicate and exquisite creation process was totally different from the cultivators’ own artifact making methods, and it naturally attracted the attention of many warriors.","The lightsabres’ bodies were as thin as cicada’s wings, and some of them looked like a beam of light when held in hand.","It looked as if the swords weren’t solid, but the users could use them to block attacks. However, the blades of the lightsabre were so radiant that they seemed to be made up of strange light beams.","“How was this sword made?” Jun Yangzi was holding a lightsabre in his hand.","Even the ordinary lightsabres were enough to baffle this grand cultivator of th eWuwei Daoist Alliance who excelled in spiritual artifact forging methods of various systems.","He didn’t even know how to find its structure, let alone research deeper into the subject.","“What a wondrous creation...” Duan Yue exclaimed in appreciation while he studied the sword which seemed to be made of light except for the handle.","For other players, they focused on the gameplay. However, these curious artifact masters were eager to find out the mystery of how the sword was made.","...","While the artifact masters were discussing the creation process of these wondrous items, adventurer teams such as the one led by Nalan Hongwu had killed their way into the Castellan’s Chamber.","These players were drawn into the game by the novel skills, exquisite sword techniques, combat techniques, and wondrous spiritual spells. During their adventures, they grew and improved.","In a corner of the internet café, two black figures were each controlling a priest.","They had both chosen to the class of Priest. It was hard to say if it was because this class featured spells and close-range combat, or it was because of something else.","Furthermore, without prior agreement, they had both chosen to be dark shadows under the sun.","Avenger was such a subclass for male priests.","Slurping sounds came from the black figure that was taller.","“Wow! I’ve never tasted such a delicacy in many years!” While shaking his head, he gulped down a big mouthful of soup with slurping sounds.","The figure beside him had a dark expression. Finally, she couldn’t remain seated anymore. “I’ll go and buy a bowl of instant noodles!”","“Okay...”","While he ate instant noodles, he asked the female trainer about the background and origin of his subclass. When the female trainer was idle, she kept mumbling, “Brother Nilvas, I will find you.” as if she was possessed.","After all, it was puzzling that out of priest, there was such a subclass which could unleash demonic power without restraint.","“Are you listening to a story?” The other figure walked back with instant noodles and asked curiously.","“Kind of.” The first figure answered with a muffled voice while eating instant noodles, “This subclass is good, and I like it. I must study it in depth. I’m trying to figure out a way to perfectly use the skill points!”","He sounded very earnest.","“...”","Different from the paladins in Diablo 2, the priests originated from the resistance of imposters.","This world was fraught with all kinds of weird forces, such as the force in the ghost-like hand of male slayers and the Metastasis in female slayers. These forces were dangerous and extremely powerful. Besides these forces, there was a force named Blood Curse concealed in this land.","The victims of Blood Curse looked like humans but had souls craving for blood, which was why they were called imposters. They would eventually grow into horrid demons who would destroy humans.","The priests were born to fight them. Priests had holy thoughts and strong wills, but it didn’t mean that they couldn’t be eroded by the Blood Curse.","In the past, many people had thought that the transformation to imposter by the Blood Curse couldn’t be reversed. Once corrupted, the victims would sooner or later turn into demons.","In the long battles with imposters, some priests who retained a trace of pureness in their hearts were not completely eroded by the demonic power and didn’t turn into devils. Although their minds were tortured by demons, they had faith inside their hearts. With their powerful wills, they resisted the demon’s efforts to pull them down into Hell. As time went by, these priests turned very vicious inside.","They could use the demonic power, but one day, they might not be able to resist the erosion of this force and would turn into true demons themselves. However, so long as they retained a trace of logic, the avengers were determined to destroy the demons even at the price of falling into a bottomless Hell.","“Excellent! With such great determination, they do deserve to be called avengers!” The figure took another mouthful of instant noodles while mumbling, “But I just feel like this subclass’s damage is too low.”","“Is it my illusion...?”","Meanwhile, not far from him, some people of the Ultimate West Realm were talking among themselves. “How come this subclass has such great damage?!”","“Instant kill! Another instant kill!”","“Instant kill?!” A black figure who was eating instant noodles paused his chopsticks. After all, it usually took him a long time to kill a monster!","Someone can instantly kill monsters?!","He glanced over and saw a sword master, which was a subclass for female slayers, holding a huge sword which emitted light!","It wasn’t a lightsabre, but it could also emit light?!","The black figure put down the instant noodles and wondered, What treasure is this?!"]},{"number":527,"title":"Chapter 527 - Although I don’t understand it, it looks great.","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This...”","A few people of the Ultimate West Realm were fighting in the dungeon known as the Castellan’s Chamber when they felt something dark coming from behind.","The few people of the Ultimate West Realm who were watching from the back also moved aside involuntarily.","“Can I ask why this weapon of yours emits light?” On the screen, the sword master’s huge sword sparkled with strange chilly lights, and everyone could see that it was a treasure.","“Does the sword have arrays engraved on them? How come it’s so powerful?!”","“This is a purple great sword that Ms. Sia got with a month of the Black Diamond Membership!” Seeing that the black-robed figure had no ill-intentions toward them, a man of the Ultimate West Realm explained smugly, “After eight reinforcements, it’s certainly more powerful than ordinary swords!”","“Reinforcements?!” After entering this shop, this black figure had heard many new terms such as games, internet, and Black Diamond, etc. Now, they were talking about reinforcements!","What is this new stuff?","He was about to ask more questions when that man of the Ultimate West Realm said impatiently, “You can study it by yourself; stop bothering us with questions.”","“...” His face darkened.","That person of the Ultimate West Realm shivered involuntarily as if he were stared by a primeval fierce beast.","Seeing the figure in black walking away, he murmured to himself, “What happened? How come I feel chills inside?”","“What is it?” The other figure asked in a low voice.","“I found out something about it. It’s a method named reinforcement which can strengthen these weapons.”","“Reinforcement?”","The figure hidden in the wide black robe nodded and said in a deep voice, “Right. I think it might be something like adding arrays or engraving runes when we make artifacts.”","Then, he added, “That little guy didn’t want to elaborate, but it doesn’t matter. I believe people with this skill are not unknown on the Arad Continent. Maybe he is a high-level artifact master. I’ll go and ask my trainer; she might have heard of such people.”","...","At this moment, the masters of families such as Tang, Wang, and Xie were walking into the shop with one more person.","There was a beautiful woman looking to be in her thirties. While wearing a white robe with black patterns, she had her yellow hair pulled up in a bun behind her head. In the ancient times, people used the term “yellow hair” to describe old people’s hair turning from white to yellow, which was a sign of longevity. With her yellow hair, she looked like an immortal.","She was followed by a group of young female disciples wearing white robes with black patterns.; each of them was a beauty with snow-white skin, attracting the attention of the customers in the shop.","“Wow... who are they? They are all so beautiful.” Lin Shao who came to the counter to buy Coke kept glancing at them.","“They are from the Qingqiu Family of the Hidden Cloud Celestial Realm in Phoenix-Resting Mountain,” Tang Yu who came with him to buy Coke whispered to him, “I’m surprised that they are here.”","“Is this family very special?” Lin Shao asked curiously, “Isn’t it one of your seven ancient families?”","Tang Yu explained in a low voice, “Even though the people outside are not aware of it, people from our seven ancient families know there’s a ranking list among us; the Qingqiu Family and Xuanyuan Family have much longer histories than the other five families! For example, Hidden Cloud Celestial Realm where Qingqiu Family lives is an intact small world that was discovered in ancient times.”","“Indeed... So wonderous?!” Lin Shao clicked his tongue in surprise. After all, small worlds, even the worn-out ones, only existed in legends.","Subconsciously, he glanced at them again and saw cold gazes that were as sharp as swords shooting toward him.","“So fierce...” Lin Shao cringed. “Let’s get Coke! Let’s buy Coke!”","...","At this moment, the middle-aged woman said, “I heard that the elder of my family had been rescued by the owner of this shop in the incident with the Nangong Family. Due to the affairs in my family, I haven’t been able to come and express my gratitude until now.”","She sized up the interior of the shop and said, “I’m surprised that a grand master resides in Yuanyang City as a hermit. Where’s the shop owner?”","“Hehehe... here comes a group of yellow-haired little girls.” At this moment, the godly swords hanging on the bamboo stick said.","“Big brother, I wonder if this little girl has poor eyesight. The shop owner is sitting just before her, and she doesn’t see him.”","“I agree. She’s not as knowledgeable as us,” another sword said in a muffled voice.","The two godly swords talked to each other.","The middle-aged woman’s face darkened, displeased that she, a woman with great age, was called a yellow-haired little girl. What kind of address is this?","Then, she glanced at the two swords hanging on the bamboo stick. Both swords condensed arms from murderous spirit, and one of them crossed its arms before its ‘chest’ while the other put its arms on its ‘waist’. It looked like they were watching a show.","Of course, if they were not hung by rough ropes, they would have looked wondrous.","The middle-aged woman from the Qingqiu Family asked, “Who are these things hung on the stick?”","“They are the holy ancestors of the Nangong Family,” The Tang Family Master whispered to her.","“...”","The middle-aged woman’s lips twitched, and she almost laughed out loud.","“Ahem...” To retain her image, she covered it with a cough. “They said that the shop owner is here?”","“Yes.” The Wang Family Master pointed at a computer near the counter. “There he is.”","Mr. Fang was busy leveling up in a dungeon, and the boss before him had lost half of its HP. With his attention focused on the battle, Fang Qi didn’t notice the newcomers.","“Ugh...” The Wang Family Master stroked his beard and said, “The shop owner is fighting the boss; we can wait here for a moment.”","“Ugh...?” Nonplussed, the people of the Qingqiu Family had no choice but stand behind him to watch.","On Mr. Fang’s screen, a tall, white-haired tall man wearing a purple high-collared coat was fighting a monster made of armor with some strange weapons.","The monster waved its sword, and lightning bolts crashed down. Also, many armored knights guarded it closely.","The character on the screen had a thick cannon barrel in his hand. With blue flashes, a cannonball that was as big as a fist shot into the monster’s armor like a lightning bolt.","Then, he slid into the group of monsters with a sliding tackle.","Who’s this guy? How can he dash into the group of enemies like this? With so many knights surrounding him, this young man with the strange spiritual artifact will be killed if each knight slashes at him, right?","While the boss knight waved his sword, the fist-sized cannonball suddenly exploded, forcing the surrounding knights to fall back. The knights closer to the cannonball were knocked down to the ground.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang stood up and smoothly pulled out a huge machine gun which spat out fire dragons, sending the boss knight flying into the high sky.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang got out of the circle with another sliding tackle and landed right before the boss armored knight fell to the ground.","He stood up and threw a grenade at the landing position before the guards got close.","Calmly, Mr. Fang bumped his knee on the Gatling gun, and the powerful recoil sent him to the distance; this was the skill named BBQ. Then, he broke out of the siege with a sliding tackle, leaving the knights behind him in the dust.","Finally, when the knights were about to catch up with him, Mr. Fang revealed the huge gun that he didn’t take out before.","A wave of radiant laser beams shot across the whole screen!","It was the Laser Rifle!","The slow motion during the kill of the boss captured this dazzling moment.","The newcomers who had been ready to greet him watched the scene with wide eyes; they didn’t understand it but thought it was indeed powerful!"]},{"number":528,"title":"Chapter 528 - Reinforcement Make You Poor for Three Generations","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I found it!”","Like G.S.D who had his own slayer venue and Pungjin who had his dojo, Kiri had her own residence and workshop.","Like the gunners, Siri also came from Empyrean. One piece of technology from the extremely-advanced Empyrean brought great transformations for almost all adventurers of Arad—the Reinforcer from Empyrean.","The machine probably used advanced technology to refine equipment again and make them sharper. Or, perhaps it used the combination of technology and magic to reprocess equipment items with the powerful and mysterious Empyrean system. Either way, the machine could do wonders. After the reinforcement process of the machine, even an old, rusty weapon could be turned into a sharp blade that could kill without being stained by blood.","– In a corner of the shop –","“Look! This is the place!” On the screen, a tall, black-clothed male priest walked into the workshop with a female priest who wore black priest clothes and carried a huge sickle.","The most eye-catching thing in the workshop was a huge strangely-shaped machine. When it worked, pale-green magic light flowed inside, and one could even see liquid-like magic energy moving through the transparent tubes.","“This is the place!”","“Hello! I’m Kiri!” The person operating the machine was a straightforward woman who was about 25 years old. With her hair pulled up casually to the back of her head, she wore a long blue robe with white edges.","The avenger wearing a big black cloak looked impatient since he didn’t care about what her name was.","Of course, he didn’t know that this name would be imprinted deeply in his mind. It could be that this name would be engraved on his bones.","“I want to reinforce this weapon. What should I do?” The avenger asked.","“It’s simple.” The woman showed him how to operate the machine with a kind-heart.","The reinforcer was easy to operate. The players only had to put the equipment that needed reinforcing into the reaction chamber, and the machine would do the rest automatically.","“It’s actually so convenient?!” In a corner of the shop, a figure engulfed by a black cloak sounded astonished.","“This game is full of pleasant surprises!” He took out an elegantly-shaped big sickle from his back and put it into the machine. “This level 25 sickle cost me many gold coins when I bought it from that merchant, and it hasn’t seen blood yet. I wonder how far it can be reinforced.”","At this stage, the players had rarely encountered purple items and couldn’t buy them even if they had money. Right now, they could only use blue weapons.","Remembering the scene where the swordmaster instantly killed many monsters, he rubbed his hands with anticipation. “With the aid of this method, I’ll certainly reach level 30 today!”","“That little girl only reinforced her weapon eight times and achieved such a great performance.” The mistress beside him said, “We’ll reinforce it 18 times.”","“Good idea!” He reinforced it once again eagerly.","Soon, the machine spat out the sickle, and they saw a faint layer of light emit from the weapon.","“From the looks of it, the sickle has greater power than before!” The uncle-like avenger chuckled. “Let’s do it a few more times!”","With that said, he paid gold coins swiftly and put the weapon into the machine again, pressing the [Start] button.","They heard the rumbling noises of the machine while it operated.","The second reinforcement was successful.","The third reinforcement was successful.","The fourth...","The fifth...","The sixth...","Looking at the sickle which had turned from dim to radiant with mystical magic light, they clicked their tongues with wonder.","“Indeed,” He exclaimed, “The weapon got more than just sharper; I feel like the magic power in my body increases when I use this weapon.”","“Excellent!” Holding her sickle, the mistress said in a low voice, “Then, I’ll have a try as well.”","“Again!”","“Fortunately, I’ve brought many golden coins with me. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be enough.” After paying more golden coins, he began the seventh reinforcement.","The seventh reinforcement was successful.","“Again!” He watched the sickle in his hand emit a series of strange and radiant magic light.","The eighth reinforcement was successful.","On the game interface, the properties of this sickle got better, and its power grew with each reinforcement","The avenger chuckled and said, “This is a good thing. I wonder if this machine can reinforce spiritual artifacts.”","“It’s said that this machine came from the city above the sky,” the other said, “This little girl doesn’t look like an immortal, but this thing called ‘Reinforcer’ is amazing.”","“Again!” He touched his pocket. “Ugh... I saved a lot of golden coins. How come I’ve used them up already?”","Nonplussed, he said, “Loan me some coins so that I can finish the last reinforce.”","“The number nine is the extreme among single digits,” the female priest said, “It reflects our status. I’ll let you finish the reinforce first.”","The uncle-like black figure dug out all the coins from his pocket and borrowed some from the mistress. After paying, he put the sickle that was sparkling with radiant magic light into the machine again.","Hearing the rumbling sounds in the machine, he waited expectantly.","“This machine is amazing,” he lamented, “We can put anything in it, and it makes no mistakes.”","The moment he said it, a shattering sound came from the reaction chamber.","Crack!","Then, the Reinforcer spat out a few colorless small crystals and some black fragments.","“!!??” The two stared at the machine dazedly, and the black cloaks concealed their expressions.","After a long pause, a voice sounded, “De... Destroyed?!”","To get the level 9 reinforcement, I had put in all my money, and you give me this?!","“What... what does it mean?!” pointing at the Reinforcer, he demanded in a loud voice.","The girl named Kiri walked over and glanced at it. “Auch. It seems that the Reinforcer ran into issues; your item was shattered...”","She forced a laugh, “After all, it received some damage when I took it from the Empyrean, and occasional mistakes do happen. Hahahaha...”","“...”","In the next instant, huge cracking sounds came from the house. “Furious Grab!”","“Shadow Render!”","“No one can dodge my bullets~”","Then two screams sounded...","Soon, two players appeared outside the door of Kiri’s shop with dark expressions, shouting, “We are buying gold coins and purple sickles!”","[Level 5 reinforcement.]","[Level 6 reinforcement.]","[Level 7 reinforcement.]","[The reinforcement failed.]","A prompt on the game interface showed, [The reinforcement effect on your weapon is reset.]","“!!??” They exchanged a look of bafflement.","Outside Kiri’s shop, they yelled, “We are buying gold coins!”","[Level 6 reinforcement.]","[Level 7 reinforcement.]","[Level 8 reinforcement.]","[The reinforcement failed.]","“...”","Outside Kiri’s shop, the two squatted on the ground and yelled listlessly, “We are buying gold coins! Trading Black Diamond Membership for gold coins!”","They glanced at the time. “No! It’s noon now!”","They had come into the shop early in the morning, and now it was noon, which meant that they would have to get offline in about two hours.","“I haven’t finished using my fatigue points yet!!!”"]},{"number":529,"title":"Chapter 529 - A Story About E-Sports","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Tang Family Master, you mean that the spiritual artifacts in this shop lead to a small world which is half-fake and half-real?” Having just arrived, the people of the Qingqiu Family obviously were ignorant of many things in the shop as new players.","They spent most of the morning getting to know the stuff in the shop. They had heard much about the shop, but it was totally different to come here and experience it in person.","For example, the luxuriously-dressed, middle-aged woman, the Qingqiu Family Master, had created a female gunner character and begun her adventures on Arad.","The other girls of the Qingqiu Family didn’t idle around and had also tried the game, submerged in the wonders of Arad and all kinds of strange spiritual spells and artifacts.","Why did the Qingqiu Family Master choose female gunner? She had seen Mr. Fang use the special spiritual artifact which could shoot out laser beams. According to the Tang Family Master, this artifact was still a low-leveled one.","Having entered the shop for only two days, they could get to use such powerful spiritual artifacts and play exciting games such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy. They had high hopes for their future adventures in the Dungeon Fighter Online.","By now, they had used up their fatigue points.","The masters of the ancient families sat on the couches in the lounge area with instant noodles on the tea table before them. Mr. Fang had treated them to instant noodles and even added a sausage in each bowl, which was quite generous of him.","The large group of disciples of the Qingqiu Family stood behind them respectfully.","“Of course!” the Tang Family Master said, “I’ve studied this kind of spiritual artifacts. They come from a new spiritual artifact system, and the weapon that you mentioned is called a laser rifle!”","He sounded excited, “This weapon attacks by shooting light beams which have great power and speed. We’ve studied this type of spiritual artifacts for some time now and found that their structures can revolutionize our spiritual artifact system.”","The weapons that he had studied for a long time didn’t come from Dungeon Fighter Online but from StarCraft, which had been released earlier.","However, they could only make use of the machines shown in StarCraft; they still had a long way to go before they could benefit from their research.","The noble lady of the Qingqiu Family said, “Tang Family Master, I just used these spiritual artifacts, and it seems to me that they are not easy to research and study.”","“In the virtual reality world, I had neither spiritual artifacts nor my own spiritual essence. All I could do was learn how to use them. I’m afraid that it would be difficult to research and study them.”","Although the launchers in the game were experts of heavy guns, they only knew how to use and improve them; they didn’t have the abilities to design and create guns.","The Xun Family Master shook his head and chuckled on the side, “Daoist Brother Tang has found a way.”","“Oh?” The Qingqiu Family Master said, “I’m all ears.”","“I’ll show you.” The Tang Family Master found a seat, got online, and entered his Character-Selection Interface.","On the screen was a tall and lean man from Empyrean. While wearing a purple windbreaker, he had pushed his goggles up above his forehead.","“This is...”","The name of the subclass at the bottom of the screen was Mechanic.","“The moment I saw the robot that I created move, I felt as if my child was born.” These were the words of a mechanic.","Mechanic was a subclass of gunner, and they come from Empyrean that had advanced technologies.","Etten Industrial Zone hosted various powerplants, lots of large-scale factories and industry infrastructures.","Mechanics were the main force operating the economy in the Empyrean.","Since they hadn’t entered the war, they gave people the impression that they were non-combative people. However, in the battle in ‘Yellow Road’, their robots were only next to a launcher’s cannons and a ranger’s shooting skills. After that battle, mechanics had been recognized as a battle subclass.","The famous mechanics could not only make robots but repair machines as well. Some of them were experts of guns, and other gunners would give them their weapons for maintenance.","According to a legend, three mechanics could work together and make a giant robot.","In fact, mechanics made and modified most of the machinery that their skills required, which meant that they knew lots of knowledge about machinery.","The Tang Family Master told them all the information about mechanics. “In fact, this isn’t something confidential. Since this subclass offers more knowledge on machinery than others, almost half of the people of our Tang Family have advanced into this subclass.”","The Qingqiu Family Master said in surprise, “If so, then the spiritual artifacts such as laser rifles and anti-tank guns will be...”","The Tang Family Master chuckled and said, “It’s not so easy. Right now, we’re still learning the basic stuff from the cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. How much we can learn depends on our own abilities.”","“It’s so... amazing!? How about the other subclasses?”","“The subclasses in the game are very complicated...”","...","While they were talking about the advantages and disadvantages of different subclasses, most of the players had used up their fatigue points.","However, it didn’t mean that they had nothing to do. Some players who liked battling had found a new place to play – Pungjin’s dojo.","Fighting in the dojo to practice their spiritual spells and combat techniques didn’t consume fatigue points. Besides, some small missions in the dojo could increase their skill points and bring them some extra experience points.","At this moment, the people of the Ultimate West Realm were cheering for Sia as they watched behind her.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang who didn’t care to join the low-level discussion among the family masters found that he was surrounded by some people.","Lan Yan asked, “You promised to tell us the story of the King’s Avatar.”","Yue Bai and Mu Qing were among the crowd. Mu Qing said in disapproval, “Sir, didn’t you promise that you’ll tell the story when you have time? Can’t you tell us something about the Vanishing Step?”","With his acute hearing, Gu Tingyun heard these girls’ request and immediately sat down in a nearby seat, thinking that this story might contain some information about this shop’s background.","Of course, this was his wishful thinking.","In a corner of the shop, two figures got offline ashen-faced. All their weapons had been shattered, and they didn’t even have weapons to battle in dungeons to level up. It forced them to buy two low-level weapons from the shop to level up, making the process extremely painful.","At this moment, they suddenly paused.","“The shop owner is going to talk about the King’s Avatar?”","“Is it something to do with the information that we need?!”","They exchanged a look and found another corner to sit down. “Let’s listen to the story!”","This time, Mr. Fang began with a new line, “This is a story about E-sports.”","Then, he began telling them his own version of the King’s Avatar which was drastically altered."]},{"number":530,"title":"Chapter 530 - Maybe He’s a Little Noob?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since Mr. Fang had told the part of the story involving Vanishing Steps to the cultivators and warriors in the Jiuhua City Shop, the people of the Spiritual State and Deserted Sea Realm who hadn’t heard of it had to hear the previous chapters from those who had listened in Jiuhua City.","Naturally, Fang Qi couldn’t tell the story word by word and explain the theories of techniques as he had done before.","Of course, since they were all stuff recreated by the system, and the two games were similar, Fang Qi could explain the techniques better with the help of Dungeon Fighter Online","Mr. Fang continued the story; he told them the part about dual-linking ghost boundaries and finished with the screen cannon tactic used in the battle against Jiang You.","The ghost boundary was similar to drawing a prison on the ground and keeping enemies inside. However, who would be so dumb as to stand in the boundaries during a battle? It needed high awareness and cooperation. If the opponents were all masters, it would be exponentially difficult to get them into the boundary. When the audience heard that two classes with the skill of ghost boundaries can cooperated seamlessly and put their enemies in their ghost boundaries all the time, they were awed by its power.","“Sir... the grandmaster named Ye Xiu is really so powerful?!”","“Even with the restrictions on his level, he can still perform to perfection...” They stumbled over these new terms, “Perform to perfection?”","“How come that owner of an internet café is so lame that he can’t recognize a grandmaster?! After all, he owns an internet café!” After all, in the eyes of the people in this world, the people who could open an internet café were as powerful as masters who were living the hermit lifestyle.","While Mr. Fang was bombarded by questions from the people around him, exclamations came from the people of the Ultimate West Realm.","On the screen, Sia stood in the dojo with a purple great sword sparkling with magic light in her hand; this sword had been reinforced eight times. This room in Pungjin’s dojo was set in the same mode as a dungeon; the only difference was that the players didn’t fight with monsters but with each other.","Also, the dojo had a balance mechanism; the attributes of the players would be adjusted to relatively closer levels.","Of course, the adjustment wouldn’t eliminate a large gap in equipment and levels. The players with better equipment and higher levels still had advantages, but the advantages weren’t as big as before.","Despite the fact that the gap between strength shortened, some people were not greatly affected; Sia was one of them. Right now, wearing a fashionable outfit, she had several reinforced purple-tier equipment, and her weapon had been reinforced to level 8. Her level was now close to level 30, which was one of the highest in the shop.","At this stage, with almost all players still equipped with white and blue equipment, her items far surpassed those of ordinary players. This was a gap that even the balance mechanism couldn’t shorten.","Inside the dojo was a huge platform; her opponent was a male fighter.","The male fighter had reached level 27, but he was completely suppressed by Sia. By now, she had inflicted quite a few wounds on him.","“Ha!” With a yell, Sia slashed out her greatsword and shot out a series of sharp sword energies. While her opponent was busy dodging, she charged forward with a lowered center of gravity like a leopard lunging at its prey.","“Swift Sword!” Her whole body shot out and left a series of blurry shadows, and the great sword in her hand turned into a sword light afterimage.","As mentioned before, the sword techniques of swordmasters emphasized explosive damage. After the first awakening, the swordmasters were called noblesse who were renowned for their sword techniques. The Swift Sword was one of these techniques.","A fragment of a shadow shot past with unimaginable, great speed. When she put away her sword, the fighter flew backward with dented armor as if he were struck with a huge impact force.","When the fighter flew toward her, the sword that Sia put away suddenly struck out again. “Flash!”","Flash! This skill condensed force and could instantly shoot three giant spirit swords forward. Although it needed a very short moment to cast, the damage contained in this strike was overwhelming once it was used!","The huge spirit swords shot through the fighter almost in the blink of an eye. With a scream, the fighter vanished, leaving behind only his military uniform and boots. With her long black hair fluttering in the wind (one could change the hair color and style in the shop), the swordmaster held her greatsword and stood proudly at the center of the screen. The victory symbol already popped up on the screen.","“So powerful!”","“Her opponent wasn’t even able to fight back!” a few people of the Ultimate West Realm exclaimed.","“With such equipment and powerful sword techniques, she’s unstoppable!”","On the screen, the swordmaster smiled. Having won many matches in a row, Sia was a little smug.","....","“Sir!” The people of Spiritual State had only heard about these techniques and movements from Mr. Fang and hadn’t seen them before. While they were enthralled by the story, to their surprise, Mr. Fang ended the story with the excuse that he was too thirsty to continue.","An idea dawned on them. “Sir, you’re tired of talking right? Maybe it’s time to get some excises? We’ve never seen you in the dojo before. Why don’t you try it now?”","Tang Yu’s eyes lit up. “That’s a good idea!”","“Should I try it?” Mr. Fang scratched his head.","“Fine. I’ll try my hand.” Soon, Mr. Fang came to the dojo.","At this stage, the dojo offered two options to enter a match. One was a fast start, and the other was entering another player’s room manually.","Randomly, Mr. Fang clicked into the first room on the first page.","In the system version, the players with the most matches and the highest win rate would get placed higher on the list. The win rate of the player in the first room on the first page wouldn’t be low.","Fang Qi looked closer and said, “Wow. It is a little noblesse sister (Swordmasters would awaken as noblesse)?”","On the other side, a group of warriors of the Ultimate West Realm saw the prompt on the left-upper corner of the screen, [The player ‘Kill One Teammate with One Bullet’ has entered the room.]","“Hahahaha! Kill One Teammate with One Bullet?! What name is this? So funny!”","“...” Even Sia almost laughed out loud, wondering who would get such a name.","“Maybe he’s a noob?” In the game, since there was no mechanism to prevent harming teammates, many new players often made mistakes. (Killing teammates on purpose was seldom seen since such behavior would lead to punishment.)","“He doesn’t even have a new outfit!”","“He is only wearing the white and blue equipment! Maybe he’s indeed a little noob?”","“This name is hilarious. Hahaha!”","This name is so funny; maybe he is here to tell jokes?"]},{"number":531,"title":"Chapter 531 - Let Me down If You Dare!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Behind Mr. Fang, the audience watched with widened eyes.","“How come her weapon sparkles with spiritual light?!”","“Dazzling! Is it an ultimate weapon!?”","“She is wearing a whole set of a fashionable outfit!” Song Qingfeng exclaimed.","Judging from her hairstyle, clothes, jewelry, boots, and even skin tone and lip gloss, everything was new and fancy from the shop.","They didn’t know if she had other things reinforced, but just this purple weapon with level 8 reinforcement and her new outfit made her attributes and properties much higher than those of ordinary players.","Then, they looked at Mr. Fang.","His blue hand cannon looked dim in color, which showed clearly that it hadn’t been reinforced.","Wearing the default gunner’s dark purple windbreaker and the goggles, he didn’t have a single new piece of clothing on him. In fact, even his hair was white, which was the default as well.","He looked as poor as a refugee.","“Is the shop owner in the dojo?” Quite a few people walked up to watch him play.","“What are you doing here in a crowd?” The masters of the ancient families who were discussing minor issues were drawn to this crowd as well.","Standing in the back of the group, they had to crane their necks to watch.","“Ugh.” Seeing his family master coming over, Tang Yu immediately answered with respect, “Mr. Fang is going to fight in the dojo.”","Pungjin’s dojo was big enough to contain several basketball courts.","While two players fought in a duel, the other players could watch on the second floor. No one could disturb the fight on the first floor.","On the screen, the referee had begun the countdown. Then, the duel began after that.","Sia slashed her blade, and the great sword with blazing light and flames transformed into a sky-blue long saber that had a handle which looked to be made of ice crystal!","Elemental Shift!","By harnessing the power of her demon hand, the swordmaster could turn her sword into one of the four elemental magic swords, including fire, water, light, shadow. After the transformation, the weapon would be more powerful than before.","It looked fancy and magnificent!","The moment that this ice water sword appeared, a long wave of sword energy shot toward Fang Qi, who was a launcher right now.","Flying Tips! It was the most common initiation skill for noblesses. Although the damage of the spirit swords wasn’t high, their attack range was longer than other skills. Even when battling opponents from a distance, they wouldn’t be at a big disadvantage.","“Can the shop owner win the duel?” The few family masters didn’t look like they had confidence in Fang Qi.","Faced with an opponent with a reinforced purple weapon and powerful skills, Mr. Fang looked to be at the disadvantage.","It must be noted that purple equipment contained magic power, which could make players move and attack faster (increasing movement speed and attack speed).","With such purple equipment on her, if she attacked first, Fang Qi wasn’t her match; he could only dodge.","Fortunately, the attack range of Flying Tips wasn’t as long as gunners. As if he had predicted her move, Fang Qi leapt into the air and dodged the Flying Tips with ease.","However, before he could take a breath, he heard a yell, “Swift Sword!”","A blurry sword shadow shot toward the place where Fang Qi would land.","His opponent was swift and sharp, not giving him any chance to regain his footing. With his momentum, Mr. Fang would undoubtedly land into this Swift Sword.","“She is using the killing strike so soon?!”","“Maybe she wants to kill the shop owner instantly with this move!”","The horrifying damage of Swift Sword and Sia’s weapon could instantly kill a group of ordinary monsters in dungeons on and below Expert Difficulty Level. If such a combination landed on a player, the consequences would be severe.","Calmly, Mr. Fang shot his hand cannon forward twice.","Fang Qi’s launcher character flew backward under the huge recoil force of the two shots.","“Aerial-Fire? Flying with guns!”","“No... No.” Song Qingfeng stared at the screen intently. “The shop owner is holding a hand cannon; it should be called flying with cannons!”","In a flash, Mr. Fang fired his hand cannon several times.","The sword and the firing cannon exchanged several rounds of attacks in the blink of an eye.","“Illusion Sword!”","“Flash!”","All kinds of spiritual swords swept across the dojo; it looked as if the noblesse was a long-range subclass instead of Fang Qi’s launcher character","“The shop owner seems to be suppressed!” Some people watching looked more worried than Mr. Fang.","“This female slayer’s equipment is too good!” Mu Qing said indignantly.","At this moment, Mr. Fang said, “Her sword techniques are okay, but she is dressed too fancily. I hope you guys won’t copy her style.”","“Swift Sword!” Obviously, his opponent had acute battle awareness and soon detected Fang Qi’s next move. Therefore, she used Swift Sword again!","The audience felt like they had an illusion! At that moment, Mr. Fang’s launcher character seemed to be split into two figures while the Swift Sword pierced between them!","“Is it... Z-Shake?!”","“Not Z-Shake! Z-Shake is used when charging forward! Right now, Mr. Fang did it on spot!”","“How did he do it?!” The audience froze at this moment.","After a while, someone finally understood the previous scene and said, “It was an afterimage left by the Enforce Skill; the shop owner had predicted her move and tricked her Swift Sword with the afterimage that the Enforce Skill left!”","[TL Note: Enforce seems to be a mechanism in the older version of Dungeon Fighter Online and doesn’t exist in the new version. In the old version, the skills that had ‘enforce’ properties can override another skill in command order and be used right away. Otherwise, the character would execute the skills in the order that player input into the system.]","The Basic Attack Cancelable Skill system was widely used in Dungeon Fighter Online. Regardless of what the player was using, it would be interrupted and leave an afterimage when canceled.","The system version also had skill that had enforce property. This property is a special method for canceling forces. In one instant, the character could remove all the momentum of the previous move and use the next move at the same time, naturally leaving a strange afterimage in the previous spot.","This was a visual deception. Under the effect of momentum, Fang Qi looked to be charging forward, but he had retreated.","While the strike passed by Fang Qi, he lifted his hand cannon and fired.","“The shop owner is fighting back!” Due to the great speed and power of Swift Sword, the enforce mechanism couldn’t be used. It meant that Mr. Fang was going to hit his target for sure!","“It is only an attack from an ordinary hand cannon; it won’t inflict much damage, right?” Some people didn’t have high hopes for this move.","However, the explosion created by the hand cannon sent Sia flying upward!","Rising Shot!","The magic power attached to the bullet could make the opponent lose balance and send them flying in mid-air!","Although she didn’t fly high, it was high enough. While firing the hand cannon, Fang Qi didn’t look up to see if his opponent were hit. Instead, he slid over with a sliding tackle.","With this sliding tackle, Fang Qi was now right below Sia.","“Did the Cannon Ball miss the target?!” The audience said in surprise when they saw the cannonball from the Cannon Ball pass his opponent. “Is that a miss?!”","“No! It didn’t miss!”","On the screen, Fang Qi instantly drew out the flamethrower!","The moment the flames shot out, he turned it off and put it away.","The audience saw Sia flying backward and crashing onto the exploding cannon ball on the floor, which sent her flying into the fire that Mr. Fang had just shot out!","“Grenade plus hand cannon plus enforced backstep?!” Sia had been sent flying backward by the huge force of Fang Qi’s hand cannon, but now she was flying back toward Fang Qi involuntarily!","In the original version, this was the standard play of Cannon Ball pull-back. Its theory was easy to understand, and it could be used in the virtual reality version.","She flew past Fang Qi’s head toward the space behind him.","Sia was sent flying outward by Fang Qi’s combo. Then, the anti-tank shell exploded, sending her flying back again like a puppet!","“My goodness!”","“F*ck!”","“Unbelievable!”","“She lost half of her HP already!” someone yelled in surprise.","“Let... put me down!” The girl whose face was covered in blood flailed her arms and legs in the air, feeling frustrated.","Let me down if you dare! Take my strike!"]},{"number":532,"title":"Chapter 532 - I’ll Investigate After I Reinforce My Weapon","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Due to the Enforce Mechanic that was embedded in techniques, each move that was enforced would leave an afterimage behind. On the screen, the launcher drew his guns, used his skills, and switched between different guns and skills under Fang Qi’s control. The launcher moved so fast that it was dazzling, and afterimages appeared on the screen one after another.","“What kinds of plays are these?!”","“How come I don’t remember hearing them in the story that the shop owner told us!”","Many people looked surprised and baffled.","“This... is called the Draw and Attack Style.”","Fang Qi was using the launchers’ standard ‘Draw and Attack Style’ in Dungeon Fighter Online.","This style was nicknamed the ‘Fancy Style’.","One would know why it had obtained such a nickname by watching Mr. Fang’s screen. He switched between all kinds of guns, combat techniques, and grenades so frequently that his moves became a blur to the audience. Before they could see his guns, he had switched to another. It looked as if he were dancing in the gunfire.","On the screen, the target looked like a puppet in this process, going anywhere he wanted. Fang Qi had totally taken control of his opponent.","If this were a show, it was a horrifying show of how he controlled the life and death of his opponent!","It wasn’t an overstatement to say that this style was fancy.","This fighting style of launchers was both complex and simple.","It was complex since the player must be quick and accurate when switching between all kinds of skills.","To move fast, the player must memorize each move and each technique.","To be accurate, the player must control each angle and each detail since they would affect a series of moves later on. Different attacking angles and forces would achieve different results.","Only by moving fast and accurately could the player lead their opponent around. Otherwise, the prey would find a chance to slip from his control.","To use this style, the player must have solid basic training and abilities.","Since there wasn’t the guaranteed protection when the players landed like how it was in the original game, in this virtual reality remake, the opponents might find a chance to fight back in the air.","At last, he used Punisher! While stepping on his opponent, Fang Qi aimed the hand cannon at his opponent’s head and fired!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","It was one of the signature finishing moves of launchers.","“Ah-!”","With a scream, the word ‘victory’ showed on Mr. Fang’s screen.","Meanwhile, the sounds of a computer getting hit came from one corner.","“Ahhhh...!” Sia almost jumped up from her seat.","“Who’s this guy?! Who’s this ‘Kill One Teammate with One Bullet’!?”","“What’s wrong with you?” Luo Piaoling had just finished one match. He was annoyed by the noises that Sia was making, so he had to look over to see what she was doing.","He saw that the audience behind Sia all looked ashen-faced or had dark expressions.","Meanwhile, the audience behind Mr. Fang was silent.","Even the young disciples of the Qingqiu Family who had just begun playing the game looked dazed while observing from behind, let alone the old and more experienced players.","They had never imagined that that battles could happen this way!","“This shop owner... is indeed a grandmaster and a hermit...” A white-clothed girl who was about 15 years old whispered.","“Even with a character that doesn’t have strong power, he could use such complicated battles skills...” another girl whispered, “When we entered this small world in virtual reality, we lost all our strength and could barely fight. He doesn’t look old; how can he be so powerful...?”","“Don’t talk about others behind their backs!”","The woman with snow-white skin and a frost-like expression was about 20 years old, and she seemed to have a high status among them. “He is a senior with great strength. If you anger him, the Family Master will punish you!”","She said solemnly, “After watching this battle, I think you must all have obtained lots of inspirations. It is rare to have such a great opportunity to learn. Now, you must carefully recall and study Senior’s battling skills.”","“Okay! We’ll try our best to learn Senior’s combat skills!”","“It’s a pity that Senior didn’t use mage... I already chose mage... What should I do?”","“I chose mage too...” They all frowned at this dilemma.","“Maybe we can create another character and choose the same class as the shop owner...”","...","– In one corner of the crowd –","Two figures who had been hiding in the crowd walked out of the shop silently. While they walked, they talked to each other.","“How come this class is so powerful?!” They had both chosen priests which were quite rare in the whole shop.","“This little shop owner could use so many complicated battle skills and defeated an opponent who was much stronger...” the other said, “He’s quite good.”","“Yeah...” The tall figure who was hidden in his cloak said, “The Draw and Attack Style? It is indeed a good battle style. I wonder if we can develop such powerful styles with our subclasses.”","“Today, my mistress character learned another skill. I think the battle style of this subclass of mine can change as well...” While they talked, they walked toward the gates of the city to leave.","When they first came to the city, this hadn’t been their topic of conversation. But now...","They talked all the way from the city center to the city gates.","“Tomorrow, after I finish reinforcing my weapon, I’ll go and fight in the dojo as well! Hmph! I’ll show them my power.”","“Of course!” Suddenly, one of them looked at the sky. The eyes that were as deep as the abyss seemed to have seen through the layers of clouds and looked into the void.","“The central star is dim; there’s not much time left... It’s funny that these people are oblivious to it.”","“Oh right, as for the background of the shop... They had opened the teleportation array again... You and I know about how the legend between the Deserted Sea Realm and Spiritual State came from better than others. Although it wasn’t wise for us to stop them from building the teleportation array, we hide in this place and schemed for so long all because...” The voice suddenly turned weaker as if the speaker were afraid of something, even though they were the only two around.","“Yeah. We must get prepared ahead of time.” After walking out of the gate of Yuanyang City, the figures turned into a puff of black mist and floated into the sky.","At this moment, they finally brought up their missions here.","The sky turned even gloomier.","“Well... It’s about time to investigate the background of this shop.” In a remote corner outside Yuanyang City, the figure hidden in the wide black robe was suddenly enveloped by a cloud of black mist. Instantly, they already arrived at another place. “Today, we got some information, but it’s still not enough. Tomorrow, after I reinforce my weapon, I’ll do a detailed investigation.”","“Tomorrow, I’ll go to the dojo to study the battle skills of the mistress. I’ll go with you when you’re free.”","“...”"]},{"number":533,"title":"Chapter 533 - Growth and the Imminent First Awakening","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Xiaoyue, come and fight with me!” Yue Bai was the most combative girl among Jiang Xiaoyue’s friends. Having watched Mr. Fang’s astonishing plays, she was eager to try her hand in the dojo.","However, her subclass was noblesse, the subclass of the person who had been beaten senseless by Mr. Fang.","In the dojo, Jiang Xiaoyue’s mage character stood further away and auto attacked and used Palm Blast. Then, she auto attacked and used Dragon Fang.","– One minute later –","“Auch!” Yue Bai’s noblesse character dropped to the ground.","“This doesn’t count! Let’s do it again!”","...","A demon slayer appeared among the female mages of the Nanhua Faction.","A demon slayer would become a demonbane after the first awakening.","On the screen next to the Xichi Spiritual Master’s, a woman with long white hair was using a serpent sword, looking like a shadow or a whip, covering all angles from all directions.","Hysterical laughter sounded by the Xichi Spiritual Master. “Ahahahaha–!”","“...” The Xichi Spiritual Master’s face darkened as she said, “Senior Sister, don’t always mimic the laughter of the crazy woman (Demon Slayer) in the game...”","In the dungeon, the Xichi Spiritual Master and her other teammates were all dead while the demon slayer was still waving her serpent sword. “Ahahahaha...”","Everyone was at a loss for words.","Mo Xian’s face darkened as she said, “She knows nothing but yelling ‘hahaha’.”","She felt so tortured in her mind that she wanted to move to another seat; her spirit was polluted.","...","On the other side, Song Qingfeng and other young men had become excited after watching Mr. Fang’s match.","Song Qingfeng said, “Young Master Lin, let’s fight!”","Tang Yu chimed in, “Brother, count me in!”","An Cheng said, “Do you want to try the glacier spell? It’s super powerful!”","Wang Xie added, “I want to test the power of the swift spell.”","“Come! Call Old Xun and others over! Let’s have a 3V3 battle!”","It was lively in the shop.","...","The Sky Relic was the biggest relic that the ancient families on the Spiritual State had discovered in the last 1,000 years.","Some rumors claimed that this relic had fallen from the Upper Realm, and there were countless treasures inside! It couldn’t be emptied out!","This relic might contain many secrets of the world.","For example, it might explain why no one had ascended in the past thousands of years.","For example, it might contain the reason why the prehistoric relics were destroyed.","The most eye-catching feature was the large number of celestial objects that were there. If people could uncover and make use of these objects, the cultivation world of Spiritual State might regain their previous prosperity and glory of the prehistoric time.","It was a prosperous world beyond the current cultivators’ imagination.","The ancient families indeed had ancient inheritance, but they were long only compared with the current forces on Spiritual State.","Even now, the ancient families were working hard to explore the relics and study the ancient cultivation civilization. However, after a long time, they still couldn’t conquer the land of the ancient cultivators.","About 3,000 years ago, Zixiao Spiritual Master had prophesied that if one day, the cultivators of this land could uncover the ancient celestial relic, the cultivators and even warriors of Spiritual State would achieve a tremendous leap.","They might even be able to solve the many mysteries from the prehistoric times.","“Old Academy Master... Vice Academy Master Xiao has returned from the Sky Relic...” Inside Heavenly Academy, an old man was quietly lounging on an old-fashioned wooden armchair, seeming to be resting with his eyes closed.","Hearing these words, a sharp glint appeared in this old man’s turbid eyes.","-Meanwhile, in the gloomy sky above Heavenly Academy-","A low voice boomed while two pairs of eyes appeared in the darkness and stared at Heavenly Academy intently. “Sky Relic...?”","“Don’t we need to stop them...?” the other voice said.","“Not necessary. What we need to do now is to improve the new plan and stop anything from disturbing our current plan.”","“Right... the people coming back from that place are either dead or had gone crazy. I’m afraid that the ancient families all have headaches.”","...","Regardless of how turbulent the hidden currents were outside, Origins Internet Club was as tranquil as usual. The players in the shop were oblivious to those hidden currents.","In fact, many people only moved in their small circles, talking about the novel things that they had seen each day.","More and more people entered this novel and amazing world. The disciples of the ancient families, including Tang Yu and Wang Xie, were growing with other adventurers in the game.","As to the grand warriors and cultivators with high-level cultivation strengths, they had higher purpose and ambitions while they studied the novel combat techniques, spiritual spells, and spiritual artifacts.","Gradually, the players moved from level 20 to level 30 and then from level 30 to level 40.","In the Sky Tower, these adventurers witnessed the grand tower that was leading to the sky. On Behemoth, they saw ‘Apostles’ for the first time and met Eighth Apostle Lotus.","Regardless if they were completing missions or adventuring in the dungeons, the players and the characters in the game shared the same goals.","For the players, they wanted to strengthen themselves in both the dojo and the dungeons while they enjoyed the fun of adventures.","For the characters in the game, such as priests who wanted to destroy imposters and the mechanics who wanted to restore brightness and order in the chaotic Empyrean,","They accepted all kinds of missions and investigated weird cases one after another. After the Sky Tower was sealed, they searched for another road leading to the Empyrean and the truth behind the formation of weird places such as the Shadow Thunderland.","During the process, the fledgling players who had made all kinds of mistakes at the beginning of the game gradually matured.","In King’s Ruin, the blind swordsman who had blundered at the beginning now waved his short sword, and the ice blades and flames turned into dazzling spiritual flowers.","When the huge Spirit Crescent lashed out, countless monsters were turned into ashes as darkness and brightness alternated.","On Song Qingfeng’s screen, the male fighter who had struck his teammate with a brick was now very powerful with his leg techniques.","With blazing flames engulfing his legs, each kick looked like a lunging and roaring fire dragon. In the constant cultivation and battles, Song Qingfeng’s fist and leg techniques had reached an ultimate level.","Meanwhile, the first group of players of the game had leved up higher and higher.","In King’s Ruin, Nalan Hongwu slashed out his lightsabre, and this sword was as fast as blurry shadows. The sword energies created a dragon head, and it swept across the screen swiftly. Raging Dragon Slash!","With his eyes covered, Zong Wu slightly moved his short sword upward.","A streak of burning flames spread on the ground. Then, a huge fire ball flew up and burst with vicious force. Fire Wave Sword","The explosion range stopped right before Nalan Hongwu who was fighting nearby.","Except for a hot wind brushing his face, Nalan Hongwu felt no burning on his skin.","Then, many wild and fierce strikes turned into a wave of dark purple spirit swords. Illusion Sword Dance “We passed!” With an exclamation, bright light appeared on their bodies, signaling that they had leveled up.","At this moment, Zong Wu came before his trainer G.S.D with a short sword on his back.","Without any aid, he moved just like an ordinary person who had good eyes.","A new mission appeared in his mission list: [Awakening— Seem Blind but Not Blind, Seem to Have Eyes but No Eyes]"]},{"number":534,"title":"Chapter 534 - Dark Abyss Mode Initials; the E-sport Begins!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","-It was the end of summer-","Although the Yuanyang City Shop had released all the old games, most of the players, as if out of habit, would spend a little over 3 hours to use up the fatigue points of Dungeon Fighter Online even though they put their main focus on games such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy or StarCraft.","The three shops had undergone another expansion. Besides the people of the Heavenly Academy and the seven ancient families, people of other forces in the Spiritual State had also come to visit the Yuanyang City Shop.","The Half City Shop and Jiuhua City Shop were in similar situations. In addition, since Dungeon Fighter Online was the first game that required no activation fee; the players only needed to spend 2 crystals per hour to play this game.","Playing this game, the civilian warriors and poor cultivators could save on the high activation fees.","By now, from the account registrations, the players of Dungeon Fighter Online had reached more than 30,000, and the number was still growing.","More and more adventurers entered the prosperous and beautiful Arad Continent.","Zong Wu, one of the oldest players of the game, was now a bit baffled.","“What mission is this?!” Although his character in the game was blind, Zong Wu wasn’t blind. Thus, he could see the information on the game interface. Puzzled, he looked at the interface while his character followed the instruction of the mission and came before his trainer G.S.D.","He had accurately found G.S.D. who hadn’t made any sounds.","The bald and blind old man was in old ragged clothes. At first glance, no one would have guessed that this little old man was one of the most powerful slayers on the continent. He excelled in all kinds of slayer sword techniques and was the first awakened Asura on Arad Continent.","“Hey! Young Man, can you see me?”","“...” Zong Wu’s face darkened. Few players advanced into the subclass of Asura because they had to destroy their own eyes.","After all, no one would willingly become blind! This was a virtual reality world with beautiful scenery","“Hehe! No need to be angry.” The short and thin old man said mildly, “There are many ways to observe things. Don’t regard yourself as a blind man. The things in the world are observed not with the eyes but with the mind. For example, you found me without the aid of sounds, right? Do you still think that you are blind?”","“...” Zong Wu was at a loss for words. He had indeed thought of giving up on this subclass, but in this world, a warrior who had high-level cultivation strength had great fortitude and never gave up without a fight.","Now, not only in the game but in the real world, he could walk smoothly without much trouble even with his eyes closed.","At this moment, G.S.D. began to teach him a new method of observing the world: Mind’s Eye.","As the trainer, G.S.D. began the lesson by letting Zong Wu feel the wave from a stone and death...","In fact, Zong Wu hadn’t understood this method of observing things at the beginning. Without anyone guiding him, he had battled with this method for a long time, but he still only had a vague concept of it.","In the previous battles, he had accumulated lots of battle experience. Now, he would be guided onto the road of awakening step by step.","With the help of his trainer, Zong Wu almost immediately understood everything. Now, he no longer looked at the old swordsman with resentment. Instead, he now spoke to the old man with respect.","“I got it now...” He carefully felt the waves of things around him including the lifeforms and dead objects. Even without eyes, he had a clear image of the things in his mind.","No one could imagine how he was feeling at this moment, the elation, thrill, and heart-felt joy after enduring so many hardships filled his mind.","Perhaps from now on, nothing could ever escape his senses, and this new way of detecting things wouldn’t put people on guard.","He had encountered more obstacles than others in battles, but he had also benefited more than others.","Now, he was only one step away from breaking off his chains!","Vilmark – Area 50 was near Elvenguard, the players’ spawn place.","Since its boss, Hyper Mecha Tau, was a mechanical bull, this map was also called Mechanical Bull.","Trainer G.S.D. had sensed lots of shadowy dark presences from this place, and he made this place the last test before awakening.","As the trainer, G.S.D. hoped his slayer disciples could benefit from the battle.","Perhaps at this moment, for Zong Wu and other slayers, G.S.D. was more than a NPC (non-player character) but a true trainer as well.","Perhaps years later, the adventurers who roamed on this land would leave, but as long as they still used the sword techniques of slayers, they would never forget their experience on this land.","As soon as Zong Wu walked out of the Back Alley where G.S.D. lived, he took a carriage to Grand Flores. When he arrived, he saw a person, who wore a purple and white long robe and held a strange-shaped short sword, yelling, “Mechanical Bull Awakening Mission! We have two and need two more! Get onboard as soon as possible!”","A loli carrying a spear stood by this man and shouted with him, “Mechanical Bull Awakening Mission! A grandmaster is leading the group. We need two teammates who are not too noob!”","“!!??” Zong Wu froze.","They were the few highest-level players in the shop, and Zong Wu thought, “A grandmaster is leading a group to the Mechanical Bull?!","While his face twitched, and he wondered, “Is it Mr. Fang?”","Meanwhile, Fang Qi received a new prompt on his system interface:","[More than 10 players have taken awakening mission in Dungeon Fighter Online. The game will be updated.]","[The update will take place in the background and won’t interfere with the players’ gaming experience. The update will finish by the end of tomorrow.]","[Update Note:","1. Release of outfit combination coupons in the shop, release of outfits for the new season.","2. Abyss Mode Initiates. The demons in the abyss are staring at this world all the time, and the unstable spaces in the dungeons are their landing portals.]","[New Task: The Path of E-Sports","Task Description: Hold an official E-sports competition. StarCraft and Dungeon Fighter Online will begin the Ladder Tournament and Division Mode, and the top 64 are eligible to enter this competition","Task Props: Dungeon Fighter Online Individual Competition – First-Place Gift Box (trophy) and one dazzling advancement contract, Second-Place Gift Box (trophy) and one dim advancement contract, Third-Place Gift Box (trophy) and one incomplete advancement contract","StarCraft Individual Competition – First-Place Gift Box (trophy) and Zeratul’s wrist blade, Second-Place Gift Box (trophy) and terran marine’s gun, Third-Place Gift Box (trophy) and Raynor’s revolver.","Task Reward: Game Cultivation Room (3 day), godly weapon fragment (1 piece), Fortune Competition Gift Box (Can randomly draw multiple competition game items)]"]},{"number":535,"title":"Chapter 535 - Unrivaled Mechanical bull","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","If the players persisted in making good use of the fatigue points every day from the beginning, even those with poor talent wouldn’t lag behind for more than one or two levels compared to others. If the players had good skills, they would be doing well.","At this moment, two black-clothed figures were busy playing Dungeon Fighter Online in the least eye-catching corner of the shop.","On their screens was a middle-aged man with a black cross printed on the back of his robe and a woman wearing a black priest robe with a sickle in her hand.","Before them was a horrifying monster that was as tall as two people. It was half bull and half machine and held a huge axe in its hand.","Its head looked more like a dragon’s than a bull’s.","Looking at its huge body, exaggerated muscles, and mechanical body, no one would doubt its tremendous strength.","Standing before it, players could all feel a huge suppression pushing toward them.","“Be careful!” The female priest looked grim. Different from the original game, the players who were doing awakening missions in the virtual reality version would enter a dungeon of real-life difficulty, so the players could experience the huge pressure as if they were in the real world, speeding up the awakening process.","“There’s nothing to be afraid of!” The tall avenger snorted while he took out the huge sickle that he carried on his back. “My level 45 blue sickle has been reinforced to level 13; I don’t believe that any monster can block my blade!”","“You’re right...” The female priest agreed. “With our countless years of experience with spiritual spells and combat skills, nothing can trouble us.”","Suddenly, this huge mechanical bull stood up with cold godly lights in its eyes. Meanwhile, many strange magic arrays appeared on the ground.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","All kinds of monsters appeared in each magic array, from the small ones, such as goblins that players had battled before, to the big bull-headed monsters, that were strengthened by machines.","Meanwhile, a dazzling huge sickle hacked into this mechanical bull’s head.","Clank!","A strange energy shield lit up, and the mechanical bull remained intact!","“How come this monster is so hard to damage?!” The figure concealed in the big black robe sounded astonished, and his eyeballs almost popped out of his eye sockets.","In a flash, the bull-headed machine king opened its mouth and spat out a streak of hot blazing flames.","The virtual reality version was different from the original game. In the original game, there were usually huge signs before each move so that the players could have time to react.","Standing before them was a horrifying war machine. With a wave of its huge axe, the ground cracked, and the huge collision force shattered a building in one go!","Meanwhile, the machine army that it summoned from the experiment field swarmed up from all directions.","At this, many magic arrays lit up on the ground.","In the blink of an eye, the machine army that surrounded them doubled.","The superior presence emitting from the mechanical bull even drove high-level monsters such as demon cats at the outer range of the forest to lunge at the two.","Soon, the area was turned into a huge sea of monsters which grew from hundreds to thousands. The two were surrounded by so many monsters that they couldn’t see the end of them!","They watched the scene and were at a loss for words.","...","Vilmark – Area 50 was a huge secret experiment field for weapons. It was originally built by the DeLos Empire to develop all kinds of strange war tools. In fact, not only the mechanical bull, but experiments such as Metastasis (female slayers were the few survivors of this experiment) all came from this experiment field.","Hidden in the depths of the forest of Grand Flores, it was fraught with dangers.","The most horrifying thing was the boss, which was the mechanical bull king. It could summon all the machine force from the whole experiment field. Besides, it was an intelligent machine with super abilities, and it was equipped with a powerful energy shield. If one couldn’t find its weakness, it was impossible to leave a scratch on it.","Of course, the players needed to go through a series of tests before they could enter this area; they couldn’t enter it until the Bel Myre Principality gave them the mission and granted them the map and permit to the experiment field.","Zong Wu and others had finished this series of missions and the first half of the awakening mission. Zong Wu had gone to King’s Rune to train for the sensing of the death wave. When he came to Grand Flores two days later, he found that almost everyone had reached level 49.","Elvenguard was the only entrance to Vilmark – Area 50.","“Sir, is this so-called Area 50 difficult to pass?” Zong Wu looked at the dense forest before him and asked the question. The previous King’s Rune had a daunting difficulty level; he and Nalan Hongwu had spent many life tokens to barely pass it.","It was almost unbearable to them since they couldn’t resurrect in the real world.","Since Vilmark – Area 50 came after the King’s Rune, it was probably the last test before awakening, which meant that it had the highest difficulty level among all dungeons.","“I saw two people enter; I wonder how they are doing.” Beside them was a player of Jiuhua City Shop, and he had also reached level 48.","The moment he said it, they heard a voice say, “How come this mechanical bull is so difficult to fight?!”","Two disheveled black-robed priests resurrected and said, “I can’t leave a scratch on this monster with my weapon that had been reinforced to level 13!”","The female priest’s face was hidden in the cloak, and no one could see her expression. However, she sounded very displeased, “In my opinion, this place isn’t a mission prepared for awakening. My purple weapon reinforced to level 11 couldn’t even break its shield.”","“So difficult?” The passerby froze. After all, a purple weapon reinforced to level 11 was a godly weapon at this stage to the players, but it couldn’t break the monster’s defense?!","This monster sounds unrivaled!","“The boss can summon endless monsters. Eventually, you will find yourself surrounded by an ocean of monsters, and it’s impossible to get out!” The other complained, “I can’t believe that the empire has designed such a monster; it is tricky to deal with. I don’t think it’s something that we can deal with at our current level.”","Vilmark – Area 50 was a nightmarish dungeon for all players below level 60, so it wasn’t so easy to pass.","“Ugh...” The passerby froze for a moment. “I heard the shop owner say that he is leading a team to pass the mechanical bull.”","Zong Wu’s face twitched. “Sir, can you do it?”","Some people claimed that it was impossible to pass while the shop owner claimed that anyone who were not noobs could join his team and pass.","Who should I believe?","“Is this kid boasting?” The avenger looked at Mr. Fang in doubt.","By now, a few other players had also resurrected; they looked weak after falling to defeat the mechanical bull.","They couldn’t break the bull’s defense and later didn’t even have a chance to get close to the monster. When surrounded by herds of monsters, even gods couldn’t defeat it!"]},{"number":536,"title":"Chapter 536 - Great Teammate and Seamless Teamwork (I)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir, can we do it or not?”","“Of course, we can!” Fang Qi said confidently.","“Okay! Count me in!” Although Zong Wu was still hesitant, he still joined the team.","There were few people around; some of them looked doubtful after being crushed by the mechanical bull, and they were hesitating. That passerby hesitated for a while and said, “Can I... join you? I’d like to try.”","Fang Qi nodded and invited him into his team.","He was a spitfire (a subclass of gunner), and his ID was ‘Master Zhou’.","Fang Qi couldn’t recall this person from his memory; it was clear that he had come into the shop after Fang Qi went to the Half City Shop.","However, he was obviously not a noob player since he had reached level 48 and finished the missions leading to Vilmark – Area 50.","Fang Qi checked his teammates’ equipment and skill levels before leading them into Vilmark – Area 50.","At this stage, there were almost no healing skills in the game. Since crusaders had healing skills, this class was more like a support at this time. Their combat strength wasn’t high enough to enable them to enter dungeons alone as the other classes did. That was why it was rare to run into competent crusaders in the game.","Equipped with only a few precious bottles of healing potion, they must be cautious with each step and avoid unnecessary consumption.","Since they had the map showing how to reach the boss in this dungeon, the mechanical bull, they didn’t venture aimlessly into the forest which was fraught with unknown dangers.","This nearby area around the experiment field was filled with demon cats which had become fierce due to mutations. They were aggressive and usually attacked in groups.","These demon cats were the first problem that players needed to solve after entering Vilmark – Area 50.","At least, some of them had good equipment on the team. The spitfire character named Master Zhou had a set of level 40 equipment on him, and his weapons included Spada’s Curse, a purple auto gun reinforced to level 8.","The equipment of the other team members was even better.","Mr. Fang’s current character’s ID was Black Noble, and he was a soul bender; he could summon powerful demons to help him battle.","If he loosened the iron chain on his arm, the demons would be able to freely move around. Using demons properly would give soul benders a great advantage in battles.","Born in an era earlier than Trainer G.S.D., the Great Zieg who was one of the first soul benders opened the path for all slayers; he was the pioneer. He taught slayers skills such as Kazan, Afterimage of Keiga, Ice Saya, and Hazy-Eyed Bremen which could summon these various demons.","Fang Qi waved his short sword, and a black shadow moved around his body.","It was Afterimage of Keiga.","“Sir! I’m moving to the left!” Jiang Xiaoyue volunteered eagerly.","Fang Qi nodded. After summoning the demon, he said to the others, “You guys stay where you are.”","The team pushed forward not in the route as indicated by the map but directly into the depths of the forest.","Faintly, they could hear a series of low roars from the depths of the forest.","Streaks of chilly gazes emitted gloomy lights from the depths of the forest.","“He entered alone?!” At this moment, two black figures stood behind Mr. Fang’s seat.","They stared at Mr. Fang’s screen intently.","The dim forest was fraught with monsters, and it was easy to be sneak-attacked from behind since it was dark in here. It meant that venturing into the forest alone wasn’t a good idea.","With a series of low shrill screams, many demon cats lunged toward Fang Qi from the forest.","Fang Qi was fast; he moved much faster than other players. He used Force Wave: Neutral to attack behind him and moved swiftly with the sliding steps of Drive Slash. Despite the great speed of the crazy demon cats, they couldn’t catch up with Fang Qi in a short while.","Obviously, the sliding step of Drive Slash was an explosive small movement technique, and the players’ bodies would be under great pressure when using it continuously. If the players used this technique too frequently, it would go beyond the limit and make them collapse.","No one would take the risk and use this technique continuously if not in an urgent situation.","Although Fang Qi moved with perfect timing in each step, more and more monsters were attracted. Almost all the demon cats came after the presence of strangers and the smell of blood and flesh.","Luring and gathering monsters was the basic skill when playing in teams. In the original version, each ‘room’ in the dungeon was of the same size, which made it much easier to lure monster. But now in the virtual reality version, this work was obviously more difficult.","“He attracted so many monsters?!” Hearing that Mr. Fang was doing the awakening mission, quite a few players gathered behind him.","“He lured most of the demon cats from nearby, right?!”","“It doesn’t look good.”","He couldn’t break out of the siege of demon cats with only Drive Slash.","The deeper into the forest, the more difficult it was to walk, and a detour was impossible in this place.","The best option was to go back the way he came, but this path was blocked by groups of demon cats.","“The terrain in the forest is very complex. With the demon cats surrounding him, I want to see how this kid can return.” The figure hidden in the black robe shook his head. With his experience, he knew that Fang Qi was cornered.","At this moment, Fang Qi chanted in a low voice, and a faint, flickering shadow slowly took shape behind him. The pitch-black demon silently rose up like a huge black wing.","Then, he turned around and took a few steps forward.","The viewers were mad; this kid ambled forward as if he were taking a stroll in the forest instead of being on an adventure.","Meanwhile, a large group of demon cats lunged at Fang Qi like raindrops in a storm!","Then, the audience saw Fang Qi making a move that they couldn’t comprehend; he crashed into the monsters!","“What’s he doing?!”","“Is he crazy?!”","“Does the shop owner want to be killed and come back with a life token?!”","While everyone was bewildered, they saw something unbelievable in the next moment.","The people watching saw the character on Mr. Fang’s screen blink and fade away. It completely vanished at the very moment that all the demon cats crashed onto him!","Fang Qi’s body traveled through the lunging demon cats!","Phantasmal Step! It was a special step that could be used when under the protection of a demon. The players could turn themselves into nothingness for one instant while dashing. Fang Qi had just used Afterimage of Keiga and summoned such a demon!"]},{"number":537,"title":"Chapter 537 - Great Teammate and Seamless Teamwork (II)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since he had to be dashing to use it, Fang Qi had purposefully slowed down before to accelerate at this moment and vanished for a split second.","He vanished for only one instant, but it helped him dodge all the attacks. When he reappeared, he had gotten away from all the demon cats that had surrounded him.","Exclamations erupted behind him.","“It can be done like this?!”","“Amazing!”","The two black figures concealed in black cloaks exchanged looks of astonishment.","Fang Qi had gotten out of the group of monsters with ease in a way that they had never imagined before!","When the demon cats lunged again, Fang Qi used the same skill to dodge their attacks. With Phantasmal Step, Fang Qi moved even faster. Soon, he returned to the previous path with all the demon cats chasing after him.","“Wow! Boss, you lured so many of them!” Jiang Xiaoyue had just returned. Seeing the large number of demon cats behind Mr. Fang, she froze with widened eyes.","“Sir! There are so many of them! How do we fight them?!” Master Zhou’s legs almost turned to jelly, and Zong Wu didn’t look any better.","“Oh, this is easy.” Mr. Fang turned back around and ran into the group of monsters.","Startled, the others shivered and almost dropped their weapons.","With perfect timing, Fang Qi dodged several demon cats that lunged at him with that split-second vanishing.","“He is dashing into the center of the monsters!?” Behind Mr. Fang, the viewers talked among themselves.","After all, with Phantasmal Step, the players could only vanish for a split second. If he went in but couldn’t get out...","In the next instant, the viewers saw a sword flash. A cross appeared on Mr. Fang’s screen!","A weird ghost shadow appeared above all the monsters, and they were frozen in mid-air!","Phantasmal Slayer!","After Phantasmal Slayer was used, Fang Qi had moved for dozens of meters and landed outside of the group of monsters in the blink of an eye.","Then, a G-18 Freeze Grenade exploded, which was seamlessly controlled to hit the monsters after Fang Qi. Following Master Zhou, Zong Wu used Fire Wave Sword.","The moment when all the monsters were released from the effect of Phantasmal Slayer, they were immediately frozen by ice.","With low chant from Fang Qi, many pitch-black tombstones containing gloomy death auras crashed down like a storm!","“Xiaoyue! Round in the remaining monsters.”","“Okay!” Jiang Xiaoyue immediately understood.","The monsters outside the battle zone were tossed into the tombstones one by one by Jiang Xiaoyue.","After the rain-drop-like tombstones landed, the ground was covered by corpses!","The viewers gasped at the scene collectively. “So fast!”","When many players fought these monsters, it had taken them a long while to kill even one of them. Meanwhile, they had been worried that if they lured out too many monsters, they would be overwhelmed by these monsters and be killed instantly instead.","In the blink of an eye, most of the monsters in the outer range had been cleared!","A few others seemed to have understood Fang Qi’s tactics. They must coordinate their control of the monsters seamlessly between them using the skills of their own classes, and they needed to damage the monsters at the perfect moment. Then, they could instantly kill the monsters and not give them time to fight back.","“Asura, gather more stamps.” At Fang Qi’s command, the team pushed forward until they came to the place where the boss of this dungeon was.","“Sir, how do we fight it?!”","In the center of the distant experiment field, they saw a huge creature, half-bull and half-machine, standing there silently.","With a huge mechanic axe in its hand, its dark-red skin and distorted horns made it look like a demonic god from Hell.","“Follow my order. Charge!” Another gloomy demonic shadow rose behind Fang Qi.","“Ugh...?”","“Charge now?!”","The viewers behind him also froze.","“What’s this kid doing?!” The two black-robed figures froze as well.","They are charging up like this? Isn’t this suicide?","“Yes! Charge!” Taking the lead, Fang Qi charged at the mechanical bull and shouted, “Follow close.”","Soon, they got close to the mechanical bull.","The huge mechanical monster suddenly opened its eyes.","It initiated.","At this moment, Fang Qi sped up, turned into nothingness, and passed it in a flash!","In the flashing sword light, a creepy demonic shadow suddenly appeared above the mechanical bull!","Phantasmal Slayer!","The bull-headed machine king which had just stood up froze on the spot!","“Asura! Fire Wave Sword! Agni Pentacle!”","“Spitfire! G-35L Flash Bang! Explosion Flame Bullet! Napalm! Launch!”","“Maximum damage output!”","Meanwhile, Fang Qi used various ghost arrays such as Kazan Ice Saya instantly.","They strengthened Fang Qi’s teammates and greatly weakened the abilities of the mechanical bull.","Moonlight Slash!","As a dark beam of moonlight appeared, Fang Qi reduced the mechanical bull’s resistance to shadow damage.","Techniques, such as Tombstones, crashed down one after another.","Meanwhile, dark purple array light shone beneath Zong Wu’s feet.","The moment the ghost shadow above the bull-headed machine king disappeared, the mechanical bull was immediately trapped by this huge dark purple spiritual array! It was seamless!","The huge dark purple Agni Pentacle spun, inflicting huge damage on the mechanical bull.","While the spitfire shot out countless bullets and the G-35L Flash Bang flashed, Jiang Xiaoyue waved her spear so fast that it turned into a blur.","“Ground Quaker!” Fang Qi continued to shout.","Asura’s Ground Quaker contained a longer negative effect on the monsters; it could affect almost all monsters, including most of the bosses.","The moment Agni Pentacle ended, Ground Quaker transformed into a blazing white ball of spiritual light, trapping the mechanical bull inside!","The players on this team all had the best equipment; even passerby Master Zhou’s equipment wasn’t bad. Besides, Master Zhou’s G-35L Flash Bang could help others unleash a huge amount of damage in one instant.","The viewers watched everything. In these few seconds where the boss was controlled, the previously fear-inducing and almost unrivaled bull-headed machine king was damaged so severely that it faltered and staggered before it could completely initiate itself.","At this moment, they finally understood what teamwork really meant. In one instant, the horrifying power unleashed from all classes had reduced the HP of the bull-headed machine king to a very low level.","“Roar!” the boss roared. The trapping power of the asura’s Ground Quaker had just disappeared, and a huge force spread out like a hurricane.","All the players were sent flying by this horrifying force.","Meanwhile, countless magic arrays lit up on the ground around them.","“It’s still alive?!”","Everyone’s heart sank. They had almost used all their skills and inflicted great damage on the bull-headed machine king in one instant, but this boss was still alive.","Even the two black-robed figures who were watching intently looked concerned.","The bull-headed machine king emitted a wave of strange magic lights.","Meanwhile, it was chanting something.","Then, shields lit up around its body.","“Finished.”","Even Zong Wu’s hands turned clammy with sweat, let alone the others.","However, this huge mechanical bull suddenly moved slower and slower. The viewers didn’t know when, but an icy-blue demon had appeared by its feet!","Meanwhile, the green demon was continuously weakening this horrifying monster.","Ice frozen!","“G-35L Flash Bang! G-18 Freeze Grenade! Continue attacking!”","The Freeze Grenade exploded, and the mechanical bull was again frozen by the chilly ice from the grenade.","All the teammates focused their attention. With high concentration, their skills were all more accurate now compared to usual.","All kinds of skills were used seamlessly.","Boom!","A huge noise suddenly came from the body of the mechanical bull, and it dropped to the ground on its knees abruptly.","It was completely broken!","“They passed?!”","“They passed just like this?!”","The viewers stared at Fang Qi’s screen intently with disbelief written on their faces.","It took less than ten seconds from the beginning to the end.","This mechanical bull that was extremely scary in others’ eyes had been instantly killed before it could launch any attacks!","It didn’t get the chance to unleash even a little bit of its great power.","Passed! Passed like this?","Even Zong Wu looked incredulous.","“When you are facing a powerful enemy, don’t forget that your teammates have your back,” deeing their astonishment, Fang Qi explained casually.","The seamless teamwork between teammates gave the players the thrill that they couldn’t experience while fighting alone. Sometimes, a team could do things which were impossible to finish by one or two people.","Only after experiencing the hardships together and helping each other in a team could they be rewarded with this indescribable elation and touching moment.","Also, by finishing their awakening mission, they either had proved their great power or had obtained some inspiration. No matter what, they could reach the next level – Awakening.","From now on, the Asura was no longer blind, and the Spitfire wasn’t only an expert... They would be Silent Eye, General, Bellatrix, and Soul Reaper!"]},{"number":538,"title":"Chapter 538 - The First Livestream of People in This World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For the people in this world, they usually engaged in one-on-one battles regardless if it were a battle of combat techniques or spiritual spells. Teaming up against an enemy was looked upon with disdain.","However, after Fang Qi commanded them to unleash horrifying battle force in one instant and killed the mechanical bull, they truly felt the charm of teamwork.","Although he hadn’t been able to reach level 50 today and learn the active skills after the first awakening, Zong Wu was satisfied already.","After exploring the game in darkness for a long time, the powerful skill ‘Mind Eye’ helped him sense many details that he wouldn’t have noticed otherwise in the real world as well.","For example, Zong Wu now noticed that Mr. Fang was writing something on the small blackboard.","The castellan of the city had come to the shop very early today. Usually, as the Castellan of Yuanyang City, he rarely came here this early.","“Castellan... The issue of the Wen Family in the western city... And the issue of Cloud Spiritual Mining Zone...” A cultivator who was dressed like a scholar followed him, looking a little frustrated.","“...” Zong Wu’s face twitched. “Later... I’ll read the reports later. Today, I’ll reach level 50 first. It isn’t too late for me to look into the issue after I learn the awakening skills!”","“Ugh...” The scholar-like cultivator’s face twitched.","...","Now, Zong Wu looked at the small blackboard curiously and saw many new pieces of content on it.","“Dojo Division System in Dungeon Fighter Online? Ladder Ranking in StarCraft?” Zong Wu read them in bafflement. “What are these?”","“What are these?!” Sia asked while pointing at the words such as [Outfit Combining Machine], [Outfit Combining Machine Gift Bag], and [QQ Livestream.]","Sia still had anger in her eyes. Ever since the gunner who wore pieces of blue and white armor and accessories defeated her in the dojo and shot her in the head at the end of the match, this girl from the western outlands glared at Mr. Fang with fury in her eyes each day.","Of course, Mr. Fang ignored her completely.","In contrast, Luo Piaoling and his followers who were also people of the Ultimate West Realm were gentle and polite. He cupped his hands, which was a greeting gesture among people of the Spiritual State, and asked, “Sir, can you explain these to us?”","“Oh. It’s you.” As if the account with the ID ‘Kill One Teammate with One Bullet’ wasn’t his, Fang Qi acted as if he was innocent and greeted them.","Then, he explained to Sia and the other people around him, “This Outfit Combining Machine... can combine two outfits into a rare outfit that is completely new. With this, you can effectively avoid the situation of wearing the same clothes as others in the game.”","“As for the QQ Livestream Platform... it’s even simpler.” Fang Qi continued to explain.","The two figures hidden in black cloaks had just walked into the shop. Then, they paused when they overheard the words. “Division System? Ladder Ranking? Outfit Combining Machine?! QQ Livestream?”","They heard every word.","They exchanged a look. What is the shop owner up to?!","“Let’s hear him first and see if there are any conspiracies!”","“Yeah! Let’s see if this kid will slip and say something about the background of the shop.”","They listened attentively.","Soon, they heard [Abyss Mode].","“We’ll encounter demons from the Abyss?! Does this virtual small world have such things?!”","Although they had hidden in the darkness of the world for a long, long time, they had never heard of such things before.","However, when the words ‘Abyss’ and ‘Demon’ came together, everyone knew that it meant a type of powerful demonic creatures.","They can even travel through space and enter the dungeons?!","How powerful must that be?!","Sitting on a couch, they each bought a cup of milk tea and listened more attentively while holding the cups in their hands.","Then, they heard that the demons carried not only pink colored godly equipment but epic equipment which only existed in legends...","They saw the players around the counter erupting into excited discussions.","“How can we encounter the Abyss Demons?!”","“What is the chance of meeting them? Are they more powerful than the mechanical bull?!”","“Can we fight them with a team of four?”","“Can I fight them in a team with a weapon reinforced to level 5?”","One of the two figures put down the milk tea cup, and the chilly and wicked female voice sounded eagerly, “Should we try it later? We’ll take the equipment from the Abyss Demons by force! Hahahaha!”","She let out a series of high-pitched laughter.","“Let’s go! Enter the game now! We’ll be the first to fight them! Don’t let others get their hands on these demons first.”","...","The space that the Arad Continent was in wasn’t too stable, and the dimensions in the dungeons were even more so. That was why demons would land there occasionally.","The powerful demons would usually bring huge disasters to adventurers.","However, a group of high-level adventurers wouldn’t be willing to wait and become their prey. They would use Demon-Breaking Stones to break open the space and lure the demons into this world.","At this moment, two figures engulfed in black cloaks sat before computers and logged into the game.","“Ugh? What’s wrong?” one of the black figures asked.","The female priest stood at where she was.","The first black figure glanced at the female priest and saw that she had opened the shop in the game.","“Wait for a moment, I’ll get a set of newly-released rare outfits.”","For many females, some things were probably more attractive than good equipment. Newly-released rare outfits were one of them.","In the females’ eyes, outfits could not only make their equipment look more beautiful; they could also increase their defensive abilities.","These outfits were good news to the girls who loved to look beautiful but had to battle in the dungeons wearing armor.","Some of them had bought many fashionable outfits for themselves long ago.","For example, there were the aristocrat-like woman and the proud girls of the Qingqiu Family","Other girls including Yue Bai and Mu Qing were also very curious and expectant about the newly-released rare outfits.","After Mr. Fang’s explanation, they had understood what the QQ livestream was for and how to use the combining machine.","They could watch the livestream through QQ on their communication jade. If they had bought the shop’s membership cards, so they could even send flowers, goose eggs, or other gifts to the streamers.","The woman hiding in the corner thought for a while. “Maybe I’ll try this thing called ‘livestream’?”","After a moment of consideration, she clicked open the icon for QQ Livestream that just appeared on the desktop.","She set up the room name and livestream description: Livestreaming Combining Rare Outfits!","The livestream started.","Then...","“Little Sister, deposit 1,000 crystals in my card!” Li Xin’er saw a woman covered in a black cloak coming over and putting down 1,000 crystals.","Soon, the woman returned to her seat, opened the shop in the game, and changed the crystals in her card into the currency in the game.","“Wait!” The black-robed man beside her seemed to have thought about something. “Be careful. This combining machine might malfunction occasionally just like the Reinforcer!”"]},{"number":539,"title":"Chapter 539 - Didn’t She Say That She Will Only Give It a Try? but the Crystals...?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Be careful. I’m afraid that the combining machine will malfunction occasionally just like the Reinforcer!”","Hearing the reminder of her companion, the woman hiding in her black robe got more cautious.","“Don’t worry. I’ll just try and see if this combining machine is good to use or not!” she said coldly.","At this moment, Yue Bai and some others had just logged into the game.","In the shop, some players such as the masters of the ancient families were busy and would leave as soon as they used up their fatigue points.","At this moment, the young people of the ancient families had logged into the game eagerly.","The girls of the Qingqiu Family led by the white-clothed girl had logged into the game already.","“Ms. Yu, what do you think of the newly-released Outfit Combining Machine? Should we try it?” After all, they had heard Mr. Fang say that the machines could make different clothes so that they could be dressed differently from ordinary mortals.","This was one of the ways that the disciples and members of the ancient families could show their outstanding status.","Obviously, the Qingqiu Family Master hadn’t arrived yet, so the cold-looking white-clothed girl was their leader.","“I must try the ‘Outfit Combining Machine’ personally...” The cold woman said. Then, she suddenly heard an exclamation from behind her.","“Someone is livestreaming? It is about combining outfits using the combining machine!”","“Ugh? Someone is doing it now?” Qingqiu Yu clicked open QQ Livestream. Sure enough, there was one livestream room named ‘Livestreaming Combining Rare Outfits.’","“Should we go in and have a look?” She could take this opportunity to see how the livestream in the shop worked.","Seeing Qingqiu Yu entering the livestream room, the other disciples of the Qingqiu Family followed suit and watched the livestream.","Meanwhile, Yue Bai, Mu Qing, Su Tianji, and some other people who were interested in new outfits had also entered the livestream room.","They saw that the streamer was a female priest who had advanced to the subclass of Mistress.","“Ugh?! So many people?” The mysterious figure in black looked at the bottom-left corner of her screen.","[Su Tianji entered the livestream room.]","[Nalan Mingxue entered the livestream room.]","[Liu Ningyun entered the livestream room.]","[Xi Yue entered the livestream room.]","[Song Qingfeng entered the livestream room.]","[Guo Xiong entered the livestream room.]","[Shui Xianyun gifted you 10 goose eggs.]","...","A long row of prompts appeared.","“Um? So many people are watching?!” She couldn’t believe it.","“What’s wrong?” The figure who was hidden in a black cloak and sitting next to her immediately looked over.","“I opened the livestream and found that there are many people watching. Someone even gifted me 10 goose eggs?!” Ten goose eggs were equivalent to one crystal; she wouldn’t have spared a glance at it if this was another normal occasion. After all, her status was high.","But now, a glint appeared in her eyes. “We can even gift each other these goose eggs on this so-called internet?!”","“Don’t expose yourself.” The person in the dark cloak warned her.","“Don’t worry!” She put down her virtual reality headset and whispered, “We’re doing a livestream in this corner; no one in the virtual small world will know who we are.”","Then, she put on her virtual reality headset and suddenly saw the messages in the chat on the bottom left corner.","[Girl, in which corner are you doing the livestream?]","[Little Sister, you’re exposed. I’ve found you already.]","[Tell us! Which corner are you guys hiding at?]","[Why are you hiding in a corner? Tell us! What bad things have you done? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\">]","“...” Covering her mouth, she stared at the comments with widened eyes. “I forgot to turn off the external communication!”","Through external communication, the sounds and messages from the outside could also be transmitted into the internal communication channel...","“Did you guys hear what I said!?”","[Yeah! Every word!]","Bullet comments all came at once.","“...”","After a long pause, she remained silent with a dark expression. In mortification, she began buying outfit combining machines.","Mu Qing typed, [Little Sister, don’t be shy! Can you say something?]","Liang Shi said earnestly, [Girl, don’t worry. We are not bad people.]","“...” This livestream room turned silent.","She was torn between turning it off and continuing the livestream; her first livestream experience was extremely poor!","Soon, she bought one Outfit Combining Machine Gift Bag from the shop for 50 crystals. Upon opening the bag, she saw 20 Outfit Combining Machines, a bottle of anti-fatigue potion from Pandemonium, and ten life tokens.","She bought 20 machines for 50 crystals. Does that mean I can make 20 high-level rare outfits?!","“They are quite cheap!” She commented before saying to the person sitting next to her, “We can buy 20 Outfit Combining Machines for only 50 crystals. The bag even contains a bottle of anti-fatigue potion from Pandemonium which can give you 30 fatigue points! It’s a good deal! Do you want to buy one?”","“It contains an anti-fatigue potion?” The black-robed man had been contemptuous of this machine. After hearing that he would get anti-fatigue potion by buying the machines, he immediately entered the shop.","He looked at the Outfit Combining Machine Gift Bag and exclaimed, “It’s true! This gift bag does give an anti-fatigue potion!”","Doesn’t this mean that I will have 30 more fatigue points compared to the others!","“I’ll buy one!” Immediately, he bought one too.","Meanwhile, the woman beside him had begun using Outfit Combining Machines to make new rare outfits.","This man concealed in his black cloak looked at the gift bag in the game.","After talking the potion and getting 30 fatigue points, I still have 20 Outfit Combining Machines. What should I do with them?","Whatever; I will use them and see if I can get anything good.","While thinking that, he put one outfit into the combining machine.","[Please put in two pieces of clothing for the same location on the body?]","“It needs to be for the same location?”","“Ugh? But I don’t have two pieces of clothing for the same location!” For most male players, they only had one set of clothing to cover themselves and not be ugly; this man was the same.","He scratched his head and decided to buy one.","He spent a little more than ten crystals and bought a permanent outfit. After all, temporary outfits couldn’t be combined.","After he put the two outfits into the machine, the combination process began.","Spiritual light lit up on the combining machine while it rumbled...","Then, this avenger received a prompt. [You got a set of Black Knight Chest Armor.]","“Is this the new outfit?”","He looked at it with widened eyes. “How come this set of chest armor looks so familiar?”","No! It looked exactly like one of the outfits except that its color changed!","I put in two sets of outfits and got one set back with a different color?! What the heck is this?!","Meanwhile, the woman who was livestreaming had also begun combining outfits.","A prompt appeared in the livestream room of the mistress. [You got a girly red vest.]","“!!??” The woman froze.","I bought it before! I put in two high-level outfits in and got only one back?!","“...” Her face even darkened.","Meanwhile, the viewers of the livestream also froze.","[What happened?]","[How come two outfits became only one?]","[Did it fail just like the Reinforcer? It can do that?]","[One of them was shattered?]","[It got shattered on the first try. What bad luck!]","“...”","While reading the bullet comments in the chat, the female priest’s face turned dark. “Just like the Reinforcer, this machine also malfunctions occasionally.”","Then, she sighed in relief and said, “Fortunately, I was just trying it.”","She felt like something wasn’t right as soon as she said that.","Trying? But I bought 20 combining machines!","Since she could get 30 fatigue points if she bought the gift bag of 20 combination machines, she chose this option!","Now that I used one, what should I do with the rest 19 machines?!","Maybe... I should try again?","Fortunately, she had bought many outfits and could use them to combine into new things. Therefore, she opened another combining machine and tossed in two outfits.","They were combined.","[You got a pair of black long pants.]","“!!??” This was something she already had. Another failure?!","Should she continue or not?!","If she stopped, she would still have 18 combining machines left!","If she continued...","With gritted teeth, she said, “I’ll try a few more; I’ll stop if I have more failures!”","[You got a faint-black necklace.] (Failed)","[You got a pair of black long boots.] (Failed)","[You got a blue vest.] (Failed)","“...This is...” Her expression was dark. “There is no way that combining machines can make any rare outfit!”","She had thought that the combining machines would only malfunction occasionally just like the Reinforcer.","Now, she knew how naïve she had been!","They didn’t malfunction occasionally; it seemed like they were malfunctioning consistently!","“This is the last try!” She said with gritted teeth, “If it fails again, I’ll stop and protest to the little shop owner!”","Ding!","A piece of melodious music sounded by her ear. [You got a black short-sleeved shirt; you got a set of Dark Saint Soul Chest Armor.]","[!!??]","[Success?!]","Bullet messages flooded the screen.","[Dark Saint Soul?!]","[Is it a newly-released rare outfit?!]","[It worked?!]","The dark color and grand design made this set of chest armor different from ordinary ones. The dark-red chest armor looked exquisite and smooth, standing out from other outfits on its own.","More importantly, it had higher attributes and properties compared to advanced outfits, and it possessed the unique set attributes like those of the green set items in Diablo!","[My goodness!]","[Awesome!]","[Unfortunately, it’s only one piece of the outfit. If you have a whole set of them, it would look so dashing.]","Seeing that there were many bullet comments in the chat, the female priest continued combining.","Anyway, she still had ten combining machines left, and they would become a waste if she stopped.","She continued with this thought...","(Failed)","(Failed)","(Failed)","...","At the 19th try, she got a pair of Dark Saint Soul Battle Boots.","At this moment, her stock of over 40 pieces of outfits had dwindled by half.","She had only made two pieces of rare outfits. She took a closer look and realized that she needed all eight pieces of this outfit to get the set bonus!","I’ll buy one more Outfit Combining Machine Gift Bag! She bought another gift bag with that thought, but the fatigue potion could only be used once per day.","She continued trying with these 20 combining machines.","(Failed)","(Failed)","(Failed)","...","When only half of the 20 combining machines were left, she found that she had run out of outfits!","Since the combination required two outfits for the same location on the body, she... ran out of outfits for the same location!","“Maybe... I should buy some more high-level outfits?”","Soon, Li Xin’er saw the woman engulfed in her black cloak coming to the counter again. “Deposit 1,000 crystals in my card!”","– Half an hour later –","“Deposit 1,000 more crystals for me!”","-One hour later-","“Again...”","“More...”","“Only two pieces away from my goal. Again!”","“Only one piece away! Again...”","She suddenly froze. “Where are my crystals?!”","To play the games in the shop, she had gotten many of crystals. After all, she had seldom used crystals before. But now they were all gone?!","I’m only one piece away from getting the whole set of this rare outfit! But I ran out of crystals now?!","After thinking for a bit, she slammed a small radiant jade bottle on the counter. “How much crystals can it trade this for? Deposit more crystals in my card...”","Since she had come to this point, she must get this whole rare outfit today!","The viewers watching the livestream fell silent.","They were dumbfounded by what they saw.","Didn’t she say that she will only give it a try?! What is going on?"]},{"number":540,"title":"Chapter 540 - The Cultivation World Is on the Brink of Destruction, and You Guys Are Making Sky Outfit Set?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, on Purple Cloud Peak in the Heavenly Academy.","The whole mountaintop seemed to have been engulfed in an extremely grim presence.","It seemed like even the air froze. The whole summit and the sky above it were covered by all kinds of restriction arrays.","Even grandmasters with great cultivation strength couldn’t enter this place without making a noise.","In the mountain was an elegant cottage, and fresh herb fragrance floated in the air in the courtyard.","A white-haired old man looking to be about 50 years old sat inside the courtyard cross-legged. He slowly opened his eyes, but his face was still pale.","“Do you feel better?”","“Thank you...” The old man sitting cross-legged snapped back to reality. “Several years passed, and you have obtained tremendous growth in cultivation strength, Old Academy Master!”","While nodding, Gu Tingyun said, “Tell me what you saw in that place. Even you guys couldn’t handle it?”","“I...” The pale-faced old man was about to speak but stopped; he looked around warily as if he were afraid of being overheard.","“Don’t worry.” Gu Tingyu said, “I’ve protected this place with restriction arrays; no one can eavesdrop on us.”","Immediately, he whispered something into Gu Tingyun’s ear about the Sky Relic that contained many ancient secrets.","Gu Tingyun nodded slightly, and the trigram tokens in his hands dropped onto the desk before him. Right now, he looked even more grim.","“Academy Master, how is it...”","“I used my life energy to make a prophecy for the future of the cultivation world of the Spiritual State; I got Kan, the sixth trigram which means an ominous future...”","“Alas...” He sighed slightly. After making this prediction, he looked even older, as fragile as the last bit of flame on a candle in the wind.","...","Although the attributes and properties of rare outfits were only a bit higher than ordinary high-level outfits, the set bonus were quite eye-catching after the outfit set was completed.","Although they had only a few attributes that could be used in battles, a whole outfit set could form a special wind-style magic spell which could increase the movement speed of the wearers in the cities and non-battle zones by 70%.","At first glance, this magic attribute seemed not so useful. After all, everyone focused on battle-related equipment and things. If this spell could only be used inside cities instead of in battles, what use did it have?","However, the truth was that this magic spell could bring the users great convenience. In the huge cities such as West Coast and Hendon Myre, when the players took a short journey to finish some missions, go to trading halls, or head to the dojo, they wouldn’t ride on carriages for such short trips.","Besides, the carriages weren’t available all the time; and it wasn’t plausible to travel to the carriage station for each trip.","With this bonus magic spell attached to the outfits, the users could mover much faster, making it a great aid in daily life and travel.","On the other hand, such rare outfits obviously looked different from the ordinary ones.","Different from the imposing, heavy, and masculine armor for male players, the female outfits were tight-fitting and smooth-lined, looking grander and prettier than ordinary clothes.","They could even change colors automatically with different subclasses. The outfits for the mistress was black.","While walking on the streets in West Coast, this female priest’s outfit gave her a higher status. The passersby kept looking at her, and the bullet comments flooded the screen in the livestream room.","[Great!]","[So dashing!]","[I’m envious!]","[Rich person! Awesome!]","[Are you walking on wind? You can move so swiftly?!]","“...”","Reading the bullet comments in the livestream room, this woman felt good even though she had emptied her pockets for it.","It seems worthwhile... she thought.","Even though the effects were only a pile of data, for some reason, she thought it was worthwhile.","“Aren’t you going to make a set of this, huh, Sky Outfit Set?” Seeing that her companion was still dressed in the ordinary outfit, she thought it brought down their status.","She urged him to make some new outfits too.","...","As an ancient cultivator who was enjoying the last years of his life, Gu Tingyun didn’t have much to do and thus came to the shop quite early each day.","But lately, he came into the shop quite late. In the last couple of days, he hadn’t come at all.","These days were most crucial since most players were doing awakening missions.","However, today, Gu Tingyun came quite late, and he brought with him a pale-faced, sick-looking old man.","Some new faces came with this old man; the people in the shop never saw them before.","“Old Academy Master... why did you bring us to this place?!” The pale-faced old man looked around the shop in bafflement.","Soon, he saw several familiar figures.","“Ugh? Isn’t that Elder Yu?!”","“That person looks like... the Tang Family Master?!”","The people who came with him talked among themselves in puzzlement.","“Ugh?! What’s happening?! How come there are so many disciples of the Qingqiu Family over there?!”","“People of the Xuanyuan Family are here too?!”","“Isn’t that Xuanyuan Qianjun, the elder of the Xuanyuan Family?!”","“Vice Academy Master Xiao... Old Academy Master... This is...?!”","Vice Academy Master Xiao moved forward curiously.","He saw the Heavenly Academy’s Vice Academy Master Zhang, who was Yue Bai’s master and the most powerful warrior in the Heavenly Academy.","On his screen was a young man wearing a long white robe and sporting long hair; he was a Nen Master, a subclass of male fighters.","At this moment, he wasn’t in a dungeon. While holding a spiritual artifact that looked like a small box, he was tossing pieces of clothes into it.","Sometimes, his face darkened and twitched, and sometimes he laughed smugly.","“Brother Zhang, what are you doing here?!”","“I’m making the Sky Outfit!” Zhang Hao answered casually while putting another piece of clothing into the box.","Soon, the spiritual box disappeared, and it was replaced by an extremely luxurious and elegant long robe.","“Hahahaha!” Zhang Hao laughed and stood up from his seat. His voice was loud enough for everyone in the internet café to hear, “Success! I have the Sky Outfit Set too!”","Then, the Tang Family Master sitting next to him howled, “How come I still need one piece to complete the Sky Outfit Set? How come it’s so difficult?!”","Vice Academy Master Xiao’s pale face fell instantly. The cultivation world is going to die, and you guys are focused on making this so-called Sky Outfit Set?!","“Old Academy Master!” Vice Academy Master Xiao suppressed his fury and turned to Gu Tingyu.","Gu Tingyun stared at Zhang Hao’s screen with his old eyes. “Are these the new outfits in the shop?!”","“Nether Realm Sky Outfit Set?! The attribute and properties...?!”","“Hurry! Show me how to make them!”","The people behind him exchanged a look and then stared at the scene with blank minds. Why are we here?!","Didn’t the Old Academy Master take us here to find a solution?! What’s happening?!"]},{"number":541,"title":"Chapter 541 - Ghost 7: Furious Blache","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Abyss Mode referred to the situation when the players encountered teams of monsters in the dungeons that were from the Otherverse.","For ordinary players, the encounter would be a disaster.","It also meant a challenge.","Most of the Abyss Demons invading this space were relatively low-leveled. After consuming lots of energy to break through the space to land in the dungeons, they could be killed by a well-coordinated team of ordinary players who were strong.","But now, only a few players had finished the awakening mission; most of the players hadn’t passed the mechanical bull dungeon yet and thus wouldn’t initiate a battle with Abyss Demons.","At this moment, Gu Tingyun had gone online to make the Sky Outfit Set, leaving Vice Academy Master Xiao and the others of the Heavenly Academy to watch from behind in confusion.","Suddenly, Vice Academy Master Xiao saw a huge altar with a statue of a demon head appear on Elder Yu’s screen.","The demon head on the altar had crimson eyes and four horns. Even from the screen, he could sense the streak of strong evil aura emitting from it.","“What’s this?!” Vice Academy Master Xiao yelled in alarm.","“Demon Altar.” Elder Yu looked grim. “It seems like someone has encountered the Abyss Demons. I’m watching it on the livestream.”","“Livestream?!” The people standing behind him sounded puzzled.","“Yeah...” Elder Yu explained with a grim expression, “It’s like the Distance Image Transmission Spell. We can sit and watch whatever they do through this spiritual artifact.”","The name of the livestream room was [An Encounter with an Abyss Demon: Uncovering the Truth About Demons].","It was the livestream of a player of Yuanyang City who was about level 30; he and his teammates were being attacked by an Abyss Demon.","“An Abyss... Demon?!” As a vice academy master of Heavenly Academy, he had seen many things, but he had never heard of such things before.","“What’s this thing?!” They intently stared at the altar on Elder Yu’s screen.","Beside the altar, a horrid shadow engulfed in flames gradually solidified from its initial vague form.","Even from the screen, they had a clear view of it. It was a human-shaped demon that was as tall as three people; it had huge horns on its head, and its greyish-white skin looked as hard as steel.","It emitted blazing flames, and the players could smell the nose-piercing odor of sulfur even from the distance. The horrifying high temperature turned the moisture on the land into water vapor, making this demon look like a living volcano that was moving!","The players on the livestream felt a burning presence rushed toward them as soon as they got close. The horrid high temperature roasted their skin to a red tone, and their HPs were dropping continuously.","Although it was clear that this demon didn’t run, it got close to the players with a few casual steps.","It hadn’t attacked yet, but the players already felt suffocated by its horrifying suppressive aura.","“This... This...” Vice Academy Master Xiao and the elders who came with him looked dazed with disbelief in their eyes. “How can it be...?! Is it really a demon!?”","As if it were answering these questions, the demon waved its hand, and a dark red magic array suddenly lit up in the sky.","In the next moment, a stream of fire shot across the sky!","A small meteorite crashed onto the ground with vicious force.","The horrifying shock wave destroyed almost everything around it. One player couldn’t dodge it in time and was buried under the meteorite and turned into ashes by the burning flames around the meteorite.","Among frantic screams, a gunner took out the anti-tank cannon from his storage space anxiously and fired!","Swoosh!","A sharp, whistling noise tore through the air, but the demon moved its body, and the missile went past it!","“He dodged it?” That player looked at the scene dumbfoundedly.","The demon seemed to pay little attention to the players. It was absorbing the energy from the air to replenish the power that it had depleted while traveling through space.","Many wisps of fire gathered around the demon. Like a big fire ball, they floated around the demon and then shot toward the nearby players like a ghost.","Soon, the demon pushed out its palms, and a huge cloud of flames flew toward the gunner.","Meanwhile, it let out a long chant, and more strange red magic arrays gathered in the sky.","“Run! Quick! Run!”","Meteorites crashed down from the sky like rain!","Even though they were watching from the livestream from the screen, the viewers felt a sense of suffocation from this horrifying scene.","Many small meteorites crashed down, filling the ground with huge craters!","By now, all the players who came to explore this place had died.","“What... what’s this monster?!” Vice Academy Master Xiao yelled in shock.","Our cultivation world is on the brink of destruction already, and such a horrifying monster appeared as well? How can cultivators like us handle such a situation?!","Desperate thoughts filled the newcomers’ heads while they wondered how they could survive!","At this moment, someone yelled, “The shop owner is going to challenge the Abyss Demon!”","“The shop owner turned on the livestream! In Room XX001127!”","“What?! Someone dares to mess with this kind of monsters?!” The vice academy masters and elders of the Heavenly Academy who had just returned from the Sky Relic were shocked to hear that someone would challenge such powerful monsters!","Soon, they saw Elder Yu entering another livestream room. Sure enough, a man wearing a dark blue robe with a dazzling slim short sword sparkling with magic light came to an altar.","The location was similar to the place where the previous altar was at; it seemed to be the same altar. (The abyss in the Behemoth Map)","On the huge platform were all kinds of strange buildings and many corpses. Except for these, there was only the strange young man with the short sword.","[The shop owner didn’t buy the Sky Outfit Set?!]","[His weapon looks very special!]","The viewers talked among themselves.","“This is a level 40 pink short sword: Teaching of Gora – Swiftness. The shop owner has reinforced it to level 12.”","“The shop owner’s equipment is superb... Wasn’t he afraid that this godly short sword would be shattered during the reinforcement process?!”","– Meanwhile –","“Is this young man crazy?!” Vice Academy Master Xiao exclaimed in shock while staring at the screen intently.","“What spiritual spell did this young man use? How come I’ve never seen them before?!”","The skeleton minions around the broken altar were cleared up.","On the screen, Fang Qi had used Afterimage of Keiga and Phantasmal Step. Then, the gloomy shadow of a demon appeared behind him.","Then, a red, vicious, ghost-like demon shadow came near the altar – Kazan.","The cultivators who had just returned from the Sky Relic had never seen such things before! They held their breaths and stared at the screen without blinking.","Soon, they saw that the demon’s shadow turned distinct before the altar.","Fang Qi walked swiftly in the red array and came near the shadow.","He chanted lightly, and the demons came at his summon.","The green demon shadow – Hazy-Eyed Bremen.","The purple demon shadow – Plague Rhasa.","The icy-blue demon shadow— Ice Saya.","As if it came from Hell, a huge bone wing spread out from behind Fang Qi. In the darkness existed another vicious and distorted demon – the Sixth Demon Kalla of Dark Flame.","These demon shadows overlapped, almost turning this place into a death zone!","The horrifying presences that they emitted seemed no less powerful compared to that of the Abyss Demon.","By now, the shadow of the Abyss Demon had turned completely solid; it had completely entered this space from the void.","“What is this young man trying to do!?” The newcomers of the Heavenly Academy gaped at the scene.","On top of them, the other viewers who were watching the livestream were also puzzled.","In the next instant, Fang Qi stabbed his short sword into the overlapped ghost arrays with vicious force.","The sky suddenly darkened, and the solid stone ground seemed to transform into a black swamp.","In the pitch-black swamp, death ripples spread out as if something horrifying was taking shape inside.","Vice Academy Master Xiao rubbed his eyes. What was he looking at?! He saw a horrifying monster slowly rising from the swamp as if it were coming from a bottomless abyss!","Only half of its head appeared, but it was so big that it filled the whole screen!","“What skill is this?! How come I’ve never seen it before?!”","“It seems to be awakening! Soul bender’s awakening!”","The viewers who were watching the livestream all yelled in astonishment.","Awakening Skill: Summoning Ghost 7: Furious Blache!","Furious Blache contained one of the negative emotions of humans; it was an ancient abyss monster formed by greed.","It was heard that anyone who mastered the power of two demons could break the seal in the depths of the swamp and release Blache. As an animal-type demon, it had a body much bigger than the Behemoth. It usually slumbered in the death swamp created by the Death God, and its responsibility was catching ghosts and imprisoning them in the swamp.","The ghosts that it couldn’t catch were called demons.","Blache hated the demons that it couldn’t catch. Whenever it saw demons, it would want to swallow them. However, it never succeeded. The Great Zieg, one of the first soul benders, took use of this and summoned many demons to stand behind the enemies. Then, Blache would be summoned and would swallow all the enemies.","The viewers saw a huge mouth opening and swallowing everything on the ground!","“This person...”","“How can such a powerful person exist in this world?!”","“Where’s that demon?!”","Vice Academy Master Xiao and the other elders gaped as they stared at the screen with turmoil in their minds.","How can this person be so powerful?!","He can even summon such a horrifying monster to battle for him! How can anyone in the world be his match?!","A few minutes later, someone finally explained to them what games were.","“Hurry! Let’s go and buy membership cards!”","“We’ll adventure on the Arad Continent too!”"]},{"number":542,"title":"Chapter 542 - World Companionship, No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since most equipment could be traded, the players could buy most of the equipment that they wanted in Dungeon Fighter Online with crystals.","Ordinary players could use two to three characters to search for materials in the dungeons or accept missions in the city. Through these methods, they could earn money and buy all the equipment needed for one account.","Many items dropped in the dungeons with low difficulty level were quite common, but it didn’t mean that they were not needed.","It was why the avid ordinary players of this game didn’t lag behind too much.","...","As for the advanced players who had surpassed level 50, learned the awakening skills, and were equipped with level 50 equipment all over, they were not left with nothing to do.","For example, Nalan Hongwu had finished the awakening mission, but he was still trying to finish a mission named Terra Rock Weapon.","Then, He casually turned on the livestream.","The elders and the vice academy masters of Heavenly Academy, who had just entered the game and learned only a few skills, could only alleviate their eagerness by watching others’ livestreams.","Terra Rocks were the special magical minerals on Terra Star. Since this rock contained magical power, weapons made with Terra Rock were craved by each adventurer.","On Nalan Hongwu’s screen, the difficulty level shown on the upper-right corner was Master.","Right now, he was alone, and there were no teammates with him!","His subclass showed on the screen was no longer Blade Master but Grand Master.","Grandmasters were swordsmen who had mastered the ultimate level of slayer sword techniques. They had awakened after breaking through the threshold of the slayer sword techniques. Now, they had mastered powerful Tempest and Iron Strike.","Nalan Hongwu’s strength as a grand master was obviously much greater than the previous blade master. While waving his lightsabre, he could cut open anything as if they were pieces of tofu with this radiant sword beam!","“He can fight in the mechanical bull dungeon alone!? This guy is super powerful!” This elder had just entered the game and didn’t know much. He didn’t even know the name of this class, and he just yelled in surprise with widened eyes.","“Hurry! Come and watch this guy!” Vice Academy Master Xiao’s eyes opened wide.","Hearing his exclamation, others looked over immediately.","On the other side, Song Qingfeng was doing a livestream as well. He was a fighter who was wearing a pair of black practice pants.","“Is he a warrior?!”","“This guy is going to fight an Abyss Demon?!”","With a mystical Demon-Breaking Rock in his hand, Song Qingfeng was walking in the Forbidden Shrine in the Behemoth, a dungeon for players above level 30.","A huge demon altar appeared before him. Different from the altar in Fang Qi’s livestream, this demon statue was bald and had no horns.","Then, a huge demon slowly appeared from the void and it said in a gloomy voice, “Little Guy, did you summon me?”","The overwhelming demonic presence from the abyss spread out, strong enough to suffocate people.","With an explosive shout, leg shadows enveloped in flames appeared on the screen.","Without sparing a glance at the demon, he immediately returned to the city. “Damn it! Another bald one!” (The bald one is the weakest Abyss Demon, and it almost never drops equipment or items.)","Vice Academy Master Xiao and the others looked at the demon that couldn’t be more dead now; it had been so arrogant a moment ago. “...”","“My goodness!”","“How come these people are so strong?!”","“Look! This guy went to challenge demons again after the first time!”","“He battles the demons every day to improve his combat techniques and Martial Dao!”","“No wonder he’s so strong!”","“Other people are doing the same!” Another elder clicked open a livestream room named [Royal Princess of Dajin].","“Look! This woman is also battling a demon!”","Another elder was watching in the livestream room named [Second Prince of Dajin].","“This guy said that he has battled Abyss Demons 20 times today!”","“Guys, look at this livestream room!” On Vice Academy Master Xiao’s screen was a livestream room named [Abstract Analysis of How to Get Pink Equipment and Items from the Abyss Demons]. Right now, they were talking about the topics such as increasing the drop rate by hitting the head with the last blow and how to enter the abyss to have a higher possibility of encountering a multi-horned demon.","“They are even sharing their experience in battling these demons with others!”","“They are even challenging stronger multi-horned demons!”","“I admire their ambitions!”","They were thrilled. “One day, we’ll also be as powerful as them! When that day comes...”","“Yeah! Vice Academy Master Xiao, we will work harder!” Another elder said passionately, “Our cultivation world still has hope!”","“Let’s team up! We can go to Grand Flores and level up today!” These low-leveled mages and slayers with trash equipment finally came to Hendon Myre.","...","Meanwhile, the dojo had started the Division Ranking System. In the past, the players usually had practice matches with friends as a way of relaxation.","In this sense, the dojo had been a place for players to spend their leisure time after they battled with monsters in the dungeons.","But now, the situation had changed.","At this moment, two figures hiding in a corner were still trying to fight the mechanical bull; they intended to make weapons with Terra Rock first.","Suddenly, they received mail.","“Ugh? What’s this?!” The avenger immediately entered the game interface and opened an exquisite envelope.","These words were written on the letter, [The gate of glory is about to open; come to the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference to obtain your own glory!]","“Martial Dao Conference?!” Martial meant warriors, and Dao would represent cultivators who devoted their lives searching for Heavenly Dao. But what did this No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference mean?!","The avenger smirked and said, “I’ve lived for countless years; why would I compete with you little guys for small benefits and fame?”","The moment he said it, he suddenly saw the rewards listed on the letter.","“Dazzling advancement contract?!”","“Can perfectly advance to the subclass?!”","Although they could learn many skills and spiritual spells in the game and use them in the real world, some very special things in all the subclasses couldn’t be learned, including the demons of soul benders, and the creatures that the summoners could summon.","As for avengers, the demonic power of this subclass couldn’t be obtained by learning.","Everyone knew how powerful the skills after the first awakening were, and these skills including Ghost 7: Furious Blache which Fang Qi had summoned in the previous livestream.","If they could perfectly advance into the subclasses in the real world, did it mean that they could gain this power too?!","After exchanging a look, they immediately clicked on the link in the letter. “We’ll participate!”","They quickly entered the registration information.","Meanwhile, the E-Sports competition had officially begun."]},{"number":543,"title":"Chapter 543 - A Bigger Arena","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In this E-Sports Competition, there were two games, StarCraft and Dungeon Fighter Online. These two mysterious figures clicked on the link in the game interface and saw two options for registration. One was the F1 World Companionship, and the other was the StarCraft World Championship Series.","Although the people in this world didn’t quite understand these names for the competition, they didn’t think too much about them since this whole event was called the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference.","Besides them, all the players of the Jiuhua City Shop and Half City Shop had received the letter through their QQ or the system in the games.","After the registration, they would enter the Ladder Ranking Competition in StarCraft or the Division Ranking System in the dojo of Dungeon Fighter Online for the initial selection stage.","After all, the previous Diablo 2 and the King of Fighters Competitions happened when the players in the two shops numbered in the several thousands, almost reaching 10,000.","Even the number of players who had bought membership cards in Jiuhua Shop had surpassed the combined number of players of the Jiuhua City Shop and the Half City Shop participating in the previous competitions!","At that time, the shops had only players from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and a few forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm. Now, the players came from Yundian Upper Realm, all the major factions, and even the prosperous Spiritual State.","The players even included the people of the Ultimate West Realm who had come from the distant snow mountains in the far west and excelled in martial arts.","The players also included the members of the most ancient families such as Xuanyuan and Qingqiu.","All of them might enter this competition.","For the original players in the Jiuhua City Shop and Half City Shop, this was a gala that they had never witnessed before.","Watching the players talking animatedly about the event of the shop, Fang Qi realized that the previous competitions were child’s play compared with this event which was grander and much bigger.","...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","Nalan Mingxue sat on a couch with a bottle of Coke in her hand.","While wearing a snow-white robe, her ice-statue-like face looked even more charming.","She had received the message through QQ on her communication jade. As someone who had won more than one championship, she didn’t feel any pride in the first places that she had gotten in the past.","She had a vague feeling that the past competitions were nothing compared to the current F1 World Companionship and StarCraft World Championship Series.","In the past, she had been so familiar with the participants that she had a clear idea who would encounter who in the matches and even who would enter the finals.","She could even guess some of the results.","But now, the situation had changed.","She didn’t even know what kind of opponents she would meet and where they might be from.","Each shop had players from different forces. It was quite possible that she might meet a genius who she had never seen before.","In fact, even Fang Qi didn’t know about the top-tier masters in the shops. For example, the spitfire player with the ID ‘Master Zhou’ whom Fang Qi had encountered in the game was someone he had never heard of before. However, this man had worked well in the team. He had ordinary equipment but had a very high level; it meant that he was a master.","Nalan Mingxue had never had this feeling before. She felt that she was facing a truly unknown world and a real challenge.","Different from other players, the earliest players in Jiuhua City had heard the legendary stories about E-Sports competitions from Mr. Fang.","When Nalan Mingxue won the first championship, she had wished that someday she would stand the tallest not among a small group of people but among the players from all over the world as told in the stories.","...","Meanwhile, the people of the Ultimate West Realm had also gathered in the shop.","The cultivators of the Spiritual State glared at them with dark expressions since these people were aggressive in grabbing seats and were quite arrogant.","The worst one was Gabriel. After lying in bed for a long time, he had recovered from his injuries, but his personality hadn’t improved as he didn’t learn a lesson.","“Look at what this guy is doing now!” Elder Yu’s face was twisted with anger while he looked at the game interface.","In the Legend of Mir 2, people had to go to the world channel for the Legend of Mir 2 on QQ if they wanted their words to be seen by all other players.","However, Dungeon Fighter Online was different. It had an extra interface in the game for this function and no longer required QQ.","The players could choose to attach a gadget named Magic Communicator on their arms or on their storage bags.","This gadget could record some information in the game, including the information about items and equipment acquired, adding friends, teams, and game announcements.","If someone spoke on it, the messages could be seen by all the players in the game. However, not everyone could speak using this method. To talk on it, players must buy an item named Magic Horn, and the players could only talk once with each horn.","That was why few people would talk on it unless they were announcing something very important. Usually, the players would turn on the alert function of this gadget so that they could receive important information and updates.","However, on this interface, a player with the ID ‘Demonic God Gabriel’ said, [Who was that? Who was so arrogant?! Come on! Talk to me! Why aren’t you talking? You dared to kick me out of the team but can’t afford to pay crystals to speak here?!]","He had posted several similar messages.","Finally, a player with the ID ‘True Dragon Hermit’ couldn’t bear it anymore. [Don’t ever team up with this guy. When an Abyss Demon appeared in the dungeon, he ignored orders and did whatever he wanted, dragging his teammates to death with him!]","Demonic God Gabriel said, [You guys are so weak; you should feel honored that I was willing to carry you. How dare you accuse me of messing around?!]","“...”","Then, messages on the Magic Communicator almost flooded the screen.","They argued about topics from dungeon fight to crystals until...","[Didn’t you say that you’re not short in crystals? Come on! Using the horns! 320!]","[I’m not afraid of you! 320!]","[321!]","[321!]","Demonic God Gabriel posted, [322! Granddaddy has many magic horns!]","True Dragon Hermit replied, [Do you think you have endless crystals?! 322! Continue!]","Not only cultivators of the Spiritual State but the cultivators and warriors in other shops as well had dark expressions on their faces.","Are they two damn morons!","-One hour later-","[3264! Any more horns?]","They had spent thousands of crystals on horns?!","How come they are still doing it?","The cultivators and warriors playing Dungeon Fighter Online were no longer angry. Instead, they began to entertain themselves by watching this drama.","“The magic horn costs one crystal each, right?”","“Yeah... So expensive!”","“With so many crystals, they could have made a Sky Outfit Set!”","At this moment, even Luo Piaoling’s face had turned dark, furious that Gabriel was so stupid as to enter a competition of buying magic horns!","He glanced at the brown-haired young man sitting near him and found that the latter had no intention to stop this moronic competition.","The guy is crazy.","While cussing silently, Luo Piaoling shook his head, clicked open the link to F1 World Companionship, and registered."]},{"number":544,"title":"Chapter 544 - The Huge Crack in the Heavenly Abyss Sea","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Fang Qi was looking at the System Interface. In the short time after Dungeon Fighter Online was released, the revenue that the shops earned had surpassed all the total income of the shop before its release.","Of course, this sum included the sales of other games, but the income from Dungeon Fighter Online accounted for the bulk of it.","By now, Mr. Fang’s fortune had increased from a few million to a bit over 10 million crystals, quite rich even compared with the big families in the Spiritual State which were fraught with grandmasters.","On one hand, Mr. Fang had been recruiting more employees, making plans, and managing the shops to make everything work smoothly and more professionally. On the other hand, he got ready to implement some ideas which had seemed far-fetched with limited funds; now that he had a big fortune left after everyday spending on spiritual elixirs and games, he could put these ideas into reality.","Soon, a group chat named ‘Official E-Sports Broadcast Platform’ was established on QQ.","“Sir, what are you up to? What’s this E-Sports Broadcast?” Since Xue Daolv, the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master, hadn’t gotten online yet, Su Tianji, the youngest and most able elder of Liuyun Daoist Palace, was pulled into the group. Nonplussed, she asked, [Can anyone who came explain it to me (Husky’s puzzled face)?]","Vice Academy Master Zhang Hao of the Heavenly Academy replied, [I’m new here too...]","Tianxu Daoist from the Yimu Daoist Palace of the Morning Star Sea Realm chimed in, [I still don’t understand it...]","The Xichi Spiritual Master from the Nanhua Faction said, [It seems to be a method to broadcast the matches in the competition with spiritual spells such as Distance Visual Transmission Spell. This way, the people who can’t watch the matches in the shops can watch them in other places...]","Andrew, an elder of the Ultimate West Realm, said, [I think it’s a way to transmit our dashing images back home. This way, the members of our families can appreciate our performances in battles! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","“...”","After Mr. Fang’s prior explanation, the cultivators and warriors began to discuss it in the group chat animatedly.","Su Tianji said, [In short, this broadcast will show the matches in different locations so that the disciples who can’t come to the shop will be able to watch them too?]","[In my opinion, the audience is not limited to the disciples of our faction,] Huangpu Tao, the castellan of Black Dragon City, typed while laughing, [I think I can use this spiritual spell in the air above Black Dragon Square in my city! Any cultivator and warrior can watch the competition!]","“Oh!” Su Tianji exclaimed and said, [It means that the whole world will see my excellent performance if I enter the competition?!]","“!!??” Understanding finally dawned on them that the champions of this competition would be truly standing on the top of the world!","...","“What...!? The competition will be broadcasted to the world?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, an independent cultivator with a disheveled appearance was working hard to upgrade his division level. Hearing this news, he almost jumped up in excitement.","He had reached tier 7. After a few more tiers, he would reach the Supreme Division, the lowest division required to stand out of the initial selection.","He was an ordinary player, but his equipment was not bad even though he didn’t spend much money on anything besides the monthly Black Diamond Membership. He had obtained his equipment with hard work by taking people to pass dungeons with his big accounts and acquiring materials with his small accounts.","“The No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference will be broadcasted to the whole world?!” In the Half City Shop, a warrior sat in a corner, and the character on his screen was engulfed by an intense bloody aura – Hell Bringer!","He waved his huge, blood-covered long blade which was long enough to be considered two sabers. The long saber that condensed horrifying blood aura crashed down with earth-shattering force, and a thick beam of fire shot up into the sky! The enemy before him was instantly burned to ashes!","At this moment, he was already in the Supreme Division in the game.","He was an unknown warrior in the Morning Star Sea Realm. There were many warriors like him in the Morning Star Sea Realm where warriors were regarded lower than cultivators ever since the ancient times. Many of them had talent, but their talent had been restricted by their dire environment.","With clenched fists, he stared at the message on the screen intently.","In the past, he had tried to increase his strength and temper his body mechanically like everyone else, not knowing what the future might hold and spending his life in ignorance. He counted himself lucky that he could play games in the shop.","This was the most truthful reflection of their lives.","However, each person had a seed buried deep inside. For some of them, the seeds had died under the heavy pressure of fate. For others, the seeds would crawl out wherever a tiny crack appeared and would sprout out seedlings.","At this moment, a voice shouted in his heart, “Go out! Show yourself to the world!”","Besides the people in the Jiuhua City Shop and the Half City Shop, the players in the Yuanyang City Shop were also thrilled.","Among the large number of players, many of the earliest players had awakened and surpassed level 50. Some players had developed into gaming masters, and they were not limited to the people who Mr. Fang was familiar with.","Silently, they had practiced their skills and strengthened themselves in the dojo without attracting any attention. Only veteran players who spent long hours in the dojo had encountered them.","No one knew their real names, but their plain IDs carried all the hard work that they had done.","– Meanwhile, on the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea –","Two pairs of deep eyes stared at the turbulent waves in the ocean.","“The turbid world is like a boat, sending us to the other shore while all creatures vanish...” The messy ocean winds blew up the edge of that figure’s black robe, revealing a stretch of ashen-colored skin which looked quite inhuman.","“The space of that place in the Heavenly Abyss Sea is getting more and more unstable...” The voice from the sky said with self-mockery. “After scheming for so many years, we might not be able to reach the Other Shore. I can feel that they...”","In the depth of the Heavenly Abyss Sea, the mountain-like mist scattered and revealed a vague shape of a pitch-black crack.","Inside the crack was a vast and dark void. In the void floated an extremely grand and magnificent building that was as beautiful as an ancient celestial palace.","In the palace, a pair of extremely cold and greedy eyes seemed to be staring at the blue sky and white clouds outside the crack."]},{"number":545,"title":"Chapter 545 - I’ll Give You the Gift of Destruction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","This ancient palace was very magnificent, and it was so huge that one couldn’t see the end of it in one glance.","It looked like a group of huge, rolling mountains, a small world, or even a huge fortress.","It silently hovered in the void and was too huge to pass through the big crack in the space.","The huge tower-shaped palace had three levels. The top level was a round array hovering above the rest of it. A foyer stood before it, acting as an invisible wall.","The middle level was surrounded by many wondrous, engraved patterns and statues. It looked like a miraculous godly palace that mortals worshiped in legends.","Behind the flowing pale-golden lights, the center of the palace suddenly opened.","In the next moment, golden clouds swarmed up while many square-shaped golden flying objects hovered in the air above the ocean outside the crack. The dazzling golden lights almost dyed the whole ocean golden.","“Well... This is really a boring world.” A young man wearing silver armor stood on the strangely-shaped flight spiritual artifact. With an arrogant expression, he studied the vast sky that was reflected on the surface of the water.","His facial features looked old and strange. With two golden patterns between his brows, he looked mysterious and unworldly.","Standing beside him was a man wearing a grand white robe and a square hat. Different from his companion, this man had only one golden pattern on his forehead.","With a hook of his finger, a translucent cup with radiant colors rose and slowly flew to his hand as if it were lifted by a strange force.","He lightly sniffed and seemed to detect the scent of the spiritual essence in the whole world. After savoring the scent, he snickered and said, “Only a bunch of ignorant monkeys are living here; they are even worse than Low Level.”","“If the mission that our clan gave us is handling a group of monkeys who aren’t even on the Low Level...” He lightly swirled the crystal-like liquid in the cup and said with a chilly smile, “I’m afraid this journey will be quite boring.”","The man in the white robe asked respectfully, “Then, we...”","The other man waved his hand casually and said with a snicker, “Go and send them the message. Before the Heaven-Hiding Palace passes the crack, we will have a good show before us.”","...","In the cottage on Purple Cloud Mountain of the Heavenly Academy, Old Academy Master Gu Tingyun was talking with the vice academy masters, elders of the academy, and the ancient family masters about the E-Sports Competition broadcast.","“Tang Family Master, what do you think?”","“I think... we can give this broadcast full support.”","“Yeah...” Wang Family Master said, “In fact, our families can hold similar competitions in the future...”","“The broadcast has my full support. It’s a good opportunity to show those little disciples in our families the abilities of masters from all over the world. This way, they won’t be overconfident.”","While they were talking animatedly, thunder and lightning bolts suddenly appeared in the clear sky!","“What’s happening?!”","Gu Tingyun’s face turned grim. “The arrays around the Heavenly Academy showed no response. Who are they!? They can easily dodge these protective and restriction arrays!”","Suddenly, as if a big hole was put into the sky, a huge palace appeared in the sky.","The huge shadow of the palace hovered in the high sky, and it was surrounded by many pitch-black lightning bolts. It looked like a legendary godly palace that would remain standing in eternity and only existed in legends.","The peace of the Heavenly Academy was instantly broken. In its place was a suffocating suppression.","“Here they are...” Vice Academy Master Xiao pointed at the sky in horror and said, “They are here! I saw them in the Sky Relic; they were enemies of the ancient immortals!”","“Hurry! Vice Academy Master Zhang, Elder Yu, evacuate the disciples now!” Facing the danger, Gu Tingyu remained calm and ordered with a deep voice.","At this moment, many people stood under the gloomy and chilly sky and almost fell to their knees under this suppression that was greater than heavenly power.","The spiritual beasts that the Heavenly Academy raised hid in their dens and shivered.","The disciples of the Heavenly Academy and the geniuses of this world all looked up at the sky.","They felt as hopeless as the ancient immortals when they faced the end of the world.","No one knew if the palace hovering in the high sky was real or just a shadow. Suddenly, a voice came out of it, “I’m the Vanguard Battle General under the Taihui God Lord. Today, we’ll give you the gift of destruction!”","All the people stared at the sky above the Heavenly Academy in shock.","The voice sounded ridiculously arrogant, but no one dared to laugh. Standing under the sky, everyone felt as tiny as a lowly ant.","“The godly army of our clan will come soon. However, my seniors intend to give you some time to do some futile resistance.”","“Three months later, you will be erased from this place. Since we don’t accept surrender, you can fight to the death and please the lords with your pathetic strength!”","...","According to the legends, in the prehistoric times, the Spiritual State had a civilization which was so prosperous and advanced that it was unimaginable to the current world. The cultivators at that time could even move mountains and fill oceans with ease.","The best of them could even pass true tribulations and ascend to the legendary Upper Realm, becoming immortals and living for eternity.","However, no one knew why the legendary civilization suddenly vanished with its many powerful spiritual spells and techniques. Also, the legendary path leading to Heaven had been sealed as a result. From that moment on, no one on the Spiritual State could ascend.","If not for the evidence of that civilization discovered by the ancient families with great inheritances, this history would have been lost in the long river of time and completely forgotten by this world and the people who lived in it.","However, some people could never erase that memory from their minds.","The tall figure engulfed in his black robe slowly took out an ancient jade which had turned a bit yellow due to the passage of time. He reached out his right hand that was withered and slightly distorted, looking like the claws of a bird. A trace of gloomy dark-red light was emitted from the inside of the black cloak.","“How many... thousand years have passed?” he asked as if his brain had become rusty with time.","On the body of his sword was engraved two extremely complicated and ancient characters – Luo Tian.","If people of the ancient families at the Spiritual State could see the characters, they would recognize that these characters were similar to those in the Luo Tian Celestial Relic, the relic that was the most destroyed.","“It’s not time to be reminiscent,” the cold shadow in the sky said with chilliness.","“The ancient invaders came again...” His voice turned gloomier, oozing an unusual coldness that never appeared before.","The other voice was filled with complicated emotions. “The appearance of that shop disturbed our plan of crossing the Bitter Ocean and reaching the Other Shore. I’m afraid that we can’t get away now...”"]},{"number":546,"title":"Chapter 546 - Mr. Fang’s Competition Will Be Cancelled?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the huge palace, the man who wore the set of fancy silver armor and had two strange golden patterns between his brows inhaled the fragrance of the nectar in his cup with an intoxicated expression. “Since this trip is so boring, why don’t we create some entertainment? It will be fun to watch these backward, ignorant barbarians struggle in despair, right?”","“Should we inform the other lords?” The white-robed man with the humble expression asked.","The silver-armored man swirled the wine cup in his hand with enjoyment and didn’t reply.","The man with the humble expression seemed to understand something, and he bowed and backed out with his head lowered.","...","Meanwhile, in the cottage where the influential people had been talking about the broadcast of the E-Sports Competition.","Vice Academy Master Xiao looked at Gu Tingyu with a pale face as he asked, “What... should we do now?!”","“Don’t panic!” The middle-aged woman of the Qingqiu Family said in a cold voice, “We can always find a way to deal with problems!”","“You guys haven’t been to the Sky Relic and don’t know their power!” Vice Academy Master Xiao said in conviction, “We are mortals; how can we face them?!”","Although he had learned a small ice spell in the shop, but...","The four grandmasters and the other masters in the game are indeed powerful, but they can’t come out of the game!","The stuff in StarCraft is also powerful. It would be great if I can have a carrier! I wouldn’t be feeling this way!","But who has such things in the real world?!","Vice Academy Master Xiao was desperate and frustrated. After all, the stuff in the shop only existed in the games and the virtual reality worlds, but their enemies had arrived at their door!","However, Gu Tingyun felt differently compared to Vice Academy Master Xiao after the incident with the Nangong Family. Although their current enemies were much more powerful than Nangong Family, he still had a sliver of hope.","Besides, the enemies told them that the battle wouldn’t come until three months later.","“Don’t panic.” Having experienced many crises, Gu Tingyu said, “We must keep it a secret and don’t cause panic among the cultivators. We... still have time to prepare for it.”","...","In reality, it was impossible to keep this a secret from the ordinary cultivators. It was a heavy blow to many civilian warriors and independent cultivators who had registered for the first worldwide E-Sports competition.","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","“Old Liang.” A warrior wearing a black warrior suit asked Liang Shi in a low voice, “Did you hear that the Spiritual State is facing an unprecedented disaster which might even spread to our Deserted Sea Realm? In the short term...”","He asked cautiously, “Will the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference be affected by this crisis?”","“Do you think that this Martial Dao Conference will be cancelled due to the issue in the Spiritual State?”","For the civilian warriors, regardless of how hard they worked in the real world, they were no match for the geniuses from the big families due to their lack of resources, poor backgrounds, and weak talents.","But now, in Dungeon Fighter Online and StarCraft, everyone was on the same starting line, and no one had outside aid.","As long as they worked hard, they wouldn’t lag behind so much that they couldn’t see the top players.","In the games, they seemed to have relived their lives on the battlefields in StarCraft and on the Arad Continent.","A young man who was in his thirties and was wearing a simple gray warrior robe nodded at them while walking past them.","Then, he entered the dojo again. On the screen, there was a male fighter with good equipment, and his ranking the Dojo Division System was an eye-catching [Supreme – 9]","“Old Fu went to the dojo again?” Liang Shi asked in a low voice.","“Yeah. Recently, he has been spending about eights hours a day in the dojo. I guess he fights at least 100 matches a day...” The warrior wearing the black warrior suit said, “You know Old Fu’s strength. During the individual competition of Diablo...”","Fu Jianghe was the Paladin player who had battled his way up in the individual competition of Diablo but backed out of the competition in the last round.","The warrior wearing the black warrior suit said, “I’m afraid that he doesn’t know about the crisis in the Spiritual State yet... If the competition is cancelled due to the crisis, his efforts will be all wasted...”","“I heard that the cultivators in the Spiritual State are preparing for war and have no time for the competition...” another cultivator said.","For most of the civilian warriors and independent cultivators, the tangible rewards of the competition were not important. They valued this rare opportunity where they could get on the same stage and have fair battles with the lofty geniuses of the big families who they could only look up to in normal situations.","[Well, I just want to go to the arena and take a look...]","[After all, I’ve never gone out of this city <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">] In the Half City shop, a bright-looking young man who looked to be less than 20 years old replied. His character in the game was a lazy-looking gunner with a twig dangling between his lips.","After replying with a message on QQ, he immediately plunged into the matches in the dojo.","Gunners were survivors in a chaotic and lawless area in Empyrean. In that place, they could encounter enemies any moment and must draw out their guns as fast as they could to kill the enemies.","To survive when they didn’t have guns, they had strengthened their hand-to-hand combat skills and thus created a combat style which combined the use of weapons and combat skills. These special gunners were called rangers.","In the game, this young man used both combat skills and his various weapons with proficiency, and he killed a blade master who was about to use an awakening skill with a kick.","After opening his game interface, he saw that he had more than 3,000 matches on the record.","When he walked out of the dojo, he saw the icon of QQ lighting up on his interface.","“What’s going on?” He opened QQ, and anger, loss, and other complicated emotions appeared on his face. “The shop in the Spiritual State is almost empty... the F1 World Championship might be cancelled as a result?”","...","Many players in the shops had been busy preparing for the competition, and no one had expected that things would take such a turn.","In the Yuanyang City Shop, there weren’t as many players as before; it even looked a little empty while the players dwindled.","Between obtaining strength and preserving their lives, most people chose the latter, even though the second option wasn’t so reliable either.","Maybe I can leave here and find a place that the others won’t find. After a while, this might pass.","Many small cultivators harbored such thoughts.","Facing such a huge crisis, everyone in the cultivation world at the Spiritual State became anxious. It seemed like Mr. Fang’s No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference might end before it even began."]},{"number":547,"title":"Chapter 547 - My Loss, Your Gain","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the huge godly palace, the silver-armored man was still sipping wine lazily. He looked like an elegant aristocrat who was calm and relaxed.","He was listening to the reports from his subordinates. “What are the natives doing now? Are they... running around aimlessly like panicking ants?”","The white-robed man bowed to him and said respectfully, “My Lord, as you predicted, these people are all fearful, and some of them are getting ready to run to remote places. Their so-called big cities are in shambles. The big families and forces are thinking hard to find ways to survive and continue their futile struggles.”","A series of wild laughter erupted in the room.","...","“Boss...”","“Boss!” Loli Jiang Xiaoyue had just come back from school and was about to pull Mr. Fang to play Dungeon Fighter Online with her. However, she was surprised to see he was sound asleep with his head on the desk.","“Boo—ss–!” She was furious. Everyone is talking about the imminent catastrophe that is about to overtake Spiritual State, and there are fewer and fewer customers in the shop. However, the damn shop owner is so care-free that he fell asleep?!","“Ah...?” Mr. Fang opened his eyes groggily. On his screen were rows of videos of livestreams, but him falling asleep made him look like a lazy good-for-nothing.","“Ah! What are you yelling about...?” Mr. Fang glanced at the screen and immediately sat up. “I almost forgot my main work.”","“Boss... Why are you collecting these livestreams recently?” Tilting her head, Jiang Xiaoyue was confused as she stared at the strange things on the screen that Fang Qi was working on.","“You don’t understand,” Mr. Fang said, “This is called promotional cinematic trailers! It’s a must-have for all E-Sports competitions!”","“But...” Seeing Jiang Xiaoyue and the people behind her such as Li Lanruo and Yue Bai looking toward his screen, he immediately turned it off and said, “You’re not supposed to see it now.”","“So mysterious!” With a snort, Jiang Xiaoyue said in disapproval, “Look around you! There are only a few players in the shop!","“If this continues, you’ll have to close the shop!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted again and sat down beside him in a huff. Then, she entered the game, ignoring Mr. Fang.","“We have fewer customers?” Mr. Fang looked around. Sure enough, people usually had to wait in line to get a computer, but the shop wasn’t full at the moment even though it was the peak time of the day.","Many people’s profile pictures flashed on his QQ.","Su Tianji asked, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f620.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F620;\"> Sir! Is the F1 World Championships still going to happen or not?!]","Liang Shi asked, [Sir, I heard that the people of the Spiritual State are under great pressure; is it true? Does it mean that the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference will be canceled?]","[The cultivation world of the Spiritual State is on the verge of destruction; why would they go to the internet café at this hour...?] Some people sent some disheartening and negative comments in the group.","Lately, Gu Tingyun and the other high-level people in the cultivation world of the Spiritual State were busy making plans and hadn’t shown up for a few days. Since their voices were missing, and they didn’t make any clear statements, more uncertainty appeared in the cultivation world.","If not for the efforts of the elders of the ancient families who tried to suppress the rumors, the whole cultivation world would have fallen into chaos.","The disciples of the big families didn’t venture out of their homes, some timid independent cultivators had begun packing up, ready to flee.","“Canceled?!” Nonplussed, Mr. Fang replied, [The No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference will be held as planned!]","“What?!”","“You’ll hold the competition in such a situation?”","“Is the shop owner crazy...?” Xu Zhu was an authentic independent cultivator in the Spiritual State. Almost all independent cultivators didn’t have a fixed living place and would go wherever it was beneficial for them and avoided trouble, which was the law of survival that was engraved in their bones.","Any independent cultivator who had survived on this land was an experienced person, and when and how to find a safer place was a part of their survival skills that people like him memorized in their heads.","At this moment, he was packing in Fulai Inn in Yuanyang City, planning to leave the city today.","Regardless of how the war might end, he would only become a victim if he stayed.","As for games and that small shop, if it could survive the war, he could come back and visit it after the war.","After packing, he glanced around at his empty room and then looked at the communication jade in his hand.","This new communication jade had cost him a small fortune and he had downloaded the shop’s mobile QQ APP on it.","[Ding! You have a new message.] A strange message suddenly popped up on QQ.","He clicked it open subconsciously.","“Welcome F1 World Championship! Rewards for returning heroes?”","“Receive gifts by logging in?”","His eyes almost popped out of his eye sockets when he saw the gifts. “Life tokens? Black Diamond Membership?!”","“One free defensive equipment mini pot for the corresponding level each day?!” [TL Note: same thing as loot boxes.]","“+10 equipment reinforcement coupons?! For no more than 5 crystals?!”","“My goodness!” He put his hands on his face and yelled, “Crazy! The shop owner will lose so much money!”","“+10 reinforcement coupons! One such coupon can trade for a top-level spiritual artifact! We can buy it for only 5 crystals in the game now?!”","“No! I’ve got to go online and see...” Xu Zhu thought, but then he hesitated. “Isn’t it too dangerous for me to stay still here...”","“I...” He felt like his brain had turned blank. When he thought that he could buy +10 reinforcement coupons, he decided to take the risk. “I can leave right after getting the reinforcement coupon!”","With gritted teeth, he hurried to the shop and logged into the game.","Sure enough, he saw a new option on the game interface for claiming gifts.","He immediately claimed the gifts.","[You obtain Black Diamond Membership for one day.]","“Hahahaha! I can indeed get a free Black Diamond Membership!” Xu Zhu laughed and glanced around as if he were afraid that someone would take it from him.","He was about to get offline and leave when he saw something. On the inference, it stated that the players could get more gifts the longer they stayed in the game.","“I can have 3 free defensive equipment mini pots after ten minutes?!” He hesitated. “Then, I’ll play for ten more minutes...”","“Oh... I’ll see how to buy the +10 reinforcement coupons...”","“Mysterious gift bag...? Do I need to buy this...?” With a frown, he read the description of this mysterious gift bag. It seemed like there were 14 potential rewards in the bag, and the players could buy one each day with different items in them. Even with the worst luck, he could certainly buy a +10 reinforcement coupon in 14 days.","“14 days... It will only cost dozens of crystals!” He didn’t believe that the shop would be so generous that players could buy a +10 reinforcement coupon with a few crystals. After reading this message, he found that it was more believable!","Dozens of crystals were a price that he could accept.","Should I... play for a few more days ...?! He decided that he would leave after he got the reinforcement coupon!","...","– Meanwhile, in the godly palace –","“Lord Vanguard General, you seem to be in a good mood!” A lazy voice came from outside the palace.","An exotic beauty walked in. She wore a set of black body-fitting leather armor and had long, curly golden hair. She also had two golden patterns between her brows.","She walked like a lazy cat, elegant and silent. If she hadn’t spoken, no one would have noticed that she had walked in.","“Hahahaha!” A series of laughter came from the room. “I find it interesting to watch the ants struggle before death; I wonder if they know that all their efforts are futile.”","“Isn’t it more interesting to watch them struggle in vain and try to hold on?” the woman smirked and said.","“Then...” The man waved his hand, and the image of a huge city appeared before them. “Let’s watch how these ants struggle!”","The scene before them changed into a prosperous ancient city.","It was Yuanyang City.","They saw large groups of cultivators and warriors.","“Let’s go! Hurry to the shop! We can get gifts after logging in! We can get a Black Diamond Membership and +10 reinforcement coupons!”","“We’re rich! The shop owner is actually giving out free reinforcement coupons! Let’s go and get them!”","“Hahahaha! Hurry! Don’t let the others get ahead of us!” In the crowd, two figures hidden in black robes whispered to each other.","The people in the palace watched the scene in a daze, and they were at a loss for words.","They were stupefied."]},{"number":548,"title":"Chapter 548 - All Masters with Foresight in the World Gather Here","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Crack! The sounds of a wine cup bring shattered came from the grand hall; the silver-armored man turned livid.","The happy scene vanished before his eyes!","We are clearly invaders, and we have come here and gave them the ultimatum. Our ancestors have established dominance many years ago already. How come these people...","Have these people totally forgotten the lesson from the ancient times!","The people on the screen celebrated so cheerfully as if they had won a five million crystal lottery! They didn’t look desperate at all.","“Please calm down, My Lord!” The white-robed man tried to calm him down. “These natives don’t know our great power. They...”","He thought for a long while to organize his words and continued, “They are only a group of mortals and... um... these ants don’t know your greatness or the feats of the lords...”","He stammered and stuttered, making others feel like he couldn’t BS anymore.","Finally, he choked out the words with a reddened face, “When the Heaven-Hiding Palace lands, we will show these ants our ultimate strength! I’m sure that these ants will be so scared that they will beg for mercy!”","The seductive woman squinted her eyes and said with a charming but cold smile, “I saw them and found that these ants are indeed ignorant. In my opinion, we must be patient and shock them when the time comes, letting them know how ignorant they are.”","The white-robed man nodded respectfully and said, “Ms. Jessica is right. As the ants usually say, ants float on the vast ocean. I’m sure that they will have a direct experience of this saying by then.”","“Good! This plan sounds good! Let’s do it.” The silver-armored man made the decision. “That so-called Origins Internet Club is a stupid and ignorant mortal shop; how dare it mess with my plans!”","“When the time comes, Lord Vanguard General, you can show your godly power in front of that shop in person; it’s just a tiny shop after all...”","“Hahahaha...!” A series of laughter resonated in the grand hall.","“Why are you guys so happy?” Some people, male and female, walked in.","Soon, more laughter came from the grand hall. “When the time comes, they will witness the great power of our clan. These lowly creatures will know how ignorant they have been!”","They were very cheerful.","With his spirits lifted, the silver-armored man poured himself another cup of wine and sipped it with enjoyment.","...","– Meanwhile, in Mr. Fang’s internet club –","The empty Yuanyang City Shop gradually became bustling with crowds again.","The cultivators of other cities noticed the change as well.","They had heard the rumor that the cultivation world would be struck with a catastrophe, and many people had fled from the cities. But now, it seemed that people were swarming into Yuanyang City as if their lives depended on it.","The unusual behavior of these cultivators grabbed the attention of the independent cultivators and ordinary warriors who were planning to flee. It was as eye-catching as a flame in the night.","“Do they know something that we don’t?!”","– Independent Immortal Pavilion in Yuanyang City –","The Independent Immortal Pavilion had been nearly empty lately, but now it was bustling with independent cultivators from all places.","The people of big families and factions in other cities all gathered here.","“Waiter! Get me a pound of spirit turtle meat and a pot of 1,000-year-old Huadiao Wine.” A dark-skinned, ordinary-looking young man who was wearing a green robe walked into the shop.","At this moment, all the tables were taken. He cupped his hands at three independent cultivators and pointed at the vacant seat at their square table before asking, “Can I sit with you guys?”","Seeing the question in their eyes, he immediately introduced himself, “I’m Han Yue from the small Yan Country in the south.”","“Han Yue?” an independent cultivator laughed and said, “Young Man, you are named after the famous independent immortal from 2,000 years ago? Do you know how to use the Green Light Godly Blade Sword Technique?”","“With this name, aren’t you afraid of being beaten when you’re out?” that man said as he shook his head, “Suit yourself.”","The green-robed young man’s face twitched.","The independent cultivators talked among themselves. One of them said in a low voice, “Did you know that the cultivators all came to Yuanyang City for a treasure?”","“What treasure?! They would risk their lives for a treasure?!”","“You can’t put it that way. It’s said that the catastrophe of the Spiritual State won’t come until three months later, but obtaining this treasure only takes about 10 days. People can leave after getting this treasure!”","“Then, do you know... what this treasure really is?!”","“One treasure? How come I heard that there are many treasures?!”","“Many treasures?! I heard that there is only one +10 reinforcement coupon!”","“No! I heard that there are Black Diamond Membership, life tokens, and mini pots!”","The young man named Han Yue listened to their conversation in a daze. “I’ve travelled around the world for years. How come... I’ve never heard of such a treasure before!?”","At this moment, a seven-colored auspicious cloud floated to the sky outside Yuanyang City.","Celestial light and mist existed above the colorful cloud, and there was also a white-clothed woman. Her snow-white skin, jade-like bones, wind-like belt, and waterfall-like, fluttering hair made her look like a true immortal.","She was accompanied by a green-clothed girl who looked extremely cute with jade-like features and a flower basket in her hand.","“Master, why are you coming to the mortal world after staying on Seven Saint Mountain for so many years?”","“The center star has dimmed, and I’m afraid that a catastrophe will strike the cultivation world of the Spiritual State.” The white-clothed woman shook her head and sighed slightly, “I’ve calculated this tribulation in my life, and it’s not right for me to escape from it; that isn’t the mentality that we cultivators should have. If I’m right with my calculations, the tribulation should happen here. If I can do something to help the situation on the Spiritual Sate, my 1,000-years of cultivation wouldn’t have gone to waste.”","“I’ll take you to visit some grandmasters in this place.” While she spoke, she landed from the high sky.","...","“Who is she...?”","“She looks like a fairy descending into the mortal world from Heaven...”","“Daoist friends.” The woman greeted the people around them and asked, “I saw that you are all hurrying toward the city; I wonder if there are some grandmasters living in the city. Can you tell us so that my disciple and I can visit them too?”","“Grandmasters...?” The people looked at each other in bafflement.","“Yes! There’s one!”","“Mr. Fang of Origins Internet Club is a grandmaster; it’s said that his cultivation strength is even greater than that of Gu Tingyu, the academy master of the Heavenly Academy!”"]},{"number":549,"title":"Chapter 549 - Sir, A Fairy Is Looking for You","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang’s T-Cat Virtual Item Trading Net was created during the time of the Legend of Mir 2, and it was for people to trade virtual items with it.","[TL Note: T-Cat is actually Tmall in real life. Tmall is a Chinese-language website for business-to-consumer online retail, spun off from Taobao, operated in China by the Alibaba Group.]","After the teleportation array was built, some people began to try to trade real objects.","The Wuwei Daoist Alliance was one of them.","The Wuwei Daoist Alliance was the force that had spent the longest time on the development of all kinds of magic spells and products of modern technology.","By now, they had developed product including magic instillation items, guns, new communication jades, and crystal cars.","However, even though these new spiritual artifacts were top-quality, most cultivators were not familiar with this trading method and thus few people bought them.","...","“Finished finally...” Mr. Fang stretched as he looked at his screen","The opening cinematics of this competition was almost done. In fact, he had done the editing and the framework, and he left the rest to the System. After all, everything that the system produced was top-quality, and Fang Qi didn’t need to worry about the final result.","Ignoring Jiang Xiaoyue’s protests, Fang Qi went upstairs to sleep.","“Bang! Bang! Bang!” At this moment, someone knocked, and then Li Xin’er’s voice came from outside, “Sir, a fairy named Qing Yun from the Color Cloud Cave of Seven Saint Mountain is here, and she is looking for you.”","“What fairy? Color Cloud Cave? I’ve never heard of it before...” While yawning, Mr. Fang said, “I’m busy! I don’t want to meet fairies!”","Then, he laid down on his bed and fell asleep instantly.","“Boss... Bo...” Li Xin’er was frustrated. She could see the female visitor’s celestial presence, which showed that she wasn’t an ordinary woman. However, her boss slept during the day and refused to see the visitor with the excuse of being busy.","Doesn’t he just play games everyday?","While shaking her head, Li Xin’er went downstairs. At the entrance of the shop, the fairy-like woman who had snow-white skin and was wearing white clothes was still waiting there with a humble and polite expression on her face.","Li Xin’er had to apologize to her, “My boss... um... is busy and can’t see you now.”","She looked embarrassed.","“It’s okay,” the woman said mildly, “Everyone said that your boss is a grandmaster; I guess he must be very busy dealing with the upcoming catastrophe of the Spiritual State.”","“Um...” Li Xin’er was even more embarrassed since she knew that her boss was just sleeping upstairs. She said, “If you two have time, you can get online and have tea here in the shop.”","“Hehe! Two more pretty girls came!” Before Li Xin’er could finish, a godly sword hanging on the bamboo stick already spoke.","“Little Girl, if you can’t see the shop owner, you can talk to us; it is the same thing. Our sword techniques are only slightly less powerful than the shop owner’s.”","“Right! We are two grandmasters, too! No, we’re grand swords!”","The other sword said, “Do you see the other swords beside us? When our elder brothers wake up, they might be even more powerful than the grandmaster shop owner who you want to see.”","“Master! These two swords can even talk! Amazing!” The green-clothed young girl stared at the swords with widen eyes.","Li Xin’er’s pretty face darkened. “Don’t listen to their nonsense. If Boss is here, they don’t dare to utter a word.”","“He could conquer so many godly swords!” The white-clothed woman exclaimed, “He’s indeed a grandmaster. From the looks of it, his sword techniques must have reached the peak level.”","“Just slightly more powerful than my Immortal-Hacking Sword Array! If my big brother comes out, it’s hard to say who’s stronger.”","“This shop owner is so strong?!” The green-clothed girl exclaimed in astonishment, “Immortal-Hacking Sword Array! Can it really hack down immortals?”","“Of course... eh? How come it’s dark?! Who sneak-attacked me?! Let me out!”","Suddenly, two black bags were put over the two godly swords before the openings were tied.","Li Wuya turned back and said to the dumbfounded visitors, “Boss told us to do this if the two swords begin babbling...”","“Um... Xin’er, take them to the computers and show them how to get online.”","Immediately, Li Xin’er led the way and showed the dumbfounded visitors to the computers.","“Master... how come I feel like something is not right in this shop...” The green-clothed girl whispered.","To kill time, they followed Li Xin’er’s instructions and clicked randomly on the desktop.","“But... that sister told us that the spiritual artifacts in the shop are connected with various regions of several continents. I wonder if it’s true!”","“M... Master?”","At this moment, the green-clothed girl saw her master clicking on a strange icon which looked like a cat’s head.","“This is our shop’s T-Cat Virtual Item Trading Net,” Li Xin’er explained while standing behind them. “Besides virtual items, there are many new spiritual artifacts mimicked from the spiritual artifacts in our shop.”","Soon, Fairy Qing Yun saw a white spiritual artifact that looking like a jade tablet with the logo of a ‘rotten apple’ with one bite taken off.","“What’s this?” Fairy Qing Yun asked curiously.","“This is the new communication jade, and it’s the newest version – iPhone 6.”","“Such a strange name...” The green-clothed girl frowned on the side.","“Our boss named it,” Li Xin’er explained.","After all, Fang Qi was a stockholder.","“This communication jade can transmit not only messages but images? I can also use it to chat with people through...um... QQ?!” Fairy Qing Yun clicked on the buy button, and the 800 crystals that she had deposited in her membership card almost ran out.","“What’s this...?” Soon, she saw a spiritual artifact that looked like a fancy car.","She watched the video beside the car and understood that it was used to move people around in the city.","“Yu’er! Go and deposit 5,000 crystals in my card. Having not entered the world for a long time, I’m surprised that they have created such an exquisite tool for transportation...”","Then, she looked at the next item, which was a pair of black-framed sunglasses.","[Added to the shopping cart.]","“Pistol?”","[Added to the shopping cart.]","“LV storage bag with magic instillation?”","[Added to the shopping cart.]","“Magic lipstick...?”","[Added to the shopping cart.]","“City-style aristocratic fur coat?”","[Added to the shopping cart.]","...","“Yawn!” While yawning, Mr. Fang finally woke up from his nap and walked downstairs. “Little Xin’er, who is here to see me? Is she still here?”","“Yes. She’s sitting on a couch in the lounge area!”","“Really?” Mr. Fang looked over and saw a girl wearing a pair of big sunglasses and playing with her cell phone. She was surrounded by big and small bags, and she had a LV bag on her shoulder.","The smart phone in her hand had an eye-catching logo of a ‘rotten apple’.","A Maserati was parked outside the door.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","Didn’t they say that she is a fairy?!"]},{"number":550,"title":"Chapter 550 - The Fairy Can Sing","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Fang Qi’s shop was now bustling with crowds, which was a totally different scene from before where the shop was almost empty.","The players included disciples from big families and independent cultivators and warriors from different places.","While talking about the treasures such as +10 reinforcement coupons and Black Diamond Membership, they joined the event called [The Return of 8 Million Adventurers in Dungeon Fighter Online.]","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was looking at the ‘fairy’ before him in bafflement.","Except for her clothes which showed that she came from this world, everything else shouted that she was a fashionable city girl.","Then, Mr. Fang saw a green-clothed girl who was about 15 years old sitting with her. This girl was slurping a bowl of instant noodles and wearing a pair of big sunglasses.","Right. She was eating instant noodles while wearing big sunglasses.","She looked up, revealing that her lips had become bright red because the soup was too spicy for her. She stared at the ordinary-looking young man who was walking toward her.","Mr. Fang scratched his head.","After all, the presence of a great beauty was quite daunting. As a professional gamer who was focused on gaming before he traveled through space and time, Mr. Fang wasn’t good at talking to beautiful girls. Since he was at a loss for what to do, he turned his eyes to the little girl and said genially, “Little sister, is she your mom?”","The people around them suddenly quieted down.","“...”","“She’s my master!” The little girl said with her mouth full of noodles. Then, she snorted and said, “At merely the King Warrior Realm, you can stop thinking of speaking to her.”","Mr. Fang’s face darkened; he was looked down upon by a little girl.","How come little girls nowadays are so sharp-tongued?","Unwilling to be looked down at, Fang Qi sat down beside her and asked, “Little Girl, are you here waiting for someone?”","“Right,” The green-clothed girl said smugly, “My master and I are waiting for a very powerful senior who is said to have defeated even Gu Tingyun, the Old Academy Master of the Heavenly Academy!”","After all, the incident where Mr. Fang crushed Academy Master Gu in StarCraft had spread to every corner.","“Um...” Mr. Fang’s face twitched. “He’s so powerful?”","“Yeah!” The little girl said in exaggeration, “This senior master is the owner of this shop! It’s said that he can defeat demons with one hand, kill the mechanical bull with eyes closed, is ranked Supreme-1 in the dojo, and is invincible at commanding Terran marines!”","“But...” The green-clothed little girl said, “I don’t know what a mechanical bull is. Anyway, I heard that he is super powerful and can fight ten King Warriors like you.”","“!!??” Mr. Fang froze, and he thought, “When did I become so powerful?!”","“Tell me more. Is this shop owner good at anything else?” he asked immediately.","“There’re a lot of his feats! I heard many things about this master!” Zhuge Yu thought for a moment and said, “Well... But they are things hard to remember. Let me think...”","“Can he manage the world with his pen and conquer the world with his powerful strength?”","“Something like that!”","“Does he have jade-like features? And is he more handsome than Pan An?”","[Pan An was a prominent Chinese fu poet in the Western Jin dynasty. He was well known for his good looks from a young age. “Pan An” has become the Chinese byword for handsome men.]","“This... I don’t remember this one... isn’t he an old man?”","“Impossible!” Mr. Fang said, “We can put this on the list!”","“Right!” The little girl patted her forehead. “We can put this on the list!”","“Can you remember more...”","“Scummy Owner! Do you want to play on this map or not?!”","“Oh! In one second!” Mr. Fang answered without thinking.","“Pu!!” The little girl who was eating the instant noodles dropped her fork, and it landed on the ground.","The great beauty who had been playing with her smartphone looked immediately toward him. “...”","“Scummy shop owner. He is trying to fool this little girl mercilessly!” people whispered among themselves.","“Despicable.”","“Sir, where’s your dignity?!”","...","“Grandmasters are all unique in their way of doing things...” Fairy Qing Yun smiled in embarrassment and tried to smooth things over.","Hearing the others’ explanations, the little girl finally saw through this scummy shop owner.","In her heart, the shop owner had come down from a grandmaster to a scummy shop owner who could only bully old people (Gu Tingyun) and little girls.","“Hump!” The little girl turned her head and ignored Fang Qi, furious that he had tricked her to say so many good things about him.","On the side, Fairy Qing Yun told him her intention of the visit.","“You mean... you want to do your share in the imminent catastrophe of the Spiritual State’s cultivation world?”","“Yes.” Fairy Qing Yun sat up straight and said solemnly, “Although I’ve stayed in my mountain for a long time, I’m a cultivator of the Spiritual State and know that we are intimately interdependent. If the cultivation world vanished from the Spiritual State, I and other cultivators in the Seven Saint Mountains would lose our home too.”","“Oh...” Mr. Fang was now having a headache. “But you can’t do anything by coming to me...”","He looked embarrassed. “I’m only the owner of an internet café and can only play games. After all, one person can’t save the entire cultivation world...”","It would only work if Mr. Fang could kill all his enemies in one way; that was all that he could do. If there were too many enemies, he couldn’t manage them all...","“Owner of the internet café...?” Fairy Qing Yun and her disciple, Zhuge Yu, looked at him in a daze.","Isn’t he a super powerful grandmaster?!","“Yeah...” Mr. Fang pointed at the posters on the wall and said, “My job is keeping the shop, playing games, and hosting competitions when necessary.”","There were two posters on the wall. On one poster, the slayers, mages, gunners, and other classes in Dungeon Fighter Online gestured in invitation with the words ‘F1 World Championship, Recruiting the Strongest Fighters.’","The other poster portrayed a battle scene among Terrans, Zerg, and Protoss. The words were ‘Fighting for the Title of the Strongest War Commander. Glory Is Waiting to You!’","“!!??” Fairy Qing Yun was dumbfounded, and she thought, You are looking for a commander and also recruiting the strongest fighters! You said that you can’t help and don’t want to get involved? Who would believe that?","“Sir, didn’t you say that you are only organizing two competitions?!” Fairy Qing Yun’s cold gaze landed on Fang Qi, and she had a strange smile on her face. After looking at the two posters, she seemed to have understood something.","Although the shop owner didn’t say much, his heart is tied to the cultivation world. He is using this method to unite the heroes and brave individuals of the Spiritual State!","And these awards... I don’t know what they are, but I guess they are precious treasures since these brave figures of the Spiritual State are eager to win them!","“Mr. Fang, I admire your heroic act! I’m on the same level as you.” Fairy Qing Yun bowed her head slightly to him, saying, “I wonder...if you can let me participate in this E-Sports competition?”","“I know it’s probably too late for me to participate, but if you have any use of me in the competition, I’m happy to help.”","“Um...” Mr. Fang thought it was not polite to decline her offer. After a moment of consideration, he asked, “Can you sing?”","“Ugh...? I can.” She froze for a moment before answering.","“Do you want to sing during the opening ceremony?”","With opening cinematics and official songs, this competition would look very grand.","..."]},{"number":551,"title":"Chapter 551 - The Outlanders Who Were Stupefied by the Opening Cinematics","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The advanced civilization on this land had been destroyed many years ago.","In the ancient war, immortals had died, and the continent was shattered.","In the eyes of the people who regarded themselves as advanced existences, this barbaric civilization that was just emerging from waste was something beneath their notice.","For them, these people were similar to a group of apes and primitive humans.","“Lady Jessica!” Respectfully, a maid stood beside a blonde woman who was lounging lazily on a big chair covered in fur pelts. Her crimson eyes oozed wickedness and a blood-thirsty aura.","She stretched a bit as if she were not here to battle but to take a holiday.","For her, a skirmish of this level couldn’t be called a war.","It was only an easy one-sided suppression; nothing more.","“The family actually sent me here for this task; I wonder if they have no regard for my abilities.” She snorted and shook her head. “Forget it. I’ll just take it as a holiday.”","“Let me see what antics and stupid things these ignorant natives are doing now.” In these people’s eyes, the people of the Spiritual State were a group of ignorant bumpkins.","She cast a spiritual spell leisurely, and a scene of Yuanyang City appeared before her.","“So many people?!” She froze for a moment because there hadn’t been so many people in the city when she checked last time...","What’s happening?!","All kinds of giant horizontal posters were on the streets and in the alleys of Yuanyang City.","[All Participants, Warm Welcome to Yuanyang City!]","The crowds almost blocked the streets.","She even heard a girl shouting in the crowd, “Ah-! New Snow! You’re gorgeous!”","“Look! That’s Academy Master Gu! Academy Master Gu, show the super psionic lightning matrix again!”","“Academy Master’s Protoss is unrivaled!”","“Look over there! Liu Ningyun, the Nanhua Fairy! My goodness! She is even more beautiful than in the game!”","“Over there! He’s said to be the most talented young man! He looks so young!”","“It’s said that he’s only 12 years old! Hahaha!”","The venue of the competition was the Spiritual State. Since the teleportation array between Half City and Jiuhua City had been built, people of Half City could travel to the Spiritual State from Jiuhua City. There was no issue for transportation.","Jessica’s jaw almost dropped as her mouth was wide open. “What are they doing?!”","With us at your door, can’t you act frightened and create that atmosphere?!","“Lady Jessica, here is your 1,000-year-old jade melon.” The maid handed her a plate of neatly placed spiritual melon slices which looked like green jade.","“Okay...” Picking up a slice distractedly, she began to watch what was going on.","...","The virtual E-Sports competition venue in Qzone could accommodate about 40,000 people, which meant that all the players in the three shops after the expansions could enter and have seats.","“Master... How come there are so many people?!” Zhuge Yu gaped at the scene before her with widened eyes. The circular audience stands surrounding the arena were crammed with people.","– Meanwhile, in Liuyun Daoist Palace –","In the central square, the disciples of Liuyun Daoist Palace each carried a small futon and sat down.","– In the Nanhua Faction of Morning Star Sea Realm –","A huge screen created by a spiritual spell appeared in the sky above the square, and the disciples could see everything on it clearly.","“Senior Brother... What’s this?” A young boy who had just entered the faction asked in a low voice.","“This is E-Sports that only the senior brothers and sisters can get in touch with! Hush! Don’t make any noise! It’s said that even the major factions in the Spiritual State are watching it! Senior Sister Liu and the others are fighting for the glory for our faction!”","“Awesome!” The young boy looked eager. “If I cultivate hard, can I enter this E-Sports in the future, just like them?”","“You must cultivate hard! Remember, all participants in the E-Sports competition are powerful!”","“Okay!”","Kevin was one of the leaders in this expedition. The family had sent them to clear this newly-found land, which was lost in the ancient times, and they planned to use this place to develop new energy sources and store resources.","At this moment, he came in with a copy of the plan, intending to discuss with the others about the preparations of this battle.","“Knock! Knock! Knock!”","“Come in!”","The blond young man walked in and saw Jessica watching something intently with a slice of melon in her hands.","“What are you watching?!”","Bewildered, Kevin watched the scene before Jessica.","At this moment, the opening cinematics had begun playing in the virtual arena in Qzone. The other major broadcasting platforms were showing it on the livestream as well.","Before Jessica was the Chongxu Dao Discussion Field in Yuanyang City.","The field was crammed with cultivators and warriors from all over the Spiritual State.","The lights dimmed. In the darkness, a clock ticked as the huge screen showed an ancient gear engraved with some ancient characters – Dungeon Fighter Online.","It represented the dreams of millions of adventurers.","Each adventurer who came here all had their own ambitious goals that were perhaps unattainable.","Suddenly, a sword beam lit up in the darkness.","[Does swordsmanship have a limit?] On the screen, this sentence showed when a blade master pulled out a longsword and awakened as a grandmaster.","This simple sentence resonated with the hunger in the hearts of the warriors who used swords; this sentence voiced their life-long pursuits, and they were excited by it.","“The dark night gives me dark eyes, but why do they emit such dazzling lights?” Before them, the silent eye suppressed darkness with his jade-like sword beam.","It was silent, but the words that were as radiant as the sword beam were louder than shouts.","“F...!” Zong Wu almost cussed when he saw this short sentence since it expressed the desire in the hearts of all asura players.","On the screen, the hellbringer with blood-red eyes and blood-covered hands looked like a lunatic.","...","[God, please forgive me...]","The priest on the screen turned into a demon, but the fire of revenge would never die down!","One after another, the stunning figures appeared before the audience.","The opening cinematics were divided into two parts. The first part was about Dungeon Fighter Online, and the other was about StarCraft.","“The Queen! Look! The Queen of Blades!”","Outside a huge fortress that appeared endless, groups of flying dragon-like creatures flew up like a black curtain in the sky. Under the fortress walls, cannons fired like blooming flowers, and the tank army of humans fired in huge waves, pushing dust into the air like a curtain.","On the screen, a battlecruiser that was as huge as an ancient mountain crashed down from the sky, shattering the whole city. While the unimaginable, epic battle scenes appeared before them, the audience fell silent and stared at the screen with widened eyes.","“What’s this?!”","The melon in Jessica’s hand already dropped to the ground.","Holding his plans, Kevin froze on the spot in a daze.","Damn it! What was the thing that teleported in the void?!","When did this grand war happen? How come we don’t know about that?!","How come cultivators and warriors in this world have reached such high realms?!","They are even chasing after the ultimate realm of swordsmanship?!","They all turned ashen-faced."]},{"number":552,"title":"Chapter 552 - Dazzling? or Just Crazy?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Carrying the heavy burden of their fates, all the players had experienced the stunning adventure in the continent of Dungeon Fighter Online as they walked toward their awakenings step by step.","“I have nothing to lose...” In Empyrean, that gunner who was wearing a dark purple windbreaker pressed on a bomb trigger and leaped down under the gazes of the enemies who had surrounded him.","“You must care for your weapon like it’s your baby.” When the music of Dungeon Fighter Online sounded, the words of Blacksmith Uncle Linus in Elvenguard resonated in their ears.","While the scenes flashed before them, the music suddenly turned high and passionate.","[Awakening]","One word appeared on the dark screen.","Among the beams of flowing array light, countless demons floated in space. The scene where that horrifying Blache dashed out of the death swamp flashed on the screen.","Then, the crazy-looking demon hacked down his sword, shattering the ground. Lava and beams of fire instantly shot up into the sky!","The scenes of earth-shaking battles flashed before the eyes of the audience.","“My goodness!” Dong Qingli exclaimed when the screen paused at the scene when a champion (Female strikers’ 1st awakening) killed an Abyss Demon with one kick.","“This is my champion!”","Sitting in Heaven-Hiding Palace, Jessica and the others’ jaws almost dropped as they watched this scene.","“What are you doing here? Lord Vanguard General is holding a meeting, and you guys...” Some luxuriously-dressed men and women walked in. At this moment, on the screen, golden battleships flew across the void in the starry sky, looking like ever-lasting fortresses in space.","The huge golden battlecruisers spread out in space. The unrivaled golden battleship fleet of the Protoss ignited the audience.","Screams and exclamations rose in waves!","Sitting on futons cross-legged on their respective squares, the disciples and elders of the Liuyun Daoist Palace and Cloud Ocean Faction intently watched the opening cinematics with blood boiling in their veins.","The disciples sitting in the back clenched their fists and thought, I must work hard! One day, I’ll also become an E-Sports player and attend this competition!","“Look! Isn’t that young man from the Nanhua Faction?!” A disciple from the Heavenly Sword Faction pointed at a swift master flashing on the big screen.","“He’s now a core disciple now! His talent in gaming is much greater than ours!”","“My goodness...” The first disciple’s face darkened.","At this moment, the faces of Jessica and the other outlanders were now all pale, and they thought, We are here to spend our holiday, and you natives present this stuff to us?","Who are the barbarians? You or me?!","“What on earth is this?!” Kevin yelled in alarm.","“Quickly call over Carl!”","“Call them all here to watch this!”","Soon, all the outlanders sat down in rows and watched the E-Sports competition intently.","They had totally forgotten about their claims to stun the people of the Spiritual State.","It seemed like they had come all the way here to watch the competition.","...","When the opening cinematics came to an end, the high and passionate music of electric guitar came from below. Under the spotlights, a charming woman wearing a green, trailing long dress was holding a dark blue electric guitar. Her green-jade-like eyes looked like the surface of a lake in the autumn with reflective lights.","The audience was charmed by her smile and moves.","With the passionate and echoing heavy-metal music, the big screen behind her was filled with fire and smoke of a war between stars.","Then, her clear and passionate singing sounded.","“What’s she singing about? I don’t understand one word of it.” Sitting in a seat in the front row, Sia asked in her poor Spiritual State language.","“It’s said to be a Western language... She is singing a song named ‘Nightwish – She Is My Sin,’ Luo Piaoling whispered to her.","[TL Note: This song is the theme song for Counter Strike 1.6, which was really popular in China.]","“Why can’t she sing in the language of the Ultimate West Realm?”","Although the audience couldn’t understand the words, they were enchanted by the rhythm. At this moment, another voice joined in as the music switched, and it sounded light, ethereal, pure, and melodious.","Two songs intertwined with each other as if a holy angel and a seductive demon joined their voices. In the end, a fairy-like woman wearing pure-white clothes flew down from the sky.","“F*ck!”","“Awesome!”","“It is worth it to not play games today!”","Stunned by these visual effects, the audience erupted into cheers, and the atmosphere was hyped.","Then, thunder seemed to be rumbling in the sky, and the big screen showed some fascinating scenes where players fought their way up from the low ranking to the high ranking to get into the competition. Some of them made it, and some of them didn’t.","An elemental bomber waved his magic staff, and the magic arrays on the ground exploded in flames.","Meanwhile, the singers seemed to have begun to sing in the language of the Spiritual State.","“The witch lifted her wand and left a frost flower on the windowsill;","She seemed to remember that the prophecy told this story;","He came from a snowstorm, freezing time that was anxious...”","...","A desperado (Male rangers’ 1st awakening) fought back in an impossible situation and claimed victory.","A desperado player who had entered the competition had tears in his eyes when he saw this scene. It was a flashback of his last battle before he entered the top 64. Even watching it now, his heart raced, and he was a little scared.","At this moment, even the outlanders in the Heaven-Hiding Palace were stupefied by what they saw.","“How can these people have such terrifying combat experience?!”","“Are they still humans?!”","Of course, they didn’t know that each participant in this E-Sports competition had fought more than 4,000 matches, not including their battles with the Abyss Demons.","“Look! What’s that?!”","A golden transportation aircraft flew over, and Protoss high templars dropped from the sky. Then, a psi storm swept across the whole battlefield!","A horrifying sea of zerg units was turned into ashes in one instant.","“Psionic lightning matrix! It’s a play that consists of dropping psionic storms from the air!” one player exclaimed.","“Airdropping ten Protoss high templars! This is a super psionic lightning matrix!”","“My goodness!”","In the Heaven-Hiding Palace, Jessica and the other outlanders yelled, “Holy God!”","“What’s this now?!”","“They seem to be yelling something like psionic lightning matrix?! It’s crazy! So powerful!”","“What am I watching?! These people are holding battles among such grandmasters?!”","At this moment, the songs came to an end while the last few words resonating in their ears, “Dazzling or just crazy?”","With wide-open eyes, the outlanders exchanged a look while gaping.","They had never been stunned and shocked like this before."]},{"number":553,"title":"Chapter 553 - The Poison Milk Duo’s Powerful Return","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Poison Milk is a Chinese slang where praying for someone makes that person perform worse.]","“My goodness!” Jessica covered her head with her arms and shrieked, “How did these people develop? Their civilization already developed to such a high level?!”","It was impossible to imagine how this could have happened for these people.","Among other things, the transition (spatial warp) in StarCraft was beyond their understanding; it was way more advanced than traditional teleportation!","What is transition? It originally refers to the transition in quantum physics, describing the drastic shift in quantum phases. Although it was different from the transition in StarCraft, it can be used to explain the instant teleportation method in the game.","The transition technique of Terrans was something like the warp drive as shown in Star Wars. The Protoss used their unique technology of particle reform, and Kerrigan, the Queen of Blades, created wormholes to teleport units to Mengsk’s home.","Carl, the Vanguard General, had a cup of wine in his hand, and he was planning to enjoy wine while watching the competition. However, he spilled it on his pants instead.","What did I say earlier?!","Fortunately, I didn’t show my face earlier!","His face turned pale.","The others around him saw his wet pants. “...”","“I spilled my wine! I spilled my wine!” He hurried to explain.","“...”","“Lady Jessica, your melon!” The maid picked up the slice of melon for Jessica.","“Forget it. Give me another slice!” She continued watching the competition.","...","Although the System provided the awards and venue for the competition, Mr. Fang, as the owner of the shop, had spent a lot of energy on this event as well.","For example, he had arranged the hosts for the gala.","Even now, he was still hurting for the money that he had paid from his own pocket.","“Wow! Awesome! Superb!” Ning Bi, the demonic woman, praised her companion, “This super cool and pure fairy with a beautiful singing voice beside me is a great figure.”","“Daoist Friend, you are exaggerating. I’m Qing Yun, an independent cultivator. I’m honored to stand here together with you.” Fairy Qing Yun looked calm and elegant, but her beautiful eyes showed her excitement. She was thrilled that Mr. Fang had gathered so many grandmasters together to defend against the enemies from the outland.","Since she would go to her auction house when she was free, Ning Bi was very familiar with this role. “First of all, let’s welcome all the friends who came from distant places and friends who are watching through the livestream! I’m Ning Bi! Welcome, everyone!”","Fairy Qing Yun was more reserved. “I’m Qing Yun! Welcome, everyone!”","“Wow-!”","“Welcome! Welcome!”","The audience outside the arena all screamed.","“Our blade master is awesome!”","“Hellbringer is unrivaled!”","“For the zerg!”","“Cheers for the Queen of Blades!”","“Fairy Qing Yun is awesome!”","“...”","“The atmosphere is so lively...” Jessica ate her melon slice while watching the show.","“Gulp! Gulp...” Carl gulped down his wine and stared at the scene before him.","Calmly, Ning Bi introduced, “After the group draw, our contestants are ready. 64 players from all over the world will engage in fierce battles in four groups.”","“Right.” Fairy Qing Yun nodded and said, “After the fierce battles in the groups, the four winners will battle for the first place.”","“The StarCraft competition and Dungeon Fighter Online competition will be held separately,” Ning Bi explained, “Now, let’s see who are in Group A of the Dungeon Fighter Online competition!”","She looked at the name list. “It seems like Group A is the group of death. King of the Swift Masters, Wang Xie!”","“F*ck!”","“This first participant is so powerful already!”","“Who’s Wang Xie? How come we don’t know about him?” The audience in the Heaven-Hiding Palace looked puzzled.","Jessica moved her spell and said, “Let’s hear what the audience members are saying about him!”","“He’s the genius of the Wang Family and the No. 1 Genius in the Heavenly Academy!”","“He won the first place in the academy entrance exam of the Heavenly Academy!”","What was wind?","Ordinary people would think that it was just a natural phenomenon.","However, for the people in the ancient magic realm, wind was an important factor in deciding one’s fate.","The depths of the Storm Hill, where the gales swept around, was the place where swift masters studied the origin of wind.","They were called wind chasers and swift masters.","“It’s said that he is the first person who could deftly control each of the hurricanes that swift masters summon using Vortex Hurrican!”","“Vortex Hurricane?!” The outlanders exchanged a look, recalling the destructive storm in the opening cinematics. That horrifying wind storm could be called the origin of wind!","“How can one control it deftly?!” F*ck...","They had the urge to cuss. Who are these weirdos!","Since the virtual reality games were different from the original ones, the players did more than controlling the timing and trying to connect combos.","In Dungeon Fighter Online, the players could control each move to the exact second!","The godlike masters wouldn’t hurt their teammates at all even if the latter stood in the attack range of a powerful skill that they learned after their first awakening.","“The next is Grand master Zhu Yanxiao!” A warrior with short hair walked up to the arena with a cool expression.","“My goodness-!” the audience yelled in astonishment.","“F*ck! Zhu Yanxiao!”","“How come I’ve never heard of him before?”","“I can’t believe that you haven’t heard of him! He is rumored to be the No.1 Blade Master. I don’t know where he is from for sure, but it seems like he is a civilian warrior from the Jiuhua City Shop. He’s super powerful!”","“A civilian warrior? Can he defeat the master warriors of the Spiritual State?”","“I didn’t believe it either, but this guy’s talent is... too insane!”","“Grand Master?!” The outlanders froze. They had just seen a person who had mastered the origin of wind, and now here came a grandmaster?!","At this moment, two figures who were engulfed in black cloaks and sitting in the rear were whispering to each other.","“What’s going on? Do we need to go up there and show ourselves on stage to participate in the competition?!","“Will our backgrounds be exposed?”","After Ning Bi introduced the contestants, she said, “Now, let’s turn the camera to our casters.”","“Hello, everyone. I’m Caster Xiao Yulv.” Although Xiao Yulv couldn’t play games, Mr. Fang had to go against his own will and managed to get Xiao Yulv a position as a caster.","“I’m Caster Mu Donglai.”","This time, the two of them sat in the special broadcasting hall in the Jiuhua City Shop.","Compared to their previous ‘casting experience’ where they sat on couches among the rest of the audience, this hall looked much grander.","“It’s the first time that we have such a big audience watching a competition...” Mu Donglai commented.","“You’re right.”","Mu Donglai said, “Gongzi Xiao, what do you think of the contestants in Group A?”","“For example, this group has Swift Master Wang Xie, Mechanic Tang Yu, Grand Master Zhu Yanxiao who many civilian players favor, and the No.1 Hellbringer from the Half City Shop... Nanhua Fairy Liu Ningyun. Wow! It seems like the contestants in Group A are all in the group of death.”"]},{"number":554,"title":"Chapter 554 - Unleash the Power","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Xiao Yulv said, “I think Mr. Mu knows more about this field than I do. From what I know, Mr. Mu has reached the Master-Tier in the Ladder Ranking System of StarCraft and thus has unique understanding of strategies and tactics. Besides, he has just reached the supreme-tier in Dungeon Fighter Online yesterday.”","Mr. Mu smiled in understanding and said, “This... I’m sure that everyone knows the big contribution that Gongzi Xiao made with his game guides.”","As usual, they first complimented each other very well.","-Inside the Heaven-Hiding Palace-","“What are these two people doing here?! They sound quite powerful?” These outlanders clearly knew nothing about the topic that these two men were discussing except the words ‘master’ and ‘supreme’.","“I know that Mr. Mu had fought with many contestants, so I think your opinion is valuable,” Xiao Yulv said, “I want to ask who you think is stronger when you were fighting your way to the supreme-tier. Who do you think is stronger or who do you think has the potential to be the champion?”","“From what I know, this ‘Crazy Butcher’ and ‘Zhu Yanxiao’ are the weakest in Group A. Not for any particular reason; when I encountered them while I fought my way up, that was how I felt.”","“Only these two?” Xiao Yulv asked, “How about Young Master Song Qingfeng? He’s in this group too.”","“Young Master Song might have more competition experience than the others,” Mu Donglai said calmly.","“Indeed. Gongzi Song has taken quite a few great rankings in previous competitions.”","“Oh.” Mu Donglai looked at the time and saw that the competition was about to begin. “I’ll tell you this. The most powerful contestant in the competition, on the warrior side, is Old Duke Nalan who surpasses the others in both swordsmanship and Sword Dao. Among the Mages, Elder Xuanyuan Changqing of the Xuanyuan Family is good. Also, Wang Xie is a young genius.”","“How about Vice Academy Master Zhang of the Heavenly Academy and Ms. Xue Bi? They are both powerful masters, right?”","“I’m sure that the champion will be one of them.” Mu Donglai nodded and said, “If Senior Gu Tingyun didn’t choose to enter StarCraft, he would be a powerful candidate in the Dungeon Fighter Online competition as well.”","Xiao Yulv said, “Now, everyone, please remember the five people who Mr. Mu just mentioned; the champion will be one of them.”","“Oh! One more.” Mr. Mu patted his hand on his forehead when a thought struck him, and he said, “Nalan Mingxue! This girl is quite powerful.”","“Right. She won the championship title for several competitions. Then, we have six prime candidates in the competition.”","Mr. Fang was also watching the livestream while drinking Coke. When he saw this scene, he spewed out his Coke. “Pu!”","“Are these six people the most powerful ones among them?” The outlanders memorized these six names and ironed them into their memory.","“Now, the competition will officially begin!” Xiao Yulv glanced at the time and announced, “Now, let’s turn the camera to the contestants.","“The first match is between Bellatrix Liu Ningyun of the Nanhua Faction in the Morning Star Sea Realm versus the young desperado genius of Half City, the King of Rangers!”","...","– Meanwhile, in the audience stand in Qzone –","Fairy Qing Yun continued to hum the song, “The witch lifted her wand and left a frost flower on the windowsill...”","In her arms was a big bag of potato chips that Mr. Fang gave to her. Before she could eat, her little disciple Zhuge Yu grabbed a big handful from the bag.","“Crunch! Crunch!” Zhuge Yu ate more than half of the chips that she grabbed in a few seconds.","“Yu’er!” Fairy Qing Yun glared at Zhuge Yu with her beautiful eyes and said, “What did I tell you before we came out? You must wash your hands before eating! And you must chew and eat slowly!","“One more thing; don’t eat chips in secret without my permission! Do you remember?”","Sitting near them, Mr. Fang’s face twitched as he thought, I think she’s really your daughter...","...","It was the outlanders’ first time watching an E-Sports competition.","Jessica ate her melon, and Carl poured himself another cup of wine.","“The six powerful people that those two mentioned are not in the first match, right?” Carl sipped his wine and said, “Although these natives’ power goes beyond our imagination, some of them are not as strong as the others.”","While taking a bite from her melon, Jessica said, “This girl looks no older than us. It seems that they are letting the ordinary masters in the younger generation battle first, and the more powerful ones will come out later.”","Kevin said, “Yeah. If my memory serves me right, Jessica, you are one of the best in your family, right?”","“She isn’t called the Shadow Spirit for nothing.” Carl lifted his cup and chuckled.","“I wonder if I can defeat this woman.” Jessica licked her red lips, looking very interested.","She had wanted to beat all the people in this world senseless. But now, she had lowered her expectations and began to compare herself with the geniuses in the younger generation.","Although the contestants all looked powerful, they represented more than half of the most powerful masters in this world.","The outlanders were sent here with a mission. Although they had been stunned by the opening cinematics, they must do their due diligence and investigate, and they would never do nothing and just go back.","At least, they must investigate their enemies’ strength first.","To do the investigation, watching the competition was the first step.","These outlanders could only watch from the distance, but they were not stupid. If the contestants had poor combat techniques and battle experience and had disguised their poor performance with grand and dazzling explosive effects, they would have seen through it.","However, from the previous opening cinematics, they could see that every move, technique, and spiritual spell that these people used followed certain laws of nature, and they could roughly understand them.","They couldn’t fake these techniques.","Outsiders only watched for fun, but the experts could see the differences. Since these outlanders were true masters, they could see the essence and great power of these techniques.","In fact, after learning their awakening skills, many cultivators of the Spiritual State didn’t know how horrifying these skills were since they didn’t have anything to compare them with.","Perhaps only the few ancient families that had studied the ethereal celestial relics knew something about the true power of these skills.","However, these outlanders had the most direct experience. They could compare these skills with their own and understand which was stronger and by how much.","“This contestant is only a child who is about 12 years old.” Carl shook his head and said, “I think their younger generation is still no match for ours.”","The moment he said it, the scene before them suddenly changed. Liu Ningyun who was holding a spear suddenly emitted golden light like an imposing godly statue!","As if she were defying gravity, her whole body floated up while horrifying magic power surrounded her and condensed into armor and a huge battle spear. While emitting golden light, she looked like a goddess!","A huge streak of magic power exploded, turning everything around her to dust!","“My goodness! Liu Ningyun successfully used the skill, Teana Transformation! The King of Rangers is in danger!” The two casters were shouting on top of their lungs.","“Teana Transformation?”","“Aren’t they just two young people?!” Seeing the horrifying presence sweeping across the space, and the golden blade chopping everything before it into two halves, Carl subconsciously dropped his wine cup.","“I spilled my wine again! I spilled it again!” His pants were wet.","“My melon!” With an exclamation, Jessica dropped it again."]},{"number":555,"title":"Chapter 555 - The Quality of Supreme-Tier Players","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the prehistoric times when the planet Terra was still intact, and magic was yet to be discovered, the advanced Terra science created 12 Teanas.","Teanas glowed in gold, and they had saint-like wisdom and battle-god-like strength. All the people of Terra worshiped them, and these people’s biggest dream was to become like them.","This was why battle mages would transform into Teana after awakening.","“Now, let’s review their previous moves,” Xiao Yulv said, “They fought steadily, and then Contestant Liu Ningyun grabbed an opportunity to use her killing technique!”","“She seemed to use Sky Assault and missed on purpose to trick her opponent into moving in a specific direction. Then, she sent him flying. While her opponent was airborne, she chanted spells to apply buffs to herself before transforming into a Teana!” Mu Donglai explained, “This contestant is very decisive! If not for the magic protection that came with his reinforced equipment, the King of Ranger would have been killed!”","“But we can see that the King of Rangers’s HP isn’t in a good situation now! He has been knocked up! Can he regain his balance and slow down the tempo of this battle?!”","“The King of Rangers tried his best to protect his vital parts, but we can see that he had been severely wounded!”","On the big screen, the dignified Teana who looked like the Martial God slashed out her saber, and the terrifying golden saber energy would turn everything before her into two halves.","It wasn’t a power that humans could block! The blade turned back and hacked down with vicious force!","“Finished!” Xiao Yulv yelled, “He will die if he is hit by this blade strike!”","Mu Donglai shook his head and said, “The King of Rangers is too young after all. I encountered this contestant in the dojo and found that he is a hard-working and talented player.”","“But on this arena, experience is very important!”","Right now, Jessica had no time to pick up melons. She almost stuck her head into the screen before her!","What did she just see?! This all originated from the man getting hit by the spear which wasn’t a hard strike. A few seconds later, the battle had entered a critical stage where one contestant was going to be killed.","“It’s finished,” Carl said, “This Teana obviously has god-level strength, and this cultivator using the weird spiritual artifact (a gun) is too weak.”","“It seems that there are weak ones among them,” Kevin said cheerfully, “For example, this young man is one of the weak ones. I wonder why they allowed a weakling like him to enter the competition!”","“The match is coming to an end. Let’s congratulate...”","To survive in the chaotic and lawless zone in Empyrean, the gunners must be able to draw out their guns and shoot very swiftly. In most cases, one mistake would mean death.","Wang Luo, a survivor in the chaotic Half City, had never imagined that some people in another world would have lives so similar to his.","Without great talents like other cultivators, guns were his best option as weapons.","In the competition venue on the second floor of Yuanyang City, the young man wearing a virtual reality headset wasn’t fearful or regretful that he would soon lose this match.","At least, he had come to the competition with his beloved guns and shouldn’t go back in disgrace. More importantly, he didn’t want his desperado character who was wearing a purple windbreaker to lose without firing one bullet.","At least, he still had one chance to fire...","In the next moment, the outlanders in the Heaven-Hiding Palace widened their eyes while they watched the scene shown by the screen created by the spiritual spell.","The contestant’s body seemed to defy the law of physics while he lifted his hand and fired unexpectedly!","“Revenger! The King of Rangers used the recoil force of Revenger to dodge the attack!”","“He could even dodge this attack?!”","“Who’s this King of Rangers?!”","“He’s too powerful! How come I’ve never heard of him before?!”","All the cultivators and warriors in Qzone and before the various big screens of the livestream stood up without thinking.","Boom!","With a loud, earth-shaking sound, the ground of the arena cracked into two halves!","For rangers who were constantly gripped by the fear of death, drawing and firing had become their second nature, and they could do it as easily as breathing. Even when they lost balance or consciousness, they could fire like a conditional reflex.","“Flying gun!” In fact, any gunner who reached the supreme-tier could use this technique, but now...","“The King of Rangers dodged another strike with the flying gun technique! He is pulling away from his opponent swiftly. Does he still have a chance?!”","“Moving Shot! Silver Bullet! Rising Shot! Oh! They are useless!” Mu Donglai yelled, “The bellatrix won’t be sent flying by magic power!”","On the screen, the desperado retreated under the attacks from the bellatrix.","“My goodness! This King of Rangers is so calm!” Xiao Yulv exclaimed, “He’s on the verge of dying, but he’s still dodging attacks!”","“We can see that the King of Rangers is using all kinds of weapons including Gatling gun, grenades, and rising bullets to interfere with his opponent’s attacks. Although the effects are insignificant, he doesn’t want to admit defeat!”","“It looks like an ant’s struggle before death.” Carl shook his head and said, “Facing an opponent much stronger than him, he is seeking death if he doesn’t give up.”","“Aya! I have to say that Contestant Liu Ningyun has chosen the perfect time to transform!” Mu Donglai lamented, “At this moment, even if the King of Rangers uses his awakening skill, it will be in vain.”","“Have you guys noticed that the King of Rangers hasn’t used Headshot!” Xiao Yulv suddenly said.","Headshot didn’t only refer to shooting the opponent’s head; it was a skill to shoot at the opponent’s vital points.","This technique consumed lots of energy and magic power.","They could only see the bellatrix’s golden saber energies, which showed that this wasn’t a battle between opponents of the same level.","However, in the next moment, a bullet shot through the saber energies.","The audience saw a weird skeleton flashing past.","“Sudden Death-!” Mu Donglai yelled in shock, “Is this Sudden Death?!”","“The King of Rangers used Sudden Death in the match!”","At this moment, even Mr. Fang stood up.","The passive skill, Sudden Death, of desperadoes was an instinctive combat skill which was obtained through many battles. With this skill, the desperadoes could sense their opponents’ vital points, but its accuracy is extremely low.","“He actually hit her?!”","The moment that the weird skeleton appeared, the bellatrix collapsed!","“This is...”","“What’s this spiritual artifact? It can even kill gods?!”","It was an instant kill!","The people in the Heaven-Hiding Palace yelled in shock.","“Grenade and then sliding tackle! Contestant Liu Ningyun was knocked back to her ordinary form by the hit! My goodness, the King of Rangers is fighting back! He is fighting back while he’s on the verge of death!” The two casters yelled hoarsely.","“At this moment, regardless if he wins or loses, this player has won our respect. His unyielding spirit is a quality that all of us, both warriors and cultivators, must have!” Mu Donglai yelled, “It’s the spirit of our supreme-tier players! He deserves the name of desperado!”","At this moment, the audience all stood up with excitement, and the whole venue was engulfed by earth-shaking cheering!"]},{"number":556,"title":"Chapter 556 - We Can Dress as the People of Ultimate West Realm to Watch Onsite","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Heaven-Hiding Palace, the outlanders were also watching the match intently.","“How come this match had such a turn of events?!”","It had been obvious that the girl who was a bellatrix was winning, and her opponent was in no position to continue the match! They were about to announce the result!","What’s happening?!","How come things changed so fast!?","With melon or wine in their hands, these people continued watching intently.","“It’s usually hard to hit the target with Sudden Death!” Mu Donglai said, “That shot was amazing!”","“Is he going to turn the tables?!” Xiao Yulv yelled in shock.","“Liu Ningyun can still use the skill, Phase Shift, where she will teleport to a nearby spot and leave behind a decoy! Will she use it?! In this situation, she must use it!”","“She’s using it. We can see that Liu Ningyun is fighting with great caution; she has realized that the King of Rangers must have worked hard on Sudden Death!”","“Now with her Teana Transformation was destroyed, she has consumed lots of her energy and can’t transform again! However, the King of Rangers still has his awakening skill with him since he didn’t use it yet. Will he use it now?!”","“We can see that Liu Ningyun is being forced into a corner by the King of Rangers! No! Finished!” The two casters were howling, “I can’t believe that he flipped the situation in such a match!”","Before them, the King of Rangers shot wildly with his revolver, and every shot followed a special rhythm. The bullets flew and formed a huge net!","“He is turning the tables!” Mu Donglai yelled.","The outlanders in Heaven-Hiding Palace were stunned. “Amazing! I can’t believe that he can turn the tables in such a situation!”","“I can’t believe that we can watch such a thrilling battle in this place!”","“I’ve never watched such an exciting battle before!” Carl sipped his wine elegantly while he watched the match with his peripheral vision.","Suddenly, a golden light flashed.","A long saber that was surrounded by a golden dragon stabbed out viciously!","“Dragon Strike! Liu Ningyun’s Dragon Strike!”","“Pu-!” Carl didn’t spill his wine on his pants this time; he spewed it out.","The casters were stunned as they sat on their seats. “The King of Rangers...!? Ugh?! The tables turned against him!”","Xiao Yulv and Mu Donglai exchanged a look.","Damn it! How can we cast this match properly?!","The two of them froze for a while, and so did the audience.","Then, the two casters suddenly stood up and yelled, “These two contestants showed the greatest competition spirit!”","“Let’s congratulate the winner!”","“Although the King of Rangers lost, he is still a honorable player!”","“Hahahaha...” They had the urge of quitting their job.","– Inside the Heaven-Hiding Palace –","“It was a great match...” Jessica laughed and said, “No one could have predicted the end result! It was so unexpected!”","Carl quickly wiped off the wine on his face. “...”","“This E-Sports competition is enthralling!”","“...”","“Then, let’s congratulate...”","“...Now, the next match is... Grandmaster Nalan Hongwu versus...”","“...Now, the matches in Group B are happening right now...”","As time went on, melon rinds littered the floor.","Several maids cleaned the floor again and again.","“Lady Jessica, it’s time for your meal!”","“Oh... get me two more melons!”","“This...” The maid said embarrassedly, “We ran out of melons...”","“Ugh?!”","“Lady Jessica... You guys have watched that for a whole day now...” The maid reminded her.","“...”","“How come I feel like it wasn’t good enough to watch like this...”","“I have the same feeling. This spiritual spell can’t show the scenes clearly!”","“I can’t make the spell too obvious and powerful. Otherwise, these natives will discover it!” Jessica stared at them and said, “Besides, I’m not someone whose job is to master this spell!”","“Should... we can go to the venue and watch it up close?”","“Aren’t you afraid that they will discover us?!”","“Didn’t you notice that they are competing in another world? If they battled in this world, the shattering of space and summoning of demons would be too much for ordinary cultivators to see!”","“You’re right... but we look different from those natives. Will they recognize us?” Kevin said with unease.","“Don’t worry,” Carl said, “We can dress up as people of the Ultimate West Realm!”","...","The Dungeon Fighter Online competition was held on the first day.","On the Spiritual State, besides the talented people of the seven families, some grandmasters lived reclusive lives in the depths of mountains and devoted all their time on cultivation.","Since these people lived outside the mortal world, they were not known to the people in the mortal world. The ancient families were aware of the existence of these reclusive cultivators, but these two groups seldom had dealings with each other since they were of different worlds.","These hermits didn’t venture into the relics such as Sky Relic and Fortune Golden Palace. If not for the imminent catastrophe of the Spiritual State’s cultivation world, no one would know about their existence.","Seven Saint Mountain was such a place; it could be counted as an ancient reclusive inheritance.","Different from other cultivators, these cultivators seldom set their foot in the mortal world and thus cultivated few spiritual spells used to fight with people.","However, living as hermits in the mountains didn’t mean that they knew nothing about the mortal world. Different from paying attention in the normal sense, they predicted the future of the Spiritual State by observing the stars and constellations.","Even though they had never set foot out of Seven Saint Mountain, they were not ignorant of the important issues in the world.","– Meanwhile, on Seven Saint Mountain –","Seven Saint Mountain was a series of rolling hills and peaks covered by white snow.","However, in the depths of the peaks was a valley that was as balmy as spring all year round. At this moment, a white-haired old man was sitting by a small lake cross-legged. Behind him was a forest of pine trees that were deep green.","A grey-haired, middle-aged man sat down beside him with a mild expression, and he had a zither in his arms.","A Daoist boy who was about ten years and had his hair tied into two buns was heating a pot of spiritual herb tea. Meanwhile, a Daoist wearing a grey Daoist robe strolled toward them from the path beside the creek and sang, “White clouds, yellow cranes, a Daoist’s home. One zither, one sword, and one cup of tea. Peace and inaction are my nature, understanding Dao without stains from the mortal world.”","“What brings Daoist Friend Wuchen Zi here?” The Daoist asked while sitting cross-legged by the lake and resting with eyes closed.","“Hahahaha... Xuyu Daoist has top-quality Longxu Tea which matures once every 700 years. Now, it’s time to enjoy the tea.”","“I was curious as to why you are here! You are here to have free tea!” The middle-aged man who carried a zither laughed.","“Unfortunately, Daoist Qing Yun is out in the mortal world and doesn’t have the fortune to enjoy the tea!”","“I told her to go down the mountain later!” A pretty woman who had silver hair and was wearing green clothes shook her head and said with a low snort.","“That’s what she gets for not listening to experienced people!”","“Liii–!” At this moment, a clear and high-pitched bird chirp resonated in the sky, and a red-crowned crane landed on the ground.","“Fairy Qing Yun sent a message! Fairy Qing Yun sent a message!” The red-crowned crane croaked and delivered the message.","“Ugh?” These people looked baffled. “Message so soon?”","“Fairy Qing Yun sent you many things! Many things!”","“What good stuff can the mortal world have?” The Daoist said with a snort.","“Iced red tea! Delicious iced red tea!” The red-crowned crane yelled, “And iPhone communication jade with QQ! You can watch E-Sports competition on it!”","“What did you say?!” They looked even more confused."]},{"number":557,"title":"Chapter 557 - The Audience Sitting near Mr. Fang","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Did Daoist Friend Qing Yun get into trouble and send the crane back for help?”","“I don’t think so...” The old Daoist said, “Why did she send us these things?”","“What are these?!” They surrounded the red-crowned crane and watched as this bird dug out many things from a new LV storage bag.","They were dazed by these things, and they thought, Although we stayed in the depths of the mountains for a long time, we aren’t bumpkins who know nothing!","Don’t try to fool us by getting these things that we never heard about!","“Wait!” The white-haired Daoist moved his fingers and said, “Let me do some calculations and see what Daoist Friend Qing Yun is up to!”","Xuyu Daoist stroked his beard lightly and calculated with his fingers.","“Um...?”","“How is it?” The others leaned over.","“Be patient, be patient. Let me do it again.” He moved his fingers and calculated again.","“Ugh-?”","With widened eyes, he calculated again.","“Ugh-?”","“What’s up?”","Before they could finish, they saw the red-crowned crane playing with the communication jade.","Soon, they heard earth-shaking cheers, and a mystical virtual screen already appeared above the communication jade.","“What’s this?!”","On a huge circular arena, Fairy Qing Yun in a white dress held a microphone in her hand and said, “Wow! Yesterday’s battles were thrilling!”","“Um? This is... Daoist Friend Qing Yun?!”","“Right! The battles were fierce from the very beginning. My heart was in my throat several times.” Demonic Woman Ning Bi patted her plump chest.","At this moment, these Daoists each had a cup of tea in their hands, sipping it with great enjoyment.","“Little Crane, we don’t have any tea left for you! We already divvied it up.” Wucheng Zi laughed smugly with a cup of Longxu Tea in his hand.","“You’re bullying me!”","“Wow! It smells so good!” Wucheng Zi sniffed the tea with intoxication written on his face.","“I’m furious! I’m furious!” The red-crowned crane flapped its wings in fury. Then, it rolled its eyes and said, “I... I can drink the iced red tea!”","After opening the cap, it poured the amber-colored liquid into a crystal cup. As a faint tea fragrance permeated the air, this white red-crowned crane put three ice cubes into the cup.","The others deeply inhaled with great interest.","“What’s this...?”","“Only immortals deserve to have this tea!”","“...”","Three minutes later, they all watched the E-Sports competition with a cup of iced red tea in each of their hands.","...","– On the other side –","“Here! This way!” Jessica walked before the others and enthusiastically waved at the people behind her.","It was hot, but Carl was tightly engulfed in a big cloak like a zongzi. It seemed like he was afraid to be beaten if he were recognized.","Stealthily, he walked up from behind with caution.","“Aren’t you afraid that the commander of that golden battleship fleet will discover us?!”","“Hush... we’re people of the Ultimate West Realm!”","Mr. Fang was sitting in an inconspicuous seat while wearing sunglasses; he looked very low-profiled.","He turned around and saw that several blond-haired foreign-looking people suddenly took seats near him.","One was a seductive woman with blonde curls and a big sword, and she was dressed in the style of the Ultimate West Realm.","Another was a blond young man.","The last one was a lean and tall young man covered by a cloak. He had long brown hair and seemed to have mixed racial features.","“Here! Come here! There are many empty seats! This guy has low cultivation strength and won’t discover our background!” Jessica whispered to the others.","“New friends from the Ultimate West Realm?” Mr. Fang froze for a moment. It didn’t occur to him that blond people might not all come from the Ultimate West Realm but rather from another world.","Jessica and her companions froze for a moment as well.","“It’s okay. He’s just an ordinary person weaker than the pinnacle stage of Low Level,” Jessica turned her head and said to her companions in a low voice.","“This spot is good; theres only ordinary people around us!” Kevin nodded.","Mr. Fang glanced at them curiously.","“What are you looking at?” Immediately, the blonde woman glared at him fiercely.","“Low-level native! Hmph!”","Mr. Fang was puzzled. How come these people of the Ultimate West Realm are so unfriendly?!","After all, the people of the Ultimate West Realm had become friendly to Mr. Fang after losing to him despite their arrogance before others.","However, Fang Qi didn’t have time to deal with them now since the competition had begun.","“Today is very important since the champion will be decided on later.” The camera had turned to Xiao Yulv. “As everyone knows, with his excellent experience, Mr. Mu had made a bold prediction and pointed out the six most promising candidates for the champion. ”","“Will one of them become the champion? The results will come out today!”","“Hiss-! Today, we will watch the six supreme masters in battle?!” Jessica exclaimed in a low voice.","The blond man Kevin said, “Indeed. I carefully watched yesterday and found that those six people are indeed as powerful as these two claimed.”","Meanwhile, Carl didn’t forget his wine cup and took it out.","Somehow, Jessica took out an exquisite small golden plate with neatly placed melon cubes. She picked up a piece with a silver fork before putting it into her mouth elegantly.","Kevin’s hands were empty, and he looked at them with a dark expression.","“It’s thrilling that the first match is between Wang Xie, one of the six supreme masters, and that person named Zhu Yanxiao.”","“Everyone had seen that Wang Xie had performed excellently in the previous matches; he can be called the Wind God!” The two casters began their discussion.","“Indeed. His minuscule control of winds and creative combat styles are bright spots in this competition!”","“Also, every master knows that the Swift Master class is very hard to handle for low-level opponents who can’t control it well,” Mu Donglai said, “Skills like Headwind and Twister are very good initiation attacks which cover a large area and can easily make opponents lose balance.”","“Now, we can see that the battle has begun! Wang Xie’s combat style is very aggressive!”","Gusts howled on the big screen. Under Wang Xie’s control, tornados and hurricanes danced like many fierce dragons.","“Contestant Zhu Yanxiao is very cautious, but he can’t continue this way!”","The two casters analyzed the match with great knowledge and experience.","The audience near Mr. Fang watched intently.","In the raucous cheers of ‘awesome’, ‘amazing’, and ‘unrivaled’, Mr. Fang felt the people near him jump up to their feet.","“Use Vortex Hurricane! Use Vortex Hurricane!”","“Wind Shadow Flash! This skill is good! Use this skill!” someone screamed.","The screams hurt Mr. Fang’s ears. “...”"]},{"number":558,"title":"Chapter 558 - The Rise of Black Light Grandmaster and the Fall of Six Masters (I)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Both parties are testing the waters on stage, and their attacks are not fierce!” Xiao Yulv said as he sat at the casters’ desk. “But it is obvious that Zhu Yanxiao is at the disadvantage and is still looking for a chance to attack!”","“It seems that Mr. Mu made precise predictions,” Xiao Yulv continued, “Everyone knows that Zhu Yanxiao is an ordinary player, and he is like a civilian compared to some high-level rich players.”","“By now, the masters among the ordinary players, such as the King of Rangers, Crazy Butcher, and Male Fighter Fu Jianghe, have done well in the matches, but the overall strength of these civilian players is still no match for that of the most powerful players.”","“Now, Zhu Yanxiao is one of the last few civilian warriors left in this competition and represents the last hope of all ordinary players. But it is a pity that he encountered Wang Xie, a super powerful opponent!” Xiao Yulv said, “Even though I hope that some ordinary players will stand out and obtain great rankings, we have to be practical.”","“You are right. Although to reach some balance, the competition has restricted the use of pink godly equipment over level 51, the gap still exists between the two groups.”","“Zhu Yanxiao is obviously at the disadvantage in terms of equipment,” Mu Donglai said with a nod, “We can see that Contestant Zhu Yanxiao has chosen this godly weapon which is a lightsabre. It is a pitch-black lightsabre which is what we call ‘Black Light.’”","“We don’t see any problem in his choice of equipment, but we heard that he had just acquired this Black Light not long ago, and he was still not too familiar with this new weapon in the previous matches,” Xiao Yulv continued, “Well, this will have a great impact on his performance in the competition...”","“Contestant Zhu Yanxiao is still looking for a chance to attack; he’s moving around his opponent on the outer range.”","“Hmph! This Grandmaster is not as strong as we expected.” The outlanders began to comment.","Carl said with a wine cup in his hand, “Indeed, compared with the great performance of one of the supreme masters, who is being called Wind God, this guy named Zhu Yanxiao is weak.”","“He’s scrambling around on the arena like a mouse; when will he stop running?” Kevin was getting a little impatient.","Mr. Fang said casually as his face lightly twitched, “Don’t say anything if you don’t understand, alright? After all, it’s not only a competition of skills but a mental game as well.”","“Ugh?” The outlanders looked at him contemptuously, thinking, You’re a low-level native; do you think you know more than us?","At this moment, a yell came from the casters’ desk, “Although Contestant Zhu Yanxiao has been evasive, Contestant Wang Xie still caught up with him!”","A sense of displeasure appeared in Jessica’s pale golden eyes, and she replied, “Shut up! We don’t need your opinion!”","Ugh!? What’s wrong with these people of the Ultimate West Realm?! Fang Qi thought to himself and toyed with the idea of finding their leaders and beating them so that they learn a lesson.","“As everyone knows, male mages can use Teleport. It’s puzzling that a male slayer is trying to run circles with a male mage. This strategy seems strange...” Xiao Yulv commented.","“It’s indeed not wise.”","Hearing the casters’ words, Jessica added, “Did you hear that? This combat strategy is not wise!”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","The moment Jessica said it, the two casters exclaimed, “Phantom Slash! Contestant Zhu Yanxiao turned back and is going to fight head-on!”","“It’s a suicidal attack! We can see that Contestant Zhu Yanxiao chose to attack at the risk of his life!”","On the big screen, Zhu Yanxiao created a curtain of horrifying sword shadows as if his sword was a phantom! The whole screen was filled with purple sword shadows!","“He missed! Contestant Wang Xie used his agile movement and moved out of his attack range! Phantom Slash missed!” Xiao Yulv yelled, “This is a big mistake. Contestant Wang Xie will take this opportunity to give his opponent a heavy blow!”","“Sure enough, Wang Xie had chanted the empowerment spells!”","“Ahh—!” The audience screamed, waiting for the thrilling moment!","The outlanders stood up again and shouted, “Vortex Hurricane! Use Vortex Hurricane!”","They all shrieked.","With a dark expression, Mr. Fang reminded them since he was feeling kind, “If he uses Vortex Hurricane at this moment, his opponent will instantly use Ultimate Slay: Tempest (the awakening skill of Grand Masters). He wouldn’t get any benefits from it.”","“Besides, Zhu Yanxiao is about to fight back...”","“Fight back? How can he fight back?” Jessica said contemptuously, “Don’t say things that you don’t understand...”","“Where’s Zhu Yanxiao?! What do we see?! Aerial Chain Slash!” They heard a yell, “Zhu Yanxiao used Phantom Slash as a diversion to block his opponent’s vision and sense of wind! Now that Aerial Chain Slash fell from the sky, it caught Wang Xie off guard! It hit!”","“Upward Slash, Secret Sword Art, and Gore Cross! Ahh! Contestant Wang Xie is caught in a close-range battle with a slayer!” Xiao Yulv howled, “Can Contestant Wang Xie get away from him?!”","“Backstep Cutter and then Secret Sword Art! Contestant Zhu Yanxiao didn’t want to knock his opponent into the air. Instead, he suppressed Wang Xie using combos with this method! My goodness! His attacks are so fast that Contestant Wang Xie was suppressed on the ground! He can do nothing but dodge! He can’t fight back!”","“Contestant Wang Xie is in danger! His HP is dropping continuously!”","“Wind Blaster! Contestant Wang Xie withstood one sword attack and took the opportunity to push away Contestant Zhu Yanxiao with Wind Blaster by force! Headwind! He’s fighting back! Contestant Wang Xie grabbed this chance and drew Zhu Yanxiao back toward him with great wind power!","“No! What’s Contestant Zhu Yanxiao doing?!” With an exclamation, the young man with the black lightsabre on the screen was drawn by the wind power and flew toward Wang Xie. At this moment, he stabbed his lightsabre forward with both hands on the handle!","“Fierce Strike? But he’s too far away to use this skill!”","Suddenly, the black lightsabre’s aura expanded, and it broke open the gust and stabbed toward Wang Xie with vicious force!","“It’s Thrust! My goodness! How could he think of using Thrust at this moment?!” After all, this skill wasn’t very useful, and few people thought of learning it...?","“Wang Xie’s counterattack was interrupted!” another exclamation sounded.","The audience was stunned as they watched the scene and this flash of sword energy.","If not for this event called an E-Sports competition, no one would witness such a thrilling performance!","“Charge Crash! He wins! Contestant Zhu Yanxiao actually won! How is this possible! Wang Xie hasn’t gotten the chance to use his best attack, Vortex Hurricane! How did he lose?!”"]},{"number":559,"title":"Chapter 559 - The Rise of Black Light Grandmaster and the Fall of Six Masters (II)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Many people in the audience couldn’t believe their eyes. After a moment of silence, louder cheers erupted.","Sitting near Mr. Fang, the outlanders exchanged a look and glanced at Mr. Fang as if he was an alien. “...”","“It was a wild guess that got you the correct answer, right?!”","Damn it! Even the casters had been wrong about the result; how come this ordinary person with low-level cultivation strength got the right result?!","On Seven Saint Mountain, the several Daoists sat together cross-legged, intently staring at the screen that the new communication jade projected.","It was a thrilling giant reversal of the situation! Even the old, peaceful Daoists were excited by the battle. “It’s a blessing for the cultivation world of the Spiritual State to have so many talented cultivators!”","Many civilians who were exploring the long path of warriors and cultivators were so thrilled that they felt like roaring in exhilaration. Their blood was boiling.","The young people watching the competition on the square in Nanhua Faction couldn’t close their mouths. “Even civilian warriors are so powerful... It’s true that no contestants in the E-Sports competition are weak...”","Their senior brothers told them, “Put more effort in your cultivation. When you are strong enough, you can be like them.”","“Yes! Senior Brother!” They were excited.","At this moment, all the cultivators and warriors watching from the stands stood up and yelled while gazing at the proud figure who was standing on the arena with the black lightsabre in his hand, “Black Light Grand Master! Black Light Grand Master!”","Perhaps even after many years, the audience members who watched this competition wouldn’t forget this place and this sword strike.","After this match, the first of the six supreme masters fell at the beginning of today’s competition. Wang Xie couldn’t even get out of the group stage, let alone becoming the champion.","The competition continued. After several matches, the second of the six supreme masters came out. He was Zhang Hao, the Vice Academy Master of the Heavenly Academy and Yue Bai’s master.","“Vice Academy Master Zhang’s class is Radiant Lion, the first awakening of male Nen masters. He can control the flow of air with the power of Nen.”","Mu Donglai said, “Right. He can use the extremely hard Nen Guard and indestructible Energy Shield. This class can attack like fire and defend like a mountain. Out of all classes that have various combat techniques, this class is equipped with the most comprehensive techniques.”","For the people in this world, they preferred to use the term ‘combat techniques’ rather than ‘skills.’","“His opponent is Fu Jianghe, a moderate ordinary player. His class is Dragon Fist, the first awakening of strikers. The match has begun!”","“Hey! Who do you think will win?” The lofty outlanders were unwilling to accept the loss since this ordinary person had guessed right last time when they got it wrong.","Jessica asked Fang Qi beside her with provocation in her eyes.","“I choose Vice Academy Master Zhang Hao!” On the screen, Fu Jianghe seemed to be at the disadvantage. Besides, Zhang Hao was one of the six supreme masters, which convinced Jessica that he would certainly be the winner.","Mr. Fang said, “I think Fu Jianghe is more likely to win.”","Stupid! Jessica was pleased as she thought, Natives are just natives.","Sitting in the audience stand, Mu Qing looked worried. “To prepare for the great war, Master had forced himself to learn the awakening skill and seemed to have encountered a problem in the process. I hope it won’t affect him...”","Yue Bai said, “I don’t suppose... it will...”","– Two minutes later –","“It’s finished! Vice Academy Master Zhang seems out of form today!”","“Contestant Fu Jianghe is fighting back! Contestant Zhang Hao can’t block him at all!”","“Ahh-! Contestant Fu Jianghe actually won!”","The two casters were dazed. Even Vice Academy Master Zhang had just lost?!","“Ahh-!” A scream sounded beside Mr. Fang. Jessica was frustrated and thought, How come it ended like this?","– One hour later –","“In the next match, we have the third candidate out of the six who has the highest potential to obtain the champion. Nalan Hongwu!”","“Let’s do it again!” The outlanders were not willing to accept defeat. “We choose Nalan Hongwu! Who do you choose?”","Mr. Fang’s face darkened. “I’ll choose the uncle-like male priest in black clothes on the other side.”","What is wrong with these people of the Ultimate West Realm? They had lost twice and still want to continue with this game.","– Three minutes later –","“Impossible!”","“Lost again?! How could it be?!”","The outlanders beside Fang Qi had the urge to kill someone.","How can we be so unlucky today?!","Jessica stared at Mr. Fang and said, “Again! Let’s do it again!”","Mr. Fang was impatient. “You lost three times now! I don’t want to do it anymore. I admit defeat, okay? You win!”","“No!”","Mr. Fang’s face twitched as he thought, Damn, this girl is unwilling to let it go! She’s insistent!","“How about this?” Jessica took out a beautiful golden rock from somewhere and said, “I bet you’ve never seen such a rock before, right?”","Seeing the puzzlement on Mr. Fang’s face which showed that he had never seen it before, Jessica said smugly, “This is a treasure that you, a little warrior, can’t understand. I will just tell you that this rock is priceless in this world! If you bet against us and win, this treasure is yours!”","“...” Mr. Fang looked at it and asked, “How come you people of the Ultimate West Realm are all so wealthy?”","Previously, Sia deposited two million crystals in one go. Now, these people took out this priceless treasure.","At this moment, Fang Qi heard a prompt from the System that had been silent lately, [A huge and pure source of energy is detected. The host can choose to acquire it.]","Resigned, Mr. Fang agreed and said, “Okay... you said that it’s a priceless treasure. Don’t fool me, okay? I hope you’re not lying!”","“Of course! Do we look like those types of people?” Carl said arrogantly on the side.","“The next match is Ms. Sprite versus Rosen Rain, a mistress.”","Ning Bi was facing a female priest who was covered in a black cloak.","“Now, I choose this Ms. Sprite. Tell us, who do you choose?”","“What choice do I have?” Mr. Fang said in disdain. “I choose Rosen Rain then.”","Smugly, Jessica turned her eyes to the match.","– Three minutes later –","“How come this Rosen Rain is so powerful?!” Xiao Yulv yelled, “I’ve never heard of this person before!”","“I seem to remember that she is the person who made the first Sky Outfit Set!” Mu Donglai said.","“She’s so powerful!”","“Finished!”","“Ah!” Before the two casters could howl, Jessica cried out beside Mr. Fang, “Impossible!”","“Can you give me that rock now?” Mr. Fang reached out his hand, looking harmless.","“No!” Jessica said, “Let’s bet again!”","“...” Mr. Fang’s face twitched as he said, “Forget it if you don’t want to honor the bet. Anyways, I don’t know you and can’t hold you to it.”","“What? I would never be dishonorable!” Jessica looked like a cat whose tail had been stepped on. “I said that let’s bet again!”","She dug out a black cloak from somewhere and said, “If you win, I’ll give you the rock and this Shadow Cloak. If you lose, this rock is still mine!”","“Jessica, maybe... it’s time to stop.” Carl, who was beside Jessica, was feeling unwell, and his face twitched.","“No! How can an honorable figure like me lose to this little figure?! This time, I choose Xuanyuan Changqing!” Again, she chose one of the ‘six supreme masters.’","– Three minutes later –","“Ahhhh...”","“This is the last bet! Winner takes all!” She took out a small, exquisite silver dagger.","“This time, I bet on Nalan Mingxue!” She saw that Nalan Mingxue’s opponent was just a loli who was about 12 years old.","After all, how could a noblesse lose to a loli?!","“You will bet on that little girl named Jiang Xiaoyue, how about that?!”","Mr. Fang spread his hands and said, “I don’t have another option. It’s settled then.”"]},{"number":560,"title":"Chapter 560 - The Immortal Has a Successor","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This...” Xiao Yulv didn’t know how to continue since five of the six supreme masters who Mr. Mu had picked had been defeated by this point.","If they were defeated while fighting for the championship, it would be acceptable. However, they didn’t even make it out of the group stage!","Xiao Yulv glanced at Mr. Mu who was sitting beside him and saw that the latter wasn’t feeling well.","Now, Nalan Mingxue was the only one left in the six supreme masters.","“Now, we’re watching the last match in the fourth group of the F1 World Championship in the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference. Nalan Mingxue versus Jiang Xiaoyue!” Xiao Yulv said, “Mr. Mu, do you have confidence in this contestant?”","“Of course, I have.” Mr. Mu forced himself to calm down and said, “We had some accidents earlier, but I’m very confident in my judgement.”","Loud cheers sounded from the audience stands in Qzone venue and the main venue.","“Champion of two contests!”","“Super genius!”","“New Snow will win her third championship!”","Hearing these types of cheers, Jessica who sat beside Mr. fang finally felt a bit more confident, and she thought, “It is a guaranteed win this time.”","Then, Xiao Yulv said, “In fact, Xiaoyue is quite cute. However, they are both our old friends, and we must be objective. Right, Mr. Mu?”","“Indeed,” Mr. Mu said, “Contestant Nalan Mingxue is impeccable both in experience and mindset. Comparatively, Xiaoyue is young and still lacks in these areas despite her great strength.”","“Mr. Mu, have you considered that Mr. Fang might have taught Xiaoyue some ultimate skills?” Xiao Yulv shook his head and asked.","Mu Donglai said, “Of course, I have considered that. However, Mr. Fang told us that he had never played the class of battle mage before, and he doesn’t have to lie to us about this.”","Xiao Yulv said, “What if... I mean what if you’re wrong again, Mr. Mu?”","“Then, I’m the poisonous milk!” Mu Donglai said firmly.","“Okay. Let’s return to the last match in the fourth group. The winner will advance to the next round to fight for the first three places!”","“What’s poisonous milk?” Sitting near Mr. Fang, the outlanders were bewildered.","“Hey! We asked you a question!”","Mr. Fang had no intention of talking to them.","“You-!”","Jessica had to enlist help from other people around her.","“You don’t know that?”","“Are you from some remote unknown place?”","“Which tribe of the Ultimate West Realm are you all from?”","“Pooh! Shame on you!”","The outlanders were all at a loss for words.","– Meanwhile, on the arena –","Nalan Mingxue said, “Xiaoyue, Big Sister is good to you, right? Can you go easy on me?”","“Pooh!” Jiang Xiaoyue stared at her and said angrily, “Boss told me not to believe a single word you say during the competition!”","“Um...” Nalan Mingxue’s face froze.","“Look at my skill!” Jiang Xiaoyue dashed forward like a lightning bolt.","“The match already began. We can see that Jiang Xiaoyue moved and used Sky Assault first with decisiveness! She didn’t give her opponent the chance to use Elemental Shift.”","“Contestant Nalan Mingxue is fighting with nimble moves. Once she gets close, her Crescent and Arcane Sword Blast will make it hard for her opponent to attack.”","Sword energies swept across the big screen and would have totally suppressed an ordinary opponent, not even giving the latter a chance to breath!","“In fact, it’s dangerous for Xiaoyue to transform now. If the noblesse uses Spacetime Cutter, she can’t escape with Phase Shift,” Xiao Yulv explained, “Even a Teana can’t block the explosive force of Spacetime Cutter.”","“But Nalan Mingxue must be careful with the use of Spacetime Cutter since it consumes lots of energy. If she misses, she will certainly lose to Teana Transformation!”","“Let’s see how Xiaoyue handles her opponent who uses a huge sword aggressively. Besides, her opponent’s protective energy (Super Armor) is too tough and impossible to break,” Xiao Yulv commented.","“This noblesse is really powerful...” Jessica watched the battle while eating a melon. Right now, Jiang Xiaoyue was obviously at the disadvantage; she was getting suppressed by Nalan Mingxue.","Mr. Fang glanced at Jessica without a word.","“What are you looking at?” She cast a contemptuous glance at him and continued to enjoy her melon.","Silently, Mr. Fang took out a bottle of iced red tea.","He dropped a few ice cubes in it and shook the bottle. Then, he drank it heartily.","Then, he took out a bag of potato chips from his storage space.","He used to eat from Jiang Xiaoyue’s bag. Today, he opened one bag himself while Jiang Xiaoyue was busy.","Crunch! Crunch...","Sipping iced red tea and crunching on the chips while watching the match, he enjoyed himself very much.","Eating 1,000-year-old spiritual melon and sipping spiritual wine on the side, Carl was at a loss for words.","This native is so brazen as to eat this garbage in front of our spiritual delicacies!","At this moment, one commentator yelled, “Crescent hit its target! Tossing Slash! My Goodness! Xiaoyue is in danger!”","“Phase Shift! Phase Shift was used! We can see Nalan Mingxue coming up with Swift Sword! Will she use Spacetime Cutter now?! Xiaoyue is in mortal danger!”","Mu Donglai said, “After the Phase Shift was lured out, Nalan Mingxue is about to win!”","Then, he laughed and said, “I told you that Nalan Mingxue has the potential to win the championship, right?”","Xiao Yulv nodded and said, “Yeah... Oh! My goodness!”","Suddenly, gasps sounded from the audience stands. In the instant when Nalan Mingxue dashed up, she was thrown up into the air! Then, a big saber with dragon patterns on it shot up like a dragon flying out from an abyss!","“Stabbing Wheel broke the Swift Sword?!” After all, Swift Sword was extremely fast. To break it, the opponent must be faster than it and have a superior reaction speed, let alone sharp judgment!","“Sky Assault, Magic Missile, and followed by Dragon Strike?!”","“How can she fight back at this stage?!” Jessica felt like killing someone. Thinking that she would lose great treasures to the native sitting next to her, she had the urge to dash out and fight in person!","“How?!” Mu Donglai howled, “Don’t do this to me! One of you must win and come out of the group stage!”","“Finished. Nalan Mingxue was clearly careless.”","“Ahh-! Nalan Mingxue is fighting back! It was just a careless mistake! Her strength is undoubtedly great!”","“Flash that combined three strikes into one! Wave Sword! Her opponent got hit once! Nalan Mingxue charged without hesitation and used Ascent! Although her HP is low, Nalan Mingxue has found a good rhythm in her counterstrikes! We can see that Jiang Xiaoyue has lost the ability to fight back!” Mr. Mu and Xiao Yulv yelled in excitement and almost hugged each other.","“She’s going to win! She is winning this match. Jiang Xiaoyue’s HP is very low now, but Nalan Mingxue’s sword isn’t stopping, forcing her opponent into a corner. Spacetime Cutter! She used Spacetime Cutter! She will win!” Finally, one of the six supreme masters who Mr. Mu pointed out earlier gave them the hope of winning a match!","Forgetting to eat her melon, Jessica exclaimed on the stop, “I win! I win this time!”","Obviously, Jiang Xiaoyue would surely lose if she were touched by Spacetime Cutter.","The horrifying strike shattered the space, leaving terrifying sword marks in the space of the arena one after another.","Even the outlanders gasped at this and thought, “Such a horrifying sword technique!”","Its horrifying power shattered the space!","At this moment, another terrifying force just as powerful spread out!","“How come Xiaoyue is intact?!”","“My goodness! She used the tremendous magic power during Teana Transformation to block several sword strikes!”","When the space was shattered, the Teana was severely wounded but didn’t collapse!","“Arcane Sword Blast! Nalan Mingxue struck again! The Teana Transformation will be broken without a doubt!” A huge, horrifying spiritual sword hacked down from the sky, turning into many sword energies before exploding and making a ton of noises. The Teana who was severely injured got instantly enveloped by the overwhelming power!","“She won?!”","In the explosions of sword energies, a golden bolt of saber energy flashed by!","When the dust settled, they both lay on the ground.","“Who won?!” Mr. Mu was impatient. “Nalan Mingxue, you must win! I can’t take the bad reputation of poisonous milk!”","Jessica almost jumped up from her seat.","“Let’s watch the replay! Watch the replay!” Xiao Yulv said immediately.","In the slow replay, they saw that Xiaoyue’s Full Swing hit Nalan Mingxue first. Then, after Nalan Mingxue fell to the ground, Arcane Sword Blast hit Jiang Xiaoyue on the second strike.","Jiang Xiaoyue won the match by a very narrow margin!","“Ahh!” Jessica was about to go crazy!","Obviously, they didn’t understand the power of poisonous milk in an E-Sports competition.","“It seems like Xudong Immortal has a great successor...” Mr. Fang murmured to himself.","[TL Note: Xudong Huang was a sports caster in China. He got famous in his early years of casting soccer matches, and he later casted E-Sports matches such as League of Legends. He is famous for predicting a victor and the opposite team winning.]","From this day on, everyone remembered the six supreme-tier masters who were killed by poisonous milk in the E-Sports competition."]},{"number":561,"title":"Chapter 561 - The end of the F1 World Championship and the Contestant Interview","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What are you mumbling about?!” Jessica glared at the ordinary guy who was still crunching potato chips calmly.","“!!!” She was furious and thought, How come this native can remain calm at this moment? Do you really have no idea who is standing in front of you?","The truth was that Mr. Fang didn’t know. He had thought that they were people of the Ultimate West Realm.","Jessica was so angry that she had the urge to reveal her true identity to shock this damn native.","Clearly, she suppressed this urge and didn’t do that.","“What were you mumbling about?!” These outlanders stared at Mr. Fang suspiciously, and they even suspected that Mr. Fang might have played some tricks to win all the bets.","How come we lost all the bets? It seems like a strange power is working against us. Did this kid manipulate the results?!","It doesn’t seem likely since he is only an ordinary person.","“This...” Mr. Fang explained, “I say, you guys really don’t know what E-Sports poisonous milk is? I suppose you don’t know who Xudong Immortal is?”","“What is E-Sports poisonous milk?! Who is Xudong Immortal?!” They looked at Mr. Fang in bewilderment.","“Um...” Mr. Fang said, “Maybe I’ll tell you the story about him?”","Then, he told them a story from the ancient oriental world.","When they heard the part of the story where Xudong Immortal said, ‘How can he lose with so many Mutalisks on his opponent’s face?’ the outlanders looked at Fang Qi incredulously with widened eyes.","“You mean the powerful TooDming Emperor led a huge army of flying-dragon-like creatures to his enemy’s base, but they got crushed because of a few words from this Xudong Immortal?!”","[TL Note: On June 3rd, 2014, TooDming played against Alicia in Group F of WCS America Ro32. In the third game, which was match point, Alicia made an early mistake and fell into a big disadvantage. During that time, Xudong Huang was casting, and he said that there was no way that TooDming was going to lose this. And then TooDming lost with the big advantage. This later turned into a meme in China.]","“Of course...” Mr. Fang imitated Xudong’s words and said, “Damn it! I’m a professional caster, alright? How could a professional caster not understand this situation...”","“Hahahaha...” Jessica laughed so hard that she almost fell to the ground and hammered the floor with her fists. The others tried hard to suppress their laughter and said, “This Xudong Immortal can be so hilarious at times.”","While listening to the secret story of the ‘immortal’, they watched the StarCraft competition.","“Are they above the void?!”","“So powerful! These people can mass produce such powerful battlecruisers and carriers?!”","“This is called airdrop psionic lightning matrix?!” They stared at the screen as a wave of horrifying lightning nets sweeped across the battlefield like a storm. The armies in neat formations from different races and different planets in the universe battled each other at full force under the fast and precise commands of contestants.","Such epic-scale battles stunned the audience every time!","After his failure in the prediction of the Dungeon Fighter Online competition, Mr. Mu was cautious with the StarCraft competition and made modest comments; he didn’t repeat his mistake.","Since the two people who had defeated Nalan Hongwu and Ning Bi respectively were in the same group, only one of them advanced to the next round. The first place of the first group was Grand Master Zhu Yanxiao, and the first place of the fourth group was Jiang Xiaoyue. Surprisingly, the fourth contestant who made it out of groups was...","In the Half City Shop, a mass of black mist put down its virtual reality headset and laughed. “Hahahhaha! I’m unrivaled! This time, I’ll win first place!”","On the screen, there was a berserker who held a slim long saber.","“My hellbringer is unrivaled in the world!”","“Unbelievable! The Smirk Face Emoji wants to be the champion!” Ning Bi, who had lost to an unknown female priest, looked at this mass of black mist in contempt.","“Get out of here! Little Demonic Woman Xue Bi, you lost to an unknown player. Just watch how Granddaddy wins the first place!”","In the StarCraft competition, the players who made it out of groups included Old Academy Master Gu Tingyun of the Heavenly Academy, the Xichi Spiritual Master of the Nanhua Faction, Tang Family Master Tang Huan of the Spiritual State, and the fourth was Li Haoran, the only player from the younger generation. He had advanced to the next round with a narrow margin. After all, some senior masters didn’t have a lot of time to spend playing the game.","In StarCraft, the players acted as ordinary commanders whose strategies and tactics came almost entirely from the experience, intelligence, and adaptability of the players themselves. In this area, the more senior masters had obvious advantages.","-In the backstage of the arena-","Two figures covered by black cloaks were whispering to each other.","“Thank you for giving the opportunity to me.”","“You must win first place!”","“I will!” The figure hidden in the black robe clenched her fists.","“Rosen Rain! The match is about to begin!","“Ah...! Coming!” She raced out.","“...”","...","In this competition, the Female Priest Rosen Rain was a big black horse. In the first match of the elimination round, she and the Smirk Face Emoji engaged in an astonishing battle. Both parties dazzled the audience with their great control of combat rhythm and details.","Finally, Rosen Rain won the match with a narrow margin, and she would enter the final match with the Black Light Grand Master who had narrowly won against Jiang Xiaoyue.","Soon, the match for the third place began.","“We can see that Demon God Almighty is in a poor form, but he still has some advantage over Xiaoyue.”","“Aw! Is this Xiaoyue?! She’s so sly and cunning! So dirty! She’s using Magic Missile and aiming for her opponent’s weaknesses! In this match, Xiaoyue is very specific with her moves!”","“This specific combat style of aiming for weakness looks like New Snow’s tactics! She has studied her opponent very well!”","“In the last match, Demon God Almighty exposed all of his trump cards! Besides, he’s in a poor form. He’s finished! He has understood her tactics and swiftly changed his methods, but it’s too late!”","“Xiaoyue wins!”","“Ahh-!” In the Half City Shop, a mass of black mist slammed its fists on the desk quickly and repeatedly.","Now, it was time for the final match.","“We can see that they have totally different combat methods, Obviously, Black Light Grand Master’s sword techniques are very fitting for his class.”","“Yeah. This contestant has achieved a big improvement!” Mu Donglai said, “I can tell that this contestant has grown a lot during the competition.”","“However, Rosen Rain has perfect control of the details! Even though Black Light Grand Master doesn’t want to compete with Rosen Rain in terms of details and has tried to fight with tactics, he is being forced to back off by his opponent!”","“Even though the battle with Demon God Almighty consumed a lot of Rosen Rain’s energy, we can see that she has no problem suppressing Black Light Grand Master in a steady fashion!”","“Black Light Grand Master continues to consume his opponent with his unique and sly style, but...” Xiao Yulv exclaimed, “It’s useless! Obviously, Rosen Rain has seen through his strategy and remained steady in each attack! She is consuming his energy as well! Her mindset is really good and stable!”","“Black Light Grand Master must do something at this point...”","“Ultimate Slay: Tempest! My goodness! Black Light Grand Master found a gap in his opponent’s movements and used Tempest!”","“Ahh–! Scud the Wrathful Demon! Scythe Massacre! We can see that Rosen Rain has transformed into a demon and used the great demonic power to block Tempest!” Xiao Yulv yelled, “My goodness! She blocked it! But her HP is low! Can Black Light Grand Master use one more strike?! Guillotine! It’s finished! He’s hooked by Rosen Rain’s Guillotine! He lost...!”","“Let’s congratulate Rosen Rain! The biggest black horse of this competition! Congratulations!”","Loud, wave-like cheers erupted on the platform and the audience stands. The whole place turned into an ocean of cheers.","The pair of eyes hidden under the cloak gazed at the magnificent sight on and off the stage as she thought, “It’s been so long since I saw such a gala...”","She was a little touched.","Congratulations to our second-place contestant, Black Light Grand Master Zhu Yanxiao, and our third-place contestant, Jiang Xiaoyue! Now, please come up to the platform, and our two hosts will present the awards to the Super Kings!”","“Then, let’s ask our champion a question.” Mu Donglai walked up before the ceremony began. “On behalf of the shop owner, we risk being rude and want to ask Rosen Rain a question. What’s on your mind right now?”","“Um... I’m elated. I didn’t expect to encounter so many powerful opponents; I almost lost in some matches.”","“Is it your first time entering such a competition, Rosen Rain?”","“I attended similar competitions... held in the faction.” This woman had a smug smile on her face. “I won the first place back then, but the competition wasn’t as big as this one.”","“Do you miss that time?”","“Maybe... It was so long ago.”","“Okay. Now, let’s turn the microphone to Contestant Zhu Yanxiao.”","Mu Donglai asked, “Black Light Grand Master, did you ever imagine that you would come this far?”","This young warrior looked a bit dull, totally different from the nimble player in the game. “No. Before I came, I thought of only slashing down as many opponents as I could. Then, I slashed my way up to this place.”"]},{"number":562,"title":"Chapter 562 - Threatening Mr. Fang?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“During the competition, we noticed a very interesting detail, and it’s something Gongzi Xiao and I wished to ask while we were casting,” Mu Donglai said, “level 58! Our Contestant Zhu Yanxiao hasn’t reached the top level (In the system version, the top level was level 60. The higher levels weren’t open to the players yet)! I’m afraid that he’s the only one who hasn’t reached the top level among the contestants who entered the group stage!”","“Ah?”","“F*ck?!”","“I didn’t notice it...”","Exclamations came from the audience.","Mu Donglai asked, “Can you tell me why this is the case?”","Zhu Yanxiao said with a somewhat dull expression, “I didn’t have money to buy equipment back then. Besides, I had to move bricks and practice combat skills in the dojo everyday. Therefore, I didn’t have time to reach the top level.”","“Although the competition doesn’t allow the contestants to wear godly equipment above level 51, and thus not reaching the top level has little impact on your competition. But still...”","“What’s the top level?” Carl, who sat beside Mr. Fang, asked in a low voice.","“Is it equivalent to the pinnacle stage in a certain level?” Jessica exclaimed, “Does it mean that Zhu Yanxiao defeated opponents of higher levels?!”","“He’s a respectable master!” Kevin said.","“Then, what does ‘moving bricks’ mean...?” Jessica asked in bafflement.","[TL Note: Moving bricks is a Chinese internet slang for doing work. It comes from the fact that most workers in construction moved bricks.]","“It means cultivation!” Mr. Fang’s face twitched.","“Oh...”","“Then... let’s congratulate these three contestants again!” Mu Donglai turned around and said, “Please present the prizes to the top three players!”","“Hey! Why didn’t you interview me?!” Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot in anger.","After Gu Tingyun won the champion in the StarCraft competition, the No.1 World-Wide Martial Dao Conference finally came to an end.","The outlanders seemed reluctant to leave and were longing for more.","The magnificent star wars, the exciting pinnacle battles...","These people hadn’t imagined that they would come here and witness such thrilling and exciting scenes and moments.","They still remembered the unbelievable counterstrike of the King of Rangers, the astonishing slash of the Black Light Grand Master, the black horse Rosen Rain, and the stunning interstellar wars.","These people had thought that these people were ignorant natives, but now...","Jessica said, “I somehow feel like something isn’t right...”","Kevin replied, “I have the same feeling...”","Carl questioned, “Are they really so strong?”","Their voices were restricted in a very small area and wouldn’t be overheard by others.","Jessica looked dubious. “These battles were excellent, but we can’t be fooled by them, right?!”","Indeed, despite the fascination, her sharp intuition told her that many things were strange, and many places were doubtful.","At this moment, they saw the ordinary person who was wearing sunglasses sipping iced red tea with enjoyment.","A dangerous presence seemed to permeate the air.","These outlanders were not morons. Although they had been stunned by the opening cinematics and the battles in the competitions, they felt like something wasn’t right as they watched more as time past.","“We are brave warriors of the Godly Palace...” A cold sneer appeared on Jessica’s face.","“We won’t be fooled like this!” Carl snickered.","[Beep!]","At this moment, Mr. Fang heard a system prompt:","[New Task: The Path of E-Sports (Completed)","Task Description: Hold an official E-sports competition. StarCraft and Dungeon Fighter Online will launch the Ladder Tournament and Division Mode, and the top 64 are eligible to enter this competition","Task Reward: Game Cultivation Room (3 day), godly weapon fragment (1 piece), Fortune Competition Gift Box (Can randomly draw multiple competition game items)]","[Do you want to claim the rewards?]","“Yes.”","Mr. Fang intently stared at the interface, wanting to see what he would get.","[Do you want to open Fortune Competition Gift Box?]","Mr. Fang was really excited. “Yes!”","[You obtained Evil Sword Apophis...]","[You got the right to summon Kalla of Dark Flame.]","[ +4% synchronization with game character Soul Reaper (1st awakening of Soul Bender).]","[You got the right to summon Ice Saya.]","[ +3% synchronization with game character Soul Reaper.]","[You got the right to summon Afterimage of Keiga.]","[ +3% synchronization with game character Soul Reaper.]","[You got...]","Before Fang Qi could see the rest, he shivered subconciously.","Nearby, Jessica’s face turned even colder. “These natives! We must have been fooled by these natives!”","Crack!","Carl’s face turned cold as well, and the wine cup in his hand was shattered by his fingers.","“Dame it...” Jessica was about to say something when she heard a voice sounding by her.","“Have you forgotten to give me the treasures for losing the bet?”","“???” The three people instantly turned their cold eyes toward him.","This guy even dared to ask for the treasures from the bets?","Doesn’t he know how to write the word – death?","“What? You guys want to slip away without honoring your bets?”","“You-!” They were so furious that they were at a loss for words. Their faces almost became distorted under anger.","“Since you want them so much, come with me.” With a snort, Jessica left the competition venue.","“Hmph!” Carl left as well.","“What’s going on? I’ve got to go with you to get what I won?” Mr. Fang scratched his head and followed.","Soon, the three people led Mr. Fang out of Yuanyang City.","They came into a remote pine forest on a cliff outside Yuanyang City.","Clearly, they were some distance away from the city, and they could do anything they wanted without attracting undue attention.","“Shall we...” Carl made a gesture by crossing his finger on his neck.","“It’s not necessary!” Jessica smiled seductively. “I laughed so hard today that I could barely stand; this hadn’t happened in a long time. I’m in a good mood today, so this little native is lucky that I will let him live.”","“We can bring him back and train him. Hahahaha!”","Kevin said, “Right. I think we can first let this damn low-level native know our true identity!”","After all, they had felt so humiliated pretending to be people of the Ultimate West Realm. They had been despised by many people, and this ordinary King Warrior even dared to ignore them.","At this moment, Fang Qi felt baffled and was about to ask them.","Then, as if they had finished discussing, the three people turned around, and a wicked smile appeared on Jessica’s face. Then, two golden spiritual patterns appeared on her forehead, looking mystical and mysterious.","Jessica’s aura suddenly changed as well. If she was like a beauty of the Ultimate West Realm before, she was now a blonde snake beauty.","Her slim fingers caressed Fang Qi’s face as she asked, “Do you know who we are? Hahaha...”","These three people’s presences suddenly rose; it felt like a huge mountain was standing before Fang Qi!","With dazzling golden patterns shining on their foreheads, the three stood before Fang Qi like three holy existences!","Mr. Fang’s face froze.","This...!!??","How come you guys are so f*cking powerful?!","Are you still the three natives of the Ultimate West Realm who screamed at the matches beside me?!","Seeing Fang Qi’s stunned expression, Jessica was very satisfied.","“Although I intend to let you live, we can’t forgive you for making us feel so frustrated! We aren’t planning to forgive you for your sins!”","“You dared to fool us. Do you still dare to ask for the rewards of the bets?” Jessica laughed hysterically with a small silver dagger in her hand. “Should I call you ignorant or audacious? Do you know what’s this in my hand? Its Kala, the Blade of Curses. Each slash...”","Before she could finish, Mr. Fang suddenly took out a huge dark-purple evil-looking sword – Evil Sword Apophis!","The three people looked at the sword that Fang Qi took out from thin air in astonishment. “!!??”"]},{"number":563,"title":"Chapter 563 - I’m the Best! No! I’m Even Better!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Evil Sword Apophis was a huge dark-purple sword engulfed in blazing evil flames that looked like tentacles. The blade and handle added together was taller than one person, and it had a vertical evil eye in the sword body. This huge, sharp blade could shock people into submission with only its appearance.","This sword was extremely dangerous since it possessed a human’s awareness and could control humans’ and monsters’ minds. In fact, it could even swallow the user’s soul!","The moment this sword came out, the outlanders felt a gloomy gust sweeping toward their faces.","“This kid has hidden strength?!” The aura emitting from the sword grew stronger as if a seal was being slowly removed from a demon.","“Hahahaha!” The outlanders laughed hysterically while their auras grew higher. “Does he think that he’s the only one who has hidden strength!”","“I’m afraid that this native still doesn’t understand this situation, right?” Carl snickered. Although they had all pretended to be pigs that could eat tigers...","The three outlanders sneered in their minds and thought, This person doesn’t know that we are actually prehistoric beasts who are acting weak!","In contrast, this young man in front of us is at most a wolf who is pretending to be a pig!","This is hilarious!","The silver Blade of Curses in Jessica’s hand shined with a decaying, gray color, as if everything it touched would wither due to its power.","The moment the dagger-like short saber was unsheathed, a tremendous amount of decaying energy appeared. As the death energy spread in the area, all the plants withered.","Moving so fast as if she was teleportating, Jessica appeared behind Fang Qi silently in the blink of an eye. While placing the blade on Fang Qi’s neck, she said, “Little Brother, don’t move. Otherwise, you’ll end up like the plants in the area if my hand shakes a little!”","Jessica didn’t open her mouth, but her voice somehow appeared in Fang Qi’s mind. She didn’t speak using the language of the Spiritual State, but strangely, Fang Qi could clearly understand her.","“Such a dangerous weapon. Let me keep an eye on it for you. Hehehehe...” With a series of wicked and arrogant giggles, a sickly pale and slim finger reached out and touched the evil sword’s handle.","At this moment, Jessica sensed that a tremendous amount of horrifying negative emotions swept toward her like surging waves.","“What’s this?!” Jessica quickly pulled back her hand as if she got electrocuted. Meanwhile, the outlanders widened their eyes and looked before them since the ordinary-looking young man had disappeared. In his place was a gloomy, black-clothed young man with the evil sword in hand, surrounded by chilly and gloomy demons. He was a soul reaper!","Fang Qi waved his left hand, and endless black shadows rotated around him like hurricanes – Afterimage of Keiga.","“Rebuild you soul and fight for me!”","Then, a skeleton hidden in the intense black mist spread out from behind Fang Qi like a huge black bone wing – Kalla of Dark Flame!","The thick black mist that seemed to come from Hell engulfed Fang Qi while pitch-black hell flames slowly appeared on the huge dark-purple evil sword!","Fang Qi waved his hand, and a dark-red demon shadow floated in the air. This streak of dark-red energy continued to increase the demonic power in Fang Qi’s body – Kazan.","On the Arad continent, some existences had more intelligence than humans and became gods; these creatures were called demons.","According to legends, Kalla had been a messenger of the Death God, the most mysterious existence on Arad. Kalla could summon the black hellfire on his body, and this fire could burn everything in the universe into nothingness. Later, it was summoned out by the great Zieg in the name of the Death God.","As for Kazan, not much explanation was needed. The blood-colored demonic hand on all males slayers came from it.","When the vague shadows of the demons were summoned out one after another, the horrifying presences overlapped, turning the whole mountain into a Hellscape with gloomy winds and ghostly shadows appearing everywhere!","The outlanders were stunned as they looked at the horrifying scenes and demons, and they thought of something even more frightening. If one could control two demons, this person could open the seal and summon the legendary Ghost 7: Furious Blache!","That was the truly terrifying existence!","If these outlanders hadn’t watched the E-Sports competition, they wouldn’t have known the horrifying power of the masters who had awakened. But now, they had watched the competition for two whole days!","At this moment, the young man who had summoned the demons said, “Ugh? You guys have hidden your strengths as well? I thought I was the only one doing it.”","“!!??”","The outlanders felt like their minds had turned blank.","Before, you were only an ordinary King Warrior, and we were warriors of the distant Ultimate West Realm. We were both like sheep and got along well.","However, while we were half way through showing our identity as wolves to shock this ‘ordinary person’, you are telling us that you have hidden your strength as well? What’s more, you pulled off your sheep skin and showed that you are a prehistoric monster?","“Are you... a soul reaper?!” Carl yelled; he finally recognized this person!","The ‘ordinary person’ in front of them was a soul reaper who could summon horrifying demons!","“Impossible!” Jessica thought that she was going crazy!","To judge if a soul bender had awakened, the easiest way was to see if he were surrounded by a horrifying force, which was the passive skill, Fear of Darkness. Since these people felt the terrifying presence that existed around them, they knew that this man was indeed an awakened soul reaper instead of an ordinary soul bender.","“Ahh-!” They screamed silently.","Impossible! How can you be a soul reaper?! These people felt like their worldview got flipped upside down.","They had thought hard after finding things to be fishy and came to the conclusion that the ‘masters’ in the E-Sports competition were only powerful in a virtual world which looked extremely similar to the real world. That was why they were powerful.","They thought that it was a small world in a relic from the ancient times. After all, the natives of this world couldn’t have created such a thing.","But now, the thing that they were certain was fake now stood in front of them!","Also, this soul reaper was extremely powerful.","These people even had this thought, Are those other things that we deemed ‘fake’ going to suddenly appear in front of us like this?","We actually said that we want to show our identity in front of him and stun him, making him feel stupid?","Damn! But now, we are the ones scared witless!"]},{"number":564,"title":"Chapter 564 - The New Janitors of the Shop","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Should they fight or just flee?!","These three outlanders had never encountered such a situation before. They regretted their decision of trying to kidnap this young man.","At this moment, Mr. Fang said, “Did you say something about identity? Tell me your identity so that I can see if it’s really that shocking.”","While he spoke, Mr. Fang summoned Ice Saya and Hazy-Eyed Bremen, turning the whole space into a realm of ice.","The ice sealed the ground and even froze the air.","While the power of demons was summoned, two factors decided the strength of this power. One was the summoner’s skill level, and the other was the empowerment coming from the equipment. For example, Evil Sword Apophis had great demonic power and could increase the strength of all the spiritual spells and sword techniques of a slayer by multiple folds.","Besides, Alvin the Ancient Ring on Fang Qi’s finger was a powerful magic item as well.","Right now, Fang Qi’s skills had reached the highest level that could be acquired through learning and training.","Almost instantly, the outlanders felt as if the whole world had been plunged into a hell of ice!","Like ducks whose necks were clenched, they opened their mouths to scream but couldn’t let out a sound.","The scariest thing was that they felt as if something extremely horrifying was moving behind the space.","“Will he really summon Ghost 7: Furious Blache!?”","“Run! Run now!”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","If they fought with their full force and gave everything that they got, Fang Qi probably couldn’t defeat them without summoning Ghost 7: Furious Blache.","Since these three people were so afraid of Ghost 7: Furious Blache, that they thought was hidden in the darkness, they were distracted and exposed many weaknesses.","In the ghost array, hellfire shot up!","Ten seconds later, the three people lay on the ground, completely scorched.","Satisfied, Mr. Fang put away the evil sword and gazed at them. “I’m in a good mood today, so you three from the Ultimate West Realm are lucky that I will let you live. From the looks of it, you guys are probably princes and princesses or sons and daughters of noble families. For the sake of Luo Piaoling and his people of the Ultimate West Realm, I won’t kill you.”","“However,” Fang Qi said after a moment of consideration, “I’ll need to bring you back to train you properly for being bold enough to try to beat me.”","Jessica’s face turned green and thought, Aren’t those my lines?","Also, what do you mean by people of the Ultimate West Realm?!","We’re...","“Oh... Right! We’re people of the Ultimate West Realm!” With tears on their faces, they said nothing about Heaven-Hiding Palace.","Mr. Fang looked puzzled. I already know that you are from the Ultimate West Realm. Why are you emphasizing it again?","Since he was too lazy to dwell on this thought, Mr. Fang brought these captives back to his shop.","At this moment, most of the players had just come into the shop after watching the competition.","The contestants had also come down from the designated competition venue on the second floor.","At this moment, they saw Mr. Fang coming back with three flying swords following him. On each sword was a person who got completely tied up.","“???”","Curious, the customers all walked up and watched either with bowls of instant noodles or bottles of Coke in their hands.","The outlanders who were tied onto the swords were embarrassed, and their faces turned dark-purple.","Ahh-!” How could he treat us like this?!","They shivered in rage.","[Beep! Detected potentially dangerous bewitching spiritual seals in the new employees. Do you choose to erase the seals?]","Upon entering the shop, Mr. Fang heard a prompt from the System.","“Ugh? What are these things...?” Mr. Fang studied the captives with squinted eyes. In fact, he had noticed the unusualness and strangeness about these so-called people of the Ultimate West Realm, but he didn’t point it out.","But... they actually have so-called spiritual seals inside their bodies? That doesn’t sound like good things.","“Erase,” Fang Qi said.","“Ahh!” With a series of screams, the three people dropped to the floor and went unconscious as if a lightning bolt had struck the depths of their minds.","“It’s okay! Nothing to see here!” Mr. Fang said in a loud voice, “These hooligans dared to try to beat me, the shop owner! To compensate for the emotional damages they caused me, they will be working here and will probably be in charge of cleaning!”","“So, they are the new employees that the shop owner recruited?”","“Janitors?”","On the morning of the next day, Jessica woke up and found herself sleeping on a strange bed.","Her burned clothes were replaced by a white pajama robe. (Of course, Li Xin’er helped her with the changing.)","She felt dizzy as if someone had hit her on the back of her head.","While rubbing her groggy eyes, she walked to the mirror.","She felt like something was missing. The two golden patterns on her forehead had disappeared.","“Ahh! My spiritual patterns!”","Her face paled. “Where are my patterns lines that I got with hard cultivation?!”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","At this moment, a series of urgent knocking sounded from the door. “It’s late! Are you still sleeping?! Get up and clean the shop!”","“Jessica, here! Clean this spot! What’s wrong with you? Don’t you know how to clean?”","“Carl! You sweep this spot! The shop must not have a single dust particle!”","The three glared at Mr. Fang with murderous spirit in their eyes.","At this moment, Mr. Fang took out a dark-purple evil sword from somewhere.","“I’ll sweep that spot!”","“I’ll clean the windows!”","“I’ll... Hey! Wait for me!”","The three ran away to do the cleaning immediately.","On this day, they began their new lives in the small shop in this place that they called the land of the natives.","The janitor girl with long golden curls, wearing the employee uniform, and sweeping the floor with a broom was Jessica.","The elegant, handsome, blond young man cleaning the shop with a broom as well was Janitor Kevin.","“I must escape! I’ll escape tonight!” The sullen young man who had mixed racial features and was cleaning was Carl. Of course, he didn’t know that the shop closed during the night.","He could never break open the door even if he tried for his entire life and the next.","...","The sky above the Heavenly Abyss Sea was as clear as sapphire stone after the cleansing of heavy rain.","On the bright blue ocean, the wind pushed up the waves while dark lightning bolts occasionally flashed over them.","That huge palace was still floating on the ocean surface all by itself.","The huge crack had disappeared. This huge palace, that looked like an aircraft or a flying fortress, had completely come out of the crack.","“War Knight Legion is ready.”","“Golden Mage Legion is ready.”","“Mr. White-robe Missionary,” a subordinate kneeled on one knee.","In the palace, a middle-aged subordinate who was wearing a pure-white robe and a square hat looked into the distance with bafflement. “Strange... The lords went to watch the E-Sports competition. I wonder why they haven’t sent back a single message after being gone for so long!”"]},{"number":565,"title":"Chapter 565 - Amazing Prizes","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– On the other hand, on the stage after the finals –","After Mr. Fang left the venue, the event had come to the prize distribution time.","The first three places of the Dungeon Fighter Online competition were Rosen Rain, Zhu Yanxiao, and Jiang Xiaoyue.","The first three places of the StarCraft competition were Gu Tingyun, Li Haoran, and the Xichi Spiritual Master.","With a microphone in her hand, Demonic Woman Ning Bi said, “Guys, the thrilling moment is not over yet! Do you want to see what’s inside the treasure chests that these top players have gotten?”","“Yes!”","“Quick! Open them now!”","At this moment, the woman who was wearing a black cloak carried an exquisite chest and a delicate parchment scroll engulfed in a series of mystical magic energy fluctuations.","She also had an exquisite golden trophy engraved with the words, [Rosen Rain, the Champion of the 1st F1 World Championship]","She was quite excited, wondering what treasures were inside the treasure chest!","“Now, let’s witness the opening of the treasure chests! How about that?”","Jiang Xiaoyue said eagerly, “I’ll open it! I’ll open it!”","While glancing at her palm-sized small treasure chest and then at the big one in Rosen Rain’s hands, she mumbled in displeasure, “My chest is so small!”","When she opened the small treasure chest, a bag bigger than her head jumped out.","“Contestant Xiaoyue opened her treasure chest and got – a bag of potato chips!” Ning Bi declared.","“Yaa!” Jiang Xiaoyue almost jumped up in rage. “How come there is only a bag of potato chips?!”","“Let’s congratulate Contestant Xiaoyue!”","Jiang Xiaoyue felt like crying. She quickly dug her hand into the small chest, trying to see if there were anything else in it.","“Ahh-! There’s one more thing!” Suddenly, Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed when she saw something glittering in the chest.","It was a glittering card.","[Inheritance Item Trading Token: You can use this token to trade for a real-life mimic of an inheritance-level game item in Dungeon Fighter Online. This token is attached to the owner and can’t be transferred to another person. This token expires in 30 days.]","“Congratulations to Contestant Xiaoyue for getting an inheritance item trading token!”","“Can it trade for a real item?!”","“A mimic?! Can it trade for an inheritance weapon?”","The venue erupted in excitement.","Jiang Xiaoyue examined the card happily and almost hugged it.","She was so happy!","“Let’s see what great treasures are in Zhu Yanxiao’s treasure chest!” Ning Bi handed the microphone to the dull-looking young warrior and asked, “Zhu Yanxiao, do you have anything that you want to get?”","“Well,” The young warrior said, “Everyone calls me Black Light Grand Master. But the truth is that I’m not a grand master and don’t have the Black Light. I borrowed the Black Light for the competition and will have to return it after using.”","Kind chuckles sounded from the audience.","“If possible, I hope to get a Black Light at the end of the day, even if it is only in the game,” Zhu Yanxiao said.","“Okay! Let’s see what’s in Contestant Zhu Yanxiao’s chest!”","The chest opened and revealed a small dark-golden ring and a card.","On it was a line of tiny words. [A man’s fury can defeat a great army. This ring’s power is greater than you think...]","“Congratulations to Zhu Yanxiao for getting a bone ring and an inheritance item trading token.”","“F*ck?!”","“My goodness!”","“A real bone ring?!”","“Awesome! A blade master equipped with a bone ring is unrivaled!”","The audience members who were watching this looked at him with envy in their eyes.","While carrying the chest, the contestant looked very emotional. While holding an advancement contract, he looked at the cheering audience and said, “A big thank you to the shop owner and everyone! Thank you so much! Thank you!”","From this moment on, this previously unknown civilian warrior would embark on a path that he had never dared to imagine.","“Then, our champion Rosen Rain is next!” Ning Bi said, “We have seen that she is the most powerful contestant and well deserves the honorable title of the champion! Let’s see what prizes she will get!”","The chest opened and revealed a strangely-shaped but exquisite necklace.","“This is...?”","“Soul Chaser! It’s Soul Chaser!” Ning Bi exclaimed, “The most powerful epic-level necklace! Soul Chaser can bring tremendous strength to the owner!”","“And an inheritance item trading token that expires in 30 days! You can trade it for any item you want!”","“Superb... wonderful!” In the black cloak, the woman was exhilarated with this treasure chest in her arms. “With this necklace, my strength will increase by 20 percent without me doing anything!”","With her current strength, a tiny increase was terrifying to ordinary people, let alone 20 percent!","The audience was stupefied.","“Such a powerful spiritual artifact?!”","“This necklace only exists in the legends even in the game, right?”","“I’ve never heard of it before even in the game...”","The whole venue erupted into exclamations.","The lively atmosphere and the enthusiasm of the audience members deeply affected the cultivators who had just come to know the shop and and this competition.","Sitting in the audience stand in a green robe and a bamboo hat, Cultivator Han Yue clicked his tongue in exclamation, “I’ve traveled around the continent for many years but have never seen such a great event.”","“Master, why are your eyes red?” Zhuge Yu looked at her master, Fairy Qing Yun, and was confused.","“I’m thinking how fortunate our Spiritual State is that we have a hermit master like Mr. Fang who stands out when the cultivation world is facing a catastrophe.”","“Maybe the cultivation world of the Spiritual State will survive this catastrophe. Everything is still in the air!” Of course, she didn’t know that a few outlanders would soon become janitors in Mr. Fang’s shop.","“Now, let’s cheer for the top three contestants in the StarCraft World Series!”","“I’ll first interview the Xichi Spiritual Master of the Nanhua Faction about her thoughts at this moment.” Ning Bi went over to the Xichi Spiritual Master"]},{"number":566,"title":"Chapter 566 - Mr. Fang Got the Legend of the White Snake?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Xichi Spiritual Master looked sulky since she didn’t like this demonic woman. Since it wasn’t polite to not answer the question, she reluctantly said with a small silver revolver in her hand, “I didn’t expect that I would become one of the top three. I came here mainly to watch Yun’er compete. I’m quite surprised.”","“You are surprised that you got the great result of third place, right?” Ning Bi asked, “Do you have anything that you want in particular?”","“Of course, I want a carrier,” Xichi Spiritual Master said, “But I don’t have high hopes for it.”","“Let’s see what’s in the chest!”","Xichi Spiritual Master opened her chest.","The audience suddenly gasped.","A golden aircraft appeared in the stage. Its golden color and streamlined-shape showed its uniqueness.","“It’s a shuttle! A flying spiritual artifact for aerospace transport of the Protoss faction!”","“My goodness!”","“I can’t believe that I’m looking at a real Protoss spiritual artifact!”","Many people in the audience stood up and intently stared at this flying artifact, wishing that they could go up the stage and study it from close-range.","The Xichi Spiritual Master gazed at the object that came out of her chest dumbfoundedly.","Although it wasn’t a carrier...","“Ahh-!”","“Master! You’re awesome!”","“What a fortune for our faction!”","Mo Xian and other girls almost rushed up onto the stage! They hugged each other and cried in elation.","After quickly putting the aircraft into her spatial spiritual artifact, the Xichi Spiritual Master was so excited that her hands shivered.","“Now, let’s see what’s in the chest of the second place!”","Impatient, Li Haoran opened the chest and saw a strangely-shaped gun appearing before him.","[C-]!","It was one of the weapons used by Ghost Agent Nova in StarCraft.","It was a deadly sniper rifle and could fire many special ammunitions. It could even fire Lockdown Grenades which would temporarily paralyze the machines within its fire range, including the spacecraft of the Protoss. Likewise, Lockdown Grenades could also paralyze the spiritual artifact and flying machines made by cultivators.","“I’m rich now!”","Now, only one person was left on the stage, and he was Gu Tingyun, the Champion of the StarCraft competition.","Obviously, this old man was excited.","In his shaking hands was a big exquisite treasure chest.","“I... I’ve never seen such treasures before!” Gu Tingyun said, “If we can completely study and understand these treasures, I think the cultivation worlds including the Spiritual State and other continents will undergo a huge advancement!”","He opened the chest and saw another golden spiritual artifact in front of him.","“Corsair! It’s the Corsair Fighter Jet!”","“Hahahaha!” Gu Tingyun laughed heartily. “I can’t believe that I got a Corsair Fighter Jet!”","“Awesome!” Vice Academy Master Zhang Hao’s eyes widened.","The other major families became green with envy. “It’s actually a Corsair Fighter Jet?!”","“It’s also Protoss technology?!”","“This old guy is so lucky!”","They had the urge to rush onto the stage and grab this aircraft for themselves.","Meanwhile, cheers erupted in the audience.","Among the cheers and exclamations of many people, the competition finally came to an end.","...","– In Yuanyang City –","It was the morning of another day filled with hope.","Mr. Fang was in a good mood when he saw the new janitors working diligently with proper attitudes.","In fact, the other two shops had enough employees. However, since Yuanyang City was new, its cleaning duties had been done by Li Xin’er and others who weren’t in charge of it in the first place.","But now, the Yuanyang City Shop had a high-end janitor team, which was an advantage over the other shops.","Different from the other employees in the shop, the members of the janitor team were forbidden to play games during working hours.","As for their off time, the shop would be closed. Thus, they couldn’t play games either.","Therefore, they could do nothing but watch people play with brooms in their hands.","Having just gotten online and started the game, Tang Yu sipped Coke with enjoyment. When he glanced back, he saw three people of the Ultimate West Realm staring at his screen intently.","Tang Yu didn’t know what to say. He started the game while being speechless.","“I guessed right. These people are indeed playing in a strange world bordering between virtual reality and reality!” The shop was quite clean to begin with. After the work was done, these outlanders whispered among themselves with brooms in their hands.","Kevin said, “Let’s watch some more. We might get more useful information!”","Standing behind Tang Yu, they watched as this mechanic fought the Abyss Demons.","“What’s this?!”","“Abyss Demon?! This monster is horrifying!”","“These people can actually fight with Abyss Demons?!”","On the screen, the sky was dark with gloomy clouds. Under the control of the demonic power of the demons, many horrifying thunderbolts crashed down from the sky.","Meanwhile, Tang Yu set up a strange-looking machine.","Suddenly, lightning bolts flashed and the spatial portal opened. Then, an extremely huge mechanical fist punched out from the spatial portal, instantly turning the Abyss Demon into ashes.","“This is... Gaebolg Punch?! This young man can use this skill?!”","Dazzling golden lights flashed on the screen, almost blinding the people who were staring at it.","“Ah! It flashed! It flashed and I got it! Hahaha!” Tang Yu yelled while slapping his hands on his thighs.","“What treasure did you get again?!”","“Let me have a look!”","Many people walked up to stand around him.","The Tang Family Master walked up as well with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands.","“Ah! Why don’t we get a flash!” The two black-robed figures also looked toward Tang Yu’s epic item enviously. With a token that could trade for any item that they wanted, they intended to trade it for a good epic spiritual artifact. “We’ve killed Abyss Demons for a whole day, and nothing came out! What is going on?”","They were eager to trade the token for an item since the token would expire in 30 days!","At this moment, a golden flash appeared on the screen.","“It flashed! I have a flash too!” The woman in the black robe screamed, “I got a flash as well!”","“Let’s see what treasure came out this time!” The idling people standing behind Tang Yu quickly swarmed behind her.","Suddenly, a message appeared on the game interface on the screen, [The internet connection is cut off. Your game time is up.]","Everyone fell silent.","“Ahhhh-!” A series of tragic screams sounded from the shop. “I haven’t picked it up yet!”","“The people in this shop all act in this way?” The three outlanders’ faces twitched.","We were defeated by such people?!","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang started counting his gains.","He had seen Evil Sword Apophis and the rights to summon all kinds of demons.","However, he hadn’t had the time to see many other things in the chest.","He pulled the list out again.","“Right to sell potato chips...”","“TV Series – Legend of the White Snake?” Mr. Fang suddenly froze.","[TL Note: The Legend of the White Snake, also known as Madame White Snake, is a Chinese legend. It has since been presented in a number of major Chinese operas, films, and television series. You can look up the plot by searching Legend of the White Snake in Wikipedia.]"]},{"number":567,"title":"Chapter 567 - Do I Look like Someone Who Would Bully Xiaoyue?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang continued looking down the list.","[You got the weapon – Cannon Gun.]","[ +1% synchronization with game character Wrecking Ball (1st awakening of launchers).]","[You got a weapon – Anti-Tank Cannon.]","[ +2% synchronization with game character Wrecking Ball.]","[You got a weapon – Charge Laser Rifle.]","[ +3% synchronization with game character Wrecking Ball.]","[You got a weapon – Ultimate Armor Penetration Hand Cannon.]","[You got the weapon – Sky Walker.]","Sky Walker was a blue lightsabre with a shape similar to the lightsabre shown in Star Wars. It looked like a light beam instead of the sword blade of a traditional lightsabre in Dungeon Fighter Online.","It must be noted that Fang Qi couldn’t use Evil Sword Apophis while he wasn’t in Complete Synchronization with the game character. Even though it didn’t dare to mess around in the shop, it possessed so much demonic power and awareness that it wouldn’t submit to any user weaker than itself.","Synchronization time was very precious, and it needed a long time to recover after each usage. To consume less energy and extend the synchronization time, Fang Qi didn’t summon Ghost 7: Furious Blache. However, not much synchronization time was left to use at this moment. Therefore, Fang Qi wouldn’t waste this precious resource.","But now, with Sky Walker and the hand cannon, Fang Qi had new weapon options when he wasn’t under Complete Synchronization.","...","-Meanwhile, outside Yuanyang City-","Usually, it was impossible for so many people to gather outside the city.","However, it was different today.","At this moment, two pale golden flying spiritual artifacts with faint blinking spiritual energy shields were hovering in the sky outside Yuanyang City.","“Wow-! It’s so fast!”","“This looks like a spiritual flying ship... but how come it’s so fast?”","“Awesome!” Exclamations sounded from the cockpit. The girls of the Nanhua Faction were curiously looking around in the shuttle.","The shuttle wasn’t hard to operate. In terms of flying, it wasn’t too different from an ordinary flying spiritual artifact.","Since these people could fly fighter jets in Grand Theft Auto 5, this aircraft wasn’t too difficult for them to control.","Of course, it wasn’t so easy to make the fancy moves with the shuttle; it was on another level.","“Trash Junior Sister! You’ve driven it for a long time now. It’s my turn!”","“No! I’m not done yet!”","“It’s my turn! My turn!”","The golden flight spiritual artifact began to spin in the air.","“Ahh-! We’re going to crash!” Screams sounded from the cockpit.","On the other side, the family masters and elders of the ancient families were visiting the Corsair Fighter Jet under the lead of Gu Tingyun.","“Guys, look at the interior of this spiritual artifact!” Gu Tingyun said proudly, still amazed that he had the opportunity to drive such a spiritual ship.","“Wow! The interior of this flight ship looks like this?” The Qingqiu Family Master looked around and touched this and that curiously. “How was this thing made?”","“I wonder why such an exquisite spiritual artifact is called Corsair.” The Xuanyuan Family Master stroked his beard and said, “It should be called the Golden Light Godly Ship!”","[TL Note: Corsair’s nickname is Chinese is pirate ship.]","“I didn’t know that there were such exquisite spiritual artifacts in the world!” The Tang Family Master patted his thigh in regret. “I should have put more time in playing StarCraft!”","It would be great to get a shuttle for transportation even if he couldn’t get a Corsair Fighter Jet!","It probably would take them a long time to only study the thrust mechanism in the Protoss’s shuttle.","Of course, they would obtain unimaginable benefits from the study.","“Ms. Yu! Come and look!” The younger people of the Qingqiu Family were also checking out the ‘pirate ship.’","Different from spiritual artifacts, the cockpit of the Corsair was filled with rows of instruments.","Gu Tingyun was fiddling with these things.","Above the cliff outside Yuanyang City, a pale blue light appeared in the middle of the golden aircraft.","With a flash, a super powerful force pierced the mountain side.","“So powerful!”","“I can’t believe that such a small spiritual ship can be so powerful!”","“Hey! It’s time for the families onboard to get off!” The Wang Family Master and the people of other families looked impatient. “It’s our turn to check out the spiritual boat!”","...","“Master, Master! Do you think the imminent catastrophe of the Spiritual State will really come?” In the Yuanyang City Shop, Fairy Qing Yun and her disciple Zhuge Yu sat on the sofa. The former had a bowl of instant noodles in her hands while the latter was eating spicy sticks.","“Wu... Slurp! It... should be soon.” Fairy Qing Yu was bewildered. She had been worried when she came down from Seven Saint Mountain, but now she was carefree enough to eat instant noodles in the shop. She said in confusion, “It’s strange. According to these cultivators, those existences claimed that they will give us only three months. The time is almost up; how come nothing is happening yet?”","She had lowered her guard because of this! It was so calm!","Jessica passed them in silence with a garbage bag in her hand. There were a few empty Coke bottles in the bag.","Green veins bulged on her forehead when she heard the conversation.","Damn it! How can anything happen while we are here dumping garbage?!","You bunch of natives are so carefree that you have the leisure to eat instant noodles!","If not for our difficult situation, you would have been destroyed long ago!","At this thought, Jessica stomped her feet in fury.","“Forget it!” At this moment, a special fragrance floated to her nose. Kevin brought two bowls of instant noodles and handed one to her. “Would you like one?”","Feeling like crying, Jessica took the bowl, regretting that she had come to this damn place!","“Slurp! Slurp...” The sounds of eating instant noodles appeared.","Oblivious of the identity of the janitors in the shop, Fairy Qing Yun continued to worry about the future of the cultivation world at Spiritual State. Meanwhile, Karl thought with ill-intentions, Sooner or later, we’ll leave this damn place! Unfortunately, our spiritual patterns were erased by this damn shop owner. With greatly reduced strength, we can’t even send a message to the Godly Palace of Light...","Then, he also heard the slurping noises. “How come this iced red tea is so delicious?! And the instant noodles...”","“Um... What was I thinking earlier? Right, we can’t get in contact with the Godly Palace...”","...","“Boss-!” At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue was about to go crazy.","She had just dug out a bag of potato chips to eat with great smugness when she saw the words on the small blackboard. [New item: potato chips, 8 crystals/bag]","“Boss! What is this?!” Jiang Xiaoyue gritted her teeth.","She got a bag of potato chips as the prize for her hard-earned third place and had to give half to Nalan Mingxue who taught her how to defeat her opponent. But now, the shop began selling potato chips!","She had the urge to bite the damn shop owner to death.","“This...” AS his face twitched a little, Mr. Fang patted Jiang Xiaoyue’s small head and looked at her before saying sincerely, “It’s just a coincidence. Do you think I’m someone who would bully you?”","“Ugh???”","Then, Mr. Fang wrote something on the small blackboard with chalk. [New TV Series: Legend of the White Snake]","“We have a new TV Series today!” Mr. Fang changed the subject.","“I won’t forgive you unless you let me watch for free!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted."]},{"number":568,"title":"Chapter 568 - West Lake Is So Beautiful in March","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Master... why do you think people like Uncle-Master Xuyu and Uncle-Master Wuchen Zi refuse to come here?” Zhuge Yu ate a spicy stick and then sipped some iced red tea with enjoyment before asking the question.","“They are not interested in the games and TV Series featuring battles. After all, the games and TV Series here are all about this,” Fairy Qing Yun said, “If one day, the cultivation world is in danger, they will come out and help. But in my opinion, the cultivators from either the Spiritual State or other places are working diligently; there’s no need for your uncle-masters to come out.”","“Hmph! They keep asking us to mail them iced red tea,” Zhuge Yu mumbled, “We should ask them to come here and grow vegetables.”","“Yu’er! You must be respectful to your seniors!” Fairy Qing Yun said solemnly.","“Okay...”","“Don’t talk about them; let’s eat instant noodles first!”","Meanwhile, a group of players were standing around a strange machine – the disassembler.","It had been solely used by Mr. Fang, but now he finally moved it out.","While a group of cultivators and warriors studied the machine, they suddenly heard someone by the counter talk about the new TV Series, and they all looked over with interest.","At this moment, Gu Tingyun and the others walked into the shop. Having walked around and examined the Corsair Fighter Jet for a while, they discovered that they couldn’t get anything out of it by studying only for a moment!","Feeling helpless, they returned to the shop, wanting to first take full use of the eight hours of online time today.","“Master! The shop has released a new TV Series!”","“Legend of the White Snake?” Fairy Qing Yun frowned and thought, “How come it has this name? Is it a story about a snake?”","She walked over curiously.","The janitors also came up with bowls of instant noodles in their hands.","Just like other TV Series, the customers could pay to watch the first four episodes on the first day. After 8 PM, two episodes would be livestreamed on the big screens.","Since TV Series such as Jade Dynasty and Wind and Cloud had ended, many cultivators were out of things to watch, especially the lazy and idle ones.","Su Tianji was one of these cultivators.","Fight Abyss Demons? Why would a lazy cultivator like her fight Abyss Demons?","For the last while, the first thing that she did after entering the shop on the daily was glancing at the small blackboard to see if there was anything new on it.","Today, there was indeed something new on it!","“Potato chips?! Legend of the White Snake?!”","“Master! Master! A new TV Series!” Her two disciples said cheerfully behind her.","“Let’s go! Let’s go! Let’s go! I’ll take you girls to watch the TV Series!” Su Tianji who had looked spiritless instantly perked up, intending to watch it regardless of what it was.","At this moment, Sia and other people of the Ultimate West Realm walked in. Sia was in a fiery-red dress, and she was still angry that she hadn’t won a prize in the F1 World Championship.","She spoke using the Spiritual State language in her awkward accent, “What are they talking about? Why is it so lively?”","They didn’t watch Jade Dynasty and wasn’t willing to watch Wind and Cloud. After all, if they started studying these things now, they would always lag behind others.","Having just lost to cultivators of the Spiritual State and Deserted Sea Realm, these proud warriors wanted to find an area in which they could surpass others.","After using up the fatigue points in Dungeon Fighter Online, they focused their energy on Final Fantasy and watched it time and time again to study the sword techniques in it.","“What’s this strange thing?” a few people of th eUltimate West Realm immediately looked over.","Soon, they saw Jessica and other janitors who were standing by.","“Ugh? Are you guys from the Ultimate West Realm too?”","“Um...” Carl and others’ faces twitched. “Yeah...”","“You speak the Spiritual State language so well!”","“We grew up in the Spiritual State...” Jessica’s face darkened.","Of course! It’s not difficult for us to learn a language!","Then, the real and fake people of the Ultimate West Realm began a friendly conversation.","“We people of Ultimate West Realm must stick together!” Sia said kindly, “Do you want to watch the Legend of the White Snake with us? I’ll pay for you!”","The outlanders cried and thought, How come there is such a good person?","“...You mean these guys?” Mr. Fang looked over and said, “They are not allowed to go online during work hours.”","“Ah-!” Jessica and her companions were angry, and their faces all turned green. They stared at Mr. Fang with murderous spirit in their eyes.","“We can stand behind them and watch!” Carl said in a low voice, “We’ll know what Legend of the White Snake is!”","“Good idea!”","Sia now had paid for the TV Series. “Activate the Legend of the White Snake for me!”","Then, she and the other people of Ultimate West Realm went online cheerfully.","After opening Super Theater, she saw the logo of the Legend of the White Snake on the interface.","Since the F1 World Championship had just ended, and the character in her main account had made a huge sword with Terra Stone, she wasn’t impatient, entering the game as soon as possible. Instead, she could relax for a bit.","Together with Luo Piaoling and other people of the Ultimate West Realm, they clicked open Legend of the White Snake to watch the TV Series.","Meanwhile, Su Tianji and her disciples had also opened the new TV Series eagerly.","Jiang Xiaoyue and Little Bell also hurried to the computers and began watching it.","Jessica and other outlanders rushed over eagerly to watch from behind, but they saw nothing but a poster on the screen.","“...”","In the nation named Huaxia where Fang Qi had lived before traveling through space and time, there were many beautiful legends about flying on swords and sword immortals who dashed into the netherworld. There were also mythical tales about mountain spirits turning into human forms.","[TL Note: Huaxia is another word for China.]","Different from other movies and TV Series which began with grand scenes, this TV Series started with a story in a past lifetime.","Legend of the White Snake began mildly with a small story in which a young boy who took care of cows saved a white snake from an old snake hunter.","Bai Suzhen, the white snake, made an oath that she would forever remember this favor and her savior.","“Is this TV Series a story about this small snake?” Curious, Su Tianji stared at the small white snake and wondered, Will it cultivate for hundreds or thousands of years and become a big snake?","Soon, it was 1,700 years later.","“Ahh! How come this snake has grown so big?!” In the Yuanyang City Shop, Little Bell was so startled that it almost fell from its chair.","In the misty valley where thunderbolts flashed, a white demon snake bigger than a dragon winded through the mountains. She turned from a small demon to the human form, and she went down the mountain and entered the mortal world. Seeing the world from the perspective of a demon, the people in this world felt very curious.","“Ya! Guys, look! She tamed a green snake!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed. Many viewers saw the battle between the white snake and the green snake, and they watched intently.","From this point on, the TV Series went on the main track and got a lot more interesting.","In the misty drizzle on the day of Qingming Festival, the white snake finally found the reincarnation of her savior from 1,700 years ago at the broken bridge on West Lake.","Standing with an oil paper umbrella in her hand, Bai Suzhen’s white-clad figure stood in the misty drizzle on the bank of West Lake. With the beautiful scenery of West Lake as the background, this scene was permanently branded into the viewers’ minds.","At this moment, many cultivators and warriors wished that they could replace Xu Xian, the reincarnation of the young boy.","When the players played games such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Dungeon Fighter Online, they would hear lovely music. Besides being melodious, the music in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy could even refresh their minds and calm their souls.","At this moment, they looked puzzled. “Um? The TV Series also has music?”","Then, they heard the lyrics of the song, “West Lake is so beautiful in March. Spring drizzle is as sweet as wine, and the willow trees with new spouts look like mist...”","“Ugh? What’s this song?”","“Ah? This episode ends here?!” Su Tianji exclaimed."]},{"number":569,"title":"Chapter 569 - More Than Just the Theme Song in This TV Series","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, other cultivators and warriors who were watching the Legend of the White Snake had also finished the first episode.","After watching it, the people of the Ultimate West Realm who had only intended to see what this new TV Series was about found themselves drawn into a world full of unique wonders.","“Ahh! How come this episode ended so soon!”","Then, they heard a series of tunes.","...","While Su Tianji was worried that there were no more episodes, she suddenly saw short clips playing after the post-credits.","They looked like the video clips shown at the opening cinematics of the E-sports competition.","“What are these?” She quickly watched them intently.","Zhuge Yu was also watching the Legend of the White Snake with Fairy Qing Yun.","“I asked the shop owner about it,” Fairy Qing Yun said, “He said that the exciting video clips at the beginning of the E-sport competition were the highlight montages. I’m surprised that the TV Series Legend of the White Snake has them too.”","The cultivators were already interested in this story that was told in the perspective of a big demon who had cultivated more than 1,700 years and would soon become an immortal. After watching the clips showing the resurrection, the chilly Black and White Impermanence, heavenly generals and soldiers, and immortals and monsters, they were even more enthralled. Zhuge Yu widened her eyes and said, “So powerful...”","[TL Note: Black and White Impermanence are two deities in Chinese folk religion in charge of escorting the spirits of the dead to the Underworld.]","“I wonder who wrote the lyrics,” Fairy Qing Yun said in surprise, “Spring drizzle is as sweet as wine, and the willow trees with new spouts look like mist... the words perfectly reflect the beautiful scenery at West Lake in March.”","The System had recreated all the scenes and spiritual spells in Legend of the White Snake while following the original and classical plot of the story. Fang Qi was surprised that the System even included the ending theme song, and he found that it was quite good after hearing it; it wasn’t awkward or cringy.","After all, the lyrics and music were classics, and the System made them even more beautiful than the original version since everything that the System made was top-tier.","Listening to the song and watching the clips, the viewers felt as if they were sitting in the boat that was floating on West Lake. In the boat, the brisk male singing voice and the soft female singing voice drifted above the lake in a light drizzle. They seemed to be standing on the bank of West Lake and were watching the honest and dull scholar and the white-clothed woman who was holding an oil paper umbrella and had a charming smile on her face.","“Ugh? There’s a song at the end!” Su Tianji picked up a potato chip with her white and slender fingers, and she nibbled it very elegantly. She just bought one big bag.","She continued watching the highlight montages.","In fact, the old players were no strangers to these weird legends since they had encountered some in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy.","For example, in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, a mountain god told Zhao Ling’er the story about Nuwa patching up the sky.","In this world, the memories and historical records about immortals and gods had been mostly lost in the long river of time. Only a few of them remained in the relics from the ancient times.","It was why these warriors and cultivators were drawn toward things that existed in the legends.","In these short video clips, they again encountered the fragments of legends that they had seen and heard in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy.","For some reason, they felt moved inside.","Eagerly, Su Tianji, Nalan Hongwu, and the others began watching the second episode.","“Bai Suzhen’s spiritual spells are so powerful?! She can even see people’s previous lives?!” The masters of the big families had just come down from the Corsair. Now, they all gathered together to watch the Legend of the White Snake.","“She can view what happened in a person’s previous lifetimes. Her skills in spiritual spells are indeed great!”","“This girl Little Qing likes to tease her big sister. Ugh? She is even playing tricks on Xu Xian as well! So naughty!” Jiang Xiaoyue was enjoying the TV Series a lot as well.","“Little Qing, what do you think?”","Mu Qing was a little confused. “Mm??? Ugh?”","Watching the story of a big demon who would soon become an immortal after cultivating for almost 2,000 years, the cultivators were curious about her life in the mortal world.","“How can she live among the mortals?” The Tang Family Master, Gu Tingyun, and the others looked astonished.","“A mortal married a big demon who had lived for almost 2,000 years?”","“Such things can happen?”","At this moment, they wished that they could become a mortal who took care of cattle in the mountains.","It wasn’t unusual for the cultivators to have over 2,000 years of cultivation strength. After all, Han Yue, the low-profiled independent cultivator, had cultivated more than 2,000 years.","However, comparisons between people induces anger and envy. The white snake in this story could soon become an immortal after cultivating for only about 2,000 years.","For the cultivators and warriors in this world, there wasn’t a clear definition and standard for immortals. In their mind, once a cultivator became an immortal, they could leave this world and ascend into another world.","However, even though the high-level cultivators of the Shu Mountain Faction in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy could travel to other realms, they were still not immortals. For example, Jing Tian in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 even traveled to the Immortal Realm, but he wasn’t an immortal.","For the cultivators, immortals were just people who had reached the high realm that ordinary cultivators could never attain.","Likewise, the mortals also regarded cultivators as immortals.","Even though this woman in Legend of the White Snake easily used the spiritual spells that could summon wind and rain and move mountains to fill oceans, she was still outside the gate of the world of immortals.","Now, the cultivators began to have a deeper understanding of immortals.","The spiritual spells and cultivation methods shown in the TV Series in glimpses were quite beneficial to some of them.","For example, the big white deer kept looking at the screen. In this scene, the white snake changed into her human form.","“Why doesn’t it show the whole process to us?! That’s infuriating!”","They followed the white snake down the mountain and watched the many interesting incidents between Xu Xian, the scholar, and Bai Suzhen, the big snake who had lived for close to 2,000 years. The viewers were entertained.","Soon, they came to the part in which Bai Suzhen told Little Qing to steal silver from Qiantang Vault so that Xu Xian could have enough funds to open a pharmacy.","“It’s a piece of cake for a demon snake who has hundreds of years of cultivation strength to steal money from mortals!” Despite the fun they had while watching this incident, Sia and some other people of the Ultimate West Realm thought that it was a task too easy for them.","“I suddenly feel like it isn’t as interesting anymore...”","Nalan Hongwu also thought that the two big demons could easily get whatever they wanted in the mortal world.","“It looks too easy and relaxed...” The Tang Family Master shook his head, losing interest when he saw Little Qing moving silver from the vault with some small ghosts.","While they were hesitating if the TV Series was worthy of their time, they saw Li Gongpu complain to the Vault God in the picture that was hung on the window, “My lord, you must do something...”","Suddenly, the picture flew out and transformed into the Vault God. With a golden whip in his hand, he blocked Little Qing with heavenly soldiers.","“Oh-!” The people of the Ultimate West Realm who had felt a bit bored almost jumped up.","The Tang Family Master who had been hesitating if he should continue watching opened his mouth wide and gasped, “What’s this?!”","These people in this world were shocked and all froze.","At this moment, a brand-new world unraveled before them like a grand picture, revealing the tip of an iceberg. In this world, there were immortals and demons, and the human world was governed by gods."]},{"number":570,"title":"Chapter 570 - A Young Man Who Had Lost His Dreams","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Seeing the strange and ingenious spiritual spells, gods, demons, and the fun incidents between humans and demons, many customers were drawn into this interesting TV Series.","“Waiting for this for 1,000 years...” Fairy Qing Yun hummed subconsciously and wondered, Most of the games and TV Series in the shop focus on battles of spiritual spells or wars. There is Arad which is fraught with dangers and StarCraft, full of wars and schemes. However, this TV Series is very different from them.","She watched four episodes in one seating. “Awesome! If the thrilling battles in the E-Sports competition are like the spicy and sour instant noodles in the shop, then the Legend of the White Snake is as sweet, refreshing, and lingering as the red iced tea.”","Working as janitors in the shop, Jessica and her companions were eager to watch this TV Series.","“What is this Legend of the White Snake? It seems like they are all enthralled by it.”","Having just finished the first four episodes, Sia put down the virtual reality headset and then sang poorly in a heavy accent, “West Lake is so beautiful in March...”","“Spring drizzle is as sweet as wine, and the willow trees with new spouts look like mist!” The Tang Family Master sitting near her continued where she left off.","“If we are destined, we will meet even if we are 1,000 kilometers apart!” Fairy Qing Yun sang with high spirits, thinking it was also fate that brought together the cultivators and warriors from different places. After all, they wouldn’t have met each other all their lives if not for the shop since they lived extremely far from each other.","“What’s wrong with the people in this internet café?!” Hearing the singing in the shop, Jessica, Kevin, and Carl were bewildered with brooms in hand.","What’s wrong with these people? They were all watching the TV Series, but now they are having a singing competition?","Hearing their cheerful voices, the three’s faces twitched as they thought, How come you are all so happy? Are you even worried about us the invaders?","Um... No. The three realized that they were now janitors.","Furious at their situation, Jessica grabbed a handful of potato chips and stuffed them into her mouth while cussing silently in resentment, I can handle 100 natives at the level of these people!","No. Without spiritual patterns, I can only handle about ten...","At this moment, someone yelled, “The garbage bins are almost full. Where are the janitors?”","“I’m here!” Jessica answered without thinking.","“Go! Go! Go! Hurry up!”","“Um...”","She was furious, wishing that she could kill the shop owner.","At 8 PM, the first two episodes of Legend of the White Snake were played on the big screens.","In the Jiuhua City Shop, the nearby civilians, rich and poor, had the habit of gathering in the shop to watch two free episodes of TV Series each day on the livestream.","The moon had just come up. Gongzi Xiao sat down on the couch and poured himself a cup of wine that he bought from Wind and Moon Pavilion, enjoying the new TV Series.","Meanwhile, the janitors in Yuanyang City Shop each poured themselves a cup of iced red tea with tears on their faces. “Finally, we can watch it...”","“Finally, we can watch it...”","“Oh-! There are actually gods in this world?”","“This Guanyin looks very powerful...”","“A mortal can summon the Vault God with a casual yell? How come there are so many gods and immortals in this world?!”","-Two hours later-","From the couch, Jessica sang, “West Lake is so beautiful...”","The customers walking by looked at them with weird expressions.","“Master, will catastrophe strike our Spiritual State or not?” Zhuge Yu asked as she sat on the couch and watched the Legend of the White Snake one more time.","“Of course, it will!” Sitting nearby, Carl said with a snort.","“How do you know?” The young girl looked at him in doubt.","“Um...” With his face twitching, Carl finally explained after a long pause, “In the vast void, weak existences are always easy targets for predators, which is the cause of almost all wars.”","Before Fang Qi traveled through space and time, he had heard someone say, “The universe is a dark forest, and each civilization is a hunter with guns. They walked in the forest stealthily like ghosts and lightly moved away the tree branches that blocked their way, trying their best not to make any sounds. The forest is full of hunters just like them. If they find another civilization, they will do only one thing: burn and destroy it.”","Mr. Fang came over and sat down. While scratching his head, he said, “Why have wars? Isn’t it better to have an E-Sports competition?”","“...” The outlanders’ faces twitched, and they didn’t feel like talking to Mr. Fang.","If they could defeat this guy, they would bring him back and whip him 100 times with force.","...","Having finally finished the task of E-Sports competition and other chores in the shop, Mr. Fang had just come out of the Game Cultivation Room.","“Um?” At this moment, Fang Qi dug out a pretty golden rock from his pocket.","“This is...” He finally remembered that this was one of the three things that he won from Jessica when they betted against each other. The other two objects that he had won were the Shadow Cloak and the Blade of Curse.","Fang Qi remembered the System telling him that this rock contained tremendous energy when Jessica took it out.","In fact, the System took most of the income of the shop so that it could have enough energy to produce and maintain the big worlds shown in the games and movies. It also needed energy to maintain the foundation of the lightning punishment system in the shop.","In fact, to finish the tasks, Mr. Fang had spent lots of his money. Also, he used a lot of money when playing Dungeon Fighter Online. Right now, he found that he was a little poor.","Should I sell this rock?","[The System is taking it in...]","[Analyzing the energy...]","“Hey!” Dumbfounded, Mr. Fang watched as the rock vanished just like the crystals that the shop had earned. “How come it’s gone?!”","“System! F*ck! Spit it out for me! You stole my treasure! Are you a dog?!”","“F*ck! If you don’t spit it out right now, I’ll stop working!”","The System replied, [Burp...]","Mr. Fang’s face darkened. “Damn you. I’ve never seen a System as shameless as you!”","At this moment, Fang Qi heard the System’s voice again. [The system energy is prepared. New privileges are being activated.]","[Cross-Plane Teleportation is getting ready.]","[The new task is activated.]","[New task: Cross-Plane Internet","Task Description: Do you want to build a unique internet system? Young Man, get up and move]","Mr. Fang replied, [No! I don’t want to go anywhere!]","The young man had lost his dreams.","The System was at a loss for words."]},{"number":571,"title":"Chapter 571 - Is the World Round or Square?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","There had been heated discussion among the people in this world as to what lay beyond the starry sky and if the world had an end, what would the end look like.","When StarCraft was first released in the shop, the cultivators and warriors had argued about these topics.","Just like what Mr. Fang had said, they were in fact living on the planets. Although Mr. Fang stated it as a fact with his life experience and knowledge that he obtained before he traveled through space and time, no one in this world believed him.","This argument was paused since Mr. Fang was busy with the release of Dungeon Fighter Online and the organization of the E-Sports competition. Now that these tasks were finished, the System’s words reminded him of the previous debate...","Mr. Fang scratched his head and wondered, Right... What does this world look like...?","– The group chat that people created in QQ to talk about if the world was round or square –","At this moment, the group members had completely deviated from the original theme.","An Huwei said, [(Screenshot) Today, I only got two epic equipment after spending a whole day killing Abyss Demons. They are both garbage! What an unlucky day!]","Nalan Hongwu said, [(A screenshot of a dazzling golden lightsabre) Hahahaha! Look at my Light Flame Sword—Blazing Sun Judgement +11!]","Xuanyuan Changqing, an elder of the Xuanyuan Family replied, [(A screenshot of the Champion of the F1 Dungeon Fighter Online competition losing her mind when she got an epic equipment but the internet connection was cut off – taken by a communication jade) In the new year, I wish you to have your internet disconnected, fail in every equipment reinforcement, damage in all your equipment, have a lack of colorless small crystals, and hit your daily online time quickly...]","Elder Yu of the Heavenly Academy replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f44d.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F44D;\">]","Nalan Hongwu’s face darkened.","Su Tianji said, [Have you guys watched the Legend of the White Snake today?]","Mr. Fang chimed in, [...Can you guys talk about the theme topic?]","Su Tianji asked, [What’s the theme topic?]","Exasperated, Mr. Fang replied quickly, [Look at the name of the group! This is an official group for science and technology discussion!]","The members looked at the group name earnestly: [Is Bean Curd Sweet or Salty?]","Mr. Fang was speechless. Pu–! Who changed the damn name?!","He immediately changed it back to: Is the World Round or Square?","The student who was on the work-study program, Li Lanruo, asked, [Sir, how come you came up with this question?]","Mr. Fang replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f630.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F630;\"> Are you not a bit curious about the mystery of the world?]","Zong Wu replied, [I haven’t finished killing all the Abyss Demons yet.]","Su Tianji said, [(A screenshot of when the ending theme song of Legend of the White Snake played) Sir, will you release four episodes tomorrow?!]","Green veins bulged on Mr. Fang’s forehead. [You guys are too lazy! Don’t you have any curiosity for knowledge?!]","Su Tianji said, [Sir, after you find the answer, don’t forget to tell us!]","They were indeed a group of lazy people who would do nothing but yell ‘awesome’ and play online.","Gu Tingyun suddenly said, [In my opinion, to find the answer to this question with our current level of spiritual spells and science knowledge, we must spend a long time to explore, or our answer will be superficial. Now that we have the Corsair of the Protoss, we might have a chance to try!]","Mr. Fang said, [Finally, we have a wise person among us!]","While stroking his beard, Gu Tingyun typed the words smugly, [The ancient scroll that we acquired from the Sky Relic says that all the people who ascended to Heaven went in the direction of the Heavenly Abyss Sea.”","[Heavenly Abyss Sea?!]","Rosen Rain suddenly typed, [...]","Tang Yu chimed in, [F*ck! You drew out the Champion!]","The three janitors who had been sneaking glances at Mr. Fang’s screen from the behind exchanged a look. ... What are these natives up to?!","They had a feeling that these natives wanted to do something big.","At this moment, Jessica suddenly saw the spiritual artifact attached to her belt blink. She immediately walked out the door.","The grand Heaven-Hiding Palace was still hovering in the sky above Heavenly Abyss Sea.","At this moment, the white-robed man was holding a strange crystal which showed the image outside the door of Origins Internet Club.","“My Lords, I finally got in contact with you!” The white-robed man looked pleased, and then he saw the janitor uniforms that they were wearing. “My Lords, why are you wearing native clothes of these natives?”","The three people’s faces twitched at the question. Carl quickly said in a cold voice, “Stop babbling. Is it your place to think for us?”","“Um...” The white-robed man quickly bowed and replied, “I was worried in the past few days since you didn’t send any messages to us.”","“We’re fine!” blond Kevin said, “We encountered a small problem and will soon solve it. Besides, these natives are not as weak as we thought; you must be careful!”","Jessica said, “We are gathering information about these natives. We’ve reached a critical stage, and you can’t disturb us!”","“Yes! My Lords!” The white-robed man bowed even lower.","“Another thing,” Carl instructed, “In a few days, these natives might send a powerful team to the area that you are in. You guys should first hide and not show yourself. We found that there are some very powerful masters among these natives, and you might not be their match!”","“There are such powerful masters among the natives?!” The white-robed man looked surprised as he said, “Even you can’t handle them, My Lords?!”","Their faces twitched.","After exchanging a look with the other two, Carl laughed and said, “How can they be our match?!”","Kevin said immediately, “He just escaped from us!”","At this moment, Gabriel and a few other people of the Ultimate West Realm walked out of the door, humming the song from Legend of the White Snake to themselves.","“I just heard the shop owner call for you to dump the garbage, so I came to give you a heads up since I didn’t see you in there. Go in now; otherwise, he will lose his temper!” With that said, Gabriel and his companions walked toward their hotel. “We are from the same place, and we should look after each other. You don’t need to thank me.”","“Hurry! Turn it off!” Carl and the other two outlanders scrambled to run into the shop without turning off the communication.","Damn it!","The white-robed man in the Heaven-Hiding Palace saw them run, and then the screen in front of him turned black.","He exchanged a look with the servants around him. “...”","What had just happened?!","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang’s technology discussion had come to an end.","Mr. Fang’s global travel plan was the first to be vetoed due to the inaccessibility of some extreme realm. Even if they could pass these areas, it would cost them lots of energy and time.","Therefore, they came up with another plan – Spiritual Ship Ascendance Plan. They could use the great abilities of the Protoss Corsair to follow the ascendance path of the ancient times, just like the ships flying into space in the game.","If they could fly into the starry sky, they certainly could see if the whole continent were round or square. They would find out if their living place was indeed a planet as Mr. Fang had claimed."]},{"number":572,"title":"Chapter 572 - Ugh? How Come It Looks like This?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For some idle people, they would play any new games and watch any new TV Series the moment they were released. Su Tianji was one of them.","Fairy Qing Yun, who had become idle recently, was another.","She had come here to do something for the cultivation world, but...","After waiting for a long time, nothing had happened. As for the brave fighters, Rosen Rain had launched her live shows, Zhu Yanxiao had established a studio for moving bricks, and as for Xiaoyue....","Jiang Xiaoyue was eating her potato chips while hiding in a corner so that the despicable shop owner couldn’t take them from her.","The damn invaders are nowhere to be seen, and the fighters are getting idle , While feeling sad and helpless, Fairy Qing Yun began to watch the new TV Series.","She even suspected that she had made a mistake in her calculations and that the catastrophe wouldn’t strike the Spiritual State after all.","“Are you guys coming or not...” Fairy Qing Yun murmured to herself while watching the TV Series.","“We are here already...” Jessica mumbled through her gritted teeth behind Fairy Qing Yun.","...","This feeling was quite weird.","For the researchers who were artifact master and mechanism masters of the grand factions, they would never stop their exploration of the unknown world regardless if the catastrophe struck the world or not.","What were the secrets about the Immortal Dao in the ancient times? Which of the worlds shown in the games and TV Series were real or closer to their own world?","Perhaps their world was just a simulation, just like the one shown in the Matrix.","They had perceived more possible explanations for the world, and these new thoughts improved their way of thinking.","People in this world said that no one could pass the Sky Mountain of the Ultimate West Realm. What lay beyond the Sky Mountain?","The ancient legend said that the people in pursuit of Dao all went to Heavenly Abyss Sea. What secrets were hidden in that forbidden area which was fraught with danger?","Why couldn’t they ascend to Heaven from their own factions?","“Welcome to this episode of Approaching Science. I’m Li Haoran.” At this moment, the big screens in the shops were showing a weird-shaped golden battle jet flying toward the Heavenly Abyss Sea at great speed. On the bottom-right corner was Li Haoran’s livestream studio. “This is the livestream sent back by Mr. Fang. In this livestream, we’ll explore the mysteries of the world in a scientific way.”","“Now, let’s ask Mr. Fang why he has a sudden interest in this question.”","Naturally, Mr. Fang wouldn’t tell them that he had just gotten a task to open another branch shop, which was why he intended to explore another place.","After all, as the shop owner, he couldn’t spend all his time playing games like these lazy people.","At this moment, Jessica, Carl, and Kevin were sitting on a couch. In one corner, two black-clothed figures were also solemnly watching ‘Approaching Science’ which was hosted by Mr. Fang.","“Heavenly Abyss Sea isn’t a peaceful place.” The two figures hiding in the corner whispered to each other. “With these people pilotting a Corsair Battle Jet, they will soon return in defeat after a few moments.”","“Aw! How come this kid went to the Heavenly Abyss Sea?!” The godly swords hung at the entrance yelled.","“Seniors, do you know the secrets of Heavenly Abyss Sea?” Some disciples of the Qingqiu Family noticed that these swords seemed to know something about this sea, so they immediately cupped their hands and asked the swords.","“Little girls, you asked the right people.” Seeing many people looking toward it, the godly sword named Qingming said arrogantly, “Weird winds sweep across Heavenly Abyss Sea frequently. In one moment the sky is clear, and in the next moment, vicious and huge waves might surge up toward you.”","“In one moment, the ocean is peaceful, and in the next, a sea monster might leap out and attack you. They are so powerful that they can swallow a cultivator like you guys whole!” the godly sword named Qingshuang said.","– Meanwhile, on the Heavenly Abyss Sea –","“Sir.” A few servants kneeled before the white-robed man and reported, “To hide our whereabouts, we’ve cleared all the nearby sea monsters; no stupid sea monsters will come to us during the concealment.”","“Okay... very good.”","– Inside the shop –","“There’s more!” The black sword said, “Huge and pitch-black holes will appear at the bottom of the sea, sucking huge amounts of water inside as if huge dragons were sucking water at the sea bottom. If you get close to them, it’s extremely dangerous!”","“It’s so dangerous?!”","“Then, the shop owner and others are in mortal danger, right?!”","The girls looked pale.","– In the palace hovering in the sky above Heavenly Abyss Sea –","“Sir, we’ve resolved the issue of ‘sea holes’ created by the spatial shards. They won’t have any impact on us.”","“Good! Good! We must do the work that Carl and the other lords assigned to us! We can’t allow those natives to notice our existence!”","“Yes! Then, why don’t we leave this place to avoid these natives...? Or we can go to the place where Jessica and the other lords are staying...”","“As for that...” The white-robe man said, “The lords don’t want us to go there; I’m sure they have good reasons for that!”","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","The godly swords continued, “There are more dangers than those! Horrifying black lightning bolts strike that area constantly. Ordinary cultivator would be turned into ashes if they were struck!”","“What lightning bolts are these? How come they are so powerful?!”","“It’s said that the ancient cultivators passed their tribulations in that place, and these lightning bolts are called Heavenly Tribulation Godly Lightning!”","“Ah! So powerful!”","More and more people gathered around the swords, and their faces paled as they yelled, “Hurry and tell the shop owner to come back! That place is too dangerous!”","– In the sky above Heavenly Abyss Sea –","“Sir, the nearby sea area is peacefully under the control of our Holy Artifact Heaven-Hiding Palace, and I’m sure that it wouldn’t trigger any Void Tribulation Lightning... But the space around the border of realms is still a bit vulnerable.”","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","“According to the legends, that place is the origin of Heavenly Dao and the birthplace of Hundun...”","[TL Note: Hundun means primordial and central chaos in Chinese cosmogony.]","“Actually, it is this amazing?!”","“Is it the legendary holy land?!”","The people around the godly swords clucked their tongues in amazement.","In the sky above Heavenly Abyss Sea.","“Okay. Now, no one will see that we’re hiding here.” The white-robed man waved his hand impatiently while mumbling to himself, “I hope that the Heavenly Dao of this world won’t slack off and fall apart... What is going on? The energy stored in this holy artifact might run out...”","“Sir, the crack that we traveled through to jump between...”","“They are coming. Some people are coming... we have no time to repair it now. Keep hiding!”","...","At this moment, the super expedition team consisting of Mr. Fang, Gu Tingyun, Zong Wu, and other cultivators and warriors of the Spiritual State finally arrived at Heavenly Abyss Sea.","Above the Heavenly Abyss Sea, the endless blue sky was dotted with white clouds.","Occasionally, some white birds flew across the ocean.","The blue ocean had gentle ripples on its surface.","“Please watch the visuals sent back by Mr. Fang.” Li Haoran, the host of Approaching Science, said at this moment.","“The blue sky and cyan ocean are so pretty!?”","“Is this really the legendary forbidden zone...?”","“Oh... Is this the so-called Heavenly Abyss Sea?”","The audience was surprised.","The godly swords who had been busy describing the dangers in Heavenly Abyss Sea scratched their heads. “Ugh? How come it looks like this?”"]},{"number":573,"title":"Chapter 573 - This Isn’t Scientific!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the Heavenly Abyss Sea was clear with a gentle breeze, which was totally different from the dire situation described by the godly swords.","The people who were not playing online all sat in the lounge area to watch Mr. Fang’s livestream named ‘Approaching Science.’","[TL Note: Approaching Science is a documentary film program of China’s CCTV-10. It was first broadcast on June 1, 1998 and became a “popular program of CCTV”. The subjects of the program include biology, archaeology, psychology, etc.]","“This ocean doesn’t look any different from any other sea...” Mu Qing murmured while gazing at the big screen in puzzlement.","“Little girl, don’t let the peaceful appearance of the Heavenly Abyss Sea fool you!” The two black-robed figures who seldomly spoke snorted. “In a little while, black winds might come up and put all these people in danger!”","“Really?” Jiang Xiaoyue munched on potato chips while watching the livestream.","After she finished half a bag of the potato chips, she asked, “Where are the black winds?”","“They will come later...”","Then, she finished the remaining potato chips in the bag.","Glancing at the peaceful ocean, Mr. Fang asked, “You mean... the ancient immortals all ascended from this place?”","Gu Tingyun said, “According to the records in the ancient scrolls, they seemed to have all came here without exception.”","Mr. Fang looked out of the window in bewilderment and asked, “Shall we... fly up and have a look?”","“This Approaching Science is boring. The Heavenly Abyss Sea is just like an ordinary sea,” Mu Qing said, “But the legends make it sound so unusual and fascinating.”","“Many years has passed, and many things can change in such a long time. Maybe the dangers have disappeared long ago.”","Instead of finding extreme dangers in the Heavenly Abyss Sea, they found that it was peaceful and quiet. With their anxiety gone, they were in a good mood. Academy Master Gu who sat in the cockpit began to hum to himself.","“West Lake is so beautiful in March...”","Mr. Fang was still talking on the side, “Guys, do you think we can fly to a planet if we keep going?”","“Look! The mist is up! The wind is up!” Someone suddenly yelled in the shop.","“Sir, look at that. These natives... where are they going?!","At this moment, Jessica and her companions who had been drowsy while sitting on a couch suddenly jumped up. “These guys...!?”","They just flew out like this?!","In the mist, they seemed to see black lightning bolts piercing the void. They couldn’t see the sun or the stars. It seemed like they traveled in a vortex tunnel.","“Um? Where’s this place? Pilot! Where’s Academy Master Gu?!”","“I don’t know where we are!”","“Oh! The instruments all seem to have issues!”","“An unknown magnetic field is detected!”","“Are we beginning the tribulation?”","“We’re finished! Forcing to pass the tribulation without enough cultivation strength, I’ll be burned by the lightning!”","The audience in the shop exclaimed in alarm as well.","Bedlam broke out in the shop and in the jet.","Jessica and her companions slammed their hands on their foreheads.","The two black-robed figures exchanged a look. “...”","After traveling through a long tunnel, the jet passed through the dark void.","“Ugh? Where is this place?” The scene before them turned from an ocean to the sky above a giant, endless forest.","It seemed that they had come to another world.","This was a world totally different from their homeworld.","Everyone stared at the scene before them dumbfoundedly. Then, they glanced at Mr. Fang.","Dumbfounded, Mr. Fang pointed at the scene before him and yelled, “This is not scientific!”","Where is the starry sky?! Where are the cosmos and the universe?!","No! I was doing a livestream! How come we are suddenly in this place after flying up?","How can I continue this livestream?!","Is this the Upper Realm?! The Immortal Realm?!","Li Haoran said, “Welcome to this episode of Approaching Science. As we can see, our Mr. Fang seems to have encountered a small problem and feels like this isn’t scientific.”","“I don’t think it’s scientific either.” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Su Tianji stuffed a potato chip into her mouth and joined the fun. [Does it mean that they passed the tribulation just like that?]","Jiang Xiaoyue chimed in, [Isn’t this show called Approaching Science?]","Jessica and her companions still had their hands on their foreheads.","The two black-robed figures exchanged a baffled look.","Mr. Fang’s live show Approaching Science continued.","“Where are we now?” Gu Tingyun looked back at Mr. Fang in bewilderment.","Mr. Fang looked at him dazedly, thinking, How can I know? This world of yours is different from the world that I lived in before I traveled through space and time...","While flying with the sword control technique, I can’t go up further after reaching a certain height. But in the sky above Heavenly Abyss Sea, we flew to this place after flying up for only a short while?","Did I travel through space and time again?","This time, I had traveled through space and time with people of another world and even the aircraft? This is really not scientific.","Wishing to stop the livestream of Approaching Science, Mr. Fang tried to explain with embarrassment on his face, “This... we might have touched some trigger and were sent to another place. My theory has a scientific foundation; there is no need to doubt me.”","“According to... I think this might be...” Mr. Fang froze as he said that, feeling like it was impossible to explain this situation.","At this moment, Gu Tingyun said, “I think this place might be a small world. In other words, we might have stumbled through a portal and came to this place by accident.”","“Right! Right! Right! I think Academy Gu’s theory makes sense.” Mr. Fang agreed immediately. “In today’s Approaching Science, we will take you to explore the secrets of this place!”","Jessica looked contemptuous. Your native world is a small world, alright? How can you guys call our world a small world?","How did they go over?","It’s said that their Corsair Battle Jet is very powerful and can even detect... magnetic fields. I wonder...","“Look at the sky!” Sia exclaimed at this moment.","Without thinking, Mr. Fang adjusted the camera angle so that everyone could see the world better. Sure enough, there were two suns in the sky. One was overhead while the other was setting.","“Um? There are two solar systems?!” Mr. Fang was totally confused.","This doesn’t make sense! What is wrong with this world?!","“Um...? Interesting.” Luo Piaoling frowned. He turned around and saw Elder Andrew looking over as well.","“What did you find?”","Luo Piaoling nodded and said, “It looks like the picture engraved on the ancient holy item in our family. I thought it depicted a rare phenomenon in the sky. How come...”","“Sir, the energy shield of the Corsair is losing lots of energy...” On the other side, Gu Tingyun reported to Fang Qi.","Mr. Fang said after a moment of pause, “... Today’s Approaching Science ends here! See you all in the next episode!”"]},{"number":574,"title":"Chapter 574 - The People of the Upper Realm Can Livestream Too?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After Mr. Fang bungled his livestream, people began to miss his nimble, sharp, and fancy shows in previous livestreams.","This time, Mr. Fang was so lame and idle that he even bungled his livestream. People began to wonder what happened to the Mr. Fang that they had known.","“How come Boss became so lame!” Jiang Xiaoyue mumbled. In the past, Mr. Fang had been regarded as a grandmaster whose plays, talents, and martial arts awed everyone as he tried his best at everything. But now, he looked like everyone else who were unknowledgeable and could fail. He was no longer on a pedestal anymore, and the others didn’t feel the need to look up at him all the time.","“... I think I like the lame version...” Xiaoyue murmured to herself.","At this moment, even Jessica thought that they could capture this lame shop owner and tie him down before taking him back to avenge themselves.","However, when she thought about it, she shivered subconsciously. Damn it! We had made the mistake by mistaking him for a lame guy, trying to shock him. In the end, we ended up as his janitors.","She began to suspect that this kid knew some things and just kept them a secret.","“Um... It’s natural to fail once or twice if you livestream constantly!” Seeing the gazes from Gu Tingyun and others, Mr. Fang remained cool as if it wasn’t a big deal.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang saw his communication jade which was attached on his belt blink.","As for why Mr. Fang could still receive messages in this place... Since he could even livestream from here, it meant that Mr. Fang always had signal with him.","As long as the other side also used the new communication jades, they could send messages to him through the network in the shop.","[Admit it. You knew our identities since long ago, right?]","Looking at the message from this strange ID, Mr. Fang hesitated and asked, [Jessica?]","In the shop, Jessica felt as if she were struck, and her vision darkened. I knew it!","She hadn’t told him her name, but this kid had guessed that the message was from her!","[What are you up to?] Jessica quickly sent a message to ask him.","“Um...” Mr. Fang answered, [I’m just a shop owner, what do you think I can do? Maybe I can open a branch shop here so people can play games together...]","“Pu!” Jessica almost spewed out blood. [We are enemies! Enemies! Aren’t you afraid of being killed?!]","“Then, what’s your mission?” Fang Qi asked, “I don’t think our destruction will bring you anything good. Even if you want to take things from this place, you don’t have to destroy everything.]","[I can’t tell you.] Jessica’s words oozed with the pride that was instilled in her bloodline. [You natives of the lower planes would never understand!]","[Colonization?] Fang Qi asked in surprise, [Suppression or slavery?]","[Or... the pure urge to destroy people different from you?]","Jessica looked a bit surprised, finding that this native seemed to know more than she had imagined.","[Your way of thinking... is very dangerous,] Mr. Fang said earnestly.","[The powerful preys on the weak; its the survival of the fittest.]","[Besides, don’t think that the fantasy worlds in your shop are so grand. In fact, we have had such things long ago.] Jessica added, [The true fantasy worlds can recreate the past relics and even planes which truly existed. They are like cultivation towers and wouldn’t make people fall back in terms of cultivation, unlike the fantasy worlds here which are faked to awe people.]","Hearing her words, Fang Qi was a bit startled, and he thought, There are such awesome stuff in this world?","[Humph. Besides, your so-called livestream isn’t something new,] Jessica said, [Many powerful fighters can cast visuals with spiritual spells when they enter these fantasy worlds. As for the battles among powerful fighters, hundreds of thousands of people can watch them through this spell. The weaker ones don’t even have the right to watch!","“It’s why we are so powerful!” If she hadn’t been so arrogant, this scummy shop owner would have begged for her mercy long ago.","Mr. Fang widened his eyes. These people in this world can livestream too?!","[How long have you been doing this?] he asked immediately.","[Much longer than you guys,] Jessica said with a snicker. [It has a long history of development.]","After all, fantasy worlds were not something that people could create in a short time.","[But now, it’s getting more popular by the day.] While she said it, Jessica sat straighter subconsciously.","After all, they were people from a higher plane, and these natives were inferior to them in every aspect.","To make sure, Mr. Fang asked again, [Do you really have such fantasy words? And many people watch them? If I want to watch them, which direction should I go?]","[Where are you now?] Jessica was pleased with Mr. Fang’s interest, hoping to stun and awe this damn native with powerful masters and the livestream industry which they took great pride in!","No! Their livestream was called Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","Spiritual spells and scientific technology were different, but they could achieve similar results in many areas.","Through spiritual spells and spiritual artifacts, some grandmasters could create some special cultivation spaces.","Even the cultivators of Spiritual State could create fantasy worlds. The people in the Upper Realm who were in a more advanced civilization could certainly do better in this area.","These fantasy worlds wouldn’t trap people or do harm to anyone. Instead, they would bring great benefits to people.","These people used the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection to achieve the effects of livestream while some grandmasters combined forces to create large-scale fantasy worlds. This method was now very mature in this world.","According to Jessica’s introduction, this continent had a large number of spell casters, which, in Fang Qi’s mind, were like cultivators in the cultivation civilizations.","There were many cultivators and warriors from the East and the West of the continent, and many grandmasters had been livestreaming.","Mr. Fang thought, Emmmm..."]},{"number":575,"title":"Chapter 575 - Dumb Mr. Fang Arrived at the New Continent","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Different from the Spiritual State, this world had many languages including the oriental languages similar to the Spiritual State language and the spirit energy communication method as Jessica did with Fang Qi in the beginning.","Of course, they also had a special basic language, which was called the inspiration spiritual spell.","After being tutored by Jessica from a distance and going through a series of processes, Fang Qi and his companions no longer needed to worry about the language barrier in this place.","“Hiss-! This city is so prosperous and bustling! Achoo!” Walking on the streets of the city, Fang Qi sneezed and looked around with great interest.","The people here mostly looked like the Westerners back on Earth, before he traveled through space and time, but there were also oriental people with black hair and dark eyes walking swiftly on the street in cloaks.","Fang Qi was astonished to see that there were all kinds of non-humans, and some of them had human bodies and beast heads.","This city was very grand and was even bigger than Yuanyang City.","In the city were buildings with white walls and red tiles. Clean water sprayed out from the fountain in the huge round flowerbed surrounded by the meticulously pruned green hedges. The pure white stone benches on both sides of the street were spotless.","However, not everyone they saw was more powerful than the grandmasters such as Gu Tingyun. On this vast continent, most cultivators had moderate cultivation strength. But walking on the street, Fang Qi sensed several extremely powerful presences from the crowds that he passed.","Two rows of heavy cavalry wearing heavy silver armor passed them, emitting gloomy murderous spirit.","“Is this... the much bigger land that Jessica mentioned...?”","Fang Qi remembered that the top-level currency in this continent was the golden rock containing tremendous energy. He had seen it when he betted with Jessica.","This rock was called a Golden Dragon Eye, which was never seen in Spiritual State.","Of course, the ordinary people traded with currencies similar to spiritual stones.","This was a land fraught with endless natural treasures. The vastness of the land was unimaginable, and there was more than one plane hidden in the depth of the land.","In a projected screen before him, Fang Qi saw a battle between a human and a huge dragon. The huge dragon spat out streaks of flames, ice, and thunderbolts which could travel 1,000 meters without losing power. The man wearing fiery-red spiritual robe chanted in a low voice, and the aura of the godly spell engulfed the whole space. Watching the scenes of the grand battle, people’s exclamations erupted like a tsunami.","The booming noises of the battle, the roars of the huge dragon, and the people’s boisterous shouts combined and assaulted Fang Qi’s ears.","“Ancient dragon! It’s an ancient dragon!”","...","Like a yellow butterfly that was fluttering its wings, a withered leaf slowly landed on Fang Qi’s shoulder.","It was autumn.","Autumn was a season that everything withered, and it was also the season where living beings died or went into rest and hibernation.","This land didn’t only have two suns but two moons as well. In a clear night, people could see two radiant moons, one red and one blue, up in the high sky.","They looked wondrous and beautiful.","High mountains rolled on the land, and many peaks reached as high as 10,000 meters. Dotted like stars in the cosmos, cities of various sizes were built on these peaks.","In the distance, there was a huge mountain peak which shot up into the sky like a sharp sword. On the top of the high cliff, white ice and snow covered the land, and there was a huge white tower with a sharp tip in the center of this place.","Six golden light patterns with different shapes rotated around the tip of the tower, making the building look like a bright lighthouse.","Her black hair was as thick and curly as surging ocean waves, draping over the throne that was covered by a snow-white fur and decorated by fiery-red gems.","This woman was wearing a pale-golden silky dress which revealed a small portion of snow-white skin, and her goddess-like cold face looked as flawless as white jade. The slightly slanting ends of her eyebrows made her look even colder and haughtier.","“How is the expedition of the Judgement Godly Palace?”","“The news of victory hadn’t come yet,” a dignified-looking, middle-aged man who was wearing silver armor replied.","“The Flame Inquisitor whose nickname is Permanent Flame, the First Place of the Godly Palace, has tamed the Ancient Dragon Alfa?”","“He has shown it to the world with the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection,” the middle-aged man said.","“Who do you think is stronger, me or the Flame Inquisitor of the Judgement Godly Palace?”","“Of course, you’re stronger, Princess Your Highness,” the middle-aged man said with a bow.","“Princess Your Highness, did you challenge those ancient existences again?”","Arrogance appeared in her eyes as she said, “It’s a pity that I’ve never had a taste of failure...”","Then, her lips curled up and showed a disdainful sneer. “Is there really no one who can defeat me.”","...","In any place of the world, autumn was always a bleak season signaling old age and decay. However, in this vast and beautiful land, flowers were still blooming everywhere.","Different from other places, this huge space was full of vital energy. Strange golden lights blinked in the sky like nimble tadpoles, moving and flashing around.","Their movements looked random, but they secretly followed the pattern of star movements without stopping day and night.","“Swein.” An old man wearing a grey robe entered this ethereal space with a walking cane in his hand.","In the sky, quick wind supported a man who had silver long hair and a cold, chiseled face like invisible wings.","“What’s going on?”","His eyes filled with vicissitude and the passage of time seemed to have came back from the endless void, shooting out godly lights that looked like lightning flashes.","The grey-robed old man chuckled. “So many years have passed, and you are the same way. You are still as rude as ever to your guests.”","“I just came back from the state of Epiphany after sensing something.” The silver-haired man named Swein said mildly, “My Friend, how are you doing?”","The old man said meaningfully, “It’s a great honor to be called ‘my friend’ by the Guardian of Wind. I’m afraid that few people in this whole continent have this honor.”","“I heard that you traveled to the distant East and had just returned?”","The old man laughed and said, “Those people kept fighting for the title of No.1, and I gave them a good lesson. Hahaha!”","“In the whole continent, I’m afraid that only you can defeat that Holiness.”","“I can’t say that. After all, there’s always someone more powerful out there, right?” The old man said, “I don’t want to show off in front of the Guardian of Wind. If you came out of this space one day, I’m sure that you will be an existence that everyone in the continent looks up to.”","“I’m not so sure...” The silver-haired man said, “I seem to sense a very gloomy presence that is moving restlessly in a distant space. As if it is hiding in a swamp of death, its presence is well-concealed. However, I can still sense the evil in it.”","“Perhaps, it has come to the continent.”"]},{"number":576,"title":"Chapter 576 - Sir, Deposit More Money!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Naturally, Fang Qi didn’t want to see the regions where he had shops at engaging in a war against each other.","After all, if people weren’t living in a peaceful time, no one would have the leisure to play online games and watch TV Series in his shops.","He knew that it was only a matter of time that the force behind Jessica, Carl, and Kevin would find out about their sticky situation.","From his conversation with Jessica, Fang Qi sensed that this land was so vast that even the forces behind her hadn’t been able to explore the whole continent.","From the information that she revealed, Fang Qi had the vague feeling that ancient existences like gods existed in this world.","Although Jessica hadn’t seen them with her own eyes, their existence was proved by many prophecies and miracles that happened in the past countless years.","Also, the spiritual patterns between their eyebrows were distinct evidence since these patterns were condensed from godly power. With these patterns, they could borrow power from the gods and use godly spiritual spells.","When two opponents of the same realm battled, with one being an ordinary cultivator or warrior who used ordinary spiritual essence and warrior qi and the other being someone who could activate such horrifying power, it was obvious who would win.","It wasn’t a battle between rivals of the same level!","It was one of the reasons why they looked down on the cultivators of the Spiritual State and dared to be arrogant.","Fang Qi had defeated them since he had the experience of countless battles. At least his game character had absorbed most of the power of the demons. After he achieved Complete Synchronization with the character, he could overpower his three opponents in terms of granular control of his energy.","Combined with the great power of Evil Sword Apophis and other equipment that offered great strength, he could fight them one versus three.","If Mr. Fang had been a newbie Soul Bender, he would have been defeated without a doubt.","Among these outlanders, Carl was the strongest, but he was only a vanguard general.","Fang Qi could imagine the great power of the Judgement Godly Palace, the force behind them.","Fortunately, Mr. Fang was here to open a shop, and he wasn’t an invader who would arrogantly claim to destroy this world. Therefore, he wasn’t worried that someone would come to him and beat him senseless like what he did to the three outlanders.","...","“Burp-!” Jessica tossed down the broom and belched uncontrollably with a bottle of Coke in her hand. “Ugh? I drank a whole bottle already? Get me a bottle of iced red tea!”","Then, she took out a strange purple crystal and paid for it.","“After I return, I’ll capture this despicable shop owner and force him to make red iced tea for us each day!” Jessica said with a snort.","Her lips curved up when she imagined the scene in which Mr. Fang served her tea and massaged her back. Her mood lightened at the thought.","“We must be cautious; there are many traps and mechanisms in the shop!” Kevin said in a low voice, “While we are here, we can gather more information and see what powerful and mysterious force is behind this shop!”","Obviously, he remembered his failure to escape from the window and door after trying to break them for a whole night, and thus he was very cautious.","On the other hand, they didn’t want people to know about their humiliating experience, so they considered how to negotiate their release with Mr. Fang while gathering information about the shop.","...","“We must prepare for the invasion of the outlanders.” Gu Tingyun looked grim. “Since we came to their world through the Heavenly Abyss Sea, they can one day go to our Spiritual State through the same portal. If that happens, the Spiritual State will be in danger!”","Fang Qi turned serious as this moment as well since he had lived in the Deserted Sea Realm for a long time and could be considered as half a native. “We must get prepared.”","Fang Qi now clearly understood that the invaders came from the force called the Judgement Godly Palace. Although he didn’t know the status of this force in the whole continent, he knew that it didn’t represent all the forces on this land.","Of course, there might be other forces coinciding with the Judgement Godly Palace in terms of missions and strategies, which was a factor that Fang Qi must put into consideration.","“I plan to return to the Spiritual State today and begin the preparations. What’s your plan, Mr. Fang?” Gu Tingyun didn’t plan to drag this on.","“I plan to find a peaceful spot to open a branch shop while experiencing the life and customs in this place. I’ll keep you guys informed and message you when I detect something,” Fang Qi said.","“Okay. Sounds good.”","...","In fact, under the suppression of the powerful Upper Realm, the fates of the cultivators and warriors in places such as the Spiritual State, Deserted Sea Realm, and Ultimate West Realm didn’t depend on Fang Qi but themselves.","Fang Qi alone couldn’t determine their fates. After all, Jessica was correct in one thing; the powerful preyed on the weak, and only the fittest would survive.","One had to admit that some things could unite all people.","Hatred and conflict of interests were nothing in front of such issues.","The cultivators of Half City were not good friends with their counterparts in the big factions of the Morning Star Sea Realm, but now they had to work together and be cooperative on the surface.","Dajin and the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had been enemies with the Yundian Upper Realm and the two saint factions respectively, but none of them had conflicts with the cultivators of Spiritual State.","The two figures hidden in black robes were now sitting in a corner of the shop. “Should we...”","“Of course...” the big man wearing a black cloak said bleakly while he gazed at the jade tablet engraved with two characters ‘Luo Tian’ in his hand, “Time flows by slowly, and the past feels like a dream. I hope your immortal souls will bless us and help us obtain victory this time!”","“So many years have passed... Now, we are going to face the enemies that they had once faced...”","“How is the ‘demonic energy’ in your body?” The black-robed man asked in a low voice.","The woman frowned slightly and replied, “I can hear the demon’s whispers occasionally, just like how it is in that world (the world in the game). The power contained in this advancement contract is perfect. Now I have the strength of ‘Stigmata,’ and I’m not afraid of demons.”","“Besides, I think I can condense a seed for demonic energy. With aid from that world, I think you can soon obtain your advancement as well.”","“With this power, perhaps ‘awakening’ is no longer so far away from us!”","“Then, let’s go to that world and study it to obtain more inspirations!”","“Let’s use up the fatigue points and then join their discussions!”","“Let’s go! If I get a piece of good equipment, I’ll treat you to Coke!”","“Should we reinforce the equipment to level 14? I remember that the prize coupon doesn’t have a restriction on the reinforcement levels.”","“My goodness! You’re right! We can’t stop at 14! We must make it to 20!”","“Sir! Deposit more money in my card!”"]},{"number":577,"title":"Chapter 577 - Resident Evil 2?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Regardless of what you learn, whether it was martial arts or combat techniques, the fundamental skills were indispensable.","The sword techniques that were powerful enough to hack open mountains and rivers originated from the most basic hacking movements.","The grandmasters who were sweeping across the whole continent had gone through the same basic training when they were young.","Only on a solid foundation can tall buildings stand still.","Therefore, don’t be surprised if you see someone knocking down a huge dragon with a rusty iron sword or someone easily battling a heavily-armored fighter with bare fists.","It was because these people were truly grandmasters.","“If you’re confident in your strength, you can pick up a tree branch from the ground and make it the best weapon in the world.”","Regardless of where they were, what nation they were in, what kind of power they used, and how talented they were, cultivators and warriors must put great efforts in the training of basic skills.","Even on this land that was rumored to have gods, people believed that basic skills were important. In fact, the people here put even more emphasis in basic skill training than anywhere else that Fang Qi had been to.","Big and small nations dotted the land like dazzling stars in the sky or precious stones in a mine, making it look like that the continent was wearing a fancy robe. Among all the nations, the Morning Light Empire that had the surging Canglan River and misty Yinyun Spring, which symbolized life, was the most beautiful pearl on this continent.","This beautiful and rich nation enjoyed the reputation of the Nation of Skills.","This nation put the greatest emphasis on fundamental skills. Although other nations valued fundamental skills as well, the people in this nation put much more time and energy in basic training than the warriors and mages of other nations.","They had complete Martial Dao mystical realms and spiritual spells mystical realms for not only junior warriors and mages but masters as well. The latter group came into these realms to do some special training with suppressed cultivation strengths.","Perhaps before entering these mystical realms, many people had the misunderstanding that the basic cultivation mystic realms were only useful to beginners and could be discarded after one’s cultivation strength grew higher.","However, after entering these realms, the foreigners who came here to cultivate would soon change their minds.","These realms welcomed warriors and mages from all places. If you were lucky, you might even encounter the legendary elves in this nation.","These cultivation mystical realms were treasures of the city which was situated by Canglan River.","People passing this area could hear groups of warriors in two or three discussing combat techniques.","With these techniques, they battled with dangerous magical beasts, hunted for top-quality fur and higher-level magical beast crystals, which was the livelihood for many people.","These realms were not open 24 hours per day. During the night, even the warriors and mages enthralled by these realms were reluctant to disturb the tranquil atmosphere of this city.","On the gravel-paved streets of this ancient European-style city thronged crowds from all over the world. This was a perfect capture of the scenery of this city.","These cultivation mystical realms all belonged to the Alchemist Union, and they had the highest travel flow.","Several young men and women with blond or brown hair had just finished cultivation. While wiping sweat off his foreheads, an innocent-looking young man with freckles was in high spirits. “Did you know? Earlier in the cultivation mystical realm, I defeated a grey wolf which was a level 2 magical beast alone! A level 2 magical beast!”","“It seems that my scores this term will be beyond outstanding! I think I can adventure into the Sunset Forest!” he said excitedly. It was clear that these young people were very interested in unknown and novel stuff.","They were drawn toward it whenever they heard about mercenaries coming back from the Sunset Forest with bags full of magical beast furs, alchemical herbs, and rare minerals.","“Grey wolves appear in groups inside the Sunset Forest. I hope you won’t wet your pants if you encounter them!” a brown-haired young man teased him.","“Right! It’s said that some senior students sneaked into the Sunset Forest and encountered dozens of grey wolves. If a group of mercenaries didn’t pass by, they wouldn’t have made it back!”","“Is it really so horrid...”","...","Through the door of the shop, Fang Qi could see a few oriental people with black hair and dark eyes mingling in the crowds. It was said that they came from another nation in the distant east. Of course, Fang Qi used these words to describe his own background as well.","The small shop had a brand-new and spotless outlook. With only about 100 computers, the shop was neat and quiet. Outside the shop was a round intersection connecting streets with bustling crowds. Through the door, Fang Qi could see the huge traffic and the giant flowerbed in the center of the intersection. On the giant flowerbed was a huge statue of a tall man lifting a long sword. It was a busy area that was good for business.","To Fang Qi’s surprise, after he opened the shop, the prize he got was the game, Resident Evil 2.","He thought it through after a moment of consideration. After all, most people in this world were ordinary, and the power of crowds couldn’t be underestimated. To spread the internet all over the world, it wouldn’t be wise if the shop only provided things that interested the few high-level warriors and grandmasters.","He would have to nurture the ‘young flowers’ with the very basic skills.","Yes, nurture. Mr. Fang thought that this was a good word to describe what he would do.","In the past, whenever he opened a new shop, there would be all the movies and TV Series. But this time, the new shop had only one movie – Resident Evil 2.","Together with the game, the shop offered only two items.","“Origins Internet Club...? What a strange name...”","“Look! There’s a new shop here! When did it open?” As usual, most people would show interest in a shop that they didn’t know anything about.","Driven by curiosity, these young people walked into the shop to see what business the shop was running.","Having just come out of a cultivation mystical realm, these young people walked into the shop and found that the presence inside was mystical and totally different from other shops. Even though the plants and decorations inside the shop matched the city’s style, the square-shaped objects that looked like magic items gave them a novel feeling.","On the counter hung the certificate from the Alchemist Union and the business certificate. Everything showed that it was a legal and formal business.","On the small blackboard was written: [Resident Evil 2 Cultivation Mystical Realm, 10 magic crystals for activation. Resident Evil 2 Movie, 8 magic crystals for activation.]","Underneath were the prices of items such as iced red tea and Coke.","“Computer time is 2 magic crystals per hour.”","“???”","“Resident Evil Cultivation Mystical Realm?!” They looked baffled.","What kind of cultivation mystical realm is this?!","We’ve just come out from the Sunset Forest Mystic Realm of Alchemist Union after killing a grey wolf! Don’t try to fool me! What is this thing?!"]},{"number":578,"title":"Chapter 578 - How Come There Is Such an Oriental Man?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Such an eye-sore.” Seeing the young people walking into the shop, the man standing beside the flowerbed outside the shop said with displeasure. This man had short blond hair that was neatly combed back, and he carried a big sword on his back while wearing a shiny suit of armor.","“What is it? Did someone mess with you, Big Sword Crete?” Beside him, a lean and short man whistled as his fingers played with a small and delicate dagger.","Mr. Fang had opened his shop in the busy section of the city. Nearby was the Mercenary Union, and Alchemist Union wasn’t far away as well.","The blond warrior pointed at the shop and said in resentment, “I mean that oriental man who came from nowhere.”","“Ahh-!” The short man snickered and dragged on his voice as he said flippantly, “An oriental man? The one who went to the Alchemist Union this morning? Did he offend you?”","“This guy doesn’t know his limits. He set several new records in the low-level mystic realms.” The blond man carrying the big sword looked at the shop sulkily and said, “I wonder which wealthy family he comes from. He dares to open a cultivation mystic realm in this place.”","“His moves seem to be quite fancy, and I heard that ‘Fiery Rose’ in the union is fond of him. I remember that you had set some of the records he broke, right? Crete? He doesn’t have any respect for his seniors, which is indeed infuriating.”","“Humph! He is showing off his combat techniques blatantly since he isn’t weak.”","“Should we...” The short one whispered, “Give this foreigner a lesson?”","“A few customers went in. Let’s... frighten them out of the shop!”","“Ruin his reputation!”","“Good idea! Give him a taste of the power of our Golden Sunlight Mercenary Group!”","...","– Meanwhile, in Fang Qi’s shop –","“What is this Resident Evil 2 Cultivation Mystical Realm?!” The brown-haired young man with freckles looked around the shop curiously and said, “This shop... looks strange...”","“So expensive!” The green-eyed girl beside him exclaimed when she saw the prices. “Two magic crystals for one hour...”","What were magic crystals? They were crystals condensed from the energy in magical beasts’ bodies. Only level 2 magical beasts could have a low chance of producing the lowest-level magic crystals, which made these crystals very valuable. With its pure energy, one magic crystal was equal to ten unpurified magic ores.","Obviously, this price was higher than that of ordinary cultivation mystical realms!","In this nation which put great importance on combat techniques, cultivation mystical realms were available to most disciples. These mystic realms were low-leveled and easy to make as the technology matured; they were affordable to most disciples who intended to become warriors and mages.","However, this new shop was even more expensive than the low-level cultivation mystical realm built by people such as the Vice President of the Morning Light Empire Branch of Alchemist Union. The latter had been in business in the city for many years.","“So expensive?!” They had wanted to try it, but they got indignant seeing the high prices.","“Let’s go,” the green-haired girl said, “It’s so expensive. I hope the shop owner lives his life with his magic crystals!”","With a pout, she went out of the shop before others.","“Is this cultivation mystical realm more powerful than the Sunset Forest?” The freckled young man followed her out.","When they looked around, they saw many people gathering before the shop.","“I heard that this shop offended the Golden Sunlight Mercenary Group?” Some spellcasters wearing black cloaks stood outside the shop.","“He’s new to the city, but he has a talent for offending people, uh?”","“He can mess with many people, but why did he choose them?”","“He’s just a little guy; do you really want to play pranks on him?” Behind the blond man named Crete stood a woman who was wearing a black mage cloak, and she asked with a playful smile on her face.","“I just want to play with him.” The blond man also had a playful and teasing smile on his face.","“Okay then.” A short dark red magic staff slid out of the woman’s sleeve. With a light wave of the magic staff, the fountain that was shooting out water toward the flowerbed dashed toward Fang Qi’s shop.","Surprisingly, the water from the fountain turned colorful like paints. In the blink of an eye, the snow-white walls of Fang Qi’s shop were dyed in many colors, and the shopfront looked like a wet chicken that was just taken out of a bucket of paint.","The warriors who were about to enter the shop to check it out paused their steps.","“Hahahaha!” the crowd instantly laughed.","However, in the next instant, the pedestrians on the street, including the blond warrior Crete and that woman, stopped laughing.","The place fell silent.","They saw the paint slide down from the walls and turn fainter until it became thin streams of water.","More surprising was that the water seemed to give a shower to the small building, turning the slightly yellowed walls pristine white. With the remaining dust washed off, the tiles on the ceiling looked spotless and translucent.","“!!??”","“Try again! Put more effort in it!”","“I just don’t believe it!”","When the water sprayed to the building, the audience widened their eyes. The water drops turned into white mist as if they were evaporated by some unknown heat source, engulfing the small shop in an ethereal white fog! This place looked like a shop of the immortals.","“Awesome...”","“Excellent!”","The young people who had just come out of the shop stood outside and exclaimed with hands covering their mouths, and disbelief appeared in their eyes.","Not only the blond man but the woman who cast the spell froze. “What is going on?!”","Mr. Fang frowned and murmured, “What’s happening outside?”","He strode out of the door.","“He’s coming out!”","“Get ready!”","“This time, we must humiliate him in front of everyone!”","“Don’t worry! I set up a small spiritual spell on the ground. It will be great to see so many people witness his humiliation.”","At this moment, the door of the shop opened, and a young man flew out stepping on a silver sword beam.","With mist surrounding the shop, the figure flying out while stepping on the sword beam looked like an immortal to the people outside the door.","“Hello! Everyone!” Mr. Fang greeted them friendly.","“Ahh-! This oriental man is dashing!”","“Wow-!”","“Cool!”","All the people of the Upper Realm who were standing on the street were stupefied by the sight.","“Joseph.” The young people who had planned to leave due to the high prices said, “Cia, shall we go back and try it...”","“Ahh-! The shop owner is so cool!” The girl with green hair and green eyes had stars in her eyes. “Let’s go and try the new mystic realm in the shop!”","“Well, should we go in and have a look?” The mages who were here to watch the drama at the door hesitated for a second before walking into the shop.","“Let’s go as well...” Some warriors carrying heavy weapons walked into the shop too.","“Ugh...?”","The blond man carrying the big sword was silent.","The short man stammered, “Um...”","The female mage didn’t say anything.","Silence fell on them.","After a long while, they scratched their heads.","“Hehe...”","“Hahaha...”","“Heiheihei...”"]},{"number":579,"title":"Chapter 579 - New Difficulty Levels; New Challenges!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The white and transparent grand hall looked as if it were carved out of a giant piece of crystal. In one glance, it was clear but bottomless like a deep spring.","“Princess, Your Highness!” The middle-aged guard kneeled on one knee.","“Is there anything... interesting that happened?” A woman sat on a tall throne made with crystals and precious stones. Her feet rested on the pedestal which was as high as the guard’s head.","This girl looked to be about 19 years old. The skin revealed by her sleeveless ice-blue long dress was whiter than snow. With her hands in silk gloves and resting on her lap, she looked dignified and elegant like a statue of a goddess.","With her youthful looks, it was hard to connect her to that legendary existence.","“Yes?” Her gaze lowered to him coldly.","The guard immediately answered, “The information from the Judgement Godly Palace shows that the Vanguard General and army that they sent to attack that plane seemed to have been captured!”","“Oh? Hehe... In a barbaric plane?!” At this moment, the existence sitting on the throne showed some interest.","...","The Judgement Godly Palace seemed to have existed on this land for a long, long time.","Their presences could be seen everywhere in this world.","They spread their beliefs all over the world. In fact, they had members inside many nations.","It was one of the largest powerhouses in the complicated power system on this continent.","A man wore a milky-white priest robe decorated with the pattern of a strange hexagonal flame.","A huge dragon with crystal-like silver scales lay beside him.","Sitting on the highest position in the grand hall, his head was on the same level of the huge dragon’s head, looking down at the mortals like a god.","The presence that he emitted was so hot that it could suffocate anyone who came close to him. In contrast, his eyes were as cold as ice.","“God said that flames will burn up all sins,” he said slowly. According to the records in the Godly Palace, this man who looked to be about 30 years old with dazzling handsome facial features had once served the God.","“God said that anyone who betrays the glories of God will be judged and punished.”","Such an existence stood at the top of the continent.","Carl and his two companions hadn’t expected that Judgement Godly Palace would know about their capture so soon.","After all, as the Flame Inquisitor, he had his own means and channels that were unknown to others.","“The Vanguard General and his two companions are elites of the Godly Palace.” Two rows of people stood neatly before the Flame Inquisitor. The people in one row wore silver armor while the people in the other row wore white priest robes.","Only a handful of people standing in the very front wore red robes and red armor, a sharp contrast from the rest.","Each of them emitted a horrifying presence. The further ahead they stood, the greater the presence they emitted.","Their expressions were cold, but their eyes had heat in them.","“I’m sad that some of our people have discarded their godly patterns and betrayed the glory of God.”","“Please release the holy flames and purge their sins!” One white-robed priest bowed and said.","They talked as if they could decide people’s lives with one word.","“No.” The white-robed man who looked as holy as a god said, “I think they only submitted and behaved against the law due to suppression; they still have a chance for redemption.”","“The people who dragged them down should be purged by the holy flame,” the haughty, godlike man said.","“I’m willing to lead the Godly Punishment Army to execute the godly punishment!” This time, the man standing in the foremost opened his mouth and spoke. He wore bright red armor engraved with a golden hexagonal flame pattern, and in the center of the flame was a holy hammer.","Only six people in the grand hall wore such armor.","They were members of the Judgement Knight Legion. Each of them possessed great strength unimaginable to mortals.","“No. You shouldn’t have to undertake such a trivial mission,” the existence sitting on the high pedestal said calmly.","“It’s only a small task to destroy a barbaric plane.” A man wearing a golden robe walked up. “I think the Thorn Flower Family and Flame Bird Family who serve our God are willing to do the job.”","Sitting on the extremely tall pedestal, the Flame Inquisitor nodded slightly.","“The people who lured God’s children and made them fall should be punished most severely. Let that person of the Dark Wing Knight Legion do the job.”","...","“Achoo!” Mr. Fang suddenly sneezed and thought, Who’s thinking of me?","At this moment, he was managing the new shop.","With all his attention focused on how to nurture the ‘new flowers’, he was oblivious to the hidden currents after having a new goal. He had no idea what was going on.","“Wow-!” The young people had gotten online, and they found that the computers in the shop were totally different from their experience in the traditional cultivation mystical realms.","“Are these magical items made by the oriental spellcasters...?” The freckled young man was Joseph, and the green-haired and green-eyed girl was Cia. It was evident that they were amazed by these ‘oriental-style’ magic items.","In fact, hand-to-hand combat techniques were not low-level skills.","They were only weak when used by weak people.","There were differences between techniques; large differences.","However, the simplest fundamental techniques usually contained the greatest potential and variations.","The monster systems in Resident Evil 2 was larger and more complicated than that in Resident Evil 1. Since the game simulated the real world, even soldiers of special forces couldn’t battle with such monsters with their bodies if they didn’t have powerful close-range combat techniques.","The system remake of Resident Evil 2 was different from Resident Evil 1.","It had three difficulty levels for players to choose, and each level required different levels of combat techniques.","In the basic difficulty, the players could choose Leon and Claire. At this stage, Leon was only a new recruit in terms of combat techniques. Although Claire had learned some combat techniques and shooting skills from Chris, she was still a university student and not proficient with these skills.","In the challenge difficulty, the players could choose Chris and Ada whose strengths didn’t need more description.","In the ultimate difficulty, the players were equipped with only one dagger and three herbs. If you passed this difficulty, you probably would know the true meaning of ‘granular control.’"]},{"number":580,"title":"Chapter 580 - Do You Want to Understand the Meaning of Life? Do You Want to Live for Real?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The new shop only offered Resident Evil 2 to the players, but it was released at the same time in the other shops, including the Jiuhua City Shop, the Half City Shop, and the Yuanyang City Shop.","“Are you finally up?! Mr. Fang has gone to the outland!”","“Oh...” Su Tianji walked into the shop groggily. Recently, they had been discussing a spiritual spell named ‘Super Railgun’ in the research group chant, and they talked late into the night.","In fact, they had begun to think and tried to create this spiritual spell as early as when they first saw the Gauss guns.","With the spiritual spell of transforming lightning into threads, they could study the coil guns. Of course, they did more than discussing it. For example, at this moment, Su Tianji sat on the couch with a bowl of instant noodles in one hand and a pink ‘iPhone’ communication jade in the other; it still had the face of a cute cat printed on the back.","[Ding-dong.]","“Huh...”","The visual that the communication jade showed was a flat chested girl humming a song, and the title was ‘A Certain Scientific Railgun.’","“Master, what are you watching?”","“It’s a story about a girl firing the railgun...” Since she could only purchase the framework of some spiritual spells in Qzone after watching this, she had to watch it and enjoy it.","During breakfast, she watched one episode of this anime with her disciples.","Perhaps only when they ate instant noodles in the shop could they enjoy a moment of peace.","After all, they were threatened by the permanent existences from that unknown world.","“My job is to protect the continent! How can I be so lazy and idle here?!”","“Aw! The shop released a new game!”","“What new game?” Su Tianji immediately turned her head to the voice.","“Resident Evil 2!”","“...” Su Tianji sat back down while pouting. “Resident Evil 2? What is fun about that?”","It has a low power system. Anyway, I can’t really go and try to develop the T-Virus and toss it into the home of the outlanders, right?","Also, it is impossible to produce such a thing.","I’m better off watching my railgun girl anime...","While watching the anime on a couch, she sent a message to Mr. Fang on QQ. [Sir, how come you released this new game? (Husky’s disdainful face)]","Mr. Fang replied, [???]","[Why don’t you play it?!]","Su Tianji asked, [Strange. Why should I?]","Sitting in the new shop, Mr. Fang chose a meme from the QQ meme collection and sent it to her.","[Do you want to understand the meaning of life? Do you want to live for real?]","Under the question were two options. The first was [Yes], and the second was [Okay].","Su Tianji stared at the screen in a daze. She almost spat out a mouthful of blood onto the screen, and she felt frustrated and wanted to beat up Mr. Fang. How can I choose from these two options?!","[Do you want to hear a story?] Mr. Fang asked.","[Ugh? A story?] It felt like an adult was trying to calm down a child.","Su Tianji thought for a second and replied, [I, a fairy, will give you face and listen to you.]","Then, Mr. Fang told her about a world named Terror Infinity.","After watching the Matrix, Su Tianji didn’t find the weird concept of Terror Infinity very hard to understand.","“Oh!” Hearing only part of it, Su Tianji jumped up and asked, [Do you mean that I can open the...um... genetic lock if I play Resident Evil 2?]","[You can only do it in the ultimate state,] Mr. Fang added.","Quickly turning off her communication jade, Su Tianji got up and murmured, “We can practice ultimate movements and techniques in Resident Evil? I’m going to play it!”","She went online cheerfully.","“...” Mr. Fang froze. “I was only telling a story. I didn’t say that it was real...”","[Hey! Hey! How come you’re playing Resident Evil?] In the group for chat for the ‘Super Railgun’, the members were puzzled when Su Tianji announced that she would try Resident Evil 2.","This game couldn’t meet the high demands of these grand cultivators and high-level warriors!","It was for the low-level young people to play.","Then, Su Tianji posted a meme in the group.","[Do you want to understand the meaning of life? Do you want to live for real?]","Then, she told them about Terror Infinity.","[F*ck?!]","[Such a thing exists?]","[Me! Me! Me! I want to play it, too!🤣 ] A member with the profile picture of a big white deer had slipped into the group.","The deer wanted to learn the railgun spiritual spell? And it even wanted to open the genetic lock? It definitely lacked a good understanding of itself.","[I want to play it too. Hehehe...🤗] A loli joined the fun as well.","Compared to the players in the old shops who lacked an understanding of themselves, the players in the new shop were much better.","Not needing Mr. Fang to tell them a story about life’s meaning, these people in this world just paid and entered the game.","“Oh! This cultivation mystical realm is so different!” The brown-haired young man yelled, “I’ve turned into another man! My name is Leon!”","“Ahh-!” The young girl with green hair also exclaimed, “I’m Claire; I have matured! Can I drink a bit of wine now?”","The blond man named Big Sword Crete who had caused trouble outside the shop entered the game as well. “What good stuff can this small shop have? It must be a basic mystical realm of the lowest level!”","“Watch me! I’ll kill all the beasts in the realm and break all the records in the shop!”","After entering the game, the players saw a city engulfed in a weird atmosphere and darkness.","The prosperous city with skyscrapers and shops didn’t even have a single light on; it was really strange.","Having just graduated from the police academy, Leon drove to the police office on his first day of work.","“This mystical realm looks weird!” While watching the opening cinematics, the outlanders put down their virtual reality headsets and exchanged a look.","They all sensed the creepy atmosphere in the game.","After putting virtual reality headsets back onto their heads, they seemed to hear staggering steps in the darkness.","At this moment, they officially entered the game.","“Where’s my qi?! Where’s my power?! How come I turn into an ordinary person?!” The Blond Mercenary Crete yelled when he saw ‘humans’ with dirty blood on their pale faces staggering toward him.","“F*ck off! You damn wastrels!” Crete quickly kicked the first zombie on the chest.","However, he didn’t notice that the ‘corpse’ lying on the ground suddenly opened its eyes.","During the interlude cinematics, Leon had stopped by this corpse to check it.","“Ahhh-! It bit my leg!”","“How can this person be biting other people!”","– Meanwhile, screams sounded in the shop –","“How come this thing can’t be killed?!”","“Ahhh-!”","Blood was everywhere on the screen. After exiting the virtual reality mode, these people stared at the screen and watched as the bodies of their game characters were eaten by the zombies. This fear made their hair stand on end!","On this day, these outlanders were struck by the fear of being overwhelmed by zombies."]},{"number":581,"title":"Chapter 581 - Tyrants and Lickers Came out as Small Monsters?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ah-! Ahh-!”","Even the veteran mercenaries of the Golden Sunlight Mercenary Group, which was claimed to be the most ferocious mercenary group, leaped up in fear. Without thinking, others were in even worse states.","Even the female players were scared when they entered the bar as Claire, the main character, and saw the zombie, which looked similar to the first generation, eating a corpse.","“What’s this mystical realm?!”","“This mystical realm is not for cultivation; it’s used to scare people!”","The mercenaries complained loudly.","After all, they had fought countless battles. If they were given a bit of their cultivation strength, they would be killing machines in the game.","The mages shared this thought. If we can cast a spiritual spell in the game, even a small fireball will work!","However, they couldn’t use any of their strength. The mercenaries yelled, “It’s despicable to increase the difficulty by suppressing our strength!”","“Besides, the monsters in there can’t be killed!” Crete yelled, “After I shattered its chest with Land Shatter (the combat technique that he used to kick the zombie), it didn’t die! It could still bite people as if nothing happened! How can such monsters exist in the world?!”","Different from Resident Evil 1, almost no one survived in the entire city in Resident Evil 2; the zombies were everywhere. In Resident Evil 1, the players would only encounter one zombie at the beginning.","“I dare to bet that no one can last more than one minute with these monsters!” Crete said as his face turned red in agitation.","While he said that, he heard an exclamation, “Wow! Is this a magical firearm? Awesome!”","The mercenaries looked back and saw the young people who had put down their virtual reality headsets in fear now gather around the girl named Cia. She controlled Claire who was holding an object that looked like a magical firearm.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Then, she quickly ran out.","“...” The mercenaries exchanged a look and wondered, This mystical realm can be like this?","Confident in their own strengths, the mercenaries naturally had a hard time accepting the skills and knowledge in the game. Instead, they tried to kill zombies with their own combat techniques.","Claire, the heroine, was soon rescued by Leon who fired at the zombies with a gun, and it was natural for her to notice this weapon.","After all, this series of games had always been nice to heroines.","Although there were many zombies, and the process was extremely dangerous thrilling, she still managed to flee from the zombies as she screamed.","Different from the original version, the system version had more than those set routes. The players could enter all the shops and houses in the small town to search for supplies.","If they could dodge the zombies that were everywhere, they might find weapons and monsters that the original version didn’t have.","Although the ammunition was limited, they could use sabers, daggers, and other weapons that they picked up from the ground.","After escaping from the siege of the zombies, these people explored the small town with pistols in their hands. Although the atmosphere was tense and suppressing, the players felt a pleasure after escaping from death. The thrilling sensation rushed out of their minds after experiencing the life-and-death situation.","“Oh! This is so cool!”","“Excellent!”","Despite the dangers around them, they had the urge and the impulse to keep exploring, trying to find out what had happened to this world, why the people had turned into monsters, and if there were more of such magical firearms.","“We can play it like this...?”","Mercenary Crete who had swore that no one could last more one minute was frustrated, and his face turned dark.","He turned his head and saw the female mage getting into the zone and enjoying herself.","She was busy shooting zombies with her small pistol.","“Let’s try it too!”","“I remember that I have such a magical firearm too!”","If they broke out from the siege, they could use their physical strength as warriors to fight the lone zombies. Their combat strengths weren’t low, and they could use melee weapons.","At this moment, the health condition of Claire who was under the control of that the female mage deteriorated.","She found that somehow a claw scratch appeared on her arm. This wound had blackened, and something was wriggling in the wound; it was a terrifying scene.","“No! The monster’s claws contain poison!”","Gradually, everything before her turned bloody red, and she somehow felt a strange urge to eat. Soon, the female mage was forced to exit from the virtual reality mode.","Meanwhile, Claire had turned into a pale-faced zombie, lunging toward the screen viciously!","“Ahh-!” Her hands shivered, and she was so frightened that she almost wetted her pants!","A moment ago, this female mage was still Claire.","She seemed to see herself in the other world turning into a ghost-like creature.","“That’s how these creatures came into being?”","“If I get scratched by them, I’ll turn into this type of creatures?!”","Seeing Zombie Claire loitering aimlessly on the street, the mercenaries including Crete felt chills run down their spines.","In the original game, the players could be healed by eating the green herbs, but now...","In the new version, any medicine could only heal wounds. If the players contracted the virus, they must find blood serum before they got turned into zombies. Otherwise, one scratch would turn them into zombies.","Obviously, this new version was more difficult to play.","Experiencing this situation in person, the mages and mercenaries on this new continent began to realize these creatures’ terrifying features bit by bit.","One light scratch could turn people into monsters just like them. This realization shocked the players like the continuous waves of the ocean.","The players’ hearts were in their throats whenever they fought with these monsters.","Even if they remained intact through the battle, they were still worried that their companions might have been scratched by a zombie, and they would be bitten by their zombified companions while they were not looking.","The players didn’t even know when a zombie would appear since they were everywhere in the city!","If this were real life, some faint-hearted people would collapse under this pressure.","However, since it was a game, this dark and creepy world stimulated the people’s desire to explore.","Without thinking, the female mage started the game again and re-entered this strange world.","Rolling up his sleeves, the mercenary Crete quickly entered the game again.","In the virtual reality mode, Resident Evil 2 was much more difficult than Resident Evil 1.","Therefore, the main characters who were only ordinary people faced even greater pressure compared to the previous game.","For example, Leon came to the police station to report to duty, so he quickly entered the building to investigate. This was the same beginning for all male players.","However, when Crete controlled Leon to explore the police station with great care, he suddenly heard a yell of alarm.","He saw a bald man wearing a green military coat standing before him like a huge iron tower— a Tyrant!","On the other side, Cia and the female mage who were playing as Claire shrieked as well!","The ceiling broke open, revealing a disgusting monster whose brains were exposed—Licker!","Yes. The bosses in the movie and game of Resident Evil 1 showed up soon after the beginning of Resident Evil 2!"]},{"number":582,"title":"Chapter 582 - Understanding of Ultimate Techniques","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Not only the mercenaries and mages in the new shop, but the old players in the Jiuhua City Shop, the Half City Shop, and the Yuanyang City Shop were stupefied as well.","How can it be?! With such a high difficulty level, how can we play it with enjoyment?!","What was more? This was the lowest difficulty level...","Everyone knew that the Lickers were powerful. They had great hearing and could hear everything, including when one was walking, running, and even breathing.","Lickers couldn’t walk upright, but they could climb the walls and ceilings with their powerful limbs and claws. With their super powerful jumps and swift movement speed, they could even dodge strafing firearms.","In the original version, the Lickers were not so powerful. After all, the players were not professional fighters.","But now, the Lickers in the game were as powerful as those in Resident Evil 1!","Tyrants were just as powerful if not more.","The players were astonished that they encountered these extremely horrifying monsters soon after the game began.","These powerful Tyrants and Lickers were hard to handle even if the mercenaries and mages had their cultivation strengths with them.","The ‘mass-produced’ Tyrants were much more powerful than the first-generation Tyrants, and they wouldn’t die even when they were plunged into melted iron. Unless grandmasters moved, spiritual spells could only tickle them. They were like human-shaped weapons!","But now, the players had to face such monsters as ordinary people!","This Tyrant obviously saw the main character controlled by the Blond Mercenary Crete.","“Ugh? What’s this creature?” It didn’t look like a zombie, but its iron-tower-like body, metallic skin, and cold inhuman eyes emanated a great suppressive aura onto the people when it looked at them.","Obviously, the new players in the new shop didn’t recognize the Tyrant.","This big bald guy looks strong, but I have a gun with me!","At the same time, the female mage, Lilith, had a similar thought facing the Licker. Although the monster before me looks horrifying, I’m not afraid since I have a magical firearm that is more advanced than those firearms created by dwarfs.","At this moment, Leon already fired at the monster under Crete’s control.","Bang! The guns fired.","Crete’s eyes opened wide as the bullet which could shatter a zombie’s head bounced off from the Tyrant’s forehead!","Then, the Tyrant that had a iron-tower-like body strode over while almost ignoring the bullets before punching down.","The Tyrant’s huge body create a gust. Its huge body didn’t look nimble, but its speed surpassed the limit for humans.","More horrifying was that it had strong combat techniques.","Boom!","A big hole appeared on the ground as Leon’s head was shattered like a watermelon!","Being forced to exit the virtual reality mode, Crete gaped at the scene on the screen. He turned his head and saw Claire under the Female Mage Lilith’s control being pierced by a long tongue before she could react.","A thought struck these at the same time, Can anyone defeat such monsters...?","Meanwhile, the young fighters had also exited the virtual reality mode.","They stared at the screens in shock.","What are these monsters?!","“Isn’t this mystical realm a basic one?!” Crete yelled. After all, only the basic mystical realms suppressed the participants’ strengths.","But this one...","The basic mystical realms built by mages with magical methods were usually used by beginners and thus wouldn’t have monsters too powerful for their abilities. After all, even when masters entered such realms, they would try to show the beginners the combat techniques instead of escaping techniques.","But such powerful monsters were impossible for people other than true masters and godly spellcasters to defeat.","You even suppressed our strength and turned us into ordinary people! What is the meaning of this?","What is the use of this game (mystical realm)? We can’t even escape properly! Are we just coming here to die?","“This is the mystical realm with the worst design that I’ve ever seen!” after many failed attempts, Crete said with a snort.","As Chris’s sister, Claire had strong combat techniques. Leon who had just graduated from the police academy was a genius. Combat techniques were not only fighting skills; there were also techniques in exerting force and how to better control one’s self.","Not able to pass this stage, the young people glanced around and saw that the shop owner was also playing the game. After watching for a while, they pointed at Fang Qi’s screen and said, “Why don’t you try to dodge?”","On Fang Qi’s screen, he was also facing the Tyrant.","One wall in the corridor had been shattered by the Tyrant with one punch.","At the moment when the Tyrant charged forward with a punch, Fang Qi took a couple of swift steps and kicked the wall in the corridor with perfect timing.","Then, he stomped the wall, and the repulsion force sent him behind the Tyrant. Then, he stood up and left, getting out of Tyrant’s attack range without a fuss.","For ordinary people, after they died several times in the game that was too difficult for them, they would either change the game setting illegally, or clear the stage with other cheats, or just give it up.","But for masters and lovers of games, they had different thoughts about the games.","With greater difficulty and challenges, these players would get greater enjoyment from the game even though the journey was full of hardships.","It was the same case with the true masters who walked step after step toward their goal with determination. They loved challenges and were not afraid of hardships, setbacks, and failures.","“Why can’t you handle a more powerful opponent? What did you do when you encountered such a situation in real life?” Fang Qi asked.","“But this is a mystical realm!” Crete refuted loudly.","“Perhaps. But for me, it’s just a game,” Fang Qi said mildly while controlling Leon to dodge the Tyrant’s pursuit. “Dodging its harsh attacks and finding its weaknesses before defeating it with any method you can is the wisdom of playing games.”","It was the fun of games to defeat seemingly invincible enemies with one’s own wisdom.","The others froze, looking as if they understood something.","Meanwhile, the players in the old shops encountered the same problem.","Nalan Hongwu looked at his screen in frustration after several failed attempts, and he almost puked blood. After thinking for a few moments, he controlled Leon to move swiftly. As an ordinary person, it was extremely difficult to dodge such an attack. Therefore, it was extremely critical that he must control his strength with precision.","“Dodge! Dodge!” At the moment when the Tyrant’s fist smashed down, Nalan Hongwu suddenly moved his feet and shifted for a few inches to the side in a flash. Then, with small and swift steps, he passed the Tyrant with perfect timing.","“Passed it!” Excitement and joy filled his heart in the next moment.","[Hahaha! Old Brother! Awesome!] Zong Wu looked at the screenshot that Nalan Hongwu posted in the group and replied, [I think I was inspired by you.]","This was an understanding of an ultimate technique."]},{"number":583,"title":"Chapter 583 - Pathetic Foils","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ahhh-!” Whenever Crete heard the shaking noises of the ground in the game, he was struck with fear. This monster is too terrifying.","After all, these young people only practiced their skills on magical beasts and had never placed themselves before such invincible opponents.","But now, Tyrants and Lickers had become the nightmare of these outlanders.","Under suffocating suppression, they had to be on guard every second, and their nerves were under a lot of tension.","However, after they escaped from their powerful enemy with a narrow margin, the sense of achievement was so great that they couldn’t find words to describe it.","When one was trapped under life-and-death pressure, a huge amount of potential would erupt from one’s body.","“Wow! This oriental lady is so beautiful!” Obviously, Crete had encountered Ada at this moment. “How come such a beautiful lady appeared in this place? Are you here for me? Um... You smell so good!”","He flirted with her casually.","“Aw!” His neck was instantly broken after he got close to her.","Looking at the words ‘GAME OVER’, he remembered the warning written on the small blackboard. [Play the games in a civil way or bear the consequences.]","...","It was afternoon when people walked out of the shop.","The clean and neat streets were lined with tall buttonwood trees. Although Fang Qi preferred the misty scenery of Jiangnan in Jiuhua City and the elegant antique building styles in Yuanyang City, this city had its own charms.","Built beside a river and mountains, the city looked magnificent. There were fancy castles at the top of the mountains. Lower down were the business zones and residential areas for rich people. In the middle was a big street winding its way up to the mountain top.","Horses and carriages could be frequently seen on the street. Occasionally, teams of city guards walked past people.","In the distant was a huge mountain. The lower ranges were covered by green plants. Fewer plants could be seen higher up, and the top was covered by white snow.","This city was a refreshing sight for Fang Qi.","“It was so thrilling!” The three young people were still savoring their experiences in the game. They were the two main characters in the game instead of themselves. If they got familiar with the combat techniques of the characters, they might be able to pass some of the levels. After all, they were only playing at the lowest difficulty.","“Huo! Huo!” The blond young man named Ron mimicked the combat techniques in the game. “It’s so cool! It seems like these moves are easier to learn than the level 1 battle techniques.”","“These techniques can help me kill one zombie with ease!” The girl added in excitement.","“Dadada! Those magical firearms are awesome!” Joseph mimicked the moves.","Most importantly, they felt like it was easier to memorize the moves that they learned in this strange mystical realm.","They were on their way to their academy.","“Wow... Look over there! Elves! They’re elves from the Silver Moon Forest!”","“Why are they here?” Although elves would come to the Morning Light Empire occasionally, most people never saw them paying a visit that was as formal as this.","There were few elves in human nations. The elves worshipped their own gods and had their own nations and cities. They seldom had dealings with human nations, but the Morning Light Empire was one of the rare exceptions.","There were a little more than ten elves. The elf in the middle wore a pure white cloak while the others wore the same style of light armor and carried exquisite silver longswords. These longswords were different from the big swords that human warriors in this nation used; they were even slimmer than the longsword of the oriental shop owner. They had thought that the shop owner’s sword was the thinnest sword there was.","These elves’ bodies were slender, and their ears were a bit sharper and narrower than those of humans but not that extreme. The differences weren’t so obvious. If these elves covered their ears with their hair, it would be hard to tell them apart from humans.","Maybe the only difference lay in the facial features. The elves’ facial features were much more defined and exquisite compared to most humans; they seemed to be favored ones of nature.","The young people watched as the elves elegantly rode down the big avenue in the center of the city on some elaphure deer.","“Look who came to greet them...”","They heard a low chirp and saw griffins with golden feathers flying down the peak of the mountain in a neat wing-shaped formation.","“The Golden Griffin Knight Legion!”","“It must feel great to fly in the sky riding on a griffin!”","“I hope that one day I can join this knight legion!” The young people looked up with envy.","The Golden Griffin Knight Legion was one of the most famous knight legions in the Morning Light Empire. Joining such a knight legion was every young person’s brightest dream.","“Stop watching! Let’s hurry back to the academy!” Cia reminded them.","“We’re finished! If we’re late, we’ll be in big trouble!” Joseph’s expression changed.","...","In this nation which put great value in fundamental combat techniques, how were their academies?","They placed great importance in real combat since all battle skills must be used in battles.","The beginners, including both fighters and mages, were treated the same under this rule. On the meadow near the academy, many fighters and mages, who weren’t even level 1 or just reached level 1 or level 2, were practicing each day with big wooden swords, magic staffs, or other weapons. They practiced either in groups or one-on-one.","But today, it seemed a little different.","The students stood together in a neat group. It seemed like there was more than one class; several classes were gathered here.","Before them was a middle-aged swordsman with an unshaved face.","Beside him was a valiant-looking woman in armor. A badge in the shape of a golden griffin was pinned on her chest plate, and her blond hair was tightly pulled up in a bun on the back of her head.","When the several young people hurried over, many of the students snickered.","The woman frowned slightly.","“They are late! People dare to be late even on such an occasion.”","“They probably don’t know about today’s special occasion!” A luxuriously clothed young man said in a low voice. His thin and long face looked proud, and he seemed to be quite popular among the students. The moment he said that, some others chimed in.","“They are just bumpkins from the countryside anyways,” a silver-haired handsome young man said.","At this moment, the instructor coughed slightly and said, “Now that everyone is here, we’ll begin today’s combat practice. As usual, you can practice in groups or one to one.”","“Um? The instructor is not going to punish us for being late?” Joseph and his companions were baffled since this instructor was usually very strict.","However, they had other things to worry about.","It seemed like other students had paired off already, which left the three of them alone.","“Hello, guys.” At this moment, the luxuriously dressed young man with an arrogant expression walked over to them and said, “If you have no one to practice with, do you want to practice with us?”","Joseph and his companions were startled since they had heard that these people came from unusual backgrounds even though they were not from the same class.","Tolf, the luxuriously dressed young man, obviously had good talent, and it was said that his father was an aristocrat.","They immediately found an open space.","“Thank you,” Joseph said in a hurry.","They had thought that no one would like to practice with people like them.","“Thank you?” The silver-haired young man snickered and looked at them as if they were morons, and he said, “Idiots.”","The three young people froze slightly. “What do you mean?”","“It’s natural that people like you don’t know about this.” The luxuriously dressed young man walked up and patted Joseph on the shoulder while saying in a low voice, “We’ll make good use of you foils to show off our strength.”","“Foils?” The three young people stared at them in bafflement.","“She is a knight from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion, and she is here to choose talented fighters to train as candidate knights in the legion.”","“Now, do you know why we chose you guys?” He snickered and said, “You guys are perfect foils for us to show off our abilities to her.”","The expressions of Joseph and his two companions changed slightly.","What? We are late for such an occasion?!","Looking at the people before them, their faces turned ashen. Today, they would probably become foils to send others to their peak and help them reach their dreams.","“You’re a few truly pathetic rats.”"]},{"number":584,"title":"Chapter 584 - Nothing Is True. Everything Is Permitted - Assassins’ Elegy","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While mentioning rats, we must first talk about the despicable and lowly rats who were hiding in the darkness.","The people here called this continent Lora, which held the meaning of the land lit with bright light.","They called a distant plane Thad, which meant “immortal relic”. That place was also called the Continent of Immortal Relic.","In the land lit with bright light, there was no place for darkness.","However, this world still had existences hiding in the depths of darkness – assassins.","The assassin group named Underground Council trained and kept the most notorious assassins on the continent. It was born after the destruction of the Sunrise Empire which was heard to be a nation full of sunshine. But now, it was reduced to gloomy and damp ruins.","Like the rats scurrying across the broken streets that were filled with potholes, the assassins who hid underground did the darkest business for money, including assassinating officials of other nations and knights of legions. Besides, they did all kinds of dirty jobs that ranged from fraud to stealing. Most people looked at them with disdain.","It was said that the high-level officials in this group had been royal members of this empire.","Of course, other nations also had fighters who worked as assassins, but they were not as despised as those in this assassin group.","By calling the three young people ‘pathetic rats’, Tolf put them into the same category as the lowly and despicable assassins on top of the already degrading superficial meaning.","The moment he said that, more snickers sounded.","It was infuriating to be compared with despicable rats.","The woman from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who was watching the combat frowned since this word reminded her of something that had happened lately.","Seeing the reddened faces of the young people who had been humiliated in public, she shook her head and thought, These young people are weaker to begin with, and their mindsets are disturbed by their opponents’ words. I don’t need to watch this battle anymore.","“Will you wastrels come together or one by one?” The luxuriously dressed young man named Tolf said with a disdainful snicker.","“I...” The three young people exchanged a look, and they saw the frustration in each others’ eyes.","Their opponents came from big aristocratic families with powerful backgrounds. It was obvious that they were no match for them.","Tolf and his companions chose the weakest opponents... The instructor frowned slightly and shouted with some displeasure, “Begin! What are you waiting for? What did I teach you? Don’t lose your courage for battle even when you’re faced with powerful opponents!”","“Don’t lose your courage for battle even when you’re faced with powerful opponents...?”","“Dodging its harsh attacks and finding its weaknesses before defeating it with any method you can is the wisdom of playing games...”","These two sentences seemed to overlap each other while the three young people remembered their life-and-death experiences with Tyrants and Lickers... and the omnipresent zombies.","Ron slightly tightened his fists and said, “Let me do it.”","Tolf’s face darkened, surprised that these wastrels dared to fight with them.","“You are asking for it!” With a sulky expression, Tolf slashed out with his huge wooden sword!","Obviously, his combat techniques were good, he moved very fast, and his strength was explosive. Soon, he already arrived before Ron.","The woman nodded slightly since the speed and the explosive force that Tolf exhibited were quite good among the people of his level and age.","As for the blond young man, he clearly had less talent and strength compared to his opponent. Although he was brave, it wasn’t enough for him to deal with his opponent.","While she was thinking that the blond young man sidestepped with lightning speed, and the attack missed him.","“He dodged it?”","The blond young man moved three times and dodged three sword strikes. Then, he placed his hand on his opponent’s wrist—anti-joint seizing technique!","The audience watched the unexpected scene with astonished expressions.","They could see that the blond young man’s battle style was totally different from that of Tolf. He didn’t use any combat technique, and his moves were not destructive at all!","According to the common battle style, the blond young man should turn back with a sword slash after dodging to send his opponent flying.","However, the blond young man simply pulled and twisted his opponent’s arm with little effort. With his arm twisted up behind him, Tolf howled in pain and didn’t dare to fight back anymore","What combat technique is this?!","Impossible! Tolf’s mind turned blank. He couldn’t understand how his opponent had subdued him, but he was certain of one thing.","I can’t disgrace myself on this occasion! He quickly signaled the silver-haired young man with his eyes.","“Combat technique – Wind Strike!” Ignoring the rules that they had agreed on, the silver-haired young man directly attacked with his sword.","With the roars of gales, white air currents engulfed the blade of the big wooden sword; it was the condensation of gusts.","This was a combat technique. Each combat technique, even the low-level ones, was powerful enough to afflict great damage.","“Quickly dodge!”","“Dodge?” The silver-haired young man had a cold grin on his face.","The advantage of the combat techniques was that they could only be blocked with other combat technique techniques. They were ultimate moves that could be used in offensive and defensive situations!","How can he dodge it?","The instructor’s face darkened. Even though it was a wooden sword, it would break several ribs in the blond young man’s body. If he wasn’t lucky, he probably would stay in bed for the rest of his life.","While the instructor hesitated and was about to walk up to intervene, the woman beside him suddenly stopped him.","Then, he saw that the young man had moved to the side right before the sword struck him!","This young man dodged it like how he had dodged the Tyrant’s punch that had horrifying speed and force.","Gales whistled past him.","“He... dodged it?!”","“To... together!”","Three vs three! In the next moment, Tolf and his two companions fell to the ground almost at the same time!","The audience members gaped at the scene with wide-open mouths.","These people...!!??","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had just exited from the game in his shop.","Suddenly, he saw that the System had released a new task.","[New Task: Nothing Is True. Everything Is Permitted","Task Content: the sale of Resident Evil 2 reaches 800, and assassins come to play in the shop","Task Reward: The release of the Assassin’s Creed series]"]},{"number":585,"title":"Chapter 585 - Sir! Open the Genetic Lock!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang looked baffled. “Assassin’s Creed...?”","It frustrated him that he had to have assassin players in the shop in order to complete this task.","Are you kidding me? Which self-respecting and busy assassin will come to the shop and play games?","Mr. Fang wondered, Are there such lazy assassins who can live long enough to come to play in my shop?","...","Meanwhile, a woman walked toward the intersection outside the shop.","She wore black leather armor, and the hem of her coat swayed in the wind, revealing her long and slender legs and long black boots.","It seemed like no one noticed this figure on the busy street. But at a closer look, one would see that everyone seemed to unconsciously stay a few meters away from her.","She reached up one hand to block the wind which blew at her flame-like long hair, revealing five white and tender fingers. Her exquisite face reminded others of the impeccable features of elves, and the silver earrings made her look vivacious.","If not for the chilly light hidden in the depths of her eyes, many people would have thought that she was a female knight with a noble background.","Subconsciously, she glanced at the weird name of the shop and thought, “Well. Can this small shop really attract any customers?”","...","As an elite of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion, Helen was surprised.","She had seen some special occasions when fighters dodged level 2 combat techniques with side-steps, but it shouldn’t happen with teenagers who hadn’t even mastered a single combat technique.","“What’s up?!” She immediately pulled the three young people into the nearby small forest.","“Where did you learn these combat techniques?!” From Helen’s perspective, she felt like there was no way that these combat techniques weren’t inherited from their families.","“We...” The young people’s faces turned red while they looked at each other.","This was their biggest secret!","Should they tell her their secret?","If they did, others would also learn these powerful skills. What could they do then?","“Don’t worry,” The instructor said, “Ms. Helen will not force you to tell your secret. But if you want to join the Golden Griffin Knight Legion, you will have to tell the secret at that time.”","“We...”","“We...” They hesitated and paused each time they began talking.","Just as the instructor and Helen became frustrated with impatience, the young people said as one, “We opened the genetic lock!”","“Puchi-!” The Golden Griffin Knight Helen and the male instructor were astounded. “What did you open!!??”","What is a genetic lock?!","“I think we must have opened the genetic lock!”","When Fang Qi told Su Tianji the story, he didn’t keep it a secret, so he didn’t hide his chat history.","The young people had been watching his screen with curiosity and thus saw the story.","Remembering his previous fear and the eventual victory, the young man named Ron got excited and said with conviction, “It’s said that people can open their genetic lock under great pressure. We must have opened our genetic locks, which is why we defeated Tolf and his companions!”","Hearing his words, Helen and the male instructor felt like their brains had blanked out. After exchanging a look, they asked, “What’s a genetic lock? Explain it slowly...”","“For example, an old lady can lift a car with one hand to pull her grandson from beneath the car wheels from an accident. It shows the great potential one can tap into when being placed in an extremely dangerous situation...” the young people said with great conviction and logic.","They explained that everyone had a unique strong suit which was the trigger to open the genetic lock.","They gave some other examples...","Hearing their theory, Helen and the male instructor exchanged another look. “So deep and mysterious...”","“So...” Helen asked immediately, “Do you mean that you opened level 1 genetic lock under the tremendous pressure just now?”","Her face twitched as she thought, Are you serious?! I face the Legion Commander, my boss, every day, and the pressure is insane. Yet, I didn’t open any so-called genetic lock! And you kids opened it in one brawl?","She stared at them with intense eyes. “Then... who told you about this genetic lock?”","“Mr. Fang!” The girl named Cia raised her hand and answered.","At this moment, Mr. Fang sneezed in the shop for some reason.","“Mr. Fang...?” Helen exchanged a look with the male instructor, and they got more baffled. “Who’s Mr. Fang?”","“The owner of the Origins Internet Club in the city center!” Joseph said immediately.","“He can fly while standing on a sword! Also, he can turn his shop into an ethereal realm with spiritual spells!”","“Right! Right! Right! Mr. Fang is super powerful!” The kids chattered.","“Mr. Fang must be a master who has opened his level 3 genetic lock!”","“No. He probably has reached the legendary level 4!”","...","It was late, and there were few people in the shop. Fatigued with the gameplay, Mr. Fang dozed off at the counter, dreaming that the shop had activated the teleportation array, and he lured Xiaoyue over to play in the new shop.","Then, he seemed to dream that he had opened level 4 genetic lock and mastered a new skill: Instant Synchronization.","With this skill, he could get into Complete Synchronization for a second when attacking or defending, thus greatly reducing the consumption of synchronization time.","Bang! A hand slammed on the counter, making the stone top shake a little.","It instantly woke up Mr. Fang.","“Who is it...” Mr. Fang looked up and saw a gorgeous girl who was wearing silver armor. She had taken off her helmet, revealing her golden hair that was coiled up in a bun behind her head.","She demanded aggressively, “Open my genetic lock!”","“Open your genetic lock...” Rubbing his eyes groggily, Mr. Fang was still savoring his dream and getting a feeling for instant synchronization. “Two magic crystals per hour, and ten magic crystals for activation.”","“...” Helen’s face twitched.","So expensive?!","He even tried to trick kids with such exorbitant prices. I’ll give this unconscientious shop owner a good lesson!","“Achoo!” Rows of data flashed in Mr. Fang’s groggily eyes.","The synchronization time got consumed at great speed.","“F*ck?!” Realizing that he hadn’t mastered the so-called instant synchronization, Mr. Fang woke up completely while he turned off Complete Synchronization.","He looked at the empty counter and scratched his head. I seemed to have seen a customer...","Then, he saw a figure clinging to the door. While waving the crystals in her hand, she said unclearly, “Wu... Open my genetic lock...”","While taking the money from her hand, Mr. Fang pulled her off the door and asked, “Why did you glue yourself onto the door? Go and get online.”","Damn it! You just wait and see!"]},{"number":586,"title":"Chapter 586 - Everything Will Be Settled","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","As for the issue regarding if the genetic lock really existed and could be open...","In fact, after Mr. Fang got strengthened by the T-Virus, he found that his physical strength and reaction speed had greatly improved.","Even though these benefits were similar to those of the genetic lock, one couldn’t say that genetic locks existed and could be opened. One could only say that these benefits came from the T-Virus itself.","Mr. Fang didn’t know if the genetic lock could be opened or not, but he knew that he hadn’t figured it out yet.","However, regarding the question if people could unleash their potential during danger, there were many examples showing that people could indeed unleash great potential during dangerous situations and under great pressure.","While Helen began playing Resident Evil 2, Mr. Fang suddenly remembered his dream.","Instant Synchronization perhaps was going to be something that only he could use. If he mastered it, he might be able to possess the defense ability of Dante’s Royalguard Style when he was defending and the awakening skills of the Soul Bender and Grand Master when he was on the offense. He could save the precious synchronization time for the moments he wanted.","Could a person’s control of techniques and strength reach a granular level with ultimate precision?","The answer was positive.","If they kept working on their precision, they could achieve a realm that they wouldn’t have imagined.","The old players were talking in a group chat named ‘Super Railgun.’","Su Tianji said, [I feel like I have opened my level 1 genetic lock! After playing Resident Evil 2, my reaction speed and control have improved greatly. <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f60a.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60A;\">]","Tang Yu said, [I think I’m going to open my level 1 lock after clearing this stage!]","Jiang Xiaoyue chimed in, [I think I have also opened my level 1 genetic lock!]","A big white deer added, [Hahaha! I think I’m going to open my genetic lock very soon!]","“...”","They all thought that they had opened or were going to open the genetic lock, and they even defined standards for different levels of genetic lock.","Nalan Hongwu said, [I think I’ve reached level 3!]","Su Tianji replied, [Pu!]","Jiang Xiaoyue added, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/12.0.0-1/svg/1f631.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F631;\">]","While reading the messages, Mr. Fang had the urge to crawl over through the cable and beat these people.","Meanwhile, Helen had died in the game more than a dozen times, getting killed by either Lickers or regular zombies in many ways.","She gaped at the screen while her character dodged the Licker’s attacks which were impossible to dodge for humans since it was beyond the reaction speed of humans. While controlling the strength in the body with great proficiency, she started to wonder...","Did I somehow open the genetic lock...?","How come I’m so powerful? Excited, she was eager to continue.","When she was about to study the genetic lock some more, she heard a noise.","Bang!","The noise of a hand slamming the desk startled Helen so much that she almost fell from her computer chair.","Then, an ordinary face leaned over with a harmless smile. “The shop is closing!”","“Okay... Okay...”","She ran out.","Revenge! It was blatant revenge!","“Ahhhh!” A figure waved her arms crazily only when she got outside the shop.","...","Regardless if the players could open the genetic lock or not, they had obtained tremendous improvement in their skills. In the later part of the game, the players could play as Chris and Ada and would thus encounter monsters much more difficult to deal with.","This game would leave them with many nightmares and countless excellent plays and operations.","Perhaps these cultivators and warriors would still remember some of the highlights in the game many years later.","– Meanwhile, on the other side of this world –","For the Flame Bird Family and the Thorn Flower Family, they were presented with a good opportunity to rise above the other families.","It was midnight, but the lights were bright in the conference room.","Sitting at the head of the conference table, the fat man with a big belly had more than ten badges pinned on his pure white army suit. As the speaker of the Flame Bird Family, his appearance didn’t show his high standing. The sparse hair on his head made him look a little ridiculous, but his squinted eyes and the glints occasionally flashing in them showed that he was a cunning man.","Sitting beside him was a middle-aged man wearing a formal black suit. His face was chiselled, and he looked like an elegant gentleman. His expression was always solemn and serious.","A detailed map was spread out on the desk. Each detail in each area of the Continent of Immortal Relics could be clearly seen on this map.","It was so detailed that it even included the information of the influential figures in each area and each nation.","“Any new intelligence?” the fat man asked.","“This is the most that we can get for now, Lord Alex.” The white-haired old man sitting beside him answered, “They have destroyed the portal. If we force our way in, they will discover us and intercept us.”","Alex, the fat, middle-aged man, frowned and said, “The fact that these natives could capture the Vanguard General and the others shows that those people are becoming more incompetent. On the other hand, it means that these natives have their own means, and we must be cautious with them.”","“It’s said that they have treasures left by the ancient immortals.” The middle-aged man with the chiseled face was the Thorn Flower Family Master. His brown curly hair and thin facial features made him look quite competent. He drew a circle around the area of Heavenly Abyss Sea on the map with his finger and said, “We are on the offense, and they are on the defense. These damn natives will set a great trap here since this is the most vulnerable spot and thus their key defense spot. Damn it. I think we should give up on this place.”","“Then, we’ll be at the disadvantage, Lord Raine.”","“But we have no choice. The elites of our Thorn Flower aren’t a part of the suicide squad; they shouldn’t be sent here to die,” Raine said, “We need nothing but a glorious victory! I can’t imagine how they will look at us if other outcomes take place!”","“Then, what’s your plan, my lord?”","“We will enter through this and this area.” Raine pointed at the borders of the Ultimate West Realm and the Deserted Sea Realm. “According to the intelligence that we gained, these two places are most vulnerable with the weakest strengths. We will catch them off guard by attacking these places. With minimal losses, we can establish a base in this damn barbaric world and then send more troops into this area to take...”","He pointed at the area around the Heavenly Abyss Sea. “We’ll take this place in one battle. When we descend onto this land, everything will be settled!"]},{"number":587,"title":"Chapter 587 - Super Su Tianji Cannon?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hey! Did you hear that?”","Helen spent last night thinking about how to open her genetic lock and didn’t sleep well. Coming to the headquarters of the knight legion groggily, she heard people talking about things like war and the Continent of Immortal Relics.","“It’s said that those damn natives used despicable methods and captured the Vanguard General Carl, that genius named the ‘Spear of Sunlight’ of the Leison Family, and ‘Shadow Spirit’ Ms. Jessica! Oh! I can’t imagine the torture and pain that our beautiful and smart Ms. Jessica must be enduring in that place!”","At this moment, Jessica was biting into a rind of melon while sitting on a couch in the Yuanyang City Shop. “Achoo!”","She was baffled. “Who’s talking about me?”","“Achoo!” Carl had a cup of wine – oh no – a cup of iced red tea in his hand. He sneezed as well as he said, “Ah! I spilled it again! My pants! I did it again!”","Kevin said, “How come I’m fine?”","He continued to eat the melon that he took from Jessica while drinking iced red tea.","While the others were busy playing games, they could do nothing but eat melons on the couch.","They were suffering from the torture of not being able to get online and play games.","“Oh! They also captured the ‘Shield of Light’, whose name is Kevin! He’s a master who reached level 9!” In the meeting room of Canglan City, a knight wearing a set of armor with golden patterns said, “I hope that the armies of the Flame Bird Family and Thorn Flower Family can rescue them!”","“Achoo!” The moment that Kevin picked up a rind of melon, he sneezed as well, smashing his face into the fruit.","He looked up and was at a loss for words.","“Of course! The Flame Bird Family is more ancient than the Leison Family where Carl comes from!” A middle-aged knight said with a smile.","“They are already creating momentum for this rescue mission! Oh! I’m so excited! Spiritual Spell Visual Projection! I think we can watch this war when it begins!”","“I’ll ask the Legion Commander for permission, so we can go and watch it together!”","A cheerful atmosphere permeated the entire knight legion.","...","– Meanwhile, on the peak of the tallest winding mountain in the distance –","Bright lights were still on in the grand hall of the palace which shot up into the sky like a sharp sword.","“Princess, Your Highness.” A white-robed old man bowed slightly and presented an invitation. “The honorable St. Heinz has sent troops to destroy those insolent barbaric natives. Interestingly, the ‘Star of Flames’ of the Flame Bird Family and the ‘Land of Thorns’ of the Thorn Flower Family will appear in this war as well.”","“Oh?” The beautiful eyes of that female looked cold and indifferent.","“Also, the ‘Inquisitor’ of the Dark Wing Knight Legion will deal with the person who caused the fall of the Vanguard General and Shadow Spirit. St. Heinz plans to open the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection and is inviting Your Highness to watch it.”","“Oh...?” the woman said mildly. “I might watch it to add some fun in my stable and boring days.”","“Bassaic. ”","The white-robed old man quickly bowed.","“Do you think that no one in the world can defeat me?”","“Um...” The white-robed old man said solemnly, “Of course. If someone says that the glory of Princess Your Highness can be destroyed, it will sound as ridiculous as anyone saying that these barbaric natives can defeat the legions sent by Mr. St. Heinz.”","...","Helen was disdainful of her lazy colleagues who weren’t focusing on the main task at hand.","After crazily playing the game for a while in the internet café, she had a feeling that she was going to open her genetic lock soon!","It must be! Otherwise, how come my strength and techniques have improved so much! After all, I had only played it for a very short time!","In the game named Resident Evil 2, she had no strength in her, but she could dodge the Tyrant’s attacks and pursuit and even avoid Lickers’ super-fast attacks with great intuition toward danger.","If Mr. Fang knew about her thoughts, he would think, WTF? I have been strengthened by the T-Virus for so long, and I didn’t even unlock the level 1 genetic lock, if there even is such a thing. However, you guys are saying that you are opening level 1, level 2, and level 3 genetic locks! Damn!","Anyway, the cultivators of the Deserted Sea Realm, Spiritual State, and Ultimate West Realm had obtained great improvements in their abilities.","In the game, Nalan Hongwu was controlling Leon, who had no firearm in his hands.","Before him stood a huge monster wearing a researcher’s coat that had been torn by the bulging muscles. This monster had one huge and distorted arm and a huge eye on his shoulder. It was William.","Nalan Hongwu had only a dagger in his hand.","William Birkin was the creator of the G-Virus. He had super talents and a fanatic passion for the research of viruses. In the end, he had injected G-Virus into his own body and turned into a monster.","G-Virus William was a monster more horrifying than Tyrants. Only cultivators on and above the True Lake Realm had the ability to kill it. If one got too close to it, they could be instantly killed by its horrifying speed and force!","Now in the game, the players had bodies of ordinary people and learned combat skills. At most, they had the top strength that could be achieved by a mortal.","It meant that it was a battle between an ordinary person and a monster with the strength of the True Lake Realm!","According to the plot, this horrifying monster would be killed by a ton of high-level weapons. But now, the players had only a dagger.","This was the ultimate training. With the reflexes of an ordinary person, he would die instantly if he couldn’t control the strength in his body with great precision!","Nalan Hongwu controlled Leon to stand calmly before the monster.","At this moment, G-Virus William seemed to have moved slightly. Then, he shot forward like a cannonball with a roar.","At the same time, Nalan Hongwu tightened his grip on the dagger. It may seem like he had no strength in his body, but in this state, he could feel each tiny strand of muscle in his body, and it felt like this body was in his complete control.","Just before the huge fist smashed onto him with whistling sounds of a cannonball, Leon suddenly swayed faster under Nalan Hongwu’s control, moving like a slippery fish.","“F*ck?!”","“Z-Shake?!”","Song Qingfeng and the others who had been watching from behind exclaimed.","Then, with lightning speed, the dagger slashed out with strength coming from his feet, waist, arms, and all the other places in the body!","Blood gushed out from the eye on the shoulder of G-Virus William, the most vulnerable spot in its body!","“Superb!”","“Awesome!”","After several attacks, William finally began to mutate. Its shoulders bulged while its face moved to its chest. It transformed into an even more horrid monster.","Its fingers on the right hand turned into huge claws that were almost one meter long!","Seeing the words [Game Over] on the screen, Nalan Hongwu put down the virtual reality headset with a shake of his head.","“Awesome! Awesome! He cleared the stage with a dagger!”","...","Meanwhile, Su Tianji was hovering in the sky above Liuyun Daoist Palace; from the dark clouds covering the sky, a thunderbolt crashed down!","The flashing lightning energy condensed into snakes that seemed to be able to tear open the sky, and they gathered in the space before Su Tianji. Then, miraculously, the horrifying heavenly lightning energy in the circle drawn by her finger turned into a coiled lightning snake.","“Super...” Subconsciously, Su Tianji looked down at her chest. Seeing that she hadn’t become flat-chested due to the growth of her strength, she heaved a sigh of relief and yelled, “Super Su Tianji Cannon!”"]},{"number":588,"title":"Chapter 588 - Techniques Reaching Dao Achievement, Limited Time Offer – Movie: The Duel","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Helen looked absent-minded lately.","In the past, she had gone into mystic realms to increase her strength, doing the same things repeatedly day after day and year after year to increase her strength. She did things such as killing high-level magic beasts and completing large-scale battles, etc.","She had set targets for herself each day and finished them mechanically without thinking.","However, it was different now. In this world named Resident Evil, she would wonder if there were more powerful magic firearms or even simpler and condensed combat techniques.","She even wondered about the ending to this weird story about Leon and Claire.","In this strange world completely different from the realm world, what kind of schemes are hidden behind the scenes? What is the ending to this story?","Everyday day, a driven by strong curiosity, she went into the world of this story to explore. It was something that she wished to do as early as possible each day.","She had kept track of how much strength she had gained each day before. But now, she didn’t care about it as much compared to other things.","She shook her head. In fact, she didn’t have time to think about the game right now. She was working and on duty.","The Golden Griffin Legion strolled with a small team of elves on the street not far from the White Pigeon Square.","The warm afternoon sunshine fell on the pebble-paved street while the balmy wind brought them the fragrance of soil and flowers, scattering the tense atmosphere before the war.","For the Elf Clan that loved peace, they disliked the word ‘war.’","When the elves heard the knights of Golden Griffin talk about the recent news about the war, they frowned in displeasure.","Elves exceled in poems, literature, and music, but it didn’t mean that they were not good at combat. In fact, they had inherited a set of ancient combat techniques from their ancestors and had the most famous sword masters and archery masters in the world.","“Mr. Lance.” The leader of this team of knights was a middle-aged knight wearing golden armor; he was about 40 years old. Riding alongside him was a male elf with pale golden hair and exquisite and elegant facial features. He wore green tight-fitting leather armor engraved with beautiful and complicated patterns.","As if sensing the mood of this male elf, the knight in the lead changed the subject. “The knights of our nation value exquisite and advanced combat techniques. In this city, we have masters from all over the world. Mr. Lance, if you have time, you can visit the outstanding magic craftsmanship in our Canglan City.”","“Really? I heard many people talk about Canglan City’s magic craftsmanship and the mystic realm craft studios belonging to the Alchemist Union.” Before Lance could speak, an elf girl who was about 16 years old said cheerfully behind them, “But our Silver Moon Forest’s magic craftsmanship and combat techniques are also not bad.”","“Of course. The Silver Moon Kingdom has the famous Moonlight Sword Saint, Master Pluto, and Master Sara...” The man in golden armor shook his head and said, “Mr. Lance is a sword master as well. There are so many masters in your kingdom.”","The girl stuck out her tongue and said. “I heard that the people who have the privilege to join the Golden Griffin Knight Legion are elites among elites. Mr. Elven, you are a level 7 master already and an influential figure.”","Their horses ambled along the bustling street.","Legion Commander Elven looked up. “Origins Internet Club?”","“When did such a shop appear in our city?”","“It only opened recently...” A female knight said, “It’s said to be a cultivation mystic realm... I heard someone mention it lately.”","“It’s a good shop,” the female knight added.","“Ugh...? We were just talking about these realms, and we ran into one? ” The middle-aged legion commander said, “Mr. Lance, do you want to go in and have a look?”","At this time, Mr. Fang had few customers.","While he sat in boredom, two teams of knights stopped at his door and walked in.","These people found the items in the shop quite weird, but they were less confused when they saw that the shop owner was a foreigner.","“I think you, Ms. Sala, is an unusual genius. Few people of your age can join Mr. Lance’s team,” they continued to chat.","“Mr. Elven, your teacher is a famous master in this nation; we don’t dare to compare ourselves to him.”","“I remember that Mr. Lance is one of the youngest sword masters in the Silver Moon Kingdom.”","“This should be a basic mystic realm of the lowest difficulty level...”","While talking about things like masters and sword saints, these people paid, got on computers, and started the game.","-In less than ten seconds-","“GAME OVER!”","“!!??”","They suddenly stopped chatting.","The place turned silent.","“Such lame players dare to say that they are masters and sword saints...?” Big Sword Crete swaggered past them with his peers and a bottle of Coke in his hand. He learned the slang from the shop owner and used it while glancing at the back of the heads and the tall computer chairs.","Helen who was about to start the game in excitement heard this comment. “Pu...!”","Elven stuck out his head from behind the computer chair while his face twitched. “...”","Lance stuck out his head from behind the computer chair as well. “...”","“Damn it!”","...","Different from the old shops, the new shop was harmonious without any trouble after Mr. Fang showed off his ability to fly on a sword and sent Helen flying with one sneeze.","However, the cultivators and warriors in the old shops in the Deserted Sea Realm and Spiritual State had a different feeling now.","In the desolate remote place north to the three saint factions, the sky suddenly turned dark with thunder, lightning bolts, and gloomy clouds appearing!","– Meanwhile, in the sky above the small nation of mortals in the Morning Star Sea Realm where Fang Qi had visited once –","Boom!","Black lightning bolts as thick as water streams destroyed buildings,!","In the deserted snowy land in the westernmost area of the Spiritual State, gloomy clouds gathered with the same horrifying phenomenon!","At this moment, Mr. Fang received a prompt from the System.","[Beep! With most players in the shops reaching the threshold for combat techniques, you have obtained the achievement, Basic Techniques.]","[Activating the series of achievements tasks: Techniques Reaching Dao.]","[Techniques Reaching Dao (I): Basic Techniques (the number of players who have mastered the basic techniques reaches 10,000. Completed)","Achievement Reward: Limited Time Offer – Movie: The Duel (Obtained)]","[TL Note: The Duel is a 2000 Hong Kong wuxia comedy film directed by Andrew Lau and starring Andy Lau, Ekin Cheng, Nick Cheung, Kristy Yang, Zhao Wei, and Patrick Tam.]","[Techniques Reaching Dao (II): Basic Techniques (the number of players who have mastered the basic techniques reaches 50,000. Incomplete)","Achievement Reward: Limited Time Offer – Movie: Tai Chi Master]","[TL Note: Tai Chi Master, also known as Tai-Chi Master and Twin Warriors, is a 1993 Hong Kong martial arts film directed by Yuen Woo-ping, and produced by Jet Li, who also starred in the film.]"]},{"number":589,"title":"Chapter 589 - Nothing Is Dazzling Enough to Be Compared to It","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In fact, in this world, at least many cultivators and warriors of the Spiritual State and Deserted Sea Realm didn’t know what the ultimate realm for techniques was.","Therefore, they usually focused on strength and chased after greater destructive power.","When one’s technique came to the peak stage, they could take a step forward and get in touch with Dao.","This was the realm of techniques reaching Dao.","Techniques were not auxiliary to strength.","According to legends, there were 3,000 Great Dao.","Looking at the prompt on the System Interface, Mr. Fang was puzzled. “There’s a time limit on this movie...?”","Apart from the limit time, he also noticed other restrictions. [40 crystals (magic crystals) for activation, only available three times, and one viewing per person.]","“F*ck?!” Mr. Fang was astonished. Besides being expensive, it even set a limit on viewing period and time?!","It must be noted that as the shop owner, Mr. Fang now had high privileges and authorities. For example, he had the right to set the release date of the movie for different shops.","Mr. Fang postponed the release date of the movie in the new shop.","He had reasons for this decision.","The customers in the new shop wouldn’t understand the concepts shown in the movie. It wasn’t that they were not good at techniques, but they couldn’t understand the oriental techniques and the Dao shown in the movie since they were still hacking and slashing with swords and sabers that were as big as doors.","Therefore, they still needed time to get used to this.","Right now, the players in the new shop could do nothing but play Resident Evil 2 or watch its movie version.","Laymen only go for the fun while professionals could spot the essence. Reaching Dao with techniques had nothing to do with the cultivation strength.","Only people who understood it could see the dazzling power of that sword technique.","...","“The Duel? What’s this thing?” Lately, Su Tianji had come to the shop quite late due to her practice of the new spiritual spell. But today, she saw something new in the shop!","“Hahaha!” She was excited.","Since she had opened the ‘genetic lock’, which was a new concept, she had obtained great improvement in her control abilities and techniques, helping her break through the bottleneck in transforming lightning fire into threads. With her new abilities, she could finally practice that new spiritual spell.","Today, she discovered a new thing!","“Limited time?!”","“We can only watch it once?!”","“So expensive?!”","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","Castellan Zong Wu had just arrived. “The Duel?! A movie?”","In Mr. Fang’s Tour Group in QQ, Su Tianji @-ed everyone. [Do you guys want to watch the new movie? Get onboard! (Husky’s grinning face)]","Jiang Xiaoyue asked, [Boss released a new movie?]","A big white deer said, [I want to watch it! I’m onboard!]","Nalan Mingxue typed, [@Mr. Fang. Sir, are you coming?]","Mr. Fang replied, [You guys can go ahead and watch it without me. 😒]","Song Qingfeng chimed in, [😒 It won’t feel the same without the shop owner.]","Tang Yu said, [Come on! Let’s go!]","Liu Ningyun added, [Sir, get onboard now. Don’t waste time 😒]","Mr. Fang said, [Don’t fool around. This shop hasn’t released it yet.]","[Awesome!]","Nalan Hongwu said, [Great thinking!]","Song Qingfeng posted a meme showing Mr. Fang clapping his hands fiercely.","Mr. Fang almost spewed blood onto his screen. Ever since these people learned how to battle using memes, they created all kinds of new memes.","[Which one of you even learned how to use Photoshop?!] (This software could be bought in Qzone)","Song Qingfeng replied, [@Jiang Xiaoyue]","Mr. Fang’s face twitched as he thought, Damn it. As your boss, I only took a few bags of potato chips from you!","Jiang Xiaoyue said, [Then, we’ll go and watch it without you! Hehe! (Husky’s cute face)]","She tried to change the subject.","This... Mr. Fang was feeling powerless.","Meanwhile, the three people who could do nothing but watch others play gathered together.","Jessica stared at the small blackboard and said, “They have a new movie...”","Kevin suggested, “Now that the shop owner isn’t here, should we...”","Carl replied, “I tried it... when someone went to the bathroom. It’s no use.”","“...”","At this moment, Gabriel said, “Can you guys help me throw the garbage? I’m busy watching the movie!”","The three people fell silent.","Weren’t they homies and good buddies?!","Feeling like crying, they went over to dump the garbage.","...","At this moment, Su Tianji, Nalan Hongwu, and the players in other shops including Zong Wu and Gu Tingyun began to watch the new movie.","Watching the movie together in Qzone, Nalan Hongwu and others found that the scene before them dimmed, and they couldn’t see anything behind them as well. When they could see light again, the scene changed to a long street engulfed in a thin mist.","It was a full moon night on the peak of the Forbidden City!","“The battle was scheduled on the 15th of August on the Purple Gold Mountain of Moling, but Ximen Chuixue insisted and postponed it to one month later and changed the venue to this place...”","In a narrow street, a shop just opened. While steam floated out of the pot of soy milk, the audience saw two men talking about the duel scheduled in one month’s time.","One of them was a man who had ‘four eyebrows’ – Lu Xiaofeng. This man had a mustache, and which counted a pair of eyebrows in others’ eyes.","[TL Note: Lu Xiaofeng is the fictional protagonist of the wuxia novel series Lu Xiaofeng Series by Gu Long, and this movie was a section of the series.]","“Ximen Chuixue?” Nalan Hongwu murmured to himself curiously.","“Ye Gucheng?” Zong Wu was also puzzled.","Gradually, they understood that Ximen Chuixue and Ye Gucheng were the most powerful sword masters in this world.","But...","“How come I feel like the people in the movie don’t have high strength?” Zong Wu said in a low voice.","“I think so too...” Su Tianji frowned.","Nalan Hongwu also looked disappointed. “Let’s watch it for a while and see...”","Soon, they saw the figure that seemed to have descended into the mortal world like a flying immortal.","The white-clothed girl walked downstairs with a basket of yellow chrysanthemum, scattering the bright flower petals on the stairs and turning it into a flower carpet.","Then, a person slowly walked up, stepping on the flowers.","In the next moment, the viewers felt like they were fortunate enough to see that sword strike. They couldn’t find words to describe the radiance and glory of that slash or its speed! It felt like it wasn’t a sword slash but the fury of the God of Thunder!","“There’s such a person and such a sword technique?!”","The audience stared at this streak of sword beam without blinking, afraid to miss any detail.","With a bitter smile, Nalan Hongwu realized that he wasn’t seeing strength but an ultimate sword technique that was at the peak of all techniques.","It reached the ultimate level in terms of force, speed, angle, and timing!","This man’s opponent didn’t even have a chance to block it. Despite the Tang Family’s world-famous skills with hidden weapons, his opponent didn’t have a chance to use it.","At this moment, the audience had the feeling that it was the most dazzling thing that they could ever see in the world, and nothing could be compared to it.","“This movie...!!!”","“F*ck!?”","“So powerful!”","At this moment, most of them understood that what the movie intended to show wasn’t strength but a new realm!","“How about Ximen Chuixue?!” Nalan Hongwu couldn’t wait to watch what realm Ximen Chuixue, Ye Gucheng’s opponent, had reached."]},{"number":590,"title":"Chapter 590 - A Sword Came from West, Flying Immortal Beyond the Heavens","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","There were many powerful techniques shown in Wind and Cloud. For Example, Sword 23 created by the Sword Saint on Sanfen Field emphasized on the unyielding spirit that warriors should have when facing nature and their fates.","This spirit overshadowed everything else.","This movie didn’t contain frightening strength, but it showed the swordsman’s tireless pursuit for the ultimate Sword Dao despite the limit of their physical strength.","It was a road of reaching Dao through techniques. The perfect sword technique was the resemblance of Sword Dao. Without being overpowered by insane and brute strength, the Sword Dao was clear and pure.","As the movie went on, the audience followed the characters into the ancient and prosperous nation and the magnificent and luxurious Forbidden City which was the royal city.","After passing Taihe Gate, they saw the grand palace covered in golden glazed tiles. Under the moonlight, it looked like a world made of gold.","“Look! Is the duel about to begin?!” Standing before the royal city, Dong Qingli was excited as she stood in the crowd who were here to watch the duel.","“Senior Sister, is this the royal city?” Mu Qing looked around while grabbing Yue Bai’s hand. Beside them, Jiang Xiaoyue also glanced around curiously standing with a big white deer. The bright moon shone on the boisterous crowds.","“Here he is! Here he is!” Nalan Hongwu, Zong Wu, and other warriors were also standing before the grand palace, and they looked up over the eaves of the building.","“Is he Ximen Chuixue?”","In the moonlight, they saw a figure flying over with his white clothes fluttered in the wind.","Only after seeing him would people truly understand the feeling of the phrase, ‘a type of people who are close to being gods.’","Just as he said, “My sword is not for show.”","“When you pierce your sword into their throats and see the bloodflower bloom out around your sword tip, you’ll know that nothing in the world is as beautiful as the radiance of that moment.”","His sword techniques were for killing.","These types of sword techniques couldn’t contain any impurities including emotions and feelings.","People crammed the space around the grand palace, including the audience from the shops in Yuanyang City, Jiuhua City, and Half City.","They all craned their necks to watch the duel.","The moon was overhead now. Standing on the ridge of the roof that looked to be made from gold and glass, the two men were all dressed in spotless white clothes.","“They look so powerful...” Jiang Xiaoyue watched with widened eyes. She glanced around and found that everyone around her was also watching with their eyes wide open.","At this moment, standing on the roof of the grand palace, Ximen Chuixue raised his sword expressionlessly and said, “This sword is one of the sharpest weapons in the world. The blade is three feet seven inches long, and the total weight is 7.13 pounds.”","Ye Gucheng said, “Good sword!”","Then, Ye Gucheng lifted his sword as well and said, “This blade is the best out of all the chilly swords from overseas. It will cut through hair if you blow on it. The blade is three feet three inches long, and it’s extremely sharp with a total weight of 6.4 pounds.”","Both had lifted their swords but didn’t unsheathe them. Drawing the sword was an integral part of sword techniques. Obviously, they wanted to compete in any area within the range of swordsmanship.","“So cool!” Song Qingfeng wished that it was he who was standing on the roof, wondering how they could appear so dashing in a duel!","“Should we copy them after we finish watching the movie...” Standing beside him, Lin Shao suggested imitating this duel afterwards.","Watching the mysterious incidents one after another, the audience began to understand the truth behind the postponing of the duel. The scheme of assassinating the emperor and trying to rebel helped the audience to better understand the characters who were both intelligent and complicated.","Ye Gucheng, the Castellan of White Cloud City, seemed to be a lofty god.","He was a proud and horrifying person; his sword technique, Flying Immortal Beyond the Heavens, was as impeccable and spotless as the white clouds in the blue sky.","His mind was as unfathomable as the abyss and the ocean.","The audience began to understand the unique magnificence of this world shown in the movie.","If they had watched the duel right after Fang Qi’s shops were opened, they wouldn’t have been enthralled and wouldn’t find these sword techniques exciting and grand.","Before their swords connected, they moved their positions slowly but constantly, but the sword blades changed positions swiftly since the swords moved with their minds before using the techniques.","Having a deep understanding of swordsmanship, only Nalan Hongwu could perceive the horrifying power of this realm. Regardless of how someone tried to dodge or duck, they would face an ultimate sword strike which was perfect in every way including the spirit, essence, speed, force, position, and all other related elements.","They showed a nearly perfect control of their swords. It seemed their sword moved with their minds, and people felt like there was no need for time to react.","More horrifying was that no matter how their sword techniques, their positions, and their opponents’ positions changed, Nalan Hongwu was sure that the sword techniques they used in the next moment would still be perfect.","The audience had never imagined that such a combat method existed in the world.","Now, the audience could only see the moving of the blades and the swordsmen, but neither of them used their techniques yet.","But Nalan Hongwu understood the duel. He could even see the countless duels in the slightest move of their blades.","With their nearly perfect control, when they spotted the tiniest opportunity, they would instantly turn the changes and variations that existed in the ‘void’ into a solid and perfect sword strike!","Without the disguise of great strength and the show of force, others could see the underlying principles better.","Finally, the viewers saw the two use their sword techniques.","At this moment, the stars and the moon dimmed. All the light in the world gathered on the two swords.","They each used only one sword strike.","At this moment, exclamations erupted all over the shop.","They saw that Ye Gucheng’s sword was like a gust beyond the white clouds.","However, an invisible thread seemed to be tied to Ximen Chuixue’s sword, and it represented his wife, his families, and his emotions.","There was the tiniest gap between them.","Nalan Hongwu, Zong Wu, and the cultivators including Gu Tingyu all opened their mouths, trying to yell but couldn’t as if something strangled their throats.","The whole place was silent.","The moon and stars disappeared in the sunlight radiated from the morning sun from the east!","However, the audience saw Ye Gucheng lie in a pool of blood, the man who had looked like an immortal and a white cloud in the blue sky.","When all his schemes collapsed, he had decided to die under Ximen Chuixue’s sword, which was the last honor of a swordsman.","Perhaps at this moment, two names were branded in the minds of the viewers.","The names were as lofty as immortals and gods.","This duel was printed into their minds as well.","Like poetry, the saying goes, [On the night of the full moon, on the peak of Forbidden City, a sword came from the west, flying immortal beyond the heavens.]","A long while later, they snapped back to reality.","“Ahh-! Awesome!” After watching the movie, Song Qingfeng almost roared.","“A sword came from the west, flying immortal beyond the heavens...” Nalan Hongwu murmured these two sentences. Despite his great age and experience, his eyes turned red with deep feelings.","Su Tianji took out her Black Snow Godly Sword and lifted it while saying, “This sword is one of the sharpest weapons in the world. The blade is three feet seven inches long, and the total weight is 7.13 pounds.”","She felt very cool while saying it.","Palace Master Xue Daolv saw this, and his face twitched. Damn it! It’s Black Snow, not the sword in the movie!","Then, Nalan Mingxue took out her Snow-Drinking Saber and said coldly, “This blade is the best out of all the chilly swords from overseas. It will cut through hair if you blow on it. The blade is three feet three inches long, and it’s extremely sharp with a total weight of 6.4 pounds!”","She felt great about herself!","The others had tears on their faces. Damn it! This is a blatant show-off!"]},{"number":591,"title":"Chapter 591 - The War Is About to Begin!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The viewers would always remember Ye Gucheng who had won the duel but still chose to die at the hands of his opponent.","They would also remember Ximen Chuixue who had transcended in the duel and became a sword god.","The ultimate radiance shown in the duel dazzled everyone.","Regardless if they were showing-off or not, people gathered in the open space before the shops.","Obviously, this movie inspired the players, and they didn’t want to wait and waste this moment.","The cultivators and warriors all ran out of the shops.","Song Qingfeng said, “Please.”","Lin Shao said with a straight face, “Not now.”","“Why not?” Song Qingfeng was so expressionless that the audiences’ faces twitched.","“Because your mind is not at peace,” Lin Shao said with great dignity. “If your mind is troubled, your sword techniques will be disturbed, which will undoubtedly lead to your death.”","“Trash! Watch my Flying Immortal Beyond the Heavens!” Xu Luo couldn’t watch it any more.","While some people acted out the scenes from the movie in a terrible manner, others were serious and savored their inspirations.","Nalan Hongwu had indeed obtained many inspirations. He moved his black sword slowly as if he were imitating something.","He seemed to have found a special rhythm.","Meanwhile, Zong Wu, Liang Heihu, and other warriors were also savoring the perfect sword strike in the movie.","As for the cultivators, they were savoring the perfect control of swords, their own strength, essence, and everything that they could put in use.","Regardless of how much they could understand, they had obtained tremendous growth.","...","In the distant, primitive snow-covered land to the west of the Spiritual State lived a group of strong and proud people. They kept company with huge dragons and living in ice and frost. They had built a nation in the chilly high mountains in the ancient times, and their descendants lived there until today.","But today, they faced destruction when the black lightning bolts tore open the sky.","The city built on the high snow mountain looked like it was made of ice. Right now, holes were everywhere, and there was only the scene of devastation.","In the huge ice-snow palace on the peak of the highest mountain stood a man with an imposing figure.","At first glance, people would think that he was a giant.","He was wearing red armor and was holding a huge dragon-headed saber that was almost as tall as himself.","Standing on the huge platform, people could see the distant snow mountains. A dark blue stone palace engulfed in pale blue light patterns hovered in the sky, and strange stone array disks flew around it.","Strange spiritual lights flowed around the huge and ancient round array disks while many spiritual patterns containing spiritual power blinked on them. When they blinked, holy light beams shot down from the sky and turned into destructive magic light, shattering the ground and destroying the cities!","“Your Majesty!” A middle-aged general who was covered in blood bowed to him. “We can’t block them. Please evacuate this place now!”","The huge man didn’t answer. This should be the liveliest moment of the day in this beautiful city built on ice, but it felt like the doomsday today.","It seemed like the roars could shake the ground. In a distant mountain, a huge blood-red horned dragon let out a great roar.","“This is the land that we’ve lived on for thousands of years.” The man in red armor was once the strongest grand emperor warrior on the continent. After getting onto his blood dragon, he charged into the sky.","Compared with the destructive shadow in the sky, the huge horned dragon looked very tiny.","Perhaps today was really their doomsday.","...","The Ultimate West Realm wasn’t the only place that was under siege.","Meanwhile, like an immortal relic, a fiery red palace hovered in the high sky above the small human nation in the Morning Star Sea Realm.","Situated in the very depth of the continent, Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain had never imagined that disaster would strike them so harshly. Today, many flames crashed onto the mountains like meteors, destroying all the spiritual essence in the factions and turning their garden of abundant spiritual plants into scorched land.","At this moment, the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection had begun.","With its great force almost covering more than half of the nations on the continent, the Judgement Godly Palace even had churches and followers in the Morning Light Empire.","Even some of the royal members of the Morning Light Empire believed in the gods of Judgement Godly Palace.","Due to the great development of information technology in this world, all kinds of magic items entered people’s everyday life.","Even civilians in the city could gather on the central square of Canglan City to watch the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection cast by the priests of Judgement Godly Palace.","In the center of the square, the light emitting from the magic crystal soon condensed into a screen.","“Ms. Sala, I understand that you dislike wars. Am I right?” A knight of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion saw the short elf girl who had silver hair and was wearing green leather armor when he got here.","“Different from you, I’m here to see when the war will end,” the elf girl said, “Oh, I don’t wish for the war to begin since it will cause many people to suffer. Almighty Elf God, please end this war as soon as possible.”","“Ms. Sala, you’re a kind person. If they hand over Carl, Jessica, and Kevin, I think the war will end very soon,” the knight said with a snort.","Meanwhile, Jessica was eating melon on a couch in Yuanyang City Shop, and she exclaimed, “What?! They are here?!”","“Xin’er! Xin’er! Get me a bottle of iced red tea and a bag of potato chips.” She was afraid that she wouldn’t be able to have such delicacies after returning home.","“Oh... coming!”","Carl said immediately, “Get me a bottle of red tea too!”","...","Of course, the war wasn’t waged just because of the three of them.","But clearly, the flames of war continued to spread.","In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, people saw a middle-aged man who was about 40 years old explaining the current situation in the war.","This man had dark skin and short brown hair that was neatly combed to two sides, and he wore a black military uniform.","As an ambassador from the Radiant Light Godly Nation, Luther was proficient with this work.","He talked with ease while watching the war.","“Now, we are seeing the battlefield in that continent. As you can see, our three forces had gained footholds on this continent. These weak natives couldn’t fight back at all!”","“Let’s first look at the battlefield in the west of the continent. We’ve captured the Blood Dragon Grand Emperor Warrior of the Ultimate West Realm. Yes, you heard it right. Oh... It’s unbelievable. Is he really the ruler of this world? He’s so weak!”","“Of course, our fighters are the strongest!”"]},{"number":592,"title":"Chapter 592 - Internet Café Army! Roll out!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Princess, Your Highness.” The old man wearing a white priest robe bowed, inviting the woman to sit down on the chair at the head of the table. This woman wore a luxurious, fiery-red long dress and an exquisite silver crown, looking extremely beautiful from every angle.","However, everyone knew that it was just her image projection.","Princess Isabella who had the most noble legendary bloodline wouldn’t come in person.","Sitting beside her was the famous St. Heinz.","Besides these two powerful figures, other powerful figures from the Radiant Light Godly Nation and other godly nations sat in the palace.","The image projection of the old man who had visited the Guardian of Wind also sat among them.","“Grand Emperor Warrior?” One of these prestigious existences frowned.","“Like ants, they don’t know how big the world is and how weak they are. They also have no idea that there are always stronger people out there, which is why they gave themselves such lofty titles,” the old man laughed heartily.","“It’s you, Mr. St. Hematon, the World Mage,” another existence said.","Before them, the scene turned to another place under the control of the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","“These are the legendary three saint factions on this continent. Behind these grand palaces, we can see Yuxu Mountain, one of the three saint factions. Oh! I can’t believe it! I thought it would be a hard battle! How dare such a weak faction call themselves saints?!”","“It seems that I must agree with you, Mr. St. Hematon,” a figure engulfed in golden light said, “It’s a shame that such an existence dares to use the title of saint.” The figure shook his head in disdain.","“Oh! What are we looking at? This human nation is so weak! Their king... Oh, my god! The strongest master of this nation is equivalent to a level 5 fighter here! Only level 5! It’s unbelievable!”","“I’m sorry for my outburst. What I wanted to say is that only uncivilized land can create such a nation!”","Then the scene turned to the Deserted Sea Realm.","“Oh! It’s unbelievable...” At this moment, Joseph, Cia, and other young people were also watching the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection while sitting on a bench on the edge of the square.","With disbelief in their eyes, they listened to Ambassador Luther’s explanations and saw how deluded the people in that land were about their own abilities and importance.","“How can they think this way?!”","“Oh! It’s hard to imagine how they can live in such a world! It’s horrifying!”","“I hope they will be saved so that we can see the redemption of this world...”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Yuanyang City Shop –","A young man with red brown hair was busy playing Dungeon Fighter Online; he was Gabriel.","Suddenly, he slammed his hand on the desk and shouted, “F*ck! Our home is being attacked!”","He actually spoke fluent Spiritual State Language!","Then, more warriors of the Ultimate West Realm jumped up from their chairs.","“Brothers! Grab your weapons and go!” Gabriel yelled.","“Bring more colorless crystals! More colorless crystals! F*ck!”","“Where’s the Disassembler?! Disassemble more of them! I’ll get some more spiritual artifacts and toss them in!”","Meanwhile, Zong Wu was practicing sword techniques outside the shop.","Dumbfounded, he watched the uproar among the warriors of Ultimate West Realm and wondered, What’s going on...?","“Bad news!” Elder Yu ran into the internet café in alarm. “Everyone! The catastrophe is about to strike the Spiritual State now!”","“What catastrophe?! Last time they claimed that it would come in three months, but nothing has happened after such a long time had passed,” Zong Wu shouted back, “What catastrophe are you talking about?!”","“Academy Master Gu has foreseen a greater catastrophe coming our way! Those existences... They are coming for real!” Elder Yu said in a loud voice.","“What?!”","“How come nothing came from the Heavenly Abyss Sea?”","“They attacked from the Ultimate West Realm!”","Right now, there were almost 10,000 players in the shop from all over the region. There were more who hadn’t come into the shop yet.","Groups of warriors and cultivators exited from the games and stood up while slamming the desk.","– Meanwhile, in the Jiuhua City Shop –","The street outside the shop was crammed with cultivators and warriors; there were more in the shop.","The purple-robed Daoist of Xuanzhong Manor and the old man of Yuxu Mountain stumbled out the shop with communication jades in their hands, almost spewing blood on the door. “No! Those people... are attacking from the direction of our factions!”","“What?!” Ji Wu was practicing sword techniques outside the shop. He was the emperor, but maintaining his warrior strength was quite important, which was why he spent hours on cultivation and practice each day.","“This time, we’re in it together! We must unite and work in consolidation!” the two faction masters felt like crying.","Why are the enemies attacking our factions first? And we are here in the internet café! They cussed silently in frustration.","“Don’t worry, Faction Master Wang!” Lan Mo thought for a moment, knowing that it wasn’t time to uphold personal grudges.","An Huwei said, “Where is the Jiuhua Army?”","At this moment, Deputy Commander Gong He was still playing the Legend of Mir 2. In the game, a warrior was chasing after a wizard while holding a huge and heavy saber.","“You dare to run?! Run more!” On the screen, a huge white spiritual sword crashed down viciously. “Watch my Sky-Opening Strike!”","Boom!","“Hahahaha! You can’t run now, huh? With my 40-meter-long big saber, I can let you run for 39 meters!” Then, this man put down the virtual reality headset and shouted, “Jiuhua Army! Jiuhua Army!”","Standing beside Nalan Hongwu, Elder Fu cupped his hands. “My Lord.”","“Okay!” Nalan Hongwu stroked his snow-white beard and stood as he withdrew his sword. “It’s time!”","– In the Half City Shop –","Sitting at the counter, Zou Mo slightly closed his eyes and seemed to see a strange scene.","He froze. “No!”","“Sister Ruan Ning, they... they are here!”","“What do you mean they are here?!” Mo Tianxing asked as he sat on the couch.","“Aha-! I calculated with my fingers.” A mass of black mist floated down from the second floor. “You’re all in danger!”","Ning Bi immediately stood up from her chair and gave it a hard look. “Smirking Face Emoji, you’ll be the first to be sacrificed if we’re in trouble!”","She frowned. “They are here!”","“Where’s my great internet café army?!”","“Here!” The cultivators and warriors in the shop answered. Row after row of cultivators and warriors stood up from their seats.","Tang Yuan said, “I’m tired of killing Abyss Demons 100 times a day. It’s great for us to fight for real to change it up!”","Black Demon said, “Let’s go! Come on! Let’s nail them!”","Mr. Fang sent a message in the group chat, [Some people are making trouble for us, homies.]","Gu Tingyu added, [Internet Café Army! Roll out!]","[Internet Café Army! Roll out!]","[Internet Café Army! Roll out!]","Messages instantly flooded the screen!"]},{"number":593,"title":"Chapter 593 - The Rumored Battling in Suits","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Battling in suits is a meme in China. In a TV Show, a girl said that all DFO players were fat otaku, so all DFO players rallied up. A lot of DFO players and streamers dressed up in suits to play the game.]","At this moment, the forces of the two families divided into three groups and gained footholds on this continent.","In their eyes, this would be a landslide victory. They had made a detailed war plan just to achieve a perfect victory.","“Have you scouted out the routes?” As the commander, Alex directed this battle in person. Despite the weak strength of their enemies, he was well-prepared.","“Yes, we have.” The guard presented him a map on which the red lines marked their direction of attack. Even the forces along the route and their strength had been figured out and reported.","They could see that from the three saint factions toward Heavenly Abyss Sea, the strength of the forces dropped.","“These barbaric natives don’t know that we can see them as clearly as if they are lights in the night.”","– Meanwhile, outside the north border of Dajin –","All kinds of huge spiritual ships were parked on the vast desert.","By now, these spiritual ships had been improved many times after they exchanged spiritual ship production processes with the Gongshu Family and the cultivators of Spiritual State. These spiritual ships were much more powerful than the old version.","– In the Ultimate West Realm –","It seemed like doomsday had come for these people of the Ultimate West Realm.","The homeless people of the Ultimate West Realm were either captured or hiding in the bitter cold snow mountains, waiting for a chance to fight back.","At this moment, almost all the prisons in the region were full of captives, and it wasn’t enough.","Many warriors of the Ultimate West Realm were forced to take off their armor. In tattered dirty clothes and chained, they kneeled on the snow-covered square of Snow Peak City, the biggest city in the Ultimate West Realm.","With their cultivation strength sealed by that mysterious force, their bare feet and hands were frozen and turned purple.","Even though these warriors had been born and raised in this bitter environment, it was hard for them to withstand this harsh cold without cultivation strength.","The huge magical stone palace hovered in the sky, casting a huge shadow and almost engulfing the whole Snow Peak City. For the residents, this was the most terrifying nightmare that they had in the past thousands of years!","...","It must be noted that Taihui, the title that Carl used in the beginning, was a translation for ‘regime’ after he had learned the Spiritual State language with a spiritual spell.","On this other land where people used the ancient godly language, this word meant God of Radiant Light Judgement who controlled the rise and fall of the two suns and had the right to judge other gods.","All the lofty members of the godly palace were proud of their radiant and esteemed image.","Luther was especially attentive to his image. Before he appeared in a public place, he would spend one to two hours to groom himself.","In a shadowy place outside the White Pigeon Square in Canglan City, two figures stood while wearing dark grey cloaks. Obviously, they didn’t like to be exposed in sunlight. “Ambassador Luther of the Radiant Light Godly Nation is just a dog to the Judgement Godly Palace! Oh! He’s just a clown! A complete clown! Look as his disgusting face while he shows off in the Spiritual Spell Image Projection!”","“Damn it! I want to throw dog sh*t on his face and tear his dirty mouth into pieces!”","However, Luther didn’t pay any attention to such insults because these people were as low as the mice and bugs living in the slums and sewers.","However, if such words reached him, some people would be in big trouble. “I remember that someone once asked me if lowly and corruptive existences still are around under the god’s light.”","“I thought that there was only one kind of such beings who hide in the filth in darkness... even the god can’t save them...”","He continued after a pause, “Oh, I think you know whom I’m referring to. They wear filthy clothes, emit a stinky odor, and inhabit the dirtiest spots, such as in the sewers. Now, I think that the barbaric natives are as low as them.”","At this moment, the visual shown by the spiritual spell displayed a small nation in the Morning Star Sea Realm.","“Look at this humble and pathetic nation! Even the strongest masters are only at level 5... Hoho! But I still hope that the god’s radiance will shine on this land as soon as possible.”","“Oh! What do we see?!” At this moment, they had a glimpse of a line of black shadows in the distant horizon. The black shadows moved forward swiftly through the clouds beyond the northern snow mountains to the west of the Spiritual State.","“The...barbaric natives are coming to us?!” Even in the grand palace where powerful masters gathered with St. Heinz, many of them looked surprised.","“Haha... They dare to attack? I thought that they would defend that sea area. At least by concentrating their forces, they might be able to struggle and fight back for a bit.”","“‘Land of Thorns’ is personally guarding this godly palace, and six sky knights and three prophets of the Thorn Flower Family are also here. They are all level 9 super masters. These natives dare to come to us?”","“Get the destruction-scale magic cannon ready!” In the fancy central hall of that grand palace, a man who was wearing a luxurious black robe with golden patterns sat on his seat.","Before him stood nine people in two rows, emitting suffocating presences. They were the six sky knights and three prophets of the Thorn Flower Family.","“It’s time to give the ignorant natives a taste of our power!”","Born in the reclusive cultivator community in Seven Saint Mountain, Fairy Qing Yun was not good at fighting.","However, not all cultivators who weren’t great at combat were useless in war.","Fairy Qing Yun excelled in making elixirs, spiritual treasures, supporting spiritual spells, and even calculation techniques.","Although she had been idle lately, she watched the Legend of the White Snake everyday. While she watched Bai Suzhen calculating and seeing people’s previous lives and the future of Little Qing and others, Fairy Qing Yun obtained more inspiration, and her calculation technique improved. Now, she only needed to do a calculation with her fingers to know anyone’s position and conditions and even the layout of forces in a certain area.","Despite her lack of combat abilities, she was stationed on the flagship ship.","She felt proud of herself.","...","“They are really getting close!” Luther sounded disdainful. “At this range, we can put the spiritual spell closer to them, so we can get a good look of these pathetic barbarians.”","On the square and in St. Heinz’s grand palace, the Spiritual Spell Image Projection zoomed in.","Soon, they had a clear view of the huge classy and beautiful spiritual ship in the center of the group. Nine people including Gu Tingyun and the masters and elders of the ancient families were standing on the bow and looking at the distant sky.","Their clothes were beautiful and grand, dignified yet not dull, haughty yet not rude. They looked like people from a mysterious and ancient nation with beautiful scenery.","Standing at the bow with their white robes fluttered in the wind, these people looked like immortals descending into the mortal world.","“My goodness!”","“Wow-! Are they really barbaric natives?”","Exclamations rose in the White Pigeon Square.","“Didn’t someone say that they are uncivilized and unruly people wearing filthy clothes like those despicable beings?” Cia froze in amazement while covering her little mouth with her hand.","“Oh... Almighty Elf God!” Beside them, Sala, the young elf girl was also stupefied.","“I think...” At this moment, they realized that these people who Luther described as uncivilized, dirty, and lowly barbaric natives were completely different from their imagination.","Mr. Fang was walking past the White Pigeon Square after having lunch, and he saw this scene.","“Pu-!”","“Ye Gucheng?! Ximen Chuixue?!” Damn it!!"]},{"number":594,"title":"Chapter 594 - You Stole All the Thunder","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Everyone in St. Heinz’ grand palace was slightly surprised.","Of course, even though this scene was unexpected, they continued watching calmly.","“I think Wilson is preparing the main cannons in the godly palace, right?” The voice came from the projected image of an old man who wore a pure-white priest robe. Obviously, he was a high-level official of the godly palace.","The moment he said it, three hexagonal stone gates opened in the ancient stone palace, revealing three black cannon muzzles.","Even without firing, they emitted a horrifying suppression.","At this moment, several figures flew out of the grand palace.","The person in the middle was Wilson, the Land of Thorns. He was the powerful existence who had sat in the center of the grand palace in a luxurious black robe with golden patterns.","The six knights were wearing armor of different colors, and the three prophets in black spiritual robes flanked him.","They floated in mid-air as if gravity didn’t apply to them.","“We should give you the most severe godly punishment for your previous sins,”‘Land of Thorns’ Wilson said, “Our god is merciful and will give you a chance to redeem yourselves. As long as you hand over the hostages and accept our god’s glory, I think the god will forgive you.”","They were surprised that these barbaric natives dared to come to them, and they would grab this opportunity to realize their goal.","As mentioned before, they needed a glorious victory, and subduing the barbaric natives without bloodshed was a good way to achieve this goal.","“Oh! What do I see? Are these barbaric natives crazy?” The image turned to another battlefield.","At this moment, on the border of Dajin, the internet café army encountered the godly palace legion which had conquered the three saint factions and was marching towards the Heavenly Abyss Sea.","“No! These barbaric natives are crazy. I feel like the barbaric natives on the other battlefield are going to come to us as well.” Luther suddenly changed his tone and said, “Do you think it looks like that they are here to surrender?”","“It’s hard to imagine! Instead of wearing armor, their warrior are wearing white clothes; are they going to a wedding or a ball?”","His teasing words made the audience chuckle.","However, it was quiet in St. Heinz’s grand palace. The lofty existences were not a bit disturbed.","They only watched and wondered if these barbaric natives were going surrender.","They were certain about the outcome of this war.","After all, nothing but pathetic defeat awaits these barbaric natives. What other outcome can there be?","Compared to the battlefield at the Spiritual State, only one figure flew out of the godly palace. He wore fiery red armor and carried a huge sword on his back.","While flying high up in the sky, he looked down and said with intense disdain, “Are you here to surrender?”","“He’s the famous sky knight, Mr. Hex, the Knight of Furious Flame!” Luther introduced, “He’s a top-tier master only next to the ‘Morning Star of Burning Flame’.”","“Mr. Hex probably thinks that these barbaric natives don’t deserve the efforts of Mr. Austin, the Morning Star of Burning Flame. From what I know, there are few level 8 masters on this land, but Mr. Austin has reached level 9! I’m afraid that he can subdue all these barbaric natives all by himself.”","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu stood on the bow of the spiritual ship.","While wearing pure white clothes, his white hair was tied behind his head, and the black longsword on his belt was sheathed.","He said mildly, “You should not be here.”","Instead of using the Spiritual State language, he spoke the language of the outlanders.","Besides eating melon and drinking red tea every day in the shop, Jessica and her companions had taught them some spiritual spells including the Language Inspiration Spell.","“Ugh... This guy...” At this moment, the young people including Cia and Joseph, other warriors and mages, and some members of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who had been watching the Spiritual Spell Image Projection were surprised.","They could feel the lofty pride in the succinct words even through the Spiritual Spell Image Projection.","Damn, this man sounds elegant and has depth!","The people watching on the square froze.","The Elf Girl named Sala blinked and wondered, Are these natives... really barbaric natives?","“I shouldn’t be here?” Hex, the Knight of Furious Flame, frowned slightly and suddenly snickered. “I think it’s you who shouldn’t be here. If you’re not here to surrender to us, then are you here to seek your death?”","“You use swords?” Nalan Hongwu glanced at the huge sword on Hex’s back.","Hex froze and then said after a long pause, “Are you blind? I carry a sword on my back. Of course, I use swords!”","Nalan Hongwu said mildly, “Do you know what the essence of swords is?”","Aya! These people’s words are so At this moment, Sala thought that these people of the Continent of Immortal Relics were mysterious and elegant, instead of being ignorant, filthy, and low as Luther had described.","“What’s happening?!”","At this moment, the lofty existences in St. Heinz’ grand palace were also surprised.","Why aren’t these people afraid?!","Instead of being afraid, he even has time to ask about the essence of swords?","“I think Mr. Klaus, the Sword Saint, will be the best person to answer this question.” The old man who was nicknamed the World Mage said.","At this moment, Hex said, “The sword in my hand was born to kill enemies of the Judgement Godly Palace!”","“Only sincere people can reach the pinnacle stage of swordsmanship. Insincere people don’t deserve to talk about swords.” Nalan Hongwu looked at Hex and said, “You’re not sincere.”","“Hiss-!” Sala touched her thin sword on her belt and thought, This old man’s words make good sense...","Even the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who were standing around Sala began to see the barbaric natives in a new light.","They were surprised that he could speak so wisely!","Damn! You stole all the thunder.","Watching the scene behind the crowd, Mr. Fang was speechless.","“Haha!” Hex drew out the huge fiery-red sword on his back with a cold smile. “If you think that you can talk us out of the war, dream on!”","Then, his face darkened as he thought, This native isn’t even at level 8, and he dares to lecture me?","“Do you know what level 8 is?” Hex said slowly, “It’s the pinnacle stage for humans!”","“So many years passed, and even this little guy Hex has also reached level 8.” In St. Heinz’ grand palace, a projected image said, “I guess he has reached it in recent years.”","“He was baptised in godly power last year. If he borrows the godly power, he can reach level 8,” a priest explained."]},{"number":595,"title":"Chapter 595 - We Might Be Watching the Fake Barbaric Natives","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Well, well! An inferior swordsman who isn’t at level 8 dares to lecture me?” Hex said lazily, “Try to take one of my sword strikes, and I’ll see if you have the right to give me lectures.”","With a cold expression, his feet moved slightly in the air.","In the next instant, he already appeared before Nalan Hongwu!","He hacked down his huge fiery-red blade with vicious force!","“Instant Strike!? This is Mr. Hex’ Instant Strike!” Many knights exclaimed on White Pigeon Square.","“The Instant Strike that can chop a level 8 magical beast in half! My goodness!”","However, in the next moment, they saw Nalan Hongwu move his feet slightly, and his body swayed to one side a little bit.","The huge blade missed him by a narrow margin!","White-haired and white-clothed, Duke Nalan stood where he was with his hands clasped behind his back, looking as if he hadn’t moved at all.","“My goodness!”","“What just happened?!”","Gasps sounded from White Pigeon Square.","Cia, Ron, and the other young people covered their mouths with their hands, and they couldn’t believe their eyes.","How could it be?!","How did he manage that?!","“Oh! That was amazing!”","Even the figures hiding in the dark corner of the square were stupefied at this scene. “He... dodged it?”","However, this sword strike wasn’t over.","With a twist of his waist, Hex slashed back his huge sword with horrifying force!","However, Nalan Hongwu seemed to have anticipated his move. Almost at the same time when Hex slashed out, Nalan Hongwu began to turn his body. When the sword came, Nalan Hongwu dodged with perfect timing!","Everyone on White Pigeon Square was shocked, and their mouths opened in a perfect O-shape.","“Sala! I told you many times. When we’re on a mission...” Lance walked up with disapproval on his face.","“No... Captain. Look!” Sala pointed at the Spiritual Spell Image Projection but couldn’t describe what she was seeing.","“Look where? It’s nothing to look at! War? It is just a war...” Lance turned his head but froze when he saw the Spiritual Spell Image Projection.","What did he see? He saw that Hex, the Knight of Furious Flame, couldn’t even touch an old man’s clothes after using several sword techniques!","Who is this guy?!","“Which nation is this grand master from?!” Lance asked immediately.","“This is...” Sala couldn’t believe this, and she stared at the battle with widened eyes as she said, “He’s from another continent...”","“The weak and helpless nation that the Judgement Godly Palace is invading?” Lance looked at the projected visuals before him.","!!??” What did I say? Weak and helpless? How can any weak force be like this?","“Who’s this guy?!” Lance asked immediately, “Is he the most powerful figure among them?!”","In St. Heinz’ grand palace, a priest murmured, “Is this barbaric native really at level 7?”","He yelled in his mind, As the Judgement Godly Palace that has all kinds of prophecies and miracles from gods, shouldn’t it be our level 6 masters beating up your level 7 masters?","But now!!??","“Good! Very good!” Hex stopped his attacks at this moment and said, “I thought that this was a boring expedition and didn’t expect to meet anyone who could force me to use my true power.”","At this time, the miraculous golden pattern on Hex’s forehead flashed with dazzling light.","Engulfed in the dazzling light, his entire body turned radiant and flashy.","A horrifying force spread from his forehead to all over his body!","It wasn’t a power that humans could have; it seemed to come from gods!","Before such horrifying power, anyone would feel humble and tiny.","Supported by that horrifying force, Hex hovered in the air, and his golden hair fluttered in the wind.","The air around him seemed to be distorted by that terrifying force!","“Do you see how big the gap between us is?” Hex said with a smirk.","“I’ll show you what is true speed!” This man in fiery-red armor moved his body and suddenly vanished before Nalan Hongwu.","In the next moment, he turned into a series of blurry shadow around Nalan Hongwu, moving as fast as the wind!","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu looked grim and serious.","He could feel that his opponent’s strength far surpassed his after that force joined in. This man’s strength was so high that it was unclimbable!","This gap of strength perhaps couldn’t be bridged with skills and techniques.","Suddenly, Nalan Hongwu’s expression changed, and his body slightly shifted to one side!","His opponent’s blade drew over his chest, making a smooth cut in his chest!","Then, red blood flowed out from the wound.","“So fast!” The audience on White Pigeon Square exclaimed again.","This speed was inhumane!","Like a horrifying fiery-red rain of sword energies and meteors, Hex attacked continuously.","Could anyone block attacks that were at such high speed?","Even grandmasters couldn’t detect the movements of the sword, let alone the eyes of ordinary people.","On top of that, it was impossible to match such a speed!","However, at this moment, Nalan Hongwu’s sword slashed out. His sword turned into a black light beam like a black lightning flash.","It was fast, but it was no match for his opponent’s horrifying speed.","Besides, the gap in their strength was too bigger.","Before the storm-like sword strikes of his opponent, Nalan Hongwu’s black sword looked like a pure light beam.","It was so impeccable and pure that it contained no variations in it. Perhaps it just didn’t need any variations.","When the sword slashed out, blood spewed into the air.","At this moment, even some of the existences in St. Heinz’ grand palace stood up subconsciously.","The Sword Saint named Claus also stared at the sword strike intently.","If it were said that Hex wasn’t using the strength of humans, then this sword strike didn’t belong to humans. It was like a sword strike that an immortal used!","“Although your strength has increased, it isn’t your own strength, which means that you can’t control it. You will only expose more weaknesses because of it.”","[A Sword Came from the West, Flying Immortal Beyond the Heavens!]","Even if he couldn’t fully understand it, any bit of inspiration was crucial. Nalan Hongwu might not have reached that realm, but he had seen it and obtained some inspirations from it.","His sword had almost reached that perfect realm.","“Ahh–!”","“These people...!?”","These people of this mysterious and ancient nation are elegant and powerful, and their swordsmanship is philosophical and poetic.","This was the impression that these ‘barbaric natives’ left on the minds of the people of the Lora Continent.","Are we really looking at the barbaric natives!"]},{"number":596,"title":"Chapter 596 - Battle!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Spiritual Spell Visual Projection came from a crystal ball sitting on a base. With magic power flowing inside, the mist above the crystal ball revealed a huge screen with scenes in the battlefields on the Continent of Immortal Relics.","These were all provided by the godly palace in Canglan City.","Sometimes, it would show some projected visuals of masters fighting in mystic realms.","“Did you see that sword technique clearly?”","With borrowed horrifying godly power, Hex created a curtain of sword shadows with blazing flames, but his attacks were shattered by one clear sword slash from his opponent.","The knights, elves, warriors, mages, and young people of the Morning Light Empire on the White Pigeon Square were shocked.","How come this is different from the battles that we watched before? With Hex’s terrifying speed, strength, and flames that are empowered by godly power, he can easily fight 10,000 warriors alone!","But you guys... destroyed all that with a sword strike? Something is wrong!","It didn’t make sense!","They were stupefied with shock and disbelief.","This battle turned their understanding of battles upside down!","This sword slash looked random and didn’t make sense, but true masters knew its power and the outcome before it landed.","They saw a horrifying control of strength after everything at that moment was known to Nalan Hongwu. He didn’t need eyes to see and ears to hear to achieve this granular control.","Seeing a tiny movement from his opponent, such as a shift of a foot or a wave of a sword, Nalan Hongwu would instantly know how to use the next sword strike.","Regardless of how fast Hex moved around Nalan Hongwu and which angle he attacked from, Nalan Hongwu would use a perfect sword strike to counter.","“I’m surprised.” The projected image of an old man who was emitting radiant light said, “Mr. St. Heinz, we might not be able to win the war as easily as we expected.”","“Obviously, Hex lost this battle due to his opponent’s superb combat skills.” The old man who was nicknamed the World Mage said, “But I’m not worried. After all, skills take hundreds of years to master but can’t extend people’s lifespan or strengthen their force. It takes everything backward. This old man has lived hundreds of years but only reached level 7. I’m afraid that he’s in the last years of his life.”","Powerful strength could extend one’s lifespan. With prolonged life, people could cultivate and reach higher realms.","These people also practiced skills, but in their eyes, skills were just auxiliary abilities while one obtained more strength.","After all, one couldn’t block a destructive spiritual spell with only techniques.","It was why these forces were called godly nations and godly palaces while the Morning Light Empire, the nation of skills, was only an empire.","“Oh! Mr. Hex was so careless.” At this moment, Luther hurried to explain. “Believe me, it was just an accident!”","For laymen, it indeed looked like an accident.","In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, Luther continued, “I hope that others won’t repeat the careless mistake that Mr. Hex made. Anyway, these barbaric natives are not good-for-nothing. Yes, that’s what has happened.”","“These barbaric natives are fearless. Maybe they think that their good luck will continue?” Luther said viciously, “I think we must teach them a lesson!”","“Was it just an accident? Oh... No!” Naïve Elf Girl Sala began to worry again.","“Obviously. Mr. Hex was defeated too easily.” A knight of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion said, “I, too, think that it was just an accident. Don’t you think so, Ms. Helen?”","Helen answered distractedly, “Maybe...”","“Even if his victory had an element of luck, he is still very powerful since he could defeat the mighty Mr. Hex!” Cia argued.","At this moment, the audience on White Pigeon Square were divided into several groups with different opinions. The knights of the knight legion thought that the barbaric natives wouldn’t be so lucky anymore. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to rescue Ms. Jessica and the others.","The group led by Elf Girl Sala thought that there might be an element of luck in the victory, but they believed that the battle was won with some high-level techniques.","While these people argued, Luther changed the scene of the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. They had set one end of the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection in each of the three battlefields, and Luther could choose any of them to show to the audience.","Obviously, he had seen something he liked on another battlefield and immediately changed the scene. It was something that the godly palace wanted to show to the audience as well.","“Oh! Look! Mr. ‘Land of Thorns’ has ordered a full-scale charge on the barbaric natives who are determined to resist us. But this time, they won’t be so lucky!”","They could see white godly light transform into destructive light beams while they crashed down from the sky. Pale blue lights lit up around the spiritual ships of Spiritual State cultivators. When the white godly light beams crashed onto the pale blue spiritual lights around the spiritual ships, the ships shook violently under the huge force.","Meanwhile, the Spiritual State began to fight back.","While artifact masters in Jiuhua City and Half City were busy preparing, the cultivators of the Spiritual State hadn’t been idle. At the end of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, Li Xiaoyao returned to Shu Mountain Faction and studied many things from the ancient scrolls.","With the artifact-making and array-planning methods that they learned from the game, the cultivators strengthened and improved the defensive and offensive arrays on their spiritual ships. Since the ancient families on the Spiritual State were the most powerful forces on this continent, they were not at an obvious disadvantage in this battle.","Meanwhile, many warriors riding all kinds of mounts flew out from the huge stone palace in the sky like locusts, dashing in all directions.","Instantly, they almost filled the whole sky and blocked out most of the light.","Behind the riders were rows of white-robed mages who were hovering in the sky.","The most eye-catching were fire-spitting huge dragons which looked like the horned dragons that Gabriel and the others rode, but these beasts were fiercer than horned dragons.","Of course, there were other rare beasts as well. One golden-armored knight was riding a magnificent lion with wings.","This knight didn’t attack. Instead, he watched the battle quietly from the high sky.","At the order of the golden-armored knight, the locus-like legion of knights swept down from the sky like a huge gloomy cloud under the cover of many godly light beams!"]},{"number":597,"title":"Chapter 597 - The Furious Roars of Eight Million Fighters","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Before them, the ice city had disappeared. Only their worst nightmare hovered high in the sky above the snowy Ultimate West Realm.","“Hell bringers of the Black Dragon Family, do you dare to come with me and kill all of them!” At this moment, a horned dragon soared up into the sky, and Gabriel raised his huge sword and roared.","“We hell bringers are unrivaled! Attack!” Before the others could answer, a warrior of the Spiritual State dashed out with red eyes. Although this war was waged in the Ultimate West Realm, it wasn’t directed only at this place. The people here were only the earliest victims of this war.","If the Ultimate West Realm was lost, the next would be the Spiritual State or the entire Continent of Immortal Relics.","“Attack!” Furious roars could be heard despite the howling of violent gusts in the sky. The cultivators of the Spiritual State had had little dealings with warriors of the Ultimate West Realm, but seeing the devastation of the land and the ruined city, the brave character of the Spiritual State burned with fury as their blood boiled.","After all, they lived on the same continent, and they guarded another continent in a virtual world together.","Instantly, at least 1,000 people charged into the enemies engulfed by raining light beams.","“Where are the grand masters!” As a grand master player, Jiang Xuan raised his fist and yelled.","“Where are the silent eyes!” Zong Wu roared, and all the silent eye players on the spiritual ships answered him.","“A sword may conquer the flesh, but only your heart may conquer the mind!”","“My eyes are in deep sleep, and my heart is my new eye!”","Not only slayers but all other classes including noblesses, dragon fists, and swift masters joined the fight. Many figures swarmed out like a terrifying wave from the spiritual ships.","“Spacetime Cutter shatters the world! Every creature is a tiny ant under the sword!”","“Radiant gunfire! Rain of 3,000 bullets!”","“Gales! Move at my order!”","“...”","“Charge! Where are my eight million fighters!” For some time now, a legend about eight million fighters in Dungeon Fighter Online had been circulating around the shops.","[TL Note: This is a reference to DFO in China. At its peak, there were eight million concurrent players on the servers.]","Although there were only tens of thousands of players, when Zong Wu flew across the sky and let out a furious roar, many resonant shouts answered him, and it sounded like a tsunami.","The world shook as if everything in the world was terrified by this force.","While the knight legion of the Thorn Flower Family from the Judgement Godly Palace swarmed down like dark clouds, the huge army of fighters of the Spiritual State surged up like turbulent waves in the ocean!","The fighters of the Ultimate West Realm were the first to charge, but the Demon Clan of the Snow Nation, who moved later, overtook them. Crown Prince Jiang Xuan pierced a knight of Judgement Godly Palace with his black-patterned treasure sword!","The Spiritual Spell Visual Projection of the Judgement Godly Palace zoomed out, and the audience could only see many people flying across the sky like ants.","They could distinctly see that two groups of Spiritual State fighters plunged into their enemies.","“These people aren’t afraid of being killed?” Luther was struck by fear while watching the battle through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","Surrounded by many enemies, Gabriel seemed to have forgotten about death, and his armor was covered in ugly wounds.","In the grand palace that was hovering in the sky, a chained figure was pushed out on a cart, and this dying man was revealed to be their lord.","“Attack!” At this moment, even the mild-tempered Luo Piaoling roared in fury.","Zong Wu slashed out his sword and shot out giant spiritual swords one after another, sending groups of knights flying.","A series of roars sounded around him.","“Mountain-Shattering Strike!”","“Saber-Drawing Hack!”","“Fierce Dragon Sky Strike!”","“...”","In the chaotic battle, sword energies looked like lightning flashes while sword lights flashed in the sky. The fierce and violent techniques seemed to have triggered TNT and caused an explosion in the middle of people.","In tattered armor and with a hole through his belly, Gabriel leaped down from his horned dragon. Then, he charged toward the direction of the grand palace without fear.","“This man... is he truly not afraid of death?!” Not only Luther, but many figures in St. Heinz’ grand palace intently stared at this figure on the battlefield.","Covered in blood and with a few grey mysterious crystals in hand, Gabriel leaped up and landed on the huge black dragon that was ridden by a knight who was wearing luxurious golden armor.","“Dereth?” Even from the distance, the audience could clearly see the blood-covered figure among the legion of knights of the Thorn Flower Family.","“What are we seeing?! This mad man dashed to Dereth, one of the most powerful elite members of the Thorn Flower Family!”","Besides the six knights and the three people wearing black priest robes who were all standing motionlessly high in the sky, the man wearing golden armor was the most eye-catching figure here.","“You are asking for it!” Dereth’s face darkened, surprised that this severely injured man dared to charge at him.","“I’ll take your head then!” Dereth hacked out with his huge sword!","Boom!","Gabriel blocked it with his sword, but the huge momentum and the sword technique allowed his opponent’s giant sword to almost chop off his shoulder!","The huge sword was stuck in his bones.","Now, Dereth could only see the attacker’s blood-red eyes.","The crazy eyes looked like that of a demon.","Then, he saw the mad man taking a vicious step forward.","Fury exploded!","Violent and bloody presence exploded like a huge cannonball!","Dereth felt a violent force crashing onto his body like a huge mountain-shattering hammer!","Instantly, he was engulfed by the horrifying blood-red fury energy!","“Impossible!” Many people exchanged a look of horror after seeing this scene and that figure who was covered in blood.","Like raindrops and locusts, people fell from the sky at every moment, but most of them were knights of the Thorn Flower Family.","In the close-range battles, the combat force of these people, who they saw as ‘barbaric natives’, far surpassed their imaginations!","Seeing this scene, Luther was at a loss for words.","Meanwhile, St. Heinz still looked indifferent and cold.","Because...","At this moment, Luther received the order to change the screen to another Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","Meanwhile, the man who was called Land of Thorns and was wearing a luxurious black robe waved his hand and said, “Unleash the Dark Judgement Legion.”","A puff of black smoke appeared beside him and then condensed into a man who was hidden in black armor.","‘Land of Thorns’ stared at the battlefield coldly and saw that no knights dared to get close to Zong Wu.","He pointed at Zong Wu and made the cutthroat gesture.","The man in black armor beside him instantly vanished."]},{"number":598,"title":"Chapter 598 - With My Real Eyes Gone, My Mind’s Eye Opens!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection that was shown to the general public had turned to another scene, but the people in St. Heinz’ grand palace could watch whatever they liked and didn’t need to follow the public.","The Spiritual Spell Visual Projection before them still showed the battlefield in the Ultimate West Realm.","“It seems that Mr. Heinz has underestimated them this time. Hahaha!” The middle-aged man wearing a luxurious fiery-red robe and a tall hat sat across from Heinz.","“Anyway, this war isn’t boring anymore.” At this moment, even the princess sitting beside St. Heinz didn’t look bored, but her tone was still lazy. “But the Thorn Flower Family must show one of their hidden cards now.”","Obviously, she knew about the hidden cards of the forces under the Judgement Godly Palace.","The moment she said that, they saw the ‘Land of Thorns’ sending out the Dark Judgement Legion.","As mentioned before, there were professions similar to the assassins of the Underground Council. For example, some forces trained and kept scouts and killers.","They used these forces to handle things that they wanted to keep secret. The Dark Judgement Legion was one of such forces.","The Thorn Flower Family had trained this force for a long time. The team consisted of three level 8 dark judgement knight captains who acted as leaders and 12 level 7 dark judgement knights.","This time, the Thorn Flower Family brought two dark judgement knight captains and six level 7 dark judgement knights to this war.","It meant that the Thorn Flower Family brought more than half of its military force to this war on the Continent of Immortal Relics, showing their determination to win!","Due to the blockage at the Heavenly Abyss Sea, they couldn’t move some powerful weapons into this land, which was another reason why they brought such powerful legions with them.","However, they were very confident in the abilities of their legions.","On the battlefield where fierce fights went on, Zong Wu waved his sword which wasn’t long but emitted bright lights, overpowering most of his enemies. Most people couldn’t handle his strikes.","However, at this moment, a streak of extremely strange presences floated into the sky above the battlefield.","He looked around carefully but couldn’t see anything unusual as if he was having a hallucination.","An old man wearing a white priest robe and a white hat said slowly, “Disguised in shadows, they judge and remove all sins. This barbaric native is not aware of the danger, which means that the Dark Judgement Knight Legion will take another soul.”","“These barbaric natives don’t know that they are as bright as lights in the dark night to the Thorn Flower Family, and they themselves are blind in the darkness.”","The moment he said it, they saw Zong Wu, who was battling one knight, suddenly stop pursuing his opponent for some reason. Then, he moved to one side confidently.","A pitch-black dagger slashed across the space before Zong Wu’s chest. Then, a figure appeared before him silently while the dagger slashed down extremely close to Zong Wu’s chest, cutting open the pure white robe near the location of his heart.","If Zong Wu had dodged a little bit slower, it was obvious what would have happened.","“!!??”","Instantly, the old man who had spoken smugly in St. Heinz’ grand palace was embarrassed, and his face turned red as if someone had slapped him.","“He... dodged it?!” They all froze.","In their eyes, this native warrior was at most in the pinnacles stage of level 7 and not level 8 yet.","However, the assassin who went after him was a level 8 master!","An level 8 master can’t assassinate a level 7 master?!","Could it be...","They immediately thought of Hex in the previous battle.","Could it be that this barbaric native warrior has the same combat techniques as the barbaric native in the previous battle?","However, St. Heinz and ‘Land of Thorns’ Wilson both looked cold and unmoved by this. ‘Land of Thorns’ Wilson had sent over more than one dark judgement knight!","Two level 8 knights and three level 7 knights were here to deal with Zong Wu!","One of the two level 8 fighters must borrow godly power to reach this level, but the other had reached this realm with his own strength!","In contrast, Zong Wu was only at the pinnacle stage of level 7.","The moment Zong Wu dodged the attack, he suddenly felt a chilly presence coming at his neck.","Without thinking, he took two steps back.","Chilliness touched his neck, and a tiny line of blood appeared. If the dagger cut a little deeper, it would have slit open his throat!","Cold sweat trickled down from Zong Wu’s forehead. At this moment, he felt tremendous pressure coming from the sneak-attacks and the invisible enemies.","There was more than one assassin. The moment Zong Wu narrowly dodged the attack that was aiming for his throat, he felt an intense murderous spirit coming from behind. He quickly bent forward, and he ducked, dodging two pitch-black daggers which swept into the air just above his back!","Before he could breathe, two deadly black blades shot toward his rib cage from the two sides!","Zong Wu didn’t even feel the movement of air around him.","In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, they saw Zong Wu was attacked from all directions by the strikes from shadows. The pitch-black daggers flashed toward him silently. Despite his swift dodges, several wounds appeared on Zong Wu’s body!","Blood dripped out drop by drop; it was a terrifying sight.","“Hehehehe...” A series of laughter came from the void. It sounded like this person was mocking him.","A man wearing black armor stood in the void not far from Zong Wu, but no one could see him, including Zong Wu.","They hid in the shadows; they were killers in the darkness!","Obviously, it seemed like Zong Wu couldn’t last much longer. The dark judgement knights, the existences hiding in shadows, retreated. They didn’t leave. Instead, they were preparing for the next wave of storm-like attacks to get the kill!","It seemed like a desperate presence was born in the peace before the storm.","“Castellan Zong?!” Standing on the spiritual ship, Zhang Hao, the Vice Academy Master of Heavenly Academy, turned grim at the scene and was about to fly over and help.","In the blink of an eye, a knight blocked him. This knight was one of the six knights who had been watching the battle outside the godly palace and didn’t move before.","“You are seeking death!” The Tang Family Master had just dashed out when another knight flew down from the high sky and blocked his path.","Obviously, no one could come to Zong Wu’s rescue.","When the dark judgement knights moved, they must return with their enemies’ heads.","‘Land of Thorns’ Wilson was playing with a ruby ring on his finger. He glanced this way at the battle with a sneer on his face.","Obviously, he had expected the interference of these people and had been prepared.","“Even if you have insane techniques, you can’t use them in such a situation.” Seeing this scene, Hematon, the World Mage, nodded and said, “It’s why I said that practicing techniques is attending to trifles and neglecting essentials.”","The moment he said it, they saw Zong Wu taking out a black band.","Under the astonished gazes of everyone in St. Heinz’ grand palace, he covered his eyes with the band.","“What’s he going to do?!”","At this moment, only that ‘shadow killer’ noticed the great difference in Zong Wu, the barbaric native warrior who had been at their mercy!","With my real eyes gone, my mind’s eye opens!","Suddenly, the dark judgment knights sensed a powerful and solid murderous spirit sweeping toward and corroding their bodies like pervasive chilly air!","Murderous Wave!"]},{"number":599,"title":"Chapter 599 - Sorry! I Can’t Fight Without Being Blind","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What is he doing?”","“Is he surrendering?”","Covering his eyes during the battle; no one had seen such a method before.","By doing this, it felt like this man had delivered himself to his enemies with his hands and feet tied.","In the high sky covered by gloomy clouds, cold winds swept across the snowy land of the Ultimate West Realm.","They saw the warrior who they regarded as a barbaric native holding a short saber emitting radiant spiritual light in his hand. With his eyes covered by the black band, he stood in the air quietly, letting the gusts flutter his robe against his body.","Right now, he looked like a weak old man who had given up resistance.","A weird presence floated past him. One must look very closely to see a trace of darkness with the same color as the gloomy sky floating in the air.","Completely silent, they seemed like ghosts who were hiding in the dark night.","A dangerous aura started to spread while four pitch-black daggers shot toward Zong Wu’s vital parts from four directions","This time, the attacks were faster and more vicious.","However, before their daggers came close, a strange white shadow rose behind Zong Wu.","This attack appeared at the perfect moment as if he had anticipated their attacks instead of being sneak-attacked.","These assassins didn’t know that in Zong Wu’s mind, their intense murderous spirit and energy waves hidden in the dark were as obvious as bright lights in darkness.","In the dark world that existed in Zong Wu’s senses, the energy waves behind him moved more violently.","Asura – Wave Radiation!","Before the explosion reached them, the existences hiding in the shadows felt like they were struck by turbulent waves. A huge force sent them flying forward as if a volcano had erupted.","They found that they were shaken out of the shadows by the weird force, and they were completely exposed to the whole world!","On top of that, they discovered that a powerful suction force drew them together.","The attack didn’t end there; this was only the beginning.","While they were shaken out of their stealth and lost their balances, they saw that Zong Wu slashed out his short sword which transformed into several surges of huge and invisible spiritual swords, leaving them no space to dodge! They were shocked!","Under the influence of the Heavenly Academy, warriors of the Spiritual State mostly focused on the cultivation of qi. Long-range attacks with sword energies such as Spirit Crescent were not difficult for them; they could use them without much practice since they had similar techniques before.","Obviously, there were experts in different fields. Zong Wu was a master in this area. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have mastered these techniques so soon.","Zong Wu slashed out his short sword, and a heated red flame shot out, following the trajectory of many ice blades. The ice and fire mingled, bursting into a wave of radiant sword energies in the sky!","Spirit Crescent!","Ice Wave Sword!","Fire Wave Sword!","The sword slashed out, and its great sword energies instantly condensed into a huge saber, followed by the ultimate combat techniques that Zong Wu mastered. Many surges of horrifying sword energies instantly engulfed the area where the assassins were.","“!!” Everyone watching the battle stared at the scene in astonishment.","With his eyes covered and strange light runes rotating around him, this barbaric native warrior had transformed his murderous spirit into visible lights that were emitting from his body. He looked like an asura who was standing high in the heavens.","Instantly, four of the elite dark judgement knights died!","The dark judgement knights who came to this war lost half of their forces!","The remaining four knights found that they were each chased by a surge of sword energy!","With great precision, each sword energy followed its target unerringly regardless of how they tried to dodge!","The lofty audience in St. Heinz’ grand palace watched as the dark judgement knights were being hunted down by the barbaric native whose eyes were covered!","Covered in pitch-black light armor, they exposed nothing but their eyes to the air. With short swords or daggers in hand, they emitted chilly and deadly presence.","“With your eyes covered, how did you do this...” The ‘shadow killer’ stared at Zong Wu intently.","He couldn’t imagine how his opponent had blocked his killing strike.","He was infuriated most by the fact that they had suppressed this man while his eyes were open, but they were now pressured by him while his eyes were covered!","“You mean this...” While stroking his beard, Zong Wu thought for a moment and said, “I’ve played as a blind man for such a long time that I don’t know how to fight with my eyes open.”","“Pu-!” The shadow killer spewed out a mouthful of blood.","The high-level officials of Judgement Godly Palace sitting in St. Heinz’ grand palace were at a loss for words.","They were livid, and their faces almost turned green.","This barbaric native...","“Reckless! Absolutely reckless!” A white-robed priest yelled furiously.","St. Heinz stared at the battlefield coldly.","Obviously, the Thorn Flower Family was more powerful than this.","Only the Thorn Flower Family Master had more hidden cards than what these barbaric natives could imagine!","Inhaling deeply, St. Heinz turned his eyes to another battlefield.","He had waited for the dark judgement knights of the Thorn Flower Family to come up with better hidden cards. But now, he decided to ignore them to not feel agitated.","In fact, some of the classes in Dungeon Fighter Online didn’t have so many restrictions as they seemed to have.","For example, berserkers, a subclass of male slayers, looked normal on usual occasions. However, when they got furious, excited, or were experiencing a mental collapse, they would turn into crazy demons and obtain great power at the price of blood.","At this moment, on another battlefield, Gabriel had almost dashed onto the stone palace all by himself. At the entrance in the center of the stone palace, ‘Land of Thorns’ was only flanked by one knight and one black-robed prophet.","“Hehe! Look at this guy. He has reached his limit after sending Dereth flying. But now, he is seeking death by coming to a sky knight!”","This black-armored knight was also riding a huge dragon which was much larger and fiercer than Gabriel’s horned dragon."]},{"number":600,"title":"Chapter 600 - How Come We Can’t Watch the Battles?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","This man was brown-haired and about 50 years old. He said with intense disdain in his eyes, “Little Guy, you shouldn’t have come here.”","The moment he said it, Gabriel raised his blood-covered right hand before him and opened his fingers.","While his fingers opened, a blood-colored vortex began to slowly take shape.","The moment the blood-colored vortex was formed, the black-armored knight suddenly felt that the huge dragon beneath him was flying toward Gabriel against its will.","Bloody Twister!","The horrifying blood-colored vortex could immobilize anything and seal any force before it. If anything were sucked into it, there was no getting away!","“You are seeking death!” As a lofty sky knight, this black-armored knight was furious that he was challenged by a young man who had barely reached level 7. He slashed out his sword viciously, and a huge sword energy flew out, intending to cut Gabriel into two halves.","“Light Shadow Strike!” Another sword energy crashed down from the sky and smashed into the sword energy unleashed by the black-armored knight.","Colorless crystal dust scattered in the wind, and the grey dust seemed to show the world what a powerful force it had unleashed.","Sia and Luo Piaoling had battled their way to this place as well.","Boom!","The ripples of the surging sword energy spread out like a storm, and a bloody light struck down with vicious force as strong wind sblew by.","As a sad howl sounded, the skull of the huge dragon that the black-armored knight was riding on was shattered by the powerful strike, and blood sprayed everywhere!","“You are seeking your deaths!” Looking extremely dignified with the huge sword in his hand, the black-armored knight activated the golden patterns between his eyebrows as he shouted, “You dare to challenge me, Godly Punisher Aude? You’ll be turned into ashes by the godly light!”","He was the best out of the six sky knights. If he borrowed godly power, he could reach level 9!","The horrifying force spread out. Even the ground couldn’t withstand this force and cracked open.","“Good. Good.” In the grand palace, the lofty existences nodded repeatedly and said, “This little guy has also reached level 9?”","“They dare to come to this place. These barbaric natives will pay for their audacity!” An old man wearing a priest robe said mildly, “I seem to foresee these ignorant barbaric natives being crushed like ants.”","However, the moment he said it, a middle-aged man in a bright blue robe floated over with a thick scroll in his hands. On the chest of his robe was an embroidered golden cross. He asked, “Godly power?”","Although the Ultimate West Realm mainly produced warriors, it didn’t mean that there weren’t any cultivators among them.","The cultivator chanted in a low voice, and faint lights began to emit from these warriors’ weapons.","[Valor Blessing]!","Then, another light fell on Gabriel’s head.","[Blessing of Dawn]!","This wasn’t the end. Soon, they saw another light landing on Gabriel’s head.","[Revenge of Light]!","Then...","[Archangel’s Blessing]!","[Source of Life]!","[Wind of Holy Healing]!","...","Lights flashed on Gabriel, Luo Piaoling, and Sia one after another. When the middle-aged man stopped chanting the blessings with a cross in his hands, the three gathered and emitted extremely powerful presences.","“May the holy light bless you!” With a long chant, the middle-aged man in the bright blue robe finally finished casting spells.","“What’s this?!” Everyone stared at the scene dumbfoundedly.","Where did these barbaric natives get this stuff?!","“Ha-!” With a furious roar, Gabriel closed his left hand, and the congealed blood slowly moved down his arm and condensed into a new sword in his hand.","“Heaaaa-! With an unintelligible roar, this fighter who was only at level 7 charged toward the knight who had reached level 9 with the help of godly power.","“With everything of the warriors of Ultimate West Realm, attack!” Sia and Luo Piaoling roared and charged forward viciously.","...","These people’s battle roars seemed to ignite the fire on the whole battlefield.","“Let’s turn to another battlefield that we haven’t watched yet.” Luther finally turned the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection to the battlefield in the Morning Star Sea Realm, but they were astonished by what they saw.","The cultivator army of the Morning Star Sea Realm had begun fighting the outland army in close-range.","A woman wearing a green dress strolled on the battlefield as if she was taking a walk, and before her was a level 8 golden-armored knight.","The moment the golden-armored knight struck out his sword, the audience saw a white light flash by.","Then, a destructive and demonic power erupted!","Release plus Devil Trigger!","In the blink of an eye, this woman withdrew the demonic power, and the level 8 knight looked as if a truck that weighed several tons had run over his body.","He died instantly!","“Oh! This... is impossible!” The Spiritual Spell Visual Projection was instantly turned to another direction.","A series of hysterical laughter resonated on the battlefield. A woman had transformed her murderous spirit into a sharp saber while demonic shadows danced behind her. The murderous spirit that only belonged to demons permeated the whole battlefield.","Blood splashed into the air while the saber danced around.","One knight fell to the ground after another like harvested wheat straws.","The demonic power had been Shui Xianyun’s nightmare, but it was now her greatest source of power.","Meanwhile, not far from her, a figure in a black robe flew up into the air.","Below him, blood gushed out, turning the ground into a pool of blood. The blood turned into tornados and sharp blades, even making this place into a horrifying bloody hell.","Many terrifying techniques of blood, ice, and flames spread out on the battlefield like lotuses made of blood and fire. They looked demonic but extremely dazzling!","“Oh! No! This can’t be real!” Seeing this, Luther stammered and then immediately turned the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection to another battlefield.","This time, he finally found something to his liking. In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, several civilian warriors of the Jiuhua City Shop were at the disadvantage as they were surrounded by several powerful knights armed with excellent weapons. It seemed like they couldn’t last long.","“Oh! Look! There are indeed some grandmasters among the barbaric natives, but their overall strength is not great.” While holding a cup of tea in his hand, Luther felt like his lips were so dry that they were about to crack.","The moment he said it, a dark sword light flashed by","Sitting on White Pigeon Square, Sala, Cia, and the others saw a short-haired young man who was about thirty years old. This man was holding a strange sword with dazzling lights.","A sword energy flashed, looking like a huge dragon’s mouth.","Raging Dragon Slash!","The knights who had been attacking the civilian warriors were sent flying high into the sky; it seemed like they had been hit by a train.","“Black Light Grand Master! He’s Black Light Grand Master!” One of the civilian warriors yelled in pleasant surprise.","The short-haired young man lifted the lightsabre and roared, “Friends, grab your weapons and kick out the invaders!”","Luther spat out his tea.","Water splashed onto the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","Then, it turned black.","“Hey!” Elf Girl Sala stood up and shouted, “How come you stopped the visual projection?!”","“Ahh-!” A few other elves also stood up. Even the two assassins hiding in the darkness were also frustrated.","We are enjoying it! How come it was turned off?"]}]);
